`Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",[1,null,3,null,\"#c97b5a\",null,null,null,null,null,26,26,[[\"on_tertiary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"surface_container_highest\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"sage\",\"#D6E4D8\"],[\"inverse_on_surface\",\"#f3f0ed\"],[\"on_tertiary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_surface\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"cream-warm\",\"#F2ECE6\"],[\"surface_dim\",\"#dcdad7\"],[\"surface_variant\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed_variant\",\"#4a4641\"],[\"tertiary_fixed_dim\",\"#ccc5bf\"],[\"tertiary_fixed\",\"#e9e1da\"],[\"outline\",\"#86736c\"],[\"error\",\"#ba1a1a\"],[\"primary_fixed\",\"#ffdbcd\"],[\"outline_variant\",\"#d9c2b9\"],[\"surface_container\",\"#f0edea\"],[\"secondary\",\"#655d58\"],[\"on_secondary_container\",\"#69615c\"],[\"secondary_fixed\",\"#ece0da\"],[\"on_error_container\",\"#93000a\"],[\"on_background\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"secondary_fixed_dim\",\"#cfc4be\"],[\"error_container\",\"#ffdad6\"],[\"tertiary_container\",\"#79746e\"],[\"inverse_primary\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"surface_container_low\",\"#f6f3f0\"],[\"primary\",\"#8c4a2d\"],[\"on_primary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_surface_variant\",\"#53433d\"],[\"surface_container_high\",\"#eae8e5\"],[\"inverse_surface\",\"#31302f\"],[\"secondary_container\",\"#e9ddd7\"],[\"clay-dark\",\"#A85E40\"],[\"surface\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"surface_tint\",\"#8f4c2f\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed_variant\",\"#4d4541\"],[\"ink-light\",\"#5A4E48\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed\",\"#1e1b17\"],[\"primary_fixed_dim\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"on_error\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_secondary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed\",\"#201a17\"],[\"border-subtle\",\"#E8DDD6\"],[\"tertiary\",\"#605b56\"],[\"surface_container_lowest\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_primary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"background\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_primary_fixed_variant\",\"#72351a\"],[\"on_primary_fixed\",\"#360f00\"],[\"surface_bright\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"primary_container\",\"#aa6243\"]],\"---\\nname: Stitch Design System\\ncolors:\\n  surface: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-dim: '#dcdad7'\\n  surface-bright: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-container-lowest: '#ffffff'\\n  surface-container-low: '#f6f3f0'\\n  surface-container: '#f0edea'\\n  surface-container-high: '#eae8e5'\\n  surface-container-highest: '#e5e2df'\\n  on-surface: '#1c1c1a'\\n  on-surface-variant: '#53433d'\\n  inverse-surface: '#31302f'\\n  inverse-on-surface: '#f3f0ed'\\n  outline: '#86736c'\\n  outline-variant: '#d9c2b9'\\n  surface-tint: '#8f4c2f'\\n  primary: '#8c4a2d'\\n  on-primary: '#ffffff'\\n  primary-container: '#aa6243'\\n  on-primary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  inverse-primary: '#ffb597'\\n  secondary: '#655d58'\\n  on-secondary: '#ffffff'\\n  secondary-container: '#e9ddd7'\\n  on-secondary-container: '#69615c'\\n  tertiary: '#605b56'\\n  on-tertiary: '#ffffff'\\n  tertiary-container: '#79746e'\\n  on-tertiary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  error: '#ba1a1a'\\n  on-error: '#ffffff'\\n  error-container: '#ffdad6'\\n  on-error-container: '#93000a'\\n  primary-fixed: '#ffdbcd'\\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#ffb597'\\n  on-primary-fixed: '#360f00'\\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#72351a'\\n  secondary-fixed: '#ece0da'\\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#cfc4be'\\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#201a17'\\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#4d4541'\\n  tertiary-fixed: '#e9e1da'\\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#ccc5bf'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#1e1b17'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#4a4641'\\n  background: '#fcf9f6'\\n  on-background: '#1c1c1a'\\n  surface-variant: '#e5e2df'\\n  clay-dark: '#A85E40'\\n  ink-light: '#5A4E48'\\n  sage: '#D6E4D8'\\n  cream-warm: '#F2ECE6'\\n  border-subtle: '#E8DDD6'\\ntypography:\\n  display:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 80px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.1'\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\n  display-mobile:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 44px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n  headline-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 40px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  headline-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 32px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  body-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.8'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.01em\\n  body-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.85'\\n  label-uppercase:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 12px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.15em\\n  caption:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 11px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.4'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.05em\\nrounded:\\n  sm: 0.25rem\\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\\n  md: 0.75rem\\n  lg: 1rem\\n  xl: 1.5rem\\n  full: 9999px\\nspacing:\\n  container-max: 1440px\\n  section-gap-desktop: 80px\\n  section-gap-mobile: 48px\\n  grid-gutter: 24px\\n  element-gap-sm: 8px\\n  element-gap-md: 16px\\n  element-gap-lg: 32px\\n---\\n\\n## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Colors\\n\\nThe palette is inspired by natural, undyed fibers and earthen materials. \\n\\n- **Primary (Clay):** Used for call-to-actions, price accents, and critical indicators. It provides a warm, energetic contrast to the neutral base.\\n- **Secondary (Ink):** The foundation for readability. Used for all primary headings and body text to ensure high legibility against light backgrounds.\\n- **Tertiary (Blush):** A soft accent for secondary surfaces, card backgrounds, and promotional banners.\\n- **Neutral (Cream):** The primary canvas. This off-white base reduces eye strain and feels more premium and \\\"organic\\\" than pure white.\\n- **Named Colors:** **Sage** is reserved for eco-specific callouts or decorative elements to reinforce the sustainability narrative. **Ink-light** is used for secondary navigation and metadata to create visual hierarchy.\\n\\n## Typography\\n\\nThis design system employs a high-contrast pairing to balance heritage and modernity.\\n\\n- **Headlines:** Use **DM Serif Display**. Its graceful curves and high contrast evoke luxury and editorial authority. Use it sparingly for section headers and hero statements.\\n- **Body \\u0026 UI:** Use **DM Sans**. This low-contrast geometric sans-serif ensures maximum legibility across all digital interfaces. \\n- **The \\\"Label-Uppercase\\\" Style:** This is a signature brand element. Use it for navigation, small headings over titles, and button labels. The generous letter-spacing (tracking) is essential to achieving the \\\"premium\\\" feel.\\n- **Line Height:** Maintain a generous line height (1.8 - 1.85) for body text to reinforce the airy, spacious aesthetic.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Shapes\\n\\nThe shape language is \\\"Soft-Modern,\\\" utilizing rounded corners to evoke friendliness and comfort—qualities essential to a wearable fashion brand.\\n\\n- **Small Elements (Buttons, Tags, Pills):** Use `rounded-full` (pill-shaped). This creates a distinct interactive language that feels modern and approachable.\\n- **Medium Elements (Product Images, Floating Cards):** Use `rounded-lg` (1rem / 16px). This softens the grid without making it feel juvenile.\\n- **Large Elements (Banners, Testimonial Containers):** Use `rounded-xl` (1.5rem / 24px) to create \\\"enveloping\\\" containers that feel substantial and high-end.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",6,\"#c97b5a\",\"#2a2420\",\"#f5ede6\",\"#faf7f4\",2,[[\"headline-lg\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"40px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"headline-md\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"32px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"caption\",[\"DM Sans\",\"11px\",\"500\",\"1.4\",\"0.05em\"]],[\"display-mobile\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"44px\",\"400\",\"1.2\"]],[\"label-uppercase\",[\"DM Sans\",\"12px\",\"500\",\"1.2\",\"0.15em\"]],[\"body-lg\",[\"DM Sans\",\"16px\",\"400\",\"1.8\",\"0.01em\"]],[\"body-md\",[\"DM Sans\",\"14px\",\"400\",\"1.85\"]],[\"display\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"80px\",\"400\",\"1.1\",\"-0.02em\"]]],[[\"element-gap-md\",\"16px\"],[\"element-gap-sm\",\"8px\"],[\"section-gap-mobile\",\"48px\"],[\"container-max\",\"1440px\"],[\"grid-gutter\",\"24px\"],[\"section-gap-desktop\",\"80px\"],[\"element-gap-lg\",\"32px\"]],null,\"dmSerifDisplay\",\"Dm Sans\",\"Dm Sans\"]],1]],[[\"projects/18178749605532028059/files/4062267964833027131\",null,\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida/AP1WRLu8MMHm6WyVDS71r2PmQhAl8DpPY9Ko5HSsnIpMAEHswM_F9p2THlaSscFacPBeKreYy_7RYYWigfhbDpGZz1B-uKf1NqErFuoGkHMHLR8PuIJ-2fVvc_aoFxHt5Fc1IuDyBDoHowVx-eTu1_fxEgqPfmVMAfxO5e-63kuLyYcmbZm0d-bQfFb3GS-3omYNs257edEesC0jkiGT6Mld5Nf5I5Q8MxcTPxcvbKby9-Z6c-b_ux2SV0Z7Ie2V\"],[\"projects/18178749605532028059/files/5190879919149671455\",null,\"https://contribution.usercontent.google.com/download?c\\u003dCgthaWRhX2NvZGVmeBJ8Eh1hcHBfY29tcGFuaW9uX2dlbmVyYXRlZF9maWxlcxpbCiVodG1sXzAwMDY1NDlkMDIxYzU3YzAwMzMyY2VhMzJlMjAzOGRjEgsSBxDv9_C4jw8YAZIBJAoKcHJvamVjdF9pZBIWQhQxODE3ODc0OTYwNTUzMjAyODA1OQ\\u0026filename\\u003d\\u0026opi\\u003d89354086\",null,null,\"text/html\"],null,null,\"fbd124e6656047beb6fca01ad574a13b\",\"figaro_agent\",\"2560\",\"3490\",\"Stitch — Thanh toán\",\"A minimalist and premium Checkout page for Stitch. \\nLayout: Two-column layout.\\nLeft Column (Shipping \\u0026 Payment):\\n- Progress Stepper: \\\"Giỏ hàng \\u003e Thanh toán \\u003e Hoàn tất\\\".\\n- Shipping Information section: Inputs for Full Name, Phone Number, Email, and Address (District, City, Detailed address).\\n- Delivery Method section: Options like \\\"Giao hàng tiêu chuẩn (Miễn phí)\\\" and \\\"Giao hàng hỏa tốc (50.000đ)\\\".\\n- Payment Method section: Options with icons for Credit Card (Visa/Mastercard), MoMo, ZaloPay, and Cash on Delivery (COD).\\nRight Column (Order Summary - Sticky):\\n- Order Summary card: List of items (small thumbnails, names, attributes, prices), Subtotal, Shipping fee, Discount code input, and Total Amount.\\n- Primary Action Button: \\\"Đặt hàng ngay\\\".\\nStyling: Use the Stitch design system (Cream background #FAF7F4, Clay accents #C97B5A, Ink text #2A2420). Clean typography, subtle borders, and generous whitespace. Ensure consistency with the TopNavBar and Footer from the design system.\",\"projects/18178749605532028059/screens/fbd124e6656047beb6fca01ad574a13b\",[1,null,3,null,\"#c97b5a\",null,null,null,null,null,26,26,[[\"clay-dark\",\"#A85E40\"],[\"inverse_surface\",\"#31302f\"],[\"on_surface_variant\",\"#53433d\"],[\"surface_container_high\",\"#eae8e5\"],[\"secondary_container\",\"#e9ddd7\"],[\"on_primary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"inverse_primary\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"tertiary_container\",\"#79746e\"],[\"surface_container_low\",\"#f6f3f0\"],[\"primary\",\"#8c4a2d\"],[\"on_primary_fixed\",\"#360f00\"],[\"primary_container\",\"#aa6243\"],[\"surface_bright\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed\",\"#201a17\"],[\"on_secondary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"border-subtle\",\"#E8DDD6\"],[\"tertiary\",\"#605b56\"],[\"on_primary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"surface_container_lowest\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"background\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_primary_fixed_variant\",\"#72351a\"],[\"primary_fixed_dim\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"on_error\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"surface_tint\",\"#8f4c2f\"],[\"surface\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed_variant\",\"#4d4541\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed\",\"#1e1b17\"],[\"ink-light\",\"#5A4E48\"],[\"cream-warm\",\"#F2ECE6\"],[\"surface_dim\",\"#dcdad7\"],[\"on_surface\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"surface_container_highest\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"sage\",\"#D6E4D8\"],[\"inverse_on_surface\",\"#f3f0ed\"],[\"on_tertiary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_tertiary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"secondary_fixed\",\"#ece0da\"],[\"on_secondary_container\",\"#69615c\"],[\"on_error_container\",\"#93000a\"],[\"secondary_fixed_dim\",\"#cfc4be\"],[\"on_background\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"error_container\",\"#ffdad6\"],[\"secondary\",\"#655d58\"],[\"primary_fixed\",\"#ffdbcd\"],[\"error\",\"#ba1a1a\"],[\"outline_variant\",\"#d9c2b9\"],[\"surface_container\",\"#f0edea\"],[\"surface_variant\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed_variant\",\"#4a4641\"],[\"tertiary_fixed_dim\",\"#ccc5bf\"],[\"tertiary_fixed\",\"#e9e1da\"],[\"outline\",\"#86736c\"]],\"---\\nname: Stitch Design System\\ncolors:\\n  surface: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-dim: '#dcdad7'\\n  surface-bright: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-container-lowest: '#ffffff'\\n  surface-container-low: '#f6f3f0'\\n  surface-container: '#f0edea'\\n  surface-container-high: '#eae8e5'\\n  surface-container-highest: '#e5e2df'\\n  on-surface: '#1c1c1a'\\n  on-surface-variant: '#53433d'\\n  inverse-surface: '#31302f'\\n  inverse-on-surface: '#f3f0ed'\\n  outline: '#86736c'\\n  outline-variant: '#d9c2b9'\\n  surface-tint: '#8f4c2f'\\n  primary: '#8c4a2d'\\n  on-primary: '#ffffff'\\n  primary-container: '#aa6243'\\n  on-primary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  inverse-primary: '#ffb597'\\n  secondary: '#655d58'\\n  on-secondary: '#ffffff'\\n  secondary-container: '#e9ddd7'\\n  on-secondary-container: '#69615c'\\n  tertiary: '#605b56'\\n  on-tertiary: '#ffffff'\\n  tertiary-container: '#79746e'\\n  on-tertiary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  error: '#ba1a1a'\\n  on-error: '#ffffff'\\n  error-container: '#ffdad6'\\n  on-error-container: '#93000a'\\n  primary-fixed: '#ffdbcd'\\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#ffb597'\\n  on-primary-fixed: '#360f00'\\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#72351a'\\n  secondary-fixed: '#ece0da'\\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#cfc4be'\\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#201a17'\\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#4d4541'\\n  tertiary-fixed: '#e9e1da'\\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#ccc5bf'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#1e1b17'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#4a4641'\\n  background: '#fcf9f6'\\n  on-background: '#1c1c1a'\\n  surface-variant: '#e5e2df'\\n  clay-dark: '#A85E40'\\n  ink-light: '#5A4E48'\\n  sage: '#D6E4D8'\\n  cream-warm: '#F2ECE6'\\n  border-subtle: '#E8DDD6'\\ntypography:\\n  display:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 80px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.1'\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\n  display-mobile:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 44px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n  headline-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 40px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  headline-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 32px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  body-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.8'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.01em\\n  body-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.85'\\n  label-uppercase:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 12px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.15em\\n  caption:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 11px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.4'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.05em\\nrounded:\\n  sm: 0.25rem\\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\\n  md: 0.75rem\\n  lg: 1rem\\n  xl: 1.5rem\\n  full: 9999px\\nspacing:\\n  container-max: 1440px\\n  section-gap-desktop: 80px\\n  section-gap-mobile: 48px\\n  grid-gutter: 24px\\n  element-gap-sm: 8px\\n  element-gap-md: 16px\\n  element-gap-lg: 32px\\n---\\n\\n## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Colors\\n\\nThe palette is inspired by natural, undyed fibers and earthen materials. \\n\\n- **Primary (Clay):** Used for call-to-actions, price accents, and critical indicators. It provides a warm, energetic contrast to the neutral base.\\n- **Secondary (Ink):** The foundation for readability. Used for all primary headings and body text to ensure high legibility against light backgrounds.\\n- **Tertiary (Blush):** A soft accent for secondary surfaces, card backgrounds, and promotional banners.\\n- **Neutral (Cream):** The primary canvas. This off-white base reduces eye strain and feels more premium and \\\"organic\\\" than pure white.\\n- **Named Colors:** **Sage** is reserved for eco-specific callouts or decorative elements to reinforce the sustainability narrative. **Ink-light** is used for secondary navigation and metadata to create visual hierarchy.\\n\\n## Typography\\n\\nThis design system employs a high-contrast pairing to balance heritage and modernity.\\n\\n- **Headlines:** Use **DM Serif Display**. Its graceful curves and high contrast evoke luxury and editorial authority. Use it sparingly for section headers and hero statements.\\n- **Body \\u0026 UI:** Use **DM Sans**. This low-contrast geometric sans-serif ensures maximum legibility across all digital interfaces. \\n- **The \\\"Label-Uppercase\\\" Style:** This is a signature brand element. Use it for navigation, small headings over titles, and button labels. The generous letter-spacing (tracking) is essential to achieving the \\\"premium\\\" feel.\\n- **Line Height:** Maintain a generous line height (1.8 - 1.85) for body text to reinforce the airy, spacious aesthetic.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Shapes\\n\\nThe shape language is \\\"Soft-Modern,\\\" utilizing rounded corners to evoke friendliness and comfort—qualities essential to a wearable fashion brand.\\n\\n- **Small Elements (Buttons, Tags, Pills):** Use `rounded-full` (pill-shaped). This creates a distinct interactive language that feels modern and approachable.\\n- **Medium Elements (Product Images, Floating Cards):** Use `rounded-lg` (1rem / 16px). This softens the grid without making it feel juvenile.\\n- **Large Elements (Banners, Testimonial Containers):** Use `rounded-xl` (1.5rem / 24px) to create \\\"enveloping\\\" containers that feel substantial and high-end.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",6,\"#c97b5a\",\"#2a2420\",\"#f5ede6\",\"#faf7f4\",2,[[\"caption\",[\"DM Sans\",\"11px\",\"500\",\"1.4\",\"0.05em\"]],[\"headline-lg\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"40px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"headline-md\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"32px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"display-mobile\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"44px\",\"400\",\"1.2\"]],[\"label-uppercase\",[\"DM Sans\",\"12px\",\"500\",\"1.2\",\"0.15em\"]],[\"body-lg\",[\"DM Sans\",\"16px\",\"400\",\"1.8\",\"0.01em\"]],[\"display\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"80px\",\"400\",\"1.1\",\"-0.02em\"]],[\"body-md\",[\"DM Sans\",\"14px\",\"400\",\"1.85\"]]],[[\"element-gap-md\",\"16px\"],[\"container-max\",\"1440px\"],[\"element-gap-sm\",\"8px\"],[\"section-gap-mobile\",\"48px\"],[\"section-gap-desktop\",\"80px\"],[\"grid-gutter\",\"24px\"],[\"element-gap-lg\",\"32px\"]],null,\"dmSerifDisplay\",\"Dm Sans\",\"Dm Sans\"],2,1,null,[null,2,null,null,2,2],null,null,[\"assets/f84726af88af499598b78556bda4af11\",null,[\"Stitch Design System\",null,\"## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",[1,null,3,null,\"#c97b5a\",null,null,null,null,null,26,26,[[\"on_primary_fixed_variant\",\"#72351a\"],[\"background\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"surface_container_lowest\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_primary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"border-subtle\",\"#E8DDD6\"],[\"tertiary\",\"#605b56\"],[\"on_secondary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed\",\"#201a17\"],[\"surface_bright\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"primary_container\",\"#aa6243\"],[\"on_primary_fixed\",\"#360f00\"],[\"ink-light\",\"#5A4E48\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed\",\"#1e1b17\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed_variant\",\"#4d4541\"],[\"surface\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"surface_tint\",\"#8f4c2f\"],[\"on_error\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"primary_fixed_dim\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"secondary_container\",\"#e9ddd7\"],[\"inverse_surface\",\"#31302f\"],[\"on_surface_variant\",\"#53433d\"],[\"surface_container_high\",\"#eae8e5\"],[\"clay-dark\",\"#A85E40\"],[\"surface_container_low\",\"#f6f3f0\"],[\"primary\",\"#8c4a2d\"],[\"tertiary_container\",\"#79746e\"],[\"inverse_primary\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"on_primary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"secondary\",\"#655d58\"],[\"error_container\",\"#ffdad6\"],[\"on_background\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"secondary_fixed_dim\",\"#cfc4be\"],[\"on_error_container\",\"#93000a\"],[\"secondary_fixed\",\"#ece0da\"],[\"on_secondary_container\",\"#69615c\"],[\"tertiary_fixed_dim\",\"#ccc5bf\"],[\"tertiary_fixed\",\"#e9e1da\"],[\"outline\",\"#86736c\"],[\"surface_variant\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed_variant\",\"#4a4641\"],[\"surface_container\",\"#f0edea\"],[\"outline_variant\",\"#d9c2b9\"],[\"error\",\"#ba1a1a\"],[\"primary_fixed\",\"#ffdbcd\"],[\"on_surface\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"surface_dim\",\"#dcdad7\"],[\"cream-warm\",\"#F2ECE6\"],[\"on_tertiary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"on_tertiary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"inverse_on_surface\",\"#f3f0ed\"],[\"sage\",\"#D6E4D8\"],[\"surface_container_highest\",\"#e5e2df\"]],\"---\\nname: Stitch Design System\\ncolors:\\n  surface: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-dim: '#dcdad7'\\n  surface-bright: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-container-lowest: '#ffffff'\\n  surface-container-low: '#f6f3f0'\\n  surface-container: '#f0edea'\\n  surface-container-high: '#eae8e5'\\n  surface-container-highest: '#e5e2df'\\n  on-surface: '#1c1c1a'\\n  on-surface-variant: '#53433d'\\n  inverse-surface: '#31302f'\\n  inverse-on-surface: '#f3f0ed'\\n  outline: '#86736c'\\n  outline-variant: '#d9c2b9'\\n  surface-tint: '#8f4c2f'\\n  primary: '#8c4a2d'\\n  on-primary: '#ffffff'\\n  primary-container: '#aa6243'\\n  on-primary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  inverse-primary: '#ffb597'\\n  secondary: '#655d58'\\n  on-secondary: '#ffffff'\\n  secondary-container: '#e9ddd7'\\n  on-secondary-container: '#69615c'\\n  tertiary: '#605b56'\\n  on-tertiary: '#ffffff'\\n  tertiary-container: '#79746e'\\n  on-tertiary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  error: '#ba1a1a'\\n  on-error: '#ffffff'\\n  error-container: '#ffdad6'\\n  on-error-container: '#93000a'\\n  primary-fixed: '#ffdbcd'\\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#ffb597'\\n  on-primary-fixed: '#360f00'\\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#72351a'\\n  secondary-fixed: '#ece0da'\\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#cfc4be'\\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#201a17'\\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#4d4541'\\n  tertiary-fixed: '#e9e1da'\\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#ccc5bf'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#1e1b17'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#4a4641'\\n  background: '#fcf9f6'\\n  on-background: '#1c1c1a'\\n  surface-variant: '#e5e2df'\\n  clay-dark: '#A85E40'\\n  ink-light: '#5A4E48'\\n  sage: '#D6E4D8'\\n  cream-warm: '#F2ECE6'\\n  border-subtle: '#E8DDD6'\\ntypography:\\n  display:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 80px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.1'\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\n  display-mobile:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 44px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n  headline-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 40px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  headline-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 32px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  body-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.8'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.01em\\n  body-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.85'\\n  label-uppercase:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 12px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.15em\\n  caption:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 11px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.4'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.05em\\nrounded:\\n  sm: 0.25rem\\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\\n  md: 0.75rem\\n  lg: 1rem\\n  xl: 1.5rem\\n  full: 9999px\\nspacing:\\n  container-max: 1440px\\n  section-gap-desktop: 80px\\n  section-gap-mobile: 48px\\n  grid-gutter: 24px\\n  element-gap-sm: 8px\\n  element-gap-md: 16px\\n  element-gap-lg: 32px\\n---\\n\\n## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Colors\\n\\nThe palette is inspired by natural, undyed fibers and earthen materials. \\n\\n- **Primary (Clay):** Used for call-to-actions, price accents, and critical indicators. It provides a warm, energetic contrast to the neutral base.\\n- **Secondary (Ink):** The foundation for readability. Used for all primary headings and body text to ensure high legibility against light backgrounds.\\n- **Tertiary (Blush):** A soft accent for secondary surfaces, card backgrounds, and promotional banners.\\n- **Neutral (Cream):** The primary canvas. This off-white base reduces eye strain and feels more premium and \\\"organic\\\" than pure white.\\n- **Named Colors:** **Sage** is reserved for eco-specific callouts or decorative elements to reinforce the sustainability narrative. **Ink-light** is used for secondary navigation and metadata to create visual hierarchy.\\n\\n## Typography\\n\\nThis design system employs a high-contrast pairing to balance heritage and modernity.\\n\\n- **Headlines:** Use **DM Serif Display**. Its graceful curves and high contrast evoke luxury and editorial authority. Use it sparingly for section headers and hero statements.\\n- **Body \\u0026 UI:** Use **DM Sans**. This low-contrast geometric sans-serif ensures maximum legibility across all digital interfaces. \\n- **The \\\"Label-Uppercase\\\" Style:** This is a signature brand element. Use it for navigation, small headings over titles, and button labels. The generous letter-spacing (tracking) is essential to achieving the \\\"premium\\\" feel.\\n- **Line Height:** Maintain a generous line height (1.8 - 1.85) for body text to reinforce the airy, spacious aesthetic.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Shapes\\n\\nThe shape language is \\\"Soft-Modern,\\\" utilizing rounded corners to evoke friendliness and comfort—qualities essential to a wearable fashion brand.\\n\\n- **Small Elements (Buttons, Tags, Pills):** Use `rounded-full` (pill-shaped). This creates a distinct interactive language that feels modern and approachable.\\n- **Medium Elements (Product Images, Floating Cards):** Use `rounded-lg` (1rem / 16px). This softens the grid without making it feel juvenile.\\n- **Large Elements (Banners, Testimonial Containers):** Use `rounded-xl` (1.5rem / 24px) to create \\\"enveloping\\\" containers that feel substantial and high-end.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",6,\"#c97b5a\",\"#2a2420\",\"#f5ede6\",\"#faf7f4\",2,[[\"caption\",[\"DM Sans\",\"11px\",\"500\",\"1.4\",\"0.05em\"]],[\"headline-lg\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"40px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"headline-md\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"32px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"display-mobile\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"44px\",\"400\",\"1.2\"]],[\"label-uppercase\",[\"DM Sans\",\"12px\",\"500\",\"1.2\",\"0.15em\"]],[\"body-lg\",[\"DM Sans\",\"16px\",\"400\",\"1.8\",\"0.01em\"]],[\"display\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"80px\",\"400\",\"1.1\",\"-0.02em\"]],[\"body-md\",[\"DM Sans\",\"14px\",\"400\",\"1.85\"]]],[[\"element-gap-md\",\"16px\"],[\"element-gap-sm\",\"8px\"],[\"section-gap-mobile\",\"48px\"],[\"container-max\",\"1440px\"],[\"grid-gutter\",\"24px\"],[\"section-gap-desktop\",\"80px\"],[\"element-gap-lg\",\"32px\"]],null,\"dmSerifDisplay\",\"Dm Sans\",\"Dm Sans\"]],1]],[[\"projects/18178749605532028059/files/16649957344679755931\",null,\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida/AP1WRLvxL4VTHd_QLdVR3mwESIec6XrNtoXol8lXQiq4bB6zkFCnI-YdhRI468tn1e3hONcf-OJMWkOVANBLWEnD3vecZ9_w4xiiSLODhom2MLL9xa41PXU0RsKhTOu2gKwaXQaVoX0moKn1mypGw8fBXBUxfbu2Pz_X_X6b1Ev3XGxJI8MEERiq3rCybDAJUXsUXRZuWz3sn9ffzrTRUcY2UPsMVI1TcnORc4EMxdh32daduhllgAszsH5wr6RZ\"],[\"projects/18178749605532028059/files/4286868327256590431\",null,\"https://contribution.usercontent.google.com/download?c\\u003dCgthaWRhX2NvZGVmeBJ8Eh1hcHBfY29tcGFuaW9uX2dlbmVyYXRlZF9maWxlcxpbCiVodG1sXzAwMDY1NDlkMDFiODI1MmIwMzkyZDQ2OWEwMTBhMDIxEgsSBxDv9_C4jw8YAZIBJAoKcHJvamVjdF9pZBIWQhQxODE3ODc0OTYwNTUzMjAyODA1OQ\\u0026filename\\u003d\\u0026opi\\u003d89354086\",null,null,\"text/html\"],null,null,\"8418de4155324c0f9ee81056bf83919b\",\"figaro_agent\",\"2560\",\"5154\",\"Stitch — Danh mục Giày dép\",\"Create a product category page for 'Giày dép' (Footwear). The page should feature a hero section with a title 'Bộ sưu tập Giày dép' and a brief description about sustainable materials. The product grid should include items like 'Sandal Da Thủ Công' using {{DATA:IMAGE:IMAGE_41}}, 'Loafers Da Cao Cấp' using {{DATA:IMAGE:IMAGE_40}}, 'Giày Sneaker Canvas' using {{DATA:IMAGE:IMAGE_39}}, and 'Mules Da Thanh Lịch' using {{DATA:IMAGE:IMAGE_42}}. Include filters for size, color, and price on the left sidebar. Use the established minimalist design system with earthy tones.\",\"projects/18178749605532028059/screens/8418de4155324c0f9ee81056bf83919b\",[1,null,3,null,\"#c97b5a\",null,null,null,null,null,26,26,[[\"inverse_on_surface\",\"#f3f0ed\"],[\"on_tertiary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"surface_container_highest\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"sage\",\"#D6E4D8\"],[\"on_tertiary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"surface_dim\",\"#dcdad7\"],[\"cream-warm\",\"#F2ECE6\"],[\"on_surface\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"surface_container\",\"#f0edea\"],[\"error\",\"#ba1a1a\"],[\"primary_fixed\",\"#ffdbcd\"],[\"outline_variant\",\"#d9c2b9\"],[\"surface_variant\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed_variant\",\"#4a4641\"],[\"tertiary_fixed_dim\",\"#ccc5bf\"],[\"tertiary_fixed\",\"#e9e1da\"],[\"outline\",\"#86736c\"],[\"on_background\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"secondary_fixed_dim\",\"#cfc4be\"],[\"error_container\",\"#ffdad6\"],[\"secondary_fixed\",\"#ece0da\"],[\"on_secondary_container\",\"#69615c\"],[\"on_error_container\",\"#93000a\"],[\"secondary\",\"#655d58\"],[\"on_primary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"primary\",\"#8c4a2d\"],[\"surface_container_low\",\"#f6f3f0\"],[\"tertiary_container\",\"#79746e\"],[\"inverse_primary\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"clay-dark\",\"#A85E40\"],[\"on_surface_variant\",\"#53433d\"],[\"surface_container_high\",\"#eae8e5\"],[\"inverse_surface\",\"#31302f\"],[\"secondary_container\",\"#e9ddd7\"],[\"primary_fixed_dim\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"on_error\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"ink-light\",\"#5A4E48\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed\",\"#1e1b17\"],[\"surface\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"surface_tint\",\"#8f4c2f\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed_variant\",\"#4d4541\"],[\"surface_bright\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"primary_container\",\"#aa6243\"],[\"on_primary_fixed\",\"#360f00\"],[\"surface_container_lowest\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_primary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"background\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_primary_fixed_variant\",\"#72351a\"],[\"on_secondary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed\",\"#201a17\"],[\"border-subtle\",\"#E8DDD6\"],[\"tertiary\",\"#605b56\"]],\"---\\nname: Stitch Design System\\ncolors:\\n  surface: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-dim: '#dcdad7'\\n  surface-bright: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-container-lowest: '#ffffff'\\n  surface-container-low: '#f6f3f0'\\n  surface-container: '#f0edea'\\n  surface-container-high: '#eae8e5'\\n  surface-container-highest: '#e5e2df'\\n  on-surface: '#1c1c1a'\\n  on-surface-variant: '#53433d'\\n  inverse-surface: '#31302f'\\n  inverse-on-surface: '#f3f0ed'\\n  outline: '#86736c'\\n  outline-variant: '#d9c2b9'\\n  surface-tint: '#8f4c2f'\\n  primary: '#8c4a2d'\\n  on-primary: '#ffffff'\\n  primary-container: '#aa6243'\\n  on-primary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  inverse-primary: '#ffb597'\\n  secondary: '#655d58'\\n  on-secondary: '#ffffff'\\n  secondary-container: '#e9ddd7'\\n  on-secondary-container: '#69615c'\\n  tertiary: '#605b56'\\n  on-tertiary: '#ffffff'\\n  tertiary-container: '#79746e'\\n  on-tertiary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  error: '#ba1a1a'\\n  on-error: '#ffffff'\\n  error-container: '#ffdad6'\\n  on-error-container: '#93000a'\\n  primary-fixed: '#ffdbcd'\\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#ffb597'\\n  on-primary-fixed: '#360f00'\\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#72351a'\\n  secondary-fixed: '#ece0da'\\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#cfc4be'\\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#201a17'\\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#4d4541'\\n  tertiary-fixed: '#e9e1da'\\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#ccc5bf'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#1e1b17'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#4a4641'\\n  background: '#fcf9f6'\\n  on-background: '#1c1c1a'\\n  surface-variant: '#e5e2df'\\n  clay-dark: '#A85E40'\\n  ink-light: '#5A4E48'\\n  sage: '#D6E4D8'\\n  cream-warm: '#F2ECE6'\\n  border-subtle: '#E8DDD6'\\ntypography:\\n  display:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 80px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.1'\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\n  display-mobile:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 44px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n  headline-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 40px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  headline-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 32px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  body-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.8'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.01em\\n  body-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.85'\\n  label-uppercase:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 12px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.15em\\n  caption:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 11px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.4'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.05em\\nrounded:\\n  sm: 0.25rem\\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\\n  md: 0.75rem\\n  lg: 1rem\\n  xl: 1.5rem\\n  full: 9999px\\nspacing:\\n  container-max: 1440px\\n  section-gap-desktop: 80px\\n  section-gap-mobile: 48px\\n  grid-gutter: 24px\\n  element-gap-sm: 8px\\n  element-gap-md: 16px\\n  element-gap-lg: 32px\\n---\\n\\n## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Colors\\n\\nThe palette is inspired by natural, undyed fibers and earthen materials. \\n\\n- **Primary (Clay):** Used for call-to-actions, price accents, and critical indicators. It provides a warm, energetic contrast to the neutral base.\\n- **Secondary (Ink):** The foundation for readability. Used for all primary headings and body text to ensure high legibility against light backgrounds.\\n- **Tertiary (Blush):** A soft accent for secondary surfaces, card backgrounds, and promotional banners.\\n- **Neutral (Cream):** The primary canvas. This off-white base reduces eye strain and feels more premium and \\\"organic\\\" than pure white.\\n- **Named Colors:** **Sage** is reserved for eco-specific callouts or decorative elements to reinforce the sustainability narrative. **Ink-light** is used for secondary navigation and metadata to create visual hierarchy.\\n\\n## Typography\\n\\nThis design system employs a high-contrast pairing to balance heritage and modernity.\\n\\n- **Headlines:** Use **DM Serif Display**. Its graceful curves and high contrast evoke luxury and editorial authority. Use it sparingly for section headers and hero statements.\\n- **Body \\u0026 UI:** Use **DM Sans**. This low-contrast geometric sans-serif ensures maximum legibility across all digital interfaces. \\n- **The \\\"Label-Uppercase\\\" Style:** This is a signature brand element. Use it for navigation, small headings over titles, and button labels. The generous letter-spacing (tracking) is essential to achieving the \\\"premium\\\" feel.\\n- **Line Height:** Maintain a generous line height (1.8 - 1.85) for body text to reinforce the airy, spacious aesthetic.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Shapes\\n\\nThe shape language is \\\"Soft-Modern,\\\" utilizing rounded corners to evoke friendliness and comfort—qualities essential to a wearable fashion brand.\\n\\n- **Small Elements (Buttons, Tags, Pills):** Use `rounded-full` (pill-shaped). This creates a distinct interactive language that feels modern and approachable.\\n- **Medium Elements (Product Images, Floating Cards):** Use `rounded-lg` (1rem / 16px). This softens the grid without making it feel juvenile.\\n- **Large Elements (Banners, Testimonial Containers):** Use `rounded-xl` (1.5rem / 24px) to create \\\"enveloping\\\" containers that feel substantial and high-end.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",6,\"#c97b5a\",\"#2a2420\",\"#f5ede6\",\"#faf7f4\",2,[[\"body-lg\",[\"DM Sans\",\"16px\",\"400\",\"1.8\",\"0.01em\"]],[\"body-md\",[\"DM Sans\",\"14px\",\"400\",\"1.85\"]],[\"display\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"80px\",\"400\",\"1.1\",\"-0.02em\"]],[\"display-mobile\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"44px\",\"400\",\"1.2\"]],[\"label-uppercase\",[\"DM Sans\",\"12px\",\"500\",\"1.2\",\"0.15em\"]],[\"headline-lg\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"40px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"headline-md\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"32px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"caption\",[\"DM Sans\",\"11px\",\"500\",\"1.4\",\"0.05em\"]]],[[\"element-gap-md\",\"16px\"],[\"element-gap-sm\",\"8px\"],[\"section-gap-mobile\",\"48px\"],[\"container-max\",\"1440px\"],[\"grid-gutter\",\"24px\"],[\"section-gap-desktop\",\"80px\"],[\"element-gap-lg\",\"32px\"]],null,\"dmSerifDisplay\",\"Dm Sans\",\"Dm Sans\"],2,1,null,[null,2,null,null,2,2],null,null,[\"assets/f84726af88af499598b78556bda4af11\",null,[\"Stitch Design System\",null,\"## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",[1,null,3,null,\"#c97b5a\",null,null,null,null,null,26,26,[[\"primary\",\"#8c4a2d\"],[\"surface_container_low\",\"#f6f3f0\"],[\"inverse_primary\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"tertiary_container\",\"#79746e\"],[\"on_primary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"surface_container_high\",\"#eae8e5\"],[\"on_surface_variant\",\"#53433d\"],[\"inverse_surface\",\"#31302f\"],[\"secondary_container\",\"#e9ddd7\"],[\"clay-dark\",\"#A85E40\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed\",\"#1e1b17\"],[\"ink-light\",\"#5A4E48\"],[\"surface_tint\",\"#8f4c2f\"],[\"surface\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed_variant\",\"#4d4541\"],[\"primary_fixed_dim\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"on_error\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_primary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"surface_container_lowest\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_primary_fixed_variant\",\"#72351a\"],[\"background\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed\",\"#201a17\"],[\"on_secondary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"tertiary\",\"#605b56\"],[\"border-subtle\",\"#E8DDD6\"],[\"primary_container\",\"#aa6243\"],[\"surface_bright\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_primary_fixed\",\"#360f00\"],[\"on_tertiary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"inverse_on_surface\",\"#f3f0ed\"],[\"on_tertiary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"surface_container_highest\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"sage\",\"#D6E4D8\"],[\"on_surface\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"surface_dim\",\"#dcdad7\"],[\"cream-warm\",\"#F2ECE6\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed_variant\",\"#4a4641\"],[\"surface_variant\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"outline\",\"#86736c\"],[\"tertiary_fixed\",\"#e9e1da\"],[\"tertiary_fixed_dim\",\"#ccc5bf\"],[\"surface_container\",\"#f0edea\"],[\"primary_fixed\",\"#ffdbcd\"],[\"error\",\"#ba1a1a\"],[\"outline_variant\",\"#d9c2b9\"],[\"secondary\",\"#655d58\"],[\"secondary_fixed_dim\",\"#cfc4be\"],[\"on_background\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"error_container\",\"#ffdad6\"],[\"secondary_fixed\",\"#ece0da\"],[\"on_secondary_container\",\"#69615c\"],[\"on_error_container\",\"#93000a\"]],\"---\\nname: Stitch Design System\\ncolors:\\n  surface: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-dim: '#dcdad7'\\n  surface-bright: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-container-lowest: '#ffffff'\\n  surface-container-low: '#f6f3f0'\\n  surface-container: '#f0edea'\\n  surface-container-high: '#eae8e5'\\n  surface-container-highest: '#e5e2df'\\n  on-surface: '#1c1c1a'\\n  on-surface-variant: '#53433d'\\n  inverse-surface: '#31302f'\\n  inverse-on-surface: '#f3f0ed'\\n  outline: '#86736c'\\n  outline-variant: '#d9c2b9'\\n  surface-tint: '#8f4c2f'\\n  primary: '#8c4a2d'\\n  on-primary: '#ffffff'\\n  primary-container: '#aa6243'\\n  on-primary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  inverse-primary: '#ffb597'\\n  secondary: '#655d58'\\n  on-secondary: '#ffffff'\\n  secondary-container: '#e9ddd7'\\n  on-secondary-container: '#69615c'\\n  tertiary: '#605b56'\\n  on-tertiary: '#ffffff'\\n  tertiary-container: '#79746e'\\n  on-tertiary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  error: '#ba1a1a'\\n  on-error: '#ffffff'\\n  error-container: '#ffdad6'\\n  on-error-container: '#93000a'\\n  primary-fixed: '#ffdbcd'\\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#ffb597'\\n  on-primary-fixed: '#360f00'\\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#72351a'\\n  secondary-fixed: '#ece0da'\\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#cfc4be'\\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#201a17'\\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#4d4541'\\n  tertiary-fixed: '#e9e1da'\\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#ccc5bf'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#1e1b17'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#4a4641'\\n  background: '#fcf9f6'\\n  on-background: '#1c1c1a'\\n  surface-variant: '#e5e2df'\\n  clay-dark: '#A85E40'\\n  ink-light: '#5A4E48'\\n  sage: '#D6E4D8'\\n  cream-warm: '#F2ECE6'\\n  border-subtle: '#E8DDD6'\\ntypography:\\n  display:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 80px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.1'\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\n  display-mobile:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 44px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n  headline-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 40px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  headline-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 32px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  body-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.8'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.01em\\n  body-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.85'\\n  label-uppercase:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 12px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.15em\\n  caption:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 11px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.4'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.05em\\nrounded:\\n  sm: 0.25rem\\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\\n  md: 0.75rem\\n  lg: 1rem\\n  xl: 1.5rem\\n  full: 9999px\\nspacing:\\n  container-max: 1440px\\n  section-gap-desktop: 80px\\n  section-gap-mobile: 48px\\n  grid-gutter: 24px\\n  element-gap-sm: 8px\\n  element-gap-md: 16px\\n  element-gap-lg: 32px\\n---\\n\\n## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Colors\\n\\nThe palette is inspired by natural, undyed fibers and earthen materials. \\n\\n- **Primary (Clay):** Used for call-to-actions, price accents, and critical indicators. It provides a warm, energetic contrast to the neutral base.\\n- **Secondary (Ink):** The foundation for readability. Used for all primary headings and body text to ensure high legibility against light backgrounds.\\n- **Tertiary (Blush):** A soft accent for secondary surfaces, card backgrounds, and promotional banners.\\n- **Neutral (Cream):** The primary canvas. This off-white base reduces eye strain and feels more premium and \\\"organic\\\" than pure white.\\n- **Named Colors:** **Sage** is reserved for eco-specific callouts or decorative elements to reinforce the sustainability narrative. **Ink-light** is used for secondary navigation and metadata to create visual hierarchy.\\n\\n## Typography\\n\\nThis design system employs a high-contrast pairing to balance heritage and modernity.\\n\\n- **Headlines:** Use **DM Serif Display**. Its graceful curves and high contrast evoke luxury and editorial authority. Use it sparingly for section headers and hero statements.\\n- **Body \\u0026 UI:** Use **DM Sans**. This low-contrast geometric sans-serif ensures maximum legibility across all digital interfaces. \\n- **The \\\"Label-Uppercase\\\" Style:** This is a signature brand element. Use it for navigation, small headings over titles, and button labels. The generous letter-spacing (tracking) is essential to achieving the \\\"premium\\\" feel.\\n- **Line Height:** Maintain a generous line height (1.8 - 1.85) for body text to reinforce the airy, spacious aesthetic.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Shapes\\n\\nThe shape language is \\\"Soft-Modern,\\\" utilizing rounded corners to evoke friendliness and comfort—qualities essential to a wearable fashion brand.\\n\\n- **Small Elements (Buttons, Tags, Pills):** Use `rounded-full` (pill-shaped). This creates a distinct interactive language that feels modern and approachable.\\n- **Medium Elements (Product Images, Floating Cards):** Use `rounded-lg` (1rem / 16px). This softens the grid without making it feel juvenile.\\n- **Large Elements (Banners, Testimonial Containers):** Use `rounded-xl` (1.5rem / 24px) to create \\\"enveloping\\\" containers that feel substantial and high-end.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",6,\"#c97b5a\",\"#2a2420\",\"#f5ede6\",\"#faf7f4\",2,[[\"display-mobile\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"44px\",\"400\",\"1.2\"]],[\"label-uppercase\",[\"DM Sans\",\"12px\",\"500\",\"1.2\",\"0.15em\"]],[\"body-lg\",[\"DM Sans\",\"16px\",\"400\",\"1.8\",\"0.01em\"]],[\"display\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"80px\",\"400\",\"1.1\",\"-0.02em\"]],[\"body-md\",[\"DM Sans\",\"14px\",\"400\",\"1.85\"]],[\"caption\",[\"DM Sans\",\"11px\",\"500\",\"1.4\",\"0.05em\"]],[\"headline-lg\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"40px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"headline-md\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"32px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]]],[[\"element-gap-md\",\"16px\"],[\"element-gap-sm\",\"8px\"],[\"section-gap-mobile\",\"48px\"],[\"container-max\",\"1440px\"],[\"section-gap-desktop\",\"80px\"],[\"grid-gutter\",\"24px\"],[\"element-gap-lg\",\"32px\"]],null,\"dmSerifDisplay\",\"Dm Sans\",\"Dm Sans\"]],1]],[[\"projects/18178749605532028059/files/225141231481094616\",null,\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida/AP1WRLsapfdBVfVRJgpbTo9dp3dwz3I3fQacuT2ChozCDUs1ic6GzSNmYVGGEG9ZiamRPm0ZPkKSbUWoXqMmISyEQHEnzc2aug2mwECb3YrHErFeII7zgbYUECZ9cZp1nM-EG24qpmFLUEs-jHUngvRgM-34ppBg4krIfK-kj9zsENW9X5jA9A7SiCIAapXfxFC-TkSyQylh2iBFv0tEQL5kjxe6z_V1idKOarm6hRasNspQjIpMhU2WJi-_Ojgt\"],[\"projects/18178749605532028059/files/14711149305455259918\",null,\"https://contribution.usercontent.google.com/download?c\\u003dCgthaWRhX2NvZGVmeBJ8Eh1hcHBfY29tcGFuaW9uX2dlbmVyYXRlZF9maWxlcxpbCiVodG1sXzAwMDY1M2UxNzA5ZDBhZjEwMmQzYzU2ZTU2Mjk2MzA2EgsSBxDv9_C4jw8YAZIBJAoKcHJvamVjdF9pZBIWQhQxODE3ODc0OTYwNTUzMjAyODA1OQ\\u0026filename\\u003d\\u0026opi\\u003d89354086\",null,null,\"text/html\"],null,null,\"1c37991722fd49c2b256f79a04ebd8d5\",\"figaro_agent\",\"2560\",\"3922\",\"Stitch — Giỏ hàng\",\"Create a high-fidelity Shopping Cart page for \\\"Stitch\\\", a sustainable fashion brand. \\n\\nThe page should include:\\n1. **Header**: The predicted TopNavBar with \\\"Shop All\\\", \\\"Women\\\", \\\"Men\\\", \\\"Accessories\\\", \\\"Our Story\\\", and \\\"Orders\\\".\\n2. **Main Cart Content**:\\n   - A clear \\\"Giỏ hàng của bạn\\\" (Your Cart) heading in a serif font.\\n   - A list of cart items. Each item should have: a placeholder product image, product name (e.g., \\\"Áo khoác Wool Blend\\\", \\\"Đầm Maxi Flowy\\\"), variant details (Color/Size), price, quantity selector, and a 'Remove' button.\\n   - Use the brand's clay (#c97b5a) and ink (#2a2420) colors.\\n3. **Cart Summary (Sidebar or Right Column)**:\\n   - \\\"Tóm tắt đơn hàng\\\" (Order Summary) section.\\n   - Subtotal, Shipping (mention \\\"Miễn phí\\\" for free shipping), and Total.\\n   - A \\\"Thanh toán ngay\\\" (Checkout Now) primary button in dark ink.\\n   - A field for discount codes (\\\"Mã giảm giá\\\").\\n   - Payment icons (Visa, Mastercard, etc.) for trust.\\n4. **Upsell Section**: \\\"Có thể bạn cũng thích\\\" (You might also like) with 2-3 product cards.\\n5. **Brand Promises**: Icons for \\\"Free Shipping\\\", \\\"30-day Returns\\\", and \\\"Sustainable Fabric\\\".\\n6. **Footer**: The predicted Footer.\\n\\nThe style should be minimal, using plenty of white space, subtle borders, and the DM Serif Display/DM Sans font pairing from the design system. Language: Vietnamese.\",\"projects/18178749605532028059/screens/1c37991722fd49c2b256f79a04ebd8d5\",[1,null,3,null,\"#c97b5a\",null,null,null,null,null,26,26,[[\"surface_container_high\",\"#eae8e5\"],[\"on_surface_variant\",\"#53433d\"],[\"inverse_surface\",\"#31302f\"],[\"secondary_container\",\"#e9ddd7\"],[\"clay-dark\",\"#A85E40\"],[\"primary\",\"#8c4a2d\"],[\"surface_container_low\",\"#f6f3f0\"],[\"inverse_primary\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"tertiary_container\",\"#79746e\"],[\"on_primary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_primary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"surface_container_lowest\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_primary_fixed_variant\",\"#72351a\"],[\"background\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed\",\"#201a17\"],[\"on_secondary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"border-subtle\",\"#E8DDD6\"],[\"tertiary\",\"#605b56\"],[\"primary_container\",\"#aa6243\"],[\"surface_bright\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_primary_fixed\",\"#360f00\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed\",\"#1e1b17\"],[\"ink-light\",\"#5A4E48\"],[\"surface_tint\",\"#8f4c2f\"],[\"surface\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed_variant\",\"#4d4541\"],[\"primary_fixed_dim\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"on_error\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_surface\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"surface_dim\",\"#dcdad7\"],[\"cream-warm\",\"#F2ECE6\"],[\"on_tertiary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"inverse_on_surface\",\"#f3f0ed\"],[\"on_tertiary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"surface_container_highest\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"sage\",\"#D6E4D8\"],[\"secondary\",\"#655d58\"],[\"secondary_fixed_dim\",\"#cfc4be\"],[\"on_background\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"error_container\",\"#ffdad6\"],[\"secondary_fixed\",\"#ece0da\"],[\"on_secondary_container\",\"#69615c\"],[\"on_error_container\",\"#93000a\"],[\"surface_variant\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed_variant\",\"#4a4641\"],[\"tertiary_fixed_dim\",\"#ccc5bf\"],[\"tertiary_fixed\",\"#e9e1da\"],[\"outline\",\"#86736c\"],[\"surface_container\",\"#f0edea\"],[\"primary_fixed\",\"#ffdbcd\"],[\"error\",\"#ba1a1a\"],[\"outline_variant\",\"#d9c2b9\"]],\"---\\nname: Stitch Design System\\ncolors:\\n  surface: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-dim: '#dcdad7'\\n  surface-bright: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-container-lowest: '#ffffff'\\n  surface-container-low: '#f6f3f0'\\n  surface-container: '#f0edea'\\n  surface-container-high: '#eae8e5'\\n  surface-container-highest: '#e5e2df'\\n  on-surface: '#1c1c1a'\\n  on-surface-variant: '#53433d'\\n  inverse-surface: '#31302f'\\n  inverse-on-surface: '#f3f0ed'\\n  outline: '#86736c'\\n  outline-variant: '#d9c2b9'\\n  surface-tint: '#8f4c2f'\\n  primary: '#8c4a2d'\\n  on-primary: '#ffffff'\\n  primary-container: '#aa6243'\\n  on-primary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  inverse-primary: '#ffb597'\\n  secondary: '#655d58'\\n  on-secondary: '#ffffff'\\n  secondary-container: '#e9ddd7'\\n  on-secondary-container: '#69615c'\\n  tertiary: '#605b56'\\n  on-tertiary: '#ffffff'\\n  tertiary-container: '#79746e'\\n  on-tertiary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  error: '#ba1a1a'\\n  on-error: '#ffffff'\\n  error-container: '#ffdad6'\\n  on-error-container: '#93000a'\\n  primary-fixed: '#ffdbcd'\\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#ffb597'\\n  on-primary-fixed: '#360f00'\\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#72351a'\\n  secondary-fixed: '#ece0da'\\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#cfc4be'\\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#201a17'\\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#4d4541'\\n  tertiary-fixed: '#e9e1da'\\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#ccc5bf'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#1e1b17'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#4a4641'\\n  background: '#fcf9f6'\\n  on-background: '#1c1c1a'\\n  surface-variant: '#e5e2df'\\n  clay-dark: '#A85E40'\\n  ink-light: '#5A4E48'\\n  sage: '#D6E4D8'\\n  cream-warm: '#F2ECE6'\\n  border-subtle: '#E8DDD6'\\ntypography:\\n  display:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 80px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.1'\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\n  display-mobile:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 44px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n  headline-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 40px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  headline-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 32px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  body-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.8'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.01em\\n  body-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.85'\\n  label-uppercase:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 12px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.15em\\n  caption:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 11px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.4'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.05em\\nrounded:\\n  sm: 0.25rem\\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\\n  md: 0.75rem\\n  lg: 1rem\\n  xl: 1.5rem\\n  full: 9999px\\nspacing:\\n  container-max: 1440px\\n  section-gap-desktop: 80px\\n  section-gap-mobile: 48px\\n  grid-gutter: 24px\\n  element-gap-sm: 8px\\n  element-gap-md: 16px\\n  element-gap-lg: 32px\\n---\\n\\n## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Colors\\n\\nThe palette is inspired by natural, undyed fibers and earthen materials. \\n\\n- **Primary (Clay):** Used for call-to-actions, price accents, and critical indicators. It provides a warm, energetic contrast to the neutral base.\\n- **Secondary (Ink):** The foundation for readability. Used for all primary headings and body text to ensure high legibility against light backgrounds.\\n- **Tertiary (Blush):** A soft accent for secondary surfaces, card backgrounds, and promotional banners.\\n- **Neutral (Cream):** The primary canvas. This off-white base reduces eye strain and feels more premium and \\\"organic\\\" than pure white.\\n- **Named Colors:** **Sage** is reserved for eco-specific callouts or decorative elements to reinforce the sustainability narrative. **Ink-light** is used for secondary navigation and metadata to create visual hierarchy.\\n\\n## Typography\\n\\nThis design system employs a high-contrast pairing to balance heritage and modernity.\\n\\n- **Headlines:** Use **DM Serif Display**. Its graceful curves and high contrast evoke luxury and editorial authority. Use it sparingly for section headers and hero statements.\\n- **Body \\u0026 UI:** Use **DM Sans**. This low-contrast geometric sans-serif ensures maximum legibility across all digital interfaces. \\n- **The \\\"Label-Uppercase\\\" Style:** This is a signature brand element. Use it for navigation, small headings over titles, and button labels. The generous letter-spacing (tracking) is essential to achieving the \\\"premium\\\" feel.\\n- **Line Height:** Maintain a generous line height (1.8 - 1.85) for body text to reinforce the airy, spacious aesthetic.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Shapes\\n\\nThe shape language is \\\"Soft-Modern,\\\" utilizing rounded corners to evoke friendliness and comfort—qualities essential to a wearable fashion brand.\\n\\n- **Small Elements (Buttons, Tags, Pills):** Use `rounded-full` (pill-shaped). This creates a distinct interactive language that feels modern and approachable.\\n- **Medium Elements (Product Images, Floating Cards):** Use `rounded-lg` (1rem / 16px). This softens the grid without making it feel juvenile.\\n- **Large Elements (Banners, Testimonial Containers):** Use `rounded-xl` (1.5rem / 24px) to create \\\"enveloping\\\" containers that feel substantial and high-end.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",6,\"#c97b5a\",\"#2a2420\",\"#f5ede6\",\"#faf7f4\",2,[[\"body-lg\",[\"DM Sans\",\"16px\",\"400\",\"1.8\",\"0.01em\"]],[\"body-md\",[\"DM Sans\",\"14px\",\"400\",\"1.85\"]],[\"display\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"80px\",\"400\",\"1.1\",\"-0.02em\"]],[\"display-mobile\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"44px\",\"400\",\"1.2\"]],[\"label-uppercase\",[\"DM Sans\",\"12px\",\"500\",\"1.2\",\"0.15em\"]],[\"headline-lg\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"40px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"headline-md\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"32px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"caption\",[\"DM Sans\",\"11px\",\"500\",\"1.4\",\"0.05em\"]]],[[\"container-max\",\"1440px\"],[\"element-gap-sm\",\"8px\"],[\"section-gap-mobile\",\"48px\"],[\"element-gap-lg\",\"32px\"],[\"grid-gutter\",\"24px\"],[\"section-gap-desktop\",\"80px\"],[\"element-gap-md\",\"16px\"]],null,\"dmSerifDisplay\",\"Dm Sans\",\"Dm Sans\"],2,1,null,[null,2,null,null,2,2],null,null,[\"assets/f84726af88af499598b78556bda4af11\",null,[\"Stitch Design System\",null,\"## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",[1,null,3,null,\"#c97b5a\",null,null,null,null,null,26,26,[[\"ink-light\",\"#5A4E48\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed\",\"#1e1b17\"],[\"surface\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"surface_tint\",\"#8f4c2f\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed_variant\",\"#4d4541\"],[\"primary_fixed_dim\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"on_error\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"surface_container_lowest\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_primary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"background\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_primary_fixed_variant\",\"#72351a\"],[\"on_secondary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed\",\"#201a17\"],[\"tertiary\",\"#605b56\"],[\"border-subtle\",\"#E8DDD6\"],[\"surface_bright\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"primary_container\",\"#aa6243\"],[\"on_primary_fixed\",\"#360f00\"],[\"primary\",\"#8c4a2d\"],[\"surface_container_low\",\"#f6f3f0\"],[\"tertiary_container\",\"#79746e\"],[\"inverse_primary\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"on_primary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"surface_container_high\",\"#eae8e5\"],[\"on_surface_variant\",\"#53433d\"],[\"inverse_surface\",\"#31302f\"],[\"secondary_container\",\"#e9ddd7\"],[\"clay-dark\",\"#A85E40\"],[\"surface_variant\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed_variant\",\"#4a4641\"],[\"tertiary_fixed_dim\",\"#ccc5bf\"],[\"tertiary_fixed\",\"#e9e1da\"],[\"outline\",\"#86736c\"],[\"surface_container\",\"#f0edea\"],[\"error\",\"#ba1a1a\"],[\"primary_fixed\",\"#ffdbcd\"],[\"outline_variant\",\"#d9c2b9\"],[\"secondary\",\"#655d58\"],[\"on_background\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"secondary_fixed_dim\",\"#cfc4be\"],[\"error_container\",\"#ffdad6\"],[\"secondary_fixed\",\"#ece0da\"],[\"on_secondary_container\",\"#69615c\"],[\"on_error_container\",\"#93000a\"],[\"on_tertiary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"inverse_on_surface\",\"#f3f0ed\"],[\"on_tertiary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"surface_container_highest\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"sage\",\"#D6E4D8\"],[\"on_surface\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"surface_dim\",\"#dcdad7\"],[\"cream-warm\",\"#F2ECE6\"]],\"---\\nname: Stitch Design System\\ncolors:\\n  surface: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-dim: '#dcdad7'\\n  surface-bright: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-container-lowest: '#ffffff'\\n  surface-container-low: '#f6f3f0'\\n  surface-container: '#f0edea'\\n  surface-container-high: '#eae8e5'\\n  surface-container-highest: '#e5e2df'\\n  on-surface: '#1c1c1a'\\n  on-surface-variant: '#53433d'\\n  inverse-surface: '#31302f'\\n  inverse-on-surface: '#f3f0ed'\\n  outline: '#86736c'\\n  outline-variant: '#d9c2b9'\\n  surface-tint: '#8f4c2f'\\n  primary: '#8c4a2d'\\n  on-primary: '#ffffff'\\n  primary-container: '#aa6243'\\n  on-primary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  inverse-primary: '#ffb597'\\n  secondary: '#655d58'\\n  on-secondary: '#ffffff'\\n  secondary-container: '#e9ddd7'\\n  on-secondary-container: '#69615c'\\n  tertiary: '#605b56'\\n  on-tertiary: '#ffffff'\\n  tertiary-container: '#79746e'\\n  on-tertiary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  error: '#ba1a1a'\\n  on-error: '#ffffff'\\n  error-container: '#ffdad6'\\n  on-error-container: '#93000a'\\n  primary-fixed: '#ffdbcd'\\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#ffb597'\\n  on-primary-fixed: '#360f00'\\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#72351a'\\n  secondary-fixed: '#ece0da'\\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#cfc4be'\\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#201a17'\\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#4d4541'\\n  tertiary-fixed: '#e9e1da'\\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#ccc5bf'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#1e1b17'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#4a4641'\\n  background: '#fcf9f6'\\n  on-background: '#1c1c1a'\\n  surface-variant: '#e5e2df'\\n  clay-dark: '#A85E40'\\n  ink-light: '#5A4E48'\\n  sage: '#D6E4D8'\\n  cream-warm: '#F2ECE6'\\n  border-subtle: '#E8DDD6'\\ntypography:\\n  display:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 80px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.1'\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\n  display-mobile:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 44px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n  headline-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 40px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  headline-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 32px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  body-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.8'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.01em\\n  body-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.85'\\n  label-uppercase:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 12px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.15em\\n  caption:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 11px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.4'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.05em\\nrounded:\\n  sm: 0.25rem\\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\\n  md: 0.75rem\\n  lg: 1rem\\n  xl: 1.5rem\\n  full: 9999px\\nspacing:\\n  container-max: 1440px\\n  section-gap-desktop: 80px\\n  section-gap-mobile: 48px\\n  grid-gutter: 24px\\n  element-gap-sm: 8px\\n  element-gap-md: 16px\\n  element-gap-lg: 32px\\n---\\n\\n## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Colors\\n\\nThe palette is inspired by natural, undyed fibers and earthen materials. \\n\\n- **Primary (Clay):** Used for call-to-actions, price accents, and critical indicators. It provides a warm, energetic contrast to the neutral base.\\n- **Secondary (Ink):** The foundation for readability. Used for all primary headings and body text to ensure high legibility against light backgrounds.\\n- **Tertiary (Blush):** A soft accent for secondary surfaces, card backgrounds, and promotional banners.\\n- **Neutral (Cream):** The primary canvas. This off-white base reduces eye strain and feels more premium and \\\"organic\\\" than pure white.\\n- **Named Colors:** **Sage** is reserved for eco-specific callouts or decorative elements to reinforce the sustainability narrative. **Ink-light** is used for secondary navigation and metadata to create visual hierarchy.\\n\\n## Typography\\n\\nThis design system employs a high-contrast pairing to balance heritage and modernity.\\n\\n- **Headlines:** Use **DM Serif Display**. Its graceful curves and high contrast evoke luxury and editorial authority. Use it sparingly for section headers and hero statements.\\n- **Body \\u0026 UI:** Use **DM Sans**. This low-contrast geometric sans-serif ensures maximum legibility across all digital interfaces. \\n- **The \\\"Label-Uppercase\\\" Style:** This is a signature brand element. Use it for navigation, small headings over titles, and button labels. The generous letter-spacing (tracking) is essential to achieving the \\\"premium\\\" feel.\\n- **Line Height:** Maintain a generous line height (1.8 - 1.85) for body text to reinforce the airy, spacious aesthetic.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Shapes\\n\\nThe shape language is \\\"Soft-Modern,\\\" utilizing rounded corners to evoke friendliness and comfort—qualities essential to a wearable fashion brand.\\n\\n- **Small Elements (Buttons, Tags, Pills):** Use `rounded-full` (pill-shaped). This creates a distinct interactive language that feels modern and approachable.\\n- **Medium Elements (Product Images, Floating Cards):** Use `rounded-lg` (1rem / 16px). This softens the grid without making it feel juvenile.\\n- **Large Elements (Banners, Testimonial Containers):** Use `rounded-xl` (1.5rem / 24px) to create \\\"enveloping\\\" containers that feel substantial and high-end.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",6,\"#c97b5a\",\"#2a2420\",\"#f5ede6\",\"#faf7f4\",2,[[\"body-lg\",[\"DM Sans\",\"16px\",\"400\",\"1.8\",\"0.01em\"]],[\"body-md\",[\"DM Sans\",\"14px\",\"400\",\"1.85\"]],[\"display\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"80px\",\"400\",\"1.1\",\"-0.02em\"]],[\"display-mobile\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"44px\",\"400\",\"1.2\"]],[\"label-uppercase\",[\"DM Sans\",\"12px\",\"500\",\"1.2\",\"0.15em\"]],[\"headline-lg\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"40px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"headline-md\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"32px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"caption\",[\"DM Sans\",\"11px\",\"500\",\"1.4\",\"0.05em\"]]],[[\"container-max\",\"1440px\"],[\"section-gap-mobile\",\"48px\"],[\"element-gap-sm\",\"8px\"],[\"element-gap-lg\",\"32px\"],[\"grid-gutter\",\"24px\"],[\"section-gap-desktop\",\"80px\"],[\"element-gap-md\",\"16px\"]],null,\"dmSerifDisplay\",\"Dm Sans\",\"Dm Sans\"]],1]],[[\"projects/18178749605532028059/files/fdb65fb8ac354076871d3dbc82d64a38\",null,\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida/AP1WRLubMmGUd7BQ7_LoaFbQ8tGWeENU2WBAFwpBnOfWK14yBxzNS2FV2bZ5LtX2zpsKYKW-k-45QiPvBSK_RIZPyC4Xyyuqk9Jq9ZOQy5bVZe0F9ASEEGVvWvzkYhXvoQfUhItmguQTGAyRIh9ojaUoOSc0oMk19cGqZjNN4-6YxIln_zXJ9L2tBb_hGjDMvFO-5ux1GNHLVth9Pu5YqNoSDFF0NcJoXJ6TpYchzSEU3J3R0W967wpV5AHrUvVb\"],[\"projects/18178749605532028059/files/f94cf8e1d8d94ababead9a672dcb6322\",null,\"https://contribution.usercontent.google.com/download?c\\u003dCgthaWRhX2NvZGVmeBJ8Eh1hcHBfY29tcGFuaW9uX2dlbmVyYXRlZF9maWxlcxpbCiVodG1sXzcxODY0Mjc2ZjBjYjRmMzM5ZTY3MzhjMjgyOTQwMzEwEgsSBxDv9_C4jw8YAZIBJAoKcHJvamVjdF9pZBIWQhQxODE3ODc0OTYwNTUzMjAyODA1OQ\\u0026filename\\u003d\\u0026opi\\u003d89354086\",null,null,\"text/html\"],null,null,\"7481b60a17f0440fb6f6a6ec26cdccbb\",\"HatterAgent\",\"2560\",\"4158\",\"Stitch — Thanh toán (Updated Footer)\",\"Synchronize the footer to match the updated Kids Fashion theme on the homepage. Ensure it includes the 'Kết nối với STITCH' newsletter section, organized shopping links (Bé trai, Bé gái, Giày dép), and professional contact information as seen on the primary screen.\",\"projects/18178749605532028059/screens/7481b60a17f0440fb6f6a6ec26cdccbb\",[1,null,3,null,\"#c97b5a\",null,null,null,null,null,26,26,[[\"error\",\"#ba1a1a\"],[\"primary_fixed\",\"#ffdbcd\"],[\"outline_variant\",\"#d9c2b9\"],[\"surface_container\",\"#f0edea\"],[\"surface_variant\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed_variant\",\"#4a4641\"],[\"tertiary_fixed_dim\",\"#ccc5bf\"],[\"tertiary_fixed\",\"#e9e1da\"],[\"outline\",\"#86736c\"],[\"on_secondary_container\",\"#69615c\"],[\"secondary_fixed\",\"#ece0da\"],[\"on_error_container\",\"#93000a\"],[\"on_background\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"secondary_fixed_dim\",\"#cfc4be\"],[\"error_container\",\"#ffdad6\"],[\"secondary\",\"#655d58\"],[\"surface_container_highest\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"sage\",\"#D6E4D8\"],[\"inverse_on_surface\",\"#f3f0ed\"],[\"on_tertiary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_tertiary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"cream-warm\",\"#F2ECE6\"],[\"surface_dim\",\"#dcdad7\"],[\"on_surface\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"primary_fixed_dim\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"on_error\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"surface\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"surface_tint\",\"#8f4c2f\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed_variant\",\"#4d4541\"],[\"ink-light\",\"#5A4E48\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed\",\"#1e1b17\"],[\"on_primary_fixed\",\"#360f00\"],[\"surface_bright\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"primary_container\",\"#aa6243\"],[\"on_secondary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed\",\"#201a17\"],[\"tertiary\",\"#605b56\"],[\"border-subtle\",\"#E8DDD6\"],[\"surface_container_lowest\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_primary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"background\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_primary_fixed_variant\",\"#72351a\"],[\"on_primary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"tertiary_container\",\"#79746e\"],[\"inverse_primary\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"surface_container_low\",\"#f6f3f0\"],[\"primary\",\"#8c4a2d\"],[\"clay-dark\",\"#A85E40\"],[\"surface_container_high\",\"#eae8e5\"],[\"on_surface_variant\",\"#53433d\"],[\"inverse_surface\",\"#31302f\"],[\"secondary_container\",\"#e9ddd7\"]],\"---\\nname: Stitch Design System\\ncolors:\\n  surface: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-dim: '#dcdad7'\\n  surface-bright: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-container-lowest: '#ffffff'\\n  surface-container-low: '#f6f3f0'\\n  surface-container: '#f0edea'\\n  surface-container-high: '#eae8e5'\\n  surface-container-highest: '#e5e2df'\\n  on-surface: '#1c1c1a'\\n  on-surface-variant: '#53433d'\\n  inverse-surface: '#31302f'\\n  inverse-on-surface: '#f3f0ed'\\n  outline: '#86736c'\\n  outline-variant: '#d9c2b9'\\n  surface-tint: '#8f4c2f'\\n  primary: '#8c4a2d'\\n  on-primary: '#ffffff'\\n  primary-container: '#aa6243'\\n  on-primary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  inverse-primary: '#ffb597'\\n  secondary: '#655d58'\\n  on-secondary: '#ffffff'\\n  secondary-container: '#e9ddd7'\\n  on-secondary-container: '#69615c'\\n  tertiary: '#605b56'\\n  on-tertiary: '#ffffff'\\n  tertiary-container: '#79746e'\\n  on-tertiary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  error: '#ba1a1a'\\n  on-error: '#ffffff'\\n  error-container: '#ffdad6'\\n  on-error-container: '#93000a'\\n  primary-fixed: '#ffdbcd'\\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#ffb597'\\n  on-primary-fixed: '#360f00'\\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#72351a'\\n  secondary-fixed: '#ece0da'\\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#cfc4be'\\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#201a17'\\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#4d4541'\\n  tertiary-fixed: '#e9e1da'\\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#ccc5bf'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#1e1b17'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#4a4641'\\n  background: '#fcf9f6'\\n  on-background: '#1c1c1a'\\n  surface-variant: '#e5e2df'\\n  clay-dark: '#A85E40'\\n  ink-light: '#5A4E48'\\n  sage: '#D6E4D8'\\n  cream-warm: '#F2ECE6'\\n  border-subtle: '#E8DDD6'\\ntypography:\\n  display:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 80px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.1'\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\n  display-mobile:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 44px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n  headline-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 40px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  headline-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 32px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  body-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.8'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.01em\\n  body-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.85'\\n  label-uppercase:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 12px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.15em\\n  caption:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 11px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.4'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.05em\\nrounded:\\n  sm: 0.25rem\\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\\n  md: 0.75rem\\n  lg: 1rem\\n  xl: 1.5rem\\n  full: 9999px\\nspacing:\\n  container-max: 1440px\\n  section-gap-desktop: 80px\\n  section-gap-mobile: 48px\\n  grid-gutter: 24px\\n  element-gap-sm: 8px\\n  element-gap-md: 16px\\n  element-gap-lg: 32px\\n---\\n\\n## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Colors\\n\\nThe palette is inspired by natural, undyed fibers and earthen materials. \\n\\n- **Primary (Clay):** Used for call-to-actions, price accents, and critical indicators. It provides a warm, energetic contrast to the neutral base.\\n- **Secondary (Ink):** The foundation for readability. Used for all primary headings and body text to ensure high legibility against light backgrounds.\\n- **Tertiary (Blush):** A soft accent for secondary surfaces, card backgrounds, and promotional banners.\\n- **Neutral (Cream):** The primary canvas. This off-white base reduces eye strain and feels more premium and \\\"organic\\\" than pure white.\\n- **Named Colors:** **Sage** is reserved for eco-specific callouts or decorative elements to reinforce the sustainability narrative. **Ink-light** is used for secondary navigation and metadata to create visual hierarchy.\\n\\n## Typography\\n\\nThis design system employs a high-contrast pairing to balance heritage and modernity.\\n\\n- **Headlines:** Use **DM Serif Display**. Its graceful curves and high contrast evoke luxury and editorial authority. Use it sparingly for section headers and hero statements.\\n- **Body \\u0026 UI:** Use **DM Sans**. This low-contrast geometric sans-serif ensures maximum legibility across all digital interfaces. \\n- **The \\\"Label-Uppercase\\\" Style:** This is a signature brand element. Use it for navigation, small headings over titles, and button labels. The generous letter-spacing (tracking) is essential to achieving the \\\"premium\\\" feel.\\n- **Line Height:** Maintain a generous line height (1.8 - 1.85) for body text to reinforce the airy, spacious aesthetic.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Shapes\\n\\nThe shape language is \\\"Soft-Modern,\\\" utilizing rounded corners to evoke friendliness and comfort—qualities essential to a wearable fashion brand.\\n\\n- **Small Elements (Buttons, Tags, Pills):** Use `rounded-full` (pill-shaped). This creates a distinct interactive language that feels modern and approachable.\\n- **Medium Elements (Product Images, Floating Cards):** Use `rounded-lg` (1rem / 16px). This softens the grid without making it feel juvenile.\\n- **Large Elements (Banners, Testimonial Containers):** Use `rounded-xl` (1.5rem / 24px) to create \\\"enveloping\\\" containers that feel substantial and high-end.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",6,\"#c97b5a\",\"#2a2420\",\"#f5ede6\",\"#faf7f4\",2,[[\"body-md\",[\"DM Sans\",\"14px\",\"400\",\"1.85\"]],[\"display\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"80px\",\"400\",\"1.1\",\"-0.02em\"]],[\"body-lg\",[\"DM Sans\",\"16px\",\"400\",\"1.8\",\"0.01em\"]],[\"display-mobile\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"44px\",\"400\",\"1.2\"]],[\"label-uppercase\",[\"DM Sans\",\"12px\",\"500\",\"1.2\",\"0.15em\"]],[\"caption\",[\"DM Sans\",\"11px\",\"500\",\"1.4\",\"0.05em\"]],[\"headline-lg\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"40px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"headline-md\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"32px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]]],[[\"section-gap-desktop\",\"80px\"],[\"grid-gutter\",\"24px\"],[\"element-gap-lg\",\"32px\"],[\"element-gap-sm\",\"8px\"],[\"section-gap-mobile\",\"48px\"],[\"container-max\",\"1440px\"],[\"element-gap-md\",\"16px\"]],null,\"dmSerifDisplay\",\"Dm Sans\",\"Dm Sans\"],2,1,null,[null,2,null,null,2],null,null,[\"assets/f84726af88af499598b78556bda4af11\",null,[\"Stitch Design System\",null,\"## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",[1,null,3,null,\"#c97b5a\",null,null,null,null,null,26,26,[[\"on_secondary_fixed_variant\",\"#4d4541\"],[\"surface_tint\",\"#8f4c2f\"],[\"surface\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed\",\"#1e1b17\"],[\"ink-light\",\"#5A4E48\"],[\"on_error\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"primary_fixed_dim\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"border-subtle\",\"#E8DDD6\"],[\"tertiary\",\"#605b56\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed\",\"#201a17\"],[\"on_secondary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_primary_fixed_variant\",\"#72351a\"],[\"background\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_primary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"surface_container_lowest\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_primary_fixed\",\"#360f00\"],[\"primary_container\",\"#aa6243\"],[\"surface_bright\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"inverse_primary\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"tertiary_container\",\"#79746e\"],[\"primary\",\"#8c4a2d\"],[\"surface_container_low\",\"#f6f3f0\"],[\"on_primary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"secondary_container\",\"#e9ddd7\"],[\"surface_container_high\",\"#eae8e5\"],[\"on_surface_variant\",\"#53433d\"],[\"inverse_surface\",\"#31302f\"],[\"clay-dark\",\"#A85E40\"],[\"tertiary_fixed_dim\",\"#ccc5bf\"],[\"tertiary_fixed\",\"#e9e1da\"],[\"outline\",\"#86736c\"],[\"surface_variant\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed_variant\",\"#4a4641\"],[\"outline_variant\",\"#d9c2b9\"],[\"primary_fixed\",\"#ffdbcd\"],[\"error\",\"#ba1a1a\"],[\"surface_container\",\"#f0edea\"],[\"secondary\",\"#655d58\"],[\"on_error_container\",\"#93000a\"],[\"secondary_fixed\",\"#ece0da\"],[\"on_secondary_container\",\"#69615c\"],[\"error_container\",\"#ffdad6\"],[\"secondary_fixed_dim\",\"#cfc4be\"],[\"on_background\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"on_tertiary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"sage\",\"#D6E4D8\"],[\"surface_container_highest\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"on_tertiary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"inverse_on_surface\",\"#f3f0ed\"],[\"on_surface\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"cream-warm\",\"#F2ECE6\"],[\"surface_dim\",\"#dcdad7\"]],\"---\\nname: Stitch Design System\\ncolors:\\n  surface: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-dim: '#dcdad7'\\n  surface-bright: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-container-lowest: '#ffffff'\\n  surface-container-low: '#f6f3f0'\\n  surface-container: '#f0edea'\\n  surface-container-high: '#eae8e5'\\n  surface-container-highest: '#e5e2df'\\n  on-surface: '#1c1c1a'\\n  on-surface-variant: '#53433d'\\n  inverse-surface: '#31302f'\\n  inverse-on-surface: '#f3f0ed'\\n  outline: '#86736c'\\n  outline-variant: '#d9c2b9'\\n  surface-tint: '#8f4c2f'\\n  primary: '#8c4a2d'\\n  on-primary: '#ffffff'\\n  primary-container: '#aa6243'\\n  on-primary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  inverse-primary: '#ffb597'\\n  secondary: '#655d58'\\n  on-secondary: '#ffffff'\\n  secondary-container: '#e9ddd7'\\n  on-secondary-container: '#69615c'\\n  tertiary: '#605b56'\\n  on-tertiary: '#ffffff'\\n  tertiary-container: '#79746e'\\n  on-tertiary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  error: '#ba1a1a'\\n  on-error: '#ffffff'\\n  error-container: '#ffdad6'\\n  on-error-container: '#93000a'\\n  primary-fixed: '#ffdbcd'\\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#ffb597'\\n  on-primary-fixed: '#360f00'\\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#72351a'\\n  secondary-fixed: '#ece0da'\\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#cfc4be'\\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#201a17'\\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#4d4541'\\n  tertiary-fixed: '#e9e1da'\\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#ccc5bf'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#1e1b17'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#4a4641'\\n  background: '#fcf9f6'\\n  on-background: '#1c1c1a'\\n  surface-variant: '#e5e2df'\\n  clay-dark: '#A85E40'\\n  ink-light: '#5A4E48'\\n  sage: '#D6E4D8'\\n  cream-warm: '#F2ECE6'\\n  border-subtle: '#E8DDD6'\\ntypography:\\n  display:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 80px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.1'\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\n  display-mobile:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 44px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n  headline-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 40px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  headline-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 32px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  body-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.8'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.01em\\n  body-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.85'\\n  label-uppercase:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 12px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.15em\\n  caption:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 11px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.4'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.05em\\nrounded:\\n  sm: 0.25rem\\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\\n  md: 0.75rem\\n  lg: 1rem\\n  xl: 1.5rem\\n  full: 9999px\\nspacing:\\n  container-max: 1440px\\n  section-gap-desktop: 80px\\n  section-gap-mobile: 48px\\n  grid-gutter: 24px\\n  element-gap-sm: 8px\\n  element-gap-md: 16px\\n  element-gap-lg: 32px\\n---\\n\\n## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Colors\\n\\nThe palette is inspired by natural, undyed fibers and earthen materials. \\n\\n- **Primary (Clay):** Used for call-to-actions, price accents, and critical indicators. It provides a warm, energetic contrast to the neutral base.\\n- **Secondary (Ink):** The foundation for readability. Used for all primary headings and body text to ensure high legibility against light backgrounds.\\n- **Tertiary (Blush):** A soft accent for secondary surfaces, card backgrounds, and promotional banners.\\n- **Neutral (Cream):** The primary canvas. This off-white base reduces eye strain and feels more premium and \\\"organic\\\" than pure white.\\n- **Named Colors:** **Sage** is reserved for eco-specific callouts or decorative elements to reinforce the sustainability narrative. **Ink-light** is used for secondary navigation and metadata to create visual hierarchy.\\n\\n## Typography\\n\\nThis design system employs a high-contrast pairing to balance heritage and modernity.\\n\\n- **Headlines:** Use **DM Serif Display**. Its graceful curves and high contrast evoke luxury and editorial authority. Use it sparingly for section headers and hero statements.\\n- **Body \\u0026 UI:** Use **DM Sans**. This low-contrast geometric sans-serif ensures maximum legibility across all digital interfaces. \\n- **The \\\"Label-Uppercase\\\" Style:** This is a signature brand element. Use it for navigation, small headings over titles, and button labels. The generous letter-spacing (tracking) is essential to achieving the \\\"premium\\\" feel.\\n- **Line Height:** Maintain a generous line height (1.8 - 1.85) for body text to reinforce the airy, spacious aesthetic.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Shapes\\n\\nThe shape language is \\\"Soft-Modern,\\\" utilizing rounded corners to evoke friendliness and comfort—qualities essential to a wearable fashion brand.\\n\\n- **Small Elements (Buttons, Tags, Pills):** Use `rounded-full` (pill-shaped). This creates a distinct interactive language that feels modern and approachable.\\n- **Medium Elements (Product Images, Floating Cards):** Use `rounded-lg` (1rem / 16px). This softens the grid without making it feel juvenile.\\n- **Large Elements (Banners, Testimonial Containers):** Use `rounded-xl` (1.5rem / 24px) to create \\\"enveloping\\\" containers that feel substantial and high-end.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",6,\"#c97b5a\",\"#2a2420\",\"#f5ede6\",\"#faf7f4\",2,[[\"headline-lg\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"40px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"headline-md\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"32px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"caption\",[\"DM Sans\",\"11px\",\"500\",\"1.4\",\"0.05em\"]],[\"display-mobile\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"44px\",\"400\",\"1.2\"]],[\"label-uppercase\",[\"DM Sans\",\"12px\",\"500\",\"1.2\",\"0.15em\"]],[\"body-lg\",[\"DM Sans\",\"16px\",\"400\",\"1.8\",\"0.01em\"]],[\"body-md\",[\"DM Sans\",\"14px\",\"400\",\"1.85\"]],[\"display\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"80px\",\"400\",\"1.1\",\"-0.02em\"]]],[[\"element-gap-md\",\"16px\"],[\"element-gap-lg\",\"32px\"],[\"grid-gutter\",\"24px\"],[\"section-gap-desktop\",\"80px\"],[\"container-max\",\"1440px\"],[\"element-gap-sm\",\"8px\"],[\"section-gap-mobile\",\"48px\"]],null,\"dmSerifDisplay\",\"Dm Sans\",\"Dm Sans\"]],1]],[[\"projects/18178749605532028059/files/c8388c50f25743f99c13562f463fcc33\",null,\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida/AP1WRLvlv_5MKatFiYQ0km_-fcLj93hFWB3rgP0j5ZqVQwFV0YkHlK-uZoIoERrwGh37pVzoOdSd66nDOvPBwgo7XQ3VFTu3GQmDLDAVJqv-WEnYK-69f54pAa3AKUvbKt5jSNfjS-LrCrxXas1h5yqVXoGife6hEybWNLjlllLf9LaZ9Hu9iAcLYYP-A5g3u6brq0GuzEDnX0TOBfAdR39cA2IQqQ16T37uzqzyevCSaZEyc0iUQp3O5mPnroF_\"],null,null,null,\"897a0d87192340cbaee7a3ff30b7ce73\",\"interactive_ui_controller\",\"1024\",\"1024\",\"Minimalist sustainable baby fashion: A cozy organic cotton onesie and soft blanket for a newborn, neutral cream and beige tones, soft focus, high-end studio lighting, professional catalog style.\",\"Minimalist sustainable baby fashion: A cozy organic cotton onesie and soft blanket for a newborn, neutral cream and beige tones, soft focus, high-end studio lighting, professional catalog style.\",\"projects/18178749605532028059/screens/897a0d87192340cbaee7a3ff30b7ce73\",[],null,2,null,[null,2,null,null,2],null,null,[\"assets/f84726af88af499598b78556bda4af11\",null,[\"Stitch Design System\",null,\"## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",[1,null,3,null,\"#c97b5a\",null,null,null,null,null,26,26,[[\"primary_fixed_dim\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"on_error\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed\",\"#1e1b17\"],[\"ink-light\",\"#5A4E48\"],[\"surface_tint\",\"#8f4c2f\"],[\"surface\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed_variant\",\"#4d4541\"],[\"primary_container\",\"#aa6243\"],[\"surface_bright\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_primary_fixed\",\"#360f00\"],[\"on_primary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"surface_container_lowest\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_primary_fixed_variant\",\"#72351a\"],[\"background\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed\",\"#201a17\"],[\"on_secondary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"tertiary\",\"#605b56\"],[\"border-subtle\",\"#E8DDD6\"],[\"on_primary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"surface_container_low\",\"#f6f3f0\"],[\"primary\",\"#8c4a2d\"],[\"inverse_primary\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"tertiary_container\",\"#79746e\"],[\"clay-dark\",\"#A85E40\"],[\"inverse_surface\",\"#31302f\"],[\"on_surface_variant\",\"#53433d\"],[\"surface_container_high\",\"#eae8e5\"],[\"secondary_container\",\"#e9ddd7\"],[\"surface_container\",\"#f0edea\"],[\"primary_fixed\",\"#ffdbcd\"],[\"error\",\"#ba1a1a\"],[\"outline_variant\",\"#d9c2b9\"],[\"surface_variant\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed_variant\",\"#4a4641\"],[\"outline\",\"#86736c\"],[\"tertiary_fixed\",\"#e9e1da\"],[\"tertiary_fixed_dim\",\"#ccc5bf\"],[\"secondary_fixed_dim\",\"#cfc4be\"],[\"on_background\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"error_container\",\"#ffdad6\"],[\"secondary_fixed\",\"#ece0da\"],[\"on_secondary_container\",\"#69615c\"],[\"on_error_container\",\"#93000a\"],[\"secondary\",\"#655d58\"],[\"inverse_on_surface\",\"#f3f0ed\"],[\"on_tertiary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"surface_container_highest\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"sage\",\"#D6E4D8\"],[\"on_tertiary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"surface_dim\",\"#dcdad7\"],[\"cream-warm\",\"#F2ECE6\"],[\"on_surface\",\"#1c1c1a\"]],\"---\\nname: Stitch Design System\\ncolors:\\n  surface: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-dim: '#dcdad7'\\n  surface-bright: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-container-lowest: '#ffffff'\\n  surface-container-low: '#f6f3f0'\\n  surface-container: '#f0edea'\\n  surface-container-high: '#eae8e5'\\n  surface-container-highest: '#e5e2df'\\n  on-surface: '#1c1c1a'\\n  on-surface-variant: '#53433d'\\n  inverse-surface: '#31302f'\\n  inverse-on-surface: '#f3f0ed'\\n  outline: '#86736c'\\n  outline-variant: '#d9c2b9'\\n  surface-tint: '#8f4c2f'\\n  primary: '#8c4a2d'\\n  on-primary: '#ffffff'\\n  primary-container: '#aa6243'\\n  on-primary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  inverse-primary: '#ffb597'\\n  secondary: '#655d58'\\n  on-secondary: '#ffffff'\\n  secondary-container: '#e9ddd7'\\n  on-secondary-container: '#69615c'\\n  tertiary: '#605b56'\\n  on-tertiary: '#ffffff'\\n  tertiary-container: '#79746e'\\n  on-tertiary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  error: '#ba1a1a'\\n  on-error: '#ffffff'\\n  error-container: '#ffdad6'\\n  on-error-container: '#93000a'\\n  primary-fixed: '#ffdbcd'\\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#ffb597'\\n  on-primary-fixed: '#360f00'\\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#72351a'\\n  secondary-fixed: '#ece0da'\\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#cfc4be'\\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#201a17'\\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#4d4541'\\n  tertiary-fixed: '#e9e1da'\\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#ccc5bf'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#1e1b17'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#4a4641'\\n  background: '#fcf9f6'\\n  on-background: '#1c1c1a'\\n  surface-variant: '#e5e2df'\\n  clay-dark: '#A85E40'\\n  ink-light: '#5A4E48'\\n  sage: '#D6E4D8'\\n  cream-warm: '#F2ECE6'\\n  border-subtle: '#E8DDD6'\\ntypography:\\n  display:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 80px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.1'\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\n  display-mobile:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 44px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n  headline-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 40px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  headline-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 32px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  body-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.8'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.01em\\n  body-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.85'\\n  label-uppercase:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 12px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.15em\\n  caption:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 11px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.4'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.05em\\nrounded:\\n  sm: 0.25rem\\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\\n  md: 0.75rem\\n  lg: 1rem\\n  xl: 1.5rem\\n  full: 9999px\\nspacing:\\n  container-max: 1440px\\n  section-gap-desktop: 80px\\n  section-gap-mobile: 48px\\n  grid-gutter: 24px\\n  element-gap-sm: 8px\\n  element-gap-md: 16px\\n  element-gap-lg: 32px\\n---\\n\\n## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Colors\\n\\nThe palette is inspired by natural, undyed fibers and earthen materials. \\n\\n- **Primary (Clay):** Used for call-to-actions, price accents, and critical indicators. It provides a warm, energetic contrast to the neutral base.\\n- **Secondary (Ink):** The foundation for readability. Used for all primary headings and body text to ensure high legibility against light backgrounds.\\n- **Tertiary (Blush):** A soft accent for secondary surfaces, card backgrounds, and promotional banners.\\n- **Neutral (Cream):** The primary canvas. This off-white base reduces eye strain and feels more premium and \\\"organic\\\" than pure white.\\n- **Named Colors:** **Sage** is reserved for eco-specific callouts or decorative elements to reinforce the sustainability narrative. **Ink-light** is used for secondary navigation and metadata to create visual hierarchy.\\n\\n## Typography\\n\\nThis design system employs a high-contrast pairing to balance heritage and modernity.\\n\\n- **Headlines:** Use **DM Serif Display**. Its graceful curves and high contrast evoke luxury and editorial authority. Use it sparingly for section headers and hero statements.\\n- **Body \\u0026 UI:** Use **DM Sans**. This low-contrast geometric sans-serif ensures maximum legibility across all digital interfaces. \\n- **The \\\"Label-Uppercase\\\" Style:** This is a signature brand element. Use it for navigation, small headings over titles, and button labels. The generous letter-spacing (tracking) is essential to achieving the \\\"premium\\\" feel.\\n- **Line Height:** Maintain a generous line height (1.8 - 1.85) for body text to reinforce the airy, spacious aesthetic.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Shapes\\n\\nThe shape language is \\\"Soft-Modern,\\\" utilizing rounded corners to evoke friendliness and comfort—qualities essential to a wearable fashion brand.\\n\\n- **Small Elements (Buttons, Tags, Pills):** Use `rounded-full` (pill-shaped). This creates a distinct interactive language that feels modern and approachable.\\n- **Medium Elements (Product Images, Floating Cards):** Use `rounded-lg` (1rem / 16px). This softens the grid without making it feel juvenile.\\n- **Large Elements (Banners, Testimonial Containers):** Use `rounded-xl` (1.5rem / 24px) to create \\\"enveloping\\\" containers that feel substantial and high-end.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",6,\"#c97b5a\",\"#2a2420\",\"#f5ede6\",\"#faf7f4\",2,[[\"caption\",[\"DM Sans\",\"11px\",\"500\",\"1.4\",\"0.05em\"]],[\"headline-lg\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"40px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"headline-md\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"32px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"body-lg\",[\"DM Sans\",\"16px\",\"400\",\"1.8\",\"0.01em\"]],[\"display\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"80px\",\"400\",\"1.1\",\"-0.02em\"]],[\"body-md\",[\"DM Sans\",\"14px\",\"400\",\"1.85\"]],[\"display-mobile\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"44px\",\"400\",\"1.2\"]],[\"label-uppercase\",[\"DM Sans\",\"12px\",\"500\",\"1.2\",\"0.15em\"]]],[[\"element-gap-lg\",\"32px\"],[\"grid-gutter\",\"24px\"],[\"section-gap-desktop\",\"80px\"],[\"container-max\",\"1440px\"],[\"section-gap-mobile\",\"48px\"],[\"element-gap-sm\",\"8px\"],[\"element-gap-md\",\"16px\"]],null,\"dmSerifDisplay\",\"Dm Sans\",\"Dm Sans\"]],1]],[[\"projects/18178749605532028059/files/922887706977227041\",null,\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida/AP1WRLuBqZT3JcDFW3Jnxltom9bLLUek3KegG27Pp4Bgmll98AwoSuRUXmEt3ZULjGnapSk5QklpAvB7NXttZR1t6VArlDfdIsLqdpkiqJii3nD7dxFn3o2C-XOGGMioM-wJeLxEVPiVXouFF_2gkerOMRd15hRvJpfUYUIVJP5xPvcmekup6wpq_hbViE42n_7_8_Znejx7C0nE3aOy4XlpaoAtPrMhTovWH0oMjbx17BuSx6mHZlAs9-P7fsE\"],[\"projects/18178749605532028059/files/8756380869187630541\",null,\"https://contribution.usercontent.google.com/download?c\\u003dCgthaWRhX2NvZGVmeBJ8Eh1hcHBfY29tcGFuaW9uX2dlbmVyYXRlZF9maWxlcxpbCiVodG1sXzAwMDY1NDlkMDIzYTc2OTEwNDMxMTYwZTRkMjkxMDQ2EgsSBxDv9_C4jw8YAZIBJAoKcHJvamVjdF9pZBIWQhQxODE3ODc0OTYwNTUzMjAyODA1OQ\\u0026filename\\u003d\\u0026opi\\u003d89354086\",null,null,\"text/html\"],null,null,\"054c78ff2e2c40f5bdfe85da8b5e530c\",\"HatterAgent\",\"2560\",\"5704\",\"Stitch — Giỏ hàng (Updated Navbar \\u0026 Address)\",\"1. Update the navigation bar to match the Home page ({{DATA:SCREEN:SCREEN_30}}): Logo 'STITCH' on the left, centered menu links (Nam, Nữ, Sale, Đơn hàng), and Account/Cart icons on the right.\\n2. In the main content area of the Cart page, add a 'Địa chỉ giao hàng' (Shipping Address) section. This section should appear before the 'Tóm tắt đơn hàng' (Order Summary) or as a new card in the main column. Include fields for 'Họ tên', 'Số điện thoại', and 'Địa chỉ chi tiết'.\\n3. Maintain the consistent footer ({{DATA:IMAGE:IMAGE_6}} style).\",\"projects/18178749605532028059/screens/054c78ff2e2c40f5bdfe85da8b5e530c\",[1,null,3,null,\"#c97b5a\",null,null,null,null,null,26,26,[[\"outline\",\"#86736c\"],[\"tertiary_fixed\",\"#e9e1da\"],[\"tertiary_fixed_dim\",\"#ccc5bf\"],[\"surface_variant\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed_variant\",\"#4a4641\"],[\"surface_container\",\"#f0edea\"],[\"outline_variant\",\"#d9c2b9\"],[\"error\",\"#ba1a1a\"],[\"primary_fixed\",\"#ffdbcd\"],[\"secondary\",\"#655d58\"],[\"error_container\",\"#ffdad6\"],[\"on_background\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"secondary_fixed_dim\",\"#cfc4be\"],[\"on_error_container\",\"#93000a\"],[\"secondary_fixed\",\"#ece0da\"],[\"on_secondary_container\",\"#69615c\"],[\"on_tertiary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"on_tertiary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"inverse_on_surface\",\"#f3f0ed\"],[\"sage\",\"#D6E4D8\"],[\"surface_container_highest\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"on_surface\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"surface_dim\",\"#dcdad7\"],[\"cream-warm\",\"#F2ECE6\"],[\"ink-light\",\"#5A4E48\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed\",\"#1e1b17\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed_variant\",\"#4d4541\"],[\"surface\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"surface_tint\",\"#8f4c2f\"],[\"on_error\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"primary_fixed_dim\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"on_primary_fixed_variant\",\"#72351a\"],[\"background\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"surface_container_lowest\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_primary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"tertiary\",\"#605b56\"],[\"border-subtle\",\"#E8DDD6\"],[\"on_secondary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed\",\"#201a17\"],[\"surface_bright\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"primary_container\",\"#aa6243\"],[\"on_primary_fixed\",\"#360f00\"],[\"surface_container_low\",\"#f6f3f0\"],[\"primary\",\"#8c4a2d\"],[\"tertiary_container\",\"#79746e\"],[\"inverse_primary\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"on_primary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"secondary_container\",\"#e9ddd7\"],[\"inverse_surface\",\"#31302f\"],[\"on_surface_variant\",\"#53433d\"],[\"surface_container_high\",\"#eae8e5\"],[\"clay-dark\",\"#A85E40\"]],\"---\\nname: Stitch Design System\\ncolors:\\n  surface: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-dim: '#dcdad7'\\n  surface-bright: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-container-lowest: '#ffffff'\\n  surface-container-low: '#f6f3f0'\\n  surface-container: '#f0edea'\\n  surface-container-high: '#eae8e5'\\n  surface-container-highest: '#e5e2df'\\n  on-surface: '#1c1c1a'\\n  on-surface-variant: '#53433d'\\n  inverse-surface: '#31302f'\\n  inverse-on-surface: '#f3f0ed'\\n  outline: '#86736c'\\n  outline-variant: '#d9c2b9'\\n  surface-tint: '#8f4c2f'\\n  primary: '#8c4a2d'\\n  on-primary: '#ffffff'\\n  primary-container: '#aa6243'\\n  on-primary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  inverse-primary: '#ffb597'\\n  secondary: '#655d58'\\n  on-secondary: '#ffffff'\\n  secondary-container: '#e9ddd7'\\n  on-secondary-container: '#69615c'\\n  tertiary: '#605b56'\\n  on-tertiary: '#ffffff'\\n  tertiary-container: '#79746e'\\n  on-tertiary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  error: '#ba1a1a'\\n  on-error: '#ffffff'\\n  error-container: '#ffdad6'\\n  on-error-container: '#93000a'\\n  primary-fixed: '#ffdbcd'\\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#ffb597'\\n  on-primary-fixed: '#360f00'\\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#72351a'\\n  secondary-fixed: '#ece0da'\\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#cfc4be'\\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#201a17'\\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#4d4541'\\n  tertiary-fixed: '#e9e1da'\\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#ccc5bf'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#1e1b17'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#4a4641'\\n  background: '#fcf9f6'\\n  on-background: '#1c1c1a'\\n  surface-variant: '#e5e2df'\\n  clay-dark: '#A85E40'\\n  ink-light: '#5A4E48'\\n  sage: '#D6E4D8'\\n  cream-warm: '#F2ECE6'\\n  border-subtle: '#E8DDD6'\\ntypography:\\n  display:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 80px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.1'\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\n  display-mobile:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 44px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n  headline-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 40px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  headline-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 32px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  body-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.8'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.01em\\n  body-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.85'\\n  label-uppercase:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 12px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.15em\\n  caption:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 11px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.4'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.05em\\nrounded:\\n  sm: 0.25rem\\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\\n  md: 0.75rem\\n  lg: 1rem\\n  xl: 1.5rem\\n  full: 9999px\\nspacing:\\n  container-max: 1440px\\n  section-gap-desktop: 80px\\n  section-gap-mobile: 48px\\n  grid-gutter: 24px\\n  element-gap-sm: 8px\\n  element-gap-md: 16px\\n  element-gap-lg: 32px\\n---\\n\\n## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Colors\\n\\nThe palette is inspired by natural, undyed fibers and earthen materials. \\n\\n- **Primary (Clay):** Used for call-to-actions, price accents, and critical indicators. It provides a warm, energetic contrast to the neutral base.\\n- **Secondary (Ink):** The foundation for readability. Used for all primary headings and body text to ensure high legibility against light backgrounds.\\n- **Tertiary (Blush):** A soft accent for secondary surfaces, card backgrounds, and promotional banners.\\n- **Neutral (Cream):** The primary canvas. This off-white base reduces eye strain and feels more premium and \\\"organic\\\" than pure white.\\n- **Named Colors:** **Sage** is reserved for eco-specific callouts or decorative elements to reinforce the sustainability narrative. **Ink-light** is used for secondary navigation and metadata to create visual hierarchy.\\n\\n## Typography\\n\\nThis design system employs a high-contrast pairing to balance heritage and modernity.\\n\\n- **Headlines:** Use **DM Serif Display**. Its graceful curves and high contrast evoke luxury and editorial authority. Use it sparingly for section headers and hero statements.\\n- **Body \\u0026 UI:** Use **DM Sans**. This low-contrast geometric sans-serif ensures maximum legibility across all digital interfaces. \\n- **The \\\"Label-Uppercase\\\" Style:** This is a signature brand element. Use it for navigation, small headings over titles, and button labels. The generous letter-spacing (tracking) is essential to achieving the \\\"premium\\\" feel.\\n- **Line Height:** Maintain a generous line height (1.8 - 1.85) for body text to reinforce the airy, spacious aesthetic.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Shapes\\n\\nThe shape language is \\\"Soft-Modern,\\\" utilizing rounded corners to evoke friendliness and comfort—qualities essential to a wearable fashion brand.\\n\\n- **Small Elements (Buttons, Tags, Pills):** Use `rounded-full` (pill-shaped). This creates a distinct interactive language that feels modern and approachable.\\n- **Medium Elements (Product Images, Floating Cards):** Use `rounded-lg` (1rem / 16px). This softens the grid without making it feel juvenile.\\n- **Large Elements (Banners, Testimonial Containers):** Use `rounded-xl` (1.5rem / 24px) to create \\\"enveloping\\\" containers that feel substantial and high-end.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",6,\"#c97b5a\",\"#2a2420\",\"#f5ede6\",\"#faf7f4\",2,[[\"body-lg\",[\"DM Sans\",\"16px\",\"400\",\"1.8\",\"0.01em\"]],[\"display\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"80px\",\"400\",\"1.1\",\"-0.02em\"]],[\"body-md\",[\"DM Sans\",\"14px\",\"400\",\"1.85\"]],[\"display-mobile\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"44px\",\"400\",\"1.2\"]],[\"label-uppercase\",[\"DM Sans\",\"12px\",\"500\",\"1.2\",\"0.15em\"]],[\"caption\",[\"DM Sans\",\"11px\",\"500\",\"1.4\",\"0.05em\"]],[\"headline-lg\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"40px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"headline-md\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"32px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]]],[[\"section-gap-mobile\",\"48px\"],[\"element-gap-sm\",\"8px\"],[\"container-max\",\"1440px\"],[\"element-gap-lg\",\"32px\"],[\"grid-gutter\",\"24px\"],[\"section-gap-desktop\",\"80px\"],[\"element-gap-md\",\"16px\"]],null,\"dmSerifDisplay\",\"Dm Sans\",\"Dm Sans\"],2,1,null,[null,2,null,null,2,2],null,null,[\"assets/f84726af88af499598b78556bda4af11\",null,[\"Stitch Design System\",null,\"## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",[1,null,3,null,\"#c97b5a\",null,null,null,null,null,26,26,[[\"primary_fixed_dim\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"on_error\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed\",\"#1e1b17\"],[\"ink-light\",\"#5A4E48\"],[\"surface_tint\",\"#8f4c2f\"],[\"surface\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed_variant\",\"#4d4541\"],[\"primary_container\",\"#aa6243\"],[\"surface_bright\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_primary_fixed\",\"#360f00\"],[\"on_primary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"surface_container_lowest\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_primary_fixed_variant\",\"#72351a\"],[\"background\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed\",\"#201a17\"],[\"on_secondary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"tertiary\",\"#605b56\"],[\"border-subtle\",\"#E8DDD6\"],[\"on_primary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"surface_container_low\",\"#f6f3f0\"],[\"primary\",\"#8c4a2d\"],[\"inverse_primary\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"tertiary_container\",\"#79746e\"],[\"clay-dark\",\"#A85E40\"],[\"inverse_surface\",\"#31302f\"],[\"on_surface_variant\",\"#53433d\"],[\"surface_container_high\",\"#eae8e5\"],[\"secondary_container\",\"#e9ddd7\"],[\"surface_container\",\"#f0edea\"],[\"primary_fixed\",\"#ffdbcd\"],[\"error\",\"#ba1a1a\"],[\"outline_variant\",\"#d9c2b9\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed_variant\",\"#4a4641\"],[\"surface_variant\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"tertiary_fixed\",\"#e9e1da\"],[\"tertiary_fixed_dim\",\"#ccc5bf\"],[\"outline\",\"#86736c\"],[\"secondary_fixed_dim\",\"#cfc4be\"],[\"on_background\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"error_container\",\"#ffdad6\"],[\"secondary_fixed\",\"#ece0da\"],[\"on_secondary_container\",\"#69615c\"],[\"on_error_container\",\"#93000a\"],[\"secondary\",\"#655d58\"],[\"inverse_on_surface\",\"#f3f0ed\"],[\"on_tertiary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"surface_container_highest\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"sage\",\"#D6E4D8\"],[\"on_tertiary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"surface_dim\",\"#dcdad7\"],[\"cream-warm\",\"#F2ECE6\"],[\"on_surface\",\"#1c1c1a\"]],\"---\\nname: Stitch Design System\\ncolors:\\n  surface: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-dim: '#dcdad7'\\n  surface-bright: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-container-lowest: '#ffffff'\\n  surface-container-low: '#f6f3f0'\\n  surface-container: '#f0edea'\\n  surface-container-high: '#eae8e5'\\n  surface-container-highest: '#e5e2df'\\n  on-surface: '#1c1c1a'\\n  on-surface-variant: '#53433d'\\n  inverse-surface: '#31302f'\\n  inverse-on-surface: '#f3f0ed'\\n  outline: '#86736c'\\n  outline-variant: '#d9c2b9'\\n  surface-tint: '#8f4c2f'\\n  primary: '#8c4a2d'\\n  on-primary: '#ffffff'\\n  primary-container: '#aa6243'\\n  on-primary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  inverse-primary: '#ffb597'\\n  secondary: '#655d58'\\n  on-secondary: '#ffffff'\\n  secondary-container: '#e9ddd7'\\n  on-secondary-container: '#69615c'\\n  tertiary: '#605b56'\\n  on-tertiary: '#ffffff'\\n  tertiary-container: '#79746e'\\n  on-tertiary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  error: '#ba1a1a'\\n  on-error: '#ffffff'\\n  error-container: '#ffdad6'\\n  on-error-container: '#93000a'\\n  primary-fixed: '#ffdbcd'\\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#ffb597'\\n  on-primary-fixed: '#360f00'\\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#72351a'\\n  secondary-fixed: '#ece0da'\\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#cfc4be'\\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#201a17'\\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#4d4541'\\n  tertiary-fixed: '#e9e1da'\\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#ccc5bf'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#1e1b17'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#4a4641'\\n  background: '#fcf9f6'\\n  on-background: '#1c1c1a'\\n  surface-variant: '#e5e2df'\\n  clay-dark: '#A85E40'\\n  ink-light: '#5A4E48'\\n  sage: '#D6E4D8'\\n  cream-warm: '#F2ECE6'\\n  border-subtle: '#E8DDD6'\\ntypography:\\n  display:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 80px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.1'\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\n  display-mobile:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 44px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n  headline-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 40px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  headline-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 32px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  body-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.8'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.01em\\n  body-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.85'\\n  label-uppercase:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 12px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.15em\\n  caption:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 11px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.4'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.05em\\nrounded:\\n  sm: 0.25rem\\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\\n  md: 0.75rem\\n  lg: 1rem\\n  xl: 1.5rem\\n  full: 9999px\\nspacing:\\n  container-max: 1440px\\n  section-gap-desktop: 80px\\n  section-gap-mobile: 48px\\n  grid-gutter: 24px\\n  element-gap-sm: 8px\\n  element-gap-md: 16px\\n  element-gap-lg: 32px\\n---\\n\\n## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Colors\\n\\nThe palette is inspired by natural, undyed fibers and earthen materials. \\n\\n- **Primary (Clay):** Used for call-to-actions, price accents, and critical indicators. It provides a warm, energetic contrast to the neutral base.\\n- **Secondary (Ink):** The foundation for readability. Used for all primary headings and body text to ensure high legibility against light backgrounds.\\n- **Tertiary (Blush):** A soft accent for secondary surfaces, card backgrounds, and promotional banners.\\n- **Neutral (Cream):** The primary canvas. This off-white base reduces eye strain and feels more premium and \\\"organic\\\" than pure white.\\n- **Named Colors:** **Sage** is reserved for eco-specific callouts or decorative elements to reinforce the sustainability narrative. **Ink-light** is used for secondary navigation and metadata to create visual hierarchy.\\n\\n## Typography\\n\\nThis design system employs a high-contrast pairing to balance heritage and modernity.\\n\\n- **Headlines:** Use **DM Serif Display**. Its graceful curves and high contrast evoke luxury and editorial authority. Use it sparingly for section headers and hero statements.\\n- **Body \\u0026 UI:** Use **DM Sans**. This low-contrast geometric sans-serif ensures maximum legibility across all digital interfaces. \\n- **The \\\"Label-Uppercase\\\" Style:** This is a signature brand element. Use it for navigation, small headings over titles, and button labels. The generous letter-spacing (tracking) is essential to achieving the \\\"premium\\\" feel.\\n- **Line Height:** Maintain a generous line height (1.8 - 1.85) for body text to reinforce the airy, spacious aesthetic.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Shapes\\n\\nThe shape language is \\\"Soft-Modern,\\\" utilizing rounded corners to evoke friendliness and comfort—qualities essential to a wearable fashion brand.\\n\\n- **Small Elements (Buttons, Tags, Pills):** Use `rounded-full` (pill-shaped). This creates a distinct interactive language that feels modern and approachable.\\n- **Medium Elements (Product Images, Floating Cards):** Use `rounded-lg` (1rem / 16px). This softens the grid without making it feel juvenile.\\n- **Large Elements (Banners, Testimonial Containers):** Use `rounded-xl` (1.5rem / 24px) to create \\\"enveloping\\\" containers that feel substantial and high-end.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",6,\"#c97b5a\",\"#2a2420\",\"#f5ede6\",\"#faf7f4\",2,[[\"headline-lg\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"40px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"headline-md\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"32px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"caption\",[\"DM Sans\",\"11px\",\"500\",\"1.4\",\"0.05em\"]],[\"body-lg\",[\"DM Sans\",\"16px\",\"400\",\"1.8\",\"0.01em\"]],[\"body-md\",[\"DM Sans\",\"14px\",\"400\",\"1.85\"]],[\"display\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"80px\",\"400\",\"1.1\",\"-0.02em\"]],[\"display-mobile\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"44px\",\"400\",\"1.2\"]],[\"label-uppercase\",[\"DM Sans\",\"12px\",\"500\",\"1.2\",\"0.15em\"]]],[[\"element-gap-md\",\"16px\"],[\"container-max\",\"1440px\"],[\"section-gap-mobile\",\"48px\"],[\"element-gap-sm\",\"8px\"],[\"element-gap-lg\",\"32px\"],[\"grid-gutter\",\"24px\"],[\"section-gap-desktop\",\"80px\"]],null,\"dmSerifDisplay\",\"Dm Sans\",\"Dm Sans\"]],1]],[[\"projects/18178749605532028059/files/9ff50ba8510049f39ba3fe67ae18b859\",null,\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida/AP1WRLtdR5bOGVgdZa4MqKaCg2qI2mfm2k-csDb4O9nLUn5L0BRrO6nl3YZ3qej7MKuDZw5IOE3YlQ41jjiokW7gpzNjj6TAuX65p_9nO0Q-Nq1OsUx7gZvxM98CBqIurGcIHmHBSJCeSFnOXD2lD2TXHhiL1UJ8wZAEU46ousbb4ytgD5ntkpqHBiop105CSwkb5dHASglYVSpuUCtSYkBxeDd-4SkOPXpWwVtD8ge5KyO90YB3MirWcsBakAWH\"],[\"projects/18178749605532028059/files/e94f6534b896441ba40d96f4b134ae0b\",null,\"https://contribution.usercontent.google.com/download?c\\u003dCgthaWRhX2NvZGVmeBJ8Eh1hcHBfY29tcGFuaW9uX2dlbmVyYXRlZF9maWxlcxpbCiVodG1sXzM0MWI3ZTI1NWMzZjQxYzJhOGRhZmEwZmJjMDdmMmVmEgsSBxDv9_C4jw8YAZIBJAoKcHJvamVjdF9pZBIWQhQxODE3ODc0OTYwNTUzMjAyODA1OQ\\u0026filename\\u003d\\u0026opi\\u003d89354086\",null,null,\"text/html\"],null,null,\"a0d6d90bb0d840beafd6d31d57b48953\",\"HatterAgent\",\"2560\",\"12798\",\"Stitch — Trang chủ (Added Best Sellers)\",\"Add a \\\"Best Sellers\\\" (Sản Phẩm Bán Chạy) section immediately after the \\\"Promotion Products\\\" (Sản phẩm khuyến mãi) section. \\n\\nThe new section should match the style of other product grids on the page:\\n- Title: \\\"Sản Phẩm Bán Chạy\\\" using the serif font (DM Serif Display).\\n- A grid of 4 product cards.\\n- Each card should feature a product image placeholder, title, and price.\\n- Include \\\"New\\\" or \\\"Best Seller\\\" labels where appropriate.\\n- Ensure consistent spacing (section gaps) and alignment with the rest of the page.\\n- Use labels like \\\"Áo Len Thủ công\\\", \\\"Túi Tote Da Thực vật\\\", \\\"Váy Lụa Terracotta\\\", \\\"Quần Tây Ống Rộng\\\" for content.\",\"projects/18178749605532028059/screens/a0d6d90bb0d840beafd6d31d57b48953\",[1,null,3,null,\"#c97b5a\",null,null,null,null,null,26,26,[[\"on_tertiary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"sage\",\"#D6E4D8\"],[\"surface_container_highest\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"on_tertiary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"inverse_on_surface\",\"#f3f0ed\"],[\"on_surface\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"cream-warm\",\"#F2ECE6\"],[\"surface_dim\",\"#dcdad7\"],[\"tertiary_fixed_dim\",\"#ccc5bf\"],[\"tertiary_fixed\",\"#e9e1da\"],[\"outline\",\"#86736c\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed_variant\",\"#4a4641\"],[\"surface_variant\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"outline_variant\",\"#d9c2b9\"],[\"error\",\"#ba1a1a\"],[\"primary_fixed\",\"#ffdbcd\"],[\"surface_container\",\"#f0edea\"],[\"secondary\",\"#655d58\"],[\"on_error_container\",\"#93000a\"],[\"on_secondary_container\",\"#69615c\"],[\"secondary_fixed\",\"#ece0da\"],[\"error_container\",\"#ffdad6\"],[\"on_background\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"secondary_fixed_dim\",\"#cfc4be\"],[\"tertiary_container\",\"#79746e\"],[\"inverse_primary\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"surface_container_low\",\"#f6f3f0\"],[\"primary\",\"#8c4a2d\"],[\"on_primary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"secondary_container\",\"#e9ddd7\"],[\"surface_container_high\",\"#eae8e5\"],[\"on_surface_variant\",\"#53433d\"],[\"inverse_surface\",\"#31302f\"],[\"clay-dark\",\"#A85E40\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed_variant\",\"#4d4541\"],[\"surface\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"surface_tint\",\"#8f4c2f\"],[\"ink-light\",\"#5A4E48\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed\",\"#1e1b17\"],[\"on_error\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"primary_fixed_dim\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"tertiary\",\"#605b56\"],[\"border-subtle\",\"#E8DDD6\"],[\"on_secondary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed\",\"#201a17\"],[\"on_primary_fixed_variant\",\"#72351a\"],[\"background\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"surface_container_lowest\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_primary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"on_primary_fixed\",\"#360f00\"],[\"surface_bright\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"primary_container\",\"#aa6243\"]],\"---\\nname: Stitch Design System\\ncolors:\\n  surface: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-dim: '#dcdad7'\\n  surface-bright: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-container-lowest: '#ffffff'\\n  surface-container-low: '#f6f3f0'\\n  surface-container: '#f0edea'\\n  surface-container-high: '#eae8e5'\\n  surface-container-highest: '#e5e2df'\\n  on-surface: '#1c1c1a'\\n  on-surface-variant: '#53433d'\\n  inverse-surface: '#31302f'\\n  inverse-on-surface: '#f3f0ed'\\n  outline: '#86736c'\\n  outline-variant: '#d9c2b9'\\n  surface-tint: '#8f4c2f'\\n  primary: '#8c4a2d'\\n  on-primary: '#ffffff'\\n  primary-container: '#aa6243'\\n  on-primary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  inverse-primary: '#ffb597'\\n  secondary: '#655d58'\\n  on-secondary: '#ffffff'\\n  secondary-container: '#e9ddd7'\\n  on-secondary-container: '#69615c'\\n  tertiary: '#605b56'\\n  on-tertiary: '#ffffff'\\n  tertiary-container: '#79746e'\\n  on-tertiary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  error: '#ba1a1a'\\n  on-error: '#ffffff'\\n  error-container: '#ffdad6'\\n  on-error-container: '#93000a'\\n  primary-fixed: '#ffdbcd'\\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#ffb597'\\n  on-primary-fixed: '#360f00'\\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#72351a'\\n  secondary-fixed: '#ece0da'\\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#cfc4be'\\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#201a17'\\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#4d4541'\\n  tertiary-fixed: '#e9e1da'\\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#ccc5bf'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#1e1b17'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#4a4641'\\n  background: '#fcf9f6'\\n  on-background: '#1c1c1a'\\n  surface-variant: '#e5e2df'\\n  clay-dark: '#A85E40'\\n  ink-light: '#5A4E48'\\n  sage: '#D6E4D8'\\n  cream-warm: '#F2ECE6'\\n  border-subtle: '#E8DDD6'\\ntypography:\\n  display:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 80px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.1'\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\n  display-mobile:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 44px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n  headline-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 40px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  headline-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 32px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  body-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.8'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.01em\\n  body-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.85'\\n  label-uppercase:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 12px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.15em\\n  caption:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 11px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.4'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.05em\\nrounded:\\n  sm: 0.25rem\\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\\n  md: 0.75rem\\n  lg: 1rem\\n  xl: 1.5rem\\n  full: 9999px\\nspacing:\\n  container-max: 1440px\\n  section-gap-desktop: 80px\\n  section-gap-mobile: 48px\\n  grid-gutter: 24px\\n  element-gap-sm: 8px\\n  element-gap-md: 16px\\n  element-gap-lg: 32px\\n---\\n\\n## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Colors\\n\\nThe palette is inspired by natural, undyed fibers and earthen materials. \\n\\n- **Primary (Clay):** Used for call-to-actions, price accents, and critical indicators. It provides a warm, energetic contrast to the neutral base.\\n- **Secondary (Ink):** The foundation for readability. Used for all primary headings and body text to ensure high legibility against light backgrounds.\\n- **Tertiary (Blush):** A soft accent for secondary surfaces, card backgrounds, and promotional banners.\\n- **Neutral (Cream):** The primary canvas. This off-white base reduces eye strain and feels more premium and \\\"organic\\\" than pure white.\\n- **Named Colors:** **Sage** is reserved for eco-specific callouts or decorative elements to reinforce the sustainability narrative. **Ink-light** is used for secondary navigation and metadata to create visual hierarchy.\\n\\n## Typography\\n\\nThis design system employs a high-contrast pairing to balance heritage and modernity.\\n\\n- **Headlines:** Use **DM Serif Display**. Its graceful curves and high contrast evoke luxury and editorial authority. Use it sparingly for section headers and hero statements.\\n- **Body \\u0026 UI:** Use **DM Sans**. This low-contrast geometric sans-serif ensures maximum legibility across all digital interfaces. \\n- **The \\\"Label-Uppercase\\\" Style:** This is a signature brand element. Use it for navigation, small headings over titles, and button labels. The generous letter-spacing (tracking) is essential to achieving the \\\"premium\\\" feel.\\n- **Line Height:** Maintain a generous line height (1.8 - 1.85) for body text to reinforce the airy, spacious aesthetic.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Shapes\\n\\nThe shape language is \\\"Soft-Modern,\\\" utilizing rounded corners to evoke friendliness and comfort—qualities essential to a wearable fashion brand.\\n\\n- **Small Elements (Buttons, Tags, Pills):** Use `rounded-full` (pill-shaped). This creates a distinct interactive language that feels modern and approachable.\\n- **Medium Elements (Product Images, Floating Cards):** Use `rounded-lg` (1rem / 16px). This softens the grid without making it feel juvenile.\\n- **Large Elements (Banners, Testimonial Containers):** Use `rounded-xl` (1.5rem / 24px) to create \\\"enveloping\\\" containers that feel substantial and high-end.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",6,\"#c97b5a\",\"#2a2420\",\"#f5ede6\",\"#faf7f4\",2,[[\"display-mobile\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"44px\",\"400\",\"1.2\"]],[\"label-uppercase\",[\"DM Sans\",\"12px\",\"500\",\"1.2\",\"0.15em\"]],[\"body-md\",[\"DM Sans\",\"14px\",\"400\",\"1.85\"]],[\"display\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"80px\",\"400\",\"1.1\",\"-0.02em\"]],[\"body-lg\",[\"DM Sans\",\"16px\",\"400\",\"1.8\",\"0.01em\"]],[\"caption\",[\"DM Sans\",\"11px\",\"500\",\"1.4\",\"0.05em\"]],[\"headline-lg\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"40px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"headline-md\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"32px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]]],[[\"container-max\",\"1440px\"],[\"section-gap-mobile\",\"48px\"],[\"element-gap-sm\",\"8px\"],[\"element-gap-lg\",\"32px\"],[\"grid-gutter\",\"24px\"],[\"section-gap-desktop\",\"80px\"],[\"element-gap-md\",\"16px\"]],null,\"dmSerifDisplay\",\"Dm Sans\",\"Dm Sans\"],2,1,null,[null,2,null,null,2],null,null,[\"assets/f84726af88af499598b78556bda4af11\",null,[\"Stitch Design System\",null,\"## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",[1,null,3,null,\"#c97b5a\",null,null,null,null,null,26,26,[[\"tertiary_container\",\"#79746e\"],[\"inverse_primary\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"surface_container_low\",\"#f6f3f0\"],[\"primary\",\"#8c4a2d\"],[\"on_primary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"secondary_container\",\"#e9ddd7\"],[\"surface_container_high\",\"#eae8e5\"],[\"on_surface_variant\",\"#53433d\"],[\"inverse_surface\",\"#31302f\"],[\"clay-dark\",\"#A85E40\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed_variant\",\"#4d4541\"],[\"surface\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"surface_tint\",\"#8f4c2f\"],[\"ink-light\",\"#5A4E48\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed\",\"#1e1b17\"],[\"on_error\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"primary_fixed_dim\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"tertiary\",\"#605b56\"],[\"border-subtle\",\"#E8DDD6\"],[\"on_secondary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed\",\"#201a17\"],[\"on_primary_fixed_variant\",\"#72351a\"],[\"background\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"surface_container_lowest\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_primary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"on_primary_fixed\",\"#360f00\"],[\"surface_bright\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"primary_container\",\"#aa6243\"],[\"on_tertiary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"sage\",\"#D6E4D8\"],[\"surface_container_highest\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"on_tertiary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"inverse_on_surface\",\"#f3f0ed\"],[\"on_surface\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"cream-warm\",\"#F2ECE6\"],[\"surface_dim\",\"#dcdad7\"],[\"tertiary_fixed_dim\",\"#ccc5bf\"],[\"tertiary_fixed\",\"#e9e1da\"],[\"outline\",\"#86736c\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed_variant\",\"#4a4641\"],[\"surface_variant\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"outline_variant\",\"#d9c2b9\"],[\"error\",\"#ba1a1a\"],[\"primary_fixed\",\"#ffdbcd\"],[\"surface_container\",\"#f0edea\"],[\"secondary\",\"#655d58\"],[\"on_error_container\",\"#93000a\"],[\"on_secondary_container\",\"#69615c\"],[\"secondary_fixed\",\"#ece0da\"],[\"error_container\",\"#ffdad6\"],[\"on_background\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"secondary_fixed_dim\",\"#cfc4be\"]],\"---\\nname: Stitch Design System\\ncolors:\\n  surface: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-dim: '#dcdad7'\\n  surface-bright: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-container-lowest: '#ffffff'\\n  surface-container-low: '#f6f3f0'\\n  surface-container: '#f0edea'\\n  surface-container-high: '#eae8e5'\\n  surface-container-highest: '#e5e2df'\\n  on-surface: '#1c1c1a'\\n  on-surface-variant: '#53433d'\\n  inverse-surface: '#31302f'\\n  inverse-on-surface: '#f3f0ed'\\n  outline: '#86736c'\\n  outline-variant: '#d9c2b9'\\n  surface-tint: '#8f4c2f'\\n  primary: '#8c4a2d'\\n  on-primary: '#ffffff'\\n  primary-container: '#aa6243'\\n  on-primary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  inverse-primary: '#ffb597'\\n  secondary: '#655d58'\\n  on-secondary: '#ffffff'\\n  secondary-container: '#e9ddd7'\\n  on-secondary-container: '#69615c'\\n  tertiary: '#605b56'\\n  on-tertiary: '#ffffff'\\n  tertiary-container: '#79746e'\\n  on-tertiary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  error: '#ba1a1a'\\n  on-error: '#ffffff'\\n  error-container: '#ffdad6'\\n  on-error-container: '#93000a'\\n  primary-fixed: '#ffdbcd'\\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#ffb597'\\n  on-primary-fixed: '#360f00'\\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#72351a'\\n  secondary-fixed: '#ece0da'\\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#cfc4be'\\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#201a17'\\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#4d4541'\\n  tertiary-fixed: '#e9e1da'\\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#ccc5bf'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#1e1b17'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#4a4641'\\n  background: '#fcf9f6'\\n  on-background: '#1c1c1a'\\n  surface-variant: '#e5e2df'\\n  clay-dark: '#A85E40'\\n  ink-light: '#5A4E48'\\n  sage: '#D6E4D8'\\n  cream-warm: '#F2ECE6'\\n  border-subtle: '#E8DDD6'\\ntypography:\\n  display:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 80px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.1'\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\n  display-mobile:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 44px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n  headline-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 40px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  headline-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 32px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  body-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.8'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.01em\\n  body-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.85'\\n  label-uppercase:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 12px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.15em\\n  caption:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 11px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.4'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.05em\\nrounded:\\n  sm: 0.25rem\\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\\n  md: 0.75rem\\n  lg: 1rem\\n  xl: 1.5rem\\n  full: 9999px\\nspacing:\\n  container-max: 1440px\\n  section-gap-desktop: 80px\\n  section-gap-mobile: 48px\\n  grid-gutter: 24px\\n  element-gap-sm: 8px\\n  element-gap-md: 16px\\n  element-gap-lg: 32px\\n---\\n\\n## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Colors\\n\\nThe palette is inspired by natural, undyed fibers and earthen materials. \\n\\n- **Primary (Clay):** Used for call-to-actions, price accents, and critical indicators. It provides a warm, energetic contrast to the neutral base.\\n- **Secondary (Ink):** The foundation for readability. Used for all primary headings and body text to ensure high legibility against light backgrounds.\\n- **Tertiary (Blush):** A soft accent for secondary surfaces, card backgrounds, and promotional banners.\\n- **Neutral (Cream):** The primary canvas. This off-white base reduces eye strain and feels more premium and \\\"organic\\\" than pure white.\\n- **Named Colors:** **Sage** is reserved for eco-specific callouts or decorative elements to reinforce the sustainability narrative. **Ink-light** is used for secondary navigation and metadata to create visual hierarchy.\\n\\n## Typography\\n\\nThis design system employs a high-contrast pairing to balance heritage and modernity.\\n\\n- **Headlines:** Use **DM Serif Display**. Its graceful curves and high contrast evoke luxury and editorial authority. Use it sparingly for section headers and hero statements.\\n- **Body \\u0026 UI:** Use **DM Sans**. This low-contrast geometric sans-serif ensures maximum legibility across all digital interfaces. \\n- **The \\\"Label-Uppercase\\\" Style:** This is a signature brand element. Use it for navigation, small headings over titles, and button labels. The generous letter-spacing (tracking) is essential to achieving the \\\"premium\\\" feel.\\n- **Line Height:** Maintain a generous line height (1.8 - 1.85) for body text to reinforce the airy, spacious aesthetic.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Shapes\\n\\nThe shape language is \\\"Soft-Modern,\\\" utilizing rounded corners to evoke friendliness and comfort—qualities essential to a wearable fashion brand.\\n\\n- **Small Elements (Buttons, Tags, Pills):** Use `rounded-full` (pill-shaped). This creates a distinct interactive language that feels modern and approachable.\\n- **Medium Elements (Product Images, Floating Cards):** Use `rounded-lg` (1rem / 16px). This softens the grid without making it feel juvenile.\\n- **Large Elements (Banners, Testimonial Containers):** Use `rounded-xl` (1.5rem / 24px) to create \\\"enveloping\\\" containers that feel substantial and high-end.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",6,\"#c97b5a\",\"#2a2420\",\"#f5ede6\",\"#faf7f4\",2,[[\"display-mobile\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"44px\",\"400\",\"1.2\"]],[\"label-uppercase\",[\"DM Sans\",\"12px\",\"500\",\"1.2\",\"0.15em\"]],[\"body-lg\",[\"DM Sans\",\"16px\",\"400\",\"1.8\",\"0.01em\"]],[\"body-md\",[\"DM Sans\",\"14px\",\"400\",\"1.85\"]],[\"display\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"80px\",\"400\",\"1.1\",\"-0.02em\"]],[\"headline-lg\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"40px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"headline-md\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"32px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"caption\",[\"DM Sans\",\"11px\",\"500\",\"1.4\",\"0.05em\"]]],[[\"element-gap-md\",\"16px\"],[\"grid-gutter\",\"24px\"],[\"section-gap-desktop\",\"80px\"],[\"element-gap-lg\",\"32px\"],[\"element-gap-sm\",\"8px\"],[\"section-gap-mobile\",\"48px\"],[\"container-max\",\"1440px\"]],null,\"dmSerifDisplay\",\"Dm Sans\",\"Dm Sans\"]],1]],[[\"projects/18178749605532028059/files/b59956625027463693a257273308b820\",null,\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida/AP1WRLvLAujRRYzUqfefCC6EB2du3SiI5uShuDgM32M6omuSz6BTG4V_iZSmPUnf0Kho-qE5P6YLlYv-n1ogkIkjaZKiPwr744o5a7kpfNYZ55YtzaY429RwQYZkhZ8kszE6j04X91E1Eyxf7QKTe6VTcfqUJlngbjCOomPvy7ukGA-e_6kpCYSIEAIIg6XjGIGWAY9cJ5dVfTCA18E8Mfg7KcicxBfSseHgIFflUXlh_P1vd-F4yP3mXjHLkKDu\"],[\"projects/18178749605532028059/files/78853b1cfeee4c6b92ebccc53408e410\",null,\"https://contribution.usercontent.google.com/download?c\\u003dCgthaWRhX2NvZGVmeBJ8Eh1hcHBfY29tcGFuaW9uX2dlbmVyYXRlZF9maWxlcxpbCiVodG1sX2M0Y2ZjMzcyMTEyMTQ3MjQ5MjNlNjg2YmQxZTljYmQ3EgsSBxDv9_C4jw8YAZIBJAoKcHJvamVjdF9pZBIWQhQxODE3ODc0OTYwNTUzMjAyODA1OQ\\u0026filename\\u003d\\u0026opi\\u003d89354086\",null,null,\"text/html\"],null,null,\"4413415108984f7d8750db8777bf7509\",\"figaro_agent\",\"2560\",\"5946\",\"Stitch — Trang chủ (Updated with Search \\u0026 Sale)\",\"Update the homepage to include:\\n1. Search and Filter: Ensure the TopNavBar or a new sub-header section has a functional-looking search bar and filter triggers.\\n2. Best Sellers Section: Add a new section titled \\\"Sản phẩm bán chạy\\\" with product cards.\\n3. Sale Products Section: Add a new section titled \\\"Sản phẩm đang sale\\\" highlighting discounted items with sale badges.\\nMaintain the existing design system, scroll animations, and Vietnamese language. Use images from existing screens as inspiration for product cards.\",\"projects/18178749605532028059/screens/4413415108984f7d8750db8777bf7509\",[1,null,3,null,\"#c97b5a\",null,null,null,null,null,26,26,[[\"surface_variant\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed_variant\",\"#4a4641\"],[\"tertiary_fixed_dim\",\"#ccc5bf\"],[\"tertiary_fixed\",\"#e9e1da\"],[\"outline\",\"#86736c\"],[\"primary_fixed\",\"#ffdbcd\"],[\"error\",\"#ba1a1a\"],[\"outline_variant\",\"#d9c2b9\"],[\"surface_container\",\"#f0edea\"],[\"secondary\",\"#655d58\"],[\"secondary_fixed\",\"#ece0da\"],[\"on_secondary_container\",\"#69615c\"],[\"on_error_container\",\"#93000a\"],[\"secondary_fixed_dim\",\"#cfc4be\"],[\"on_background\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"error_container\",\"#ffdad6\"],[\"on_tertiary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"surface_container_highest\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"sage\",\"#D6E4D8\"],[\"inverse_on_surface\",\"#f3f0ed\"],[\"on_tertiary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_surface\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"cream-warm\",\"#F2ECE6\"],[\"surface_dim\",\"#dcdad7\"],[\"surface_tint\",\"#8f4c2f\"],[\"surface\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed_variant\",\"#4d4541\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed\",\"#1e1b17\"],[\"ink-light\",\"#5A4E48\"],[\"primary_fixed_dim\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"on_error\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed\",\"#201a17\"],[\"on_secondary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"border-subtle\",\"#E8DDD6\"],[\"tertiary\",\"#605b56\"],[\"on_primary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"surface_container_lowest\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_primary_fixed_variant\",\"#72351a\"],[\"background\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_primary_fixed\",\"#360f00\"],[\"primary_container\",\"#aa6243\"],[\"surface_bright\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"inverse_primary\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"tertiary_container\",\"#79746e\"],[\"surface_container_low\",\"#f6f3f0\"],[\"primary\",\"#8c4a2d\"],[\"on_primary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"inverse_surface\",\"#31302f\"],[\"on_surface_variant\",\"#53433d\"],[\"surface_container_high\",\"#eae8e5\"],[\"secondary_container\",\"#e9ddd7\"],[\"clay-dark\",\"#A85E40\"]],\"---\\nname: Stitch Design System\\ncolors:\\n  surface: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-dim: '#dcdad7'\\n  surface-bright: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-container-lowest: '#ffffff'\\n  surface-container-low: '#f6f3f0'\\n  surface-container: '#f0edea'\\n  surface-container-high: '#eae8e5'\\n  surface-container-highest: '#e5e2df'\\n  on-surface: '#1c1c1a'\\n  on-surface-variant: '#53433d'\\n  inverse-surface: '#31302f'\\n  inverse-on-surface: '#f3f0ed'\\n  outline: '#86736c'\\n  outline-variant: '#d9c2b9'\\n  surface-tint: '#8f4c2f'\\n  primary: '#8c4a2d'\\n  on-primary: '#ffffff'\\n  primary-container: '#aa6243'\\n  on-primary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  inverse-primary: '#ffb597'\\n  secondary: '#655d58'\\n  on-secondary: '#ffffff'\\n  secondary-container: '#e9ddd7'\\n  on-secondary-container: '#69615c'\\n  tertiary: '#605b56'\\n  on-tertiary: '#ffffff'\\n  tertiary-container: '#79746e'\\n  on-tertiary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  error: '#ba1a1a'\\n  on-error: '#ffffff'\\n  error-container: '#ffdad6'\\n  on-error-container: '#93000a'\\n  primary-fixed: '#ffdbcd'\\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#ffb597'\\n  on-primary-fixed: '#360f00'\\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#72351a'\\n  secondary-fixed: '#ece0da'\\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#cfc4be'\\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#201a17'\\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#4d4541'\\n  tertiary-fixed: '#e9e1da'\\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#ccc5bf'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#1e1b17'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#4a4641'\\n  background: '#fcf9f6'\\n  on-background: '#1c1c1a'\\n  surface-variant: '#e5e2df'\\n  clay-dark: '#A85E40'\\n  ink-light: '#5A4E48'\\n  sage: '#D6E4D8'\\n  cream-warm: '#F2ECE6'\\n  border-subtle: '#E8DDD6'\\ntypography:\\n  display:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 80px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.1'\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\n  display-mobile:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 44px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n  headline-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 40px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  headline-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 32px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  body-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.8'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.01em\\n  body-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.85'\\n  label-uppercase:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 12px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.15em\\n  caption:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 11px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.4'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.05em\\nrounded:\\n  sm: 0.25rem\\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\\n  md: 0.75rem\\n  lg: 1rem\\n  xl: 1.5rem\\n  full: 9999px\\nspacing:\\n  container-max: 1440px\\n  section-gap-desktop: 80px\\n  section-gap-mobile: 48px\\n  grid-gutter: 24px\\n  element-gap-sm: 8px\\n  element-gap-md: 16px\\n  element-gap-lg: 32px\\n---\\n\\n## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Colors\\n\\nThe palette is inspired by natural, undyed fibers and earthen materials. \\n\\n- **Primary (Clay):** Used for call-to-actions, price accents, and critical indicators. It provides a warm, energetic contrast to the neutral base.\\n- **Secondary (Ink):** The foundation for readability. Used for all primary headings and body text to ensure high legibility against light backgrounds.\\n- **Tertiary (Blush):** A soft accent for secondary surfaces, card backgrounds, and promotional banners.\\n- **Neutral (Cream):** The primary canvas. This off-white base reduces eye strain and feels more premium and \\\"organic\\\" than pure white.\\n- **Named Colors:** **Sage** is reserved for eco-specific callouts or decorative elements to reinforce the sustainability narrative. **Ink-light** is used for secondary navigation and metadata to create visual hierarchy.\\n\\n## Typography\\n\\nThis design system employs a high-contrast pairing to balance heritage and modernity.\\n\\n- **Headlines:** Use **DM Serif Display**. Its graceful curves and high contrast evoke luxury and editorial authority. Use it sparingly for section headers and hero statements.\\n- **Body \\u0026 UI:** Use **DM Sans**. This low-contrast geometric sans-serif ensures maximum legibility across all digital interfaces. \\n- **The \\\"Label-Uppercase\\\" Style:** This is a signature brand element. Use it for navigation, small headings over titles, and button labels. The generous letter-spacing (tracking) is essential to achieving the \\\"premium\\\" feel.\\n- **Line Height:** Maintain a generous line height (1.8 - 1.85) for body text to reinforce the airy, spacious aesthetic.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Shapes\\n\\nThe shape language is \\\"Soft-Modern,\\\" utilizing rounded corners to evoke friendliness and comfort—qualities essential to a wearable fashion brand.\\n\\n- **Small Elements (Buttons, Tags, Pills):** Use `rounded-full` (pill-shaped). This creates a distinct interactive language that feels modern and approachable.\\n- **Medium Elements (Product Images, Floating Cards):** Use `rounded-lg` (1rem / 16px). This softens the grid without making it feel juvenile.\\n- **Large Elements (Banners, Testimonial Containers):** Use `rounded-xl` (1.5rem / 24px) to create \\\"enveloping\\\" containers that feel substantial and high-end.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",6,\"#c97b5a\",\"#2a2420\",\"#f5ede6\",\"#faf7f4\",null,[[\"body-md\",[\"DM Sans\",\"14px\",\"400\",\"1.85\"]],[\"display\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"80px\",\"400\",\"1.1\",\"-0.02em\"]],[\"body-lg\",[\"DM Sans\",\"16px\",\"400\",\"1.8\",\"0.01em\"]],[\"display-mobile\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"44px\",\"400\",\"1.2\"]],[\"label-uppercase\",[\"DM Sans\",\"12px\",\"500\",\"1.2\",\"0.15em\"]],[\"caption\",[\"DM Sans\",\"11px\",\"500\",\"1.4\",\"0.05em\"]],[\"headline-lg\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"40px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"headline-md\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"32px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]]],[[\"section-gap-mobile\",\"48px\"],[\"element-gap-sm\",\"8px\"],[\"container-max\",\"1440px\"],[\"element-gap-lg\",\"32px\"],[\"grid-gutter\",\"24px\"],[\"section-gap-desktop\",\"80px\"],[\"element-gap-md\",\"16px\"]],null,\"dmSerifDisplay\",\"Dm Sans\",\"Dm Sans\"],2,1,null,[null,2,null,null,2]],[null,[\"projects/18178749605532028059/files/4970728669553672483\",null,\"https://contribution.usercontent.google.com/download?c\\u003dCgthaWRhX2NvZGVmeBKOARIhYXBwX2NvbXBhbmlvbl91c2VyX3VwbG9hZGVkX2ZpbGVzGmkKM3VzZXJfdXBsb2FkZWRfaHRtbF8wMDA2NTNlMGE5ZjJkYjE5MDMzODUyN2ZlNDJhNjBhOBILEgcQ7_fwuI8PGAGSASQKCnByb2plY3RfaWQSFkIUMTgxNzg3NDk2MDU1MzIwMjgwNTk\\u0026filename\\u003d\\u0026opi\\u003d89354086\",null,null,\"text/html\"],null,null,\"4970728669553674094\",null,null,null,\"stitch-fashion-light.html\",null,\"projects/18178749605532028059/screens/4970728669553674094\",[],null,4,true,[null,null,null,null,2,3]],[[\"projects/18178749605532028059/files/62329a3e2cfc4c1ea0c05f25f7cf0e45\",null,\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida/AP1WRLvxIt_dWu_Jcd4OOca-0gadpIGo467qLkKXJ4UMEJ8NKRmDyrnBQlX-mtzSF4hc99q5i9OgJ9SLLAL4hUra3hukitdb_MDL0jgANeenWOmKHck7GpmMobDsheiLJ0YfslfFn7w5a7iOkRZ2cJUPeGEiI-k8NmBBpa9zbNRtdVsjTy8V1VqaIUtd3LuC9QQhYcXB5inxKcJWHY2XgY-QlB6_OWK7IFZuBxb8YD5L2v4lrNVReadOv6zeDWqc\"],null,null,null,\"a952f7268f4049e8b5efc432face024c\",\"interactive_ui_controller\",\"1024\",\"1024\",\"Minimalist sustainable fashion: An elegant organic cotton girl's summer dress displayed beautifully, soft terracotta and floral patterns, natural textures, clean aesthetic, professional fashion photography.\",\"Minimalist sustainable fashion: An elegant organic cotton girl's summer dress displayed beautifully, soft terracotta and floral patterns, natural textures, clean aesthetic, professional fashion photography.\",\"projects/18178749605532028059/screens/a952f7268f4049e8b5efc432face024c\",[],null,2,null,[null,2,null,null,2],null,null,[\"assets/f84726af88af499598b78556bda4af11\",null,[\"Stitch Design System\",null,\"## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",[1,null,3,null,\"#c97b5a\",null,null,null,null,null,26,26,[[\"on_primary_fixed\",\"#360f00\"],[\"surface_bright\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"primary_container\",\"#aa6243\"],[\"on_secondary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed\",\"#201a17\"],[\"border-subtle\",\"#E8DDD6\"],[\"tertiary\",\"#605b56\"],[\"surface_container_lowest\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_primary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"background\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_primary_fixed_variant\",\"#72351a\"],[\"primary_fixed_dim\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"on_error\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"surface\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"surface_tint\",\"#8f4c2f\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed_variant\",\"#4d4541\"],[\"ink-light\",\"#5A4E48\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed\",\"#1e1b17\"],[\"clay-dark\",\"#A85E40\"],[\"on_surface_variant\",\"#53433d\"],[\"surface_container_high\",\"#eae8e5\"],[\"inverse_surface\",\"#31302f\"],[\"secondary_container\",\"#e9ddd7\"],[\"on_primary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"tertiary_container\",\"#79746e\"],[\"inverse_primary\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"primary\",\"#8c4a2d\"],[\"surface_container_low\",\"#f6f3f0\"],[\"secondary_fixed\",\"#ece0da\"],[\"on_secondary_container\",\"#69615c\"],[\"on_error_container\",\"#93000a\"],[\"on_background\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"secondary_fixed_dim\",\"#cfc4be\"],[\"error_container\",\"#ffdad6\"],[\"secondary\",\"#655d58\"],[\"error\",\"#ba1a1a\"],[\"primary_fixed\",\"#ffdbcd\"],[\"outline_variant\",\"#d9c2b9\"],[\"surface_container\",\"#f0edea\"],[\"surface_variant\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed_variant\",\"#4a4641\"],[\"tertiary_fixed_dim\",\"#ccc5bf\"],[\"tertiary_fixed\",\"#e9e1da\"],[\"outline\",\"#86736c\"],[\"cream-warm\",\"#F2ECE6\"],[\"surface_dim\",\"#dcdad7\"],[\"on_surface\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"surface_container_highest\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"sage\",\"#D6E4D8\"],[\"inverse_on_surface\",\"#f3f0ed\"],[\"on_tertiary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_tertiary_container\",\"#fffbff\"]],\"---\\nname: Stitch Design System\\ncolors:\\n  surface: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-dim: '#dcdad7'\\n  surface-bright: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-container-lowest: '#ffffff'\\n  surface-container-low: '#f6f3f0'\\n  surface-container: '#f0edea'\\n  surface-container-high: '#eae8e5'\\n  surface-container-highest: '#e5e2df'\\n  on-surface: '#1c1c1a'\\n  on-surface-variant: '#53433d'\\n  inverse-surface: '#31302f'\\n  inverse-on-surface: '#f3f0ed'\\n  outline: '#86736c'\\n  outline-variant: '#d9c2b9'\\n  surface-tint: '#8f4c2f'\\n  primary: '#8c4a2d'\\n  on-primary: '#ffffff'\\n  primary-container: '#aa6243'\\n  on-primary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  inverse-primary: '#ffb597'\\n  secondary: '#655d58'\\n  on-secondary: '#ffffff'\\n  secondary-container: '#e9ddd7'\\n  on-secondary-container: '#69615c'\\n  tertiary: '#605b56'\\n  on-tertiary: '#ffffff'\\n  tertiary-container: '#79746e'\\n  on-tertiary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  error: '#ba1a1a'\\n  on-error: '#ffffff'\\n  error-container: '#ffdad6'\\n  on-error-container: '#93000a'\\n  primary-fixed: '#ffdbcd'\\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#ffb597'\\n  on-primary-fixed: '#360f00'\\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#72351a'\\n  secondary-fixed: '#ece0da'\\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#cfc4be'\\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#201a17'\\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#4d4541'\\n  tertiary-fixed: '#e9e1da'\\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#ccc5bf'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#1e1b17'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#4a4641'\\n  background: '#fcf9f6'\\n  on-background: '#1c1c1a'\\n  surface-variant: '#e5e2df'\\n  clay-dark: '#A85E40'\\n  ink-light: '#5A4E48'\\n  sage: '#D6E4D8'\\n  cream-warm: '#F2ECE6'\\n  border-subtle: '#E8DDD6'\\ntypography:\\n  display:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 80px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.1'\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\n  display-mobile:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 44px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n  headline-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 40px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  headline-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 32px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  body-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.8'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.01em\\n  body-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.85'\\n  label-uppercase:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 12px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.15em\\n  caption:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 11px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.4'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.05em\\nrounded:\\n  sm: 0.25rem\\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\\n  md: 0.75rem\\n  lg: 1rem\\n  xl: 1.5rem\\n  full: 9999px\\nspacing:\\n  container-max: 1440px\\n  section-gap-desktop: 80px\\n  section-gap-mobile: 48px\\n  grid-gutter: 24px\\n  element-gap-sm: 8px\\n  element-gap-md: 16px\\n  element-gap-lg: 32px\\n---\\n\\n## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Colors\\n\\nThe palette is inspired by natural, undyed fibers and earthen materials. \\n\\n- **Primary (Clay):** Used for call-to-actions, price accents, and critical indicators. It provides a warm, energetic contrast to the neutral base.\\n- **Secondary (Ink):** The foundation for readability. Used for all primary headings and body text to ensure high legibility against light backgrounds.\\n- **Tertiary (Blush):** A soft accent for secondary surfaces, card backgrounds, and promotional banners.\\n- **Neutral (Cream):** The primary canvas. This off-white base reduces eye strain and feels more premium and \\\"organic\\\" than pure white.\\n- **Named Colors:** **Sage** is reserved for eco-specific callouts or decorative elements to reinforce the sustainability narrative. **Ink-light** is used for secondary navigation and metadata to create visual hierarchy.\\n\\n## Typography\\n\\nThis design system employs a high-contrast pairing to balance heritage and modernity.\\n\\n- **Headlines:** Use **DM Serif Display**. Its graceful curves and high contrast evoke luxury and editorial authority. Use it sparingly for section headers and hero statements.\\n- **Body \\u0026 UI:** Use **DM Sans**. This low-contrast geometric sans-serif ensures maximum legibility across all digital interfaces. \\n- **The \\\"Label-Uppercase\\\" Style:** This is a signature brand element. Use it for navigation, small headings over titles, and button labels. The generous letter-spacing (tracking) is essential to achieving the \\\"premium\\\" feel.\\n- **Line Height:** Maintain a generous line height (1.8 - 1.85) for body text to reinforce the airy, spacious aesthetic.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Shapes\\n\\nThe shape language is \\\"Soft-Modern,\\\" utilizing rounded corners to evoke friendliness and comfort—qualities essential to a wearable fashion brand.\\n\\n- **Small Elements (Buttons, Tags, Pills):** Use `rounded-full` (pill-shaped). This creates a distinct interactive language that feels modern and approachable.\\n- **Medium Elements (Product Images, Floating Cards):** Use `rounded-lg` (1rem / 16px). This softens the grid without making it feel juvenile.\\n- **Large Elements (Banners, Testimonial Containers):** Use `rounded-xl` (1.5rem / 24px) to create \\\"enveloping\\\" containers that feel substantial and high-end.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",6,\"#c97b5a\",\"#2a2420\",\"#f5ede6\",\"#faf7f4\",2,[[\"caption\",[\"DM Sans\",\"11px\",\"500\",\"1.4\",\"0.05em\"]],[\"headline-lg\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"40px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"headline-md\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"32px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"display-mobile\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"44px\",\"400\",\"1.2\"]],[\"label-uppercase\",[\"DM Sans\",\"12px\",\"500\",\"1.2\",\"0.15em\"]],[\"body-lg\",[\"DM Sans\",\"16px\",\"400\",\"1.8\",\"0.01em\"]],[\"display\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"80px\",\"400\",\"1.1\",\"-0.02em\"]],[\"body-md\",[\"DM Sans\",\"14px\",\"400\",\"1.85\"]]],[[\"element-gap-md\",\"16px\"],[\"element-gap-sm\",\"8px\"],[\"section-gap-mobile\",\"48px\"],[\"container-max\",\"1440px\"],[\"section-gap-desktop\",\"80px\"],[\"grid-gutter\",\"24px\"],[\"element-gap-lg\",\"32px\"]],null,\"dmSerifDisplay\",\"Dm Sans\",\"Dm Sans\"]],1]],[[\"projects/18178749605532028059/files/671c97aa900040a58e1addb12e6dd775\",null,\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida/AP1WRLtyEXU-ADgRsGjZM9pc5LS72d4VOX9zWNUaxJG8r9hDVExvWT4nlYEg8jHY76-qs4fNzVCUlZT5CRNUWQ8mEdtAJ_jr7kMXh5yK-cmMB1iCjZvfDu-Vuvik-7FnKWQvyNQiitEadgu6rne-bA7IyOZVMqn1V7cs_AxYJV8dL1Av5OBNL5Onz3Rr-LYORwKjMzm0Xzf6VdenDNhoi_AxpMci7WNelWsUWjLLO8Avf1Z218Zq2raVkM59sZhM\"],null,null,null,\"c4a21b968d5b4061a50e911fa6de288c\",\"interactive_ui_controller\",\"896\",\"1200\",\"Minimalist girls' outfit: a simple cotton skirt and top set in dusty rose color, eco-conscious materials, natural textures, soft lighting, professional catalog photography.\",\"Minimalist girls' outfit: a simple cotton skirt and top set in dusty rose color, eco-conscious materials, natural textures, soft lighting, professional catalog photography.\",\"projects/18178749605532028059/screens/c4a21b968d5b4061a50e911fa6de288c\",[],null,2,null,[null,2,null,null,2],null,null,[\"assets/f84726af88af499598b78556bda4af11\",null,[\"Stitch Design System\",null,\"## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",[1,null,3,null,\"#c97b5a\",null,null,null,null,null,26,26,[[\"sage\",\"#D6E4D8\"],[\"surface_container_highest\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"on_tertiary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"inverse_on_surface\",\"#f3f0ed\"],[\"on_tertiary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"cream-warm\",\"#F2ECE6\"],[\"surface_dim\",\"#dcdad7\"],[\"on_surface\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"outline_variant\",\"#d9c2b9\"],[\"error\",\"#ba1a1a\"],[\"primary_fixed\",\"#ffdbcd\"],[\"surface_container\",\"#f0edea\"],[\"tertiary_fixed_dim\",\"#ccc5bf\"],[\"tertiary_fixed\",\"#e9e1da\"],[\"outline\",\"#86736c\"],[\"surface_variant\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed_variant\",\"#4a4641\"],[\"on_error_container\",\"#93000a\"],[\"secondary_fixed\",\"#ece0da\"],[\"on_secondary_container\",\"#69615c\"],[\"error_container\",\"#ffdad6\"],[\"on_background\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"secondary_fixed_dim\",\"#cfc4be\"],[\"secondary\",\"#655d58\"],[\"on_primary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"tertiary_container\",\"#79746e\"],[\"inverse_primary\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"primary\",\"#8c4a2d\"],[\"surface_container_low\",\"#f6f3f0\"],[\"clay-dark\",\"#A85E40\"],[\"secondary_container\",\"#e9ddd7\"],[\"surface_container_high\",\"#eae8e5\"],[\"on_surface_variant\",\"#53433d\"],[\"inverse_surface\",\"#31302f\"],[\"on_error\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"primary_fixed_dim\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed_variant\",\"#4d4541\"],[\"surface\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"surface_tint\",\"#8f4c2f\"],[\"ink-light\",\"#5A4E48\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed\",\"#1e1b17\"],[\"on_primary_fixed\",\"#360f00\"],[\"surface_bright\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"primary_container\",\"#aa6243\"],[\"border-subtle\",\"#E8DDD6\"],[\"tertiary\",\"#605b56\"],[\"on_secondary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed\",\"#201a17\"],[\"background\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_primary_fixed_variant\",\"#72351a\"],[\"surface_container_lowest\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_primary_container\",\"#fffbff\"]],\"---\\nname: Stitch Design System\\ncolors:\\n  surface: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-dim: '#dcdad7'\\n  surface-bright: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-container-lowest: '#ffffff'\\n  surface-container-low: '#f6f3f0'\\n  surface-container: '#f0edea'\\n  surface-container-high: '#eae8e5'\\n  surface-container-highest: '#e5e2df'\\n  on-surface: '#1c1c1a'\\n  on-surface-variant: '#53433d'\\n  inverse-surface: '#31302f'\\n  inverse-on-surface: '#f3f0ed'\\n  outline: '#86736c'\\n  outline-variant: '#d9c2b9'\\n  surface-tint: '#8f4c2f'\\n  primary: '#8c4a2d'\\n  on-primary: '#ffffff'\\n  primary-container: '#aa6243'\\n  on-primary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  inverse-primary: '#ffb597'\\n  secondary: '#655d58'\\n  on-secondary: '#ffffff'\\n  secondary-container: '#e9ddd7'\\n  on-secondary-container: '#69615c'\\n  tertiary: '#605b56'\\n  on-tertiary: '#ffffff'\\n  tertiary-container: '#79746e'\\n  on-tertiary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  error: '#ba1a1a'\\n  on-error: '#ffffff'\\n  error-container: '#ffdad6'\\n  on-error-container: '#93000a'\\n  primary-fixed: '#ffdbcd'\\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#ffb597'\\n  on-primary-fixed: '#360f00'\\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#72351a'\\n  secondary-fixed: '#ece0da'\\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#cfc4be'\\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#201a17'\\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#4d4541'\\n  tertiary-fixed: '#e9e1da'\\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#ccc5bf'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#1e1b17'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#4a4641'\\n  background: '#fcf9f6'\\n  on-background: '#1c1c1a'\\n  surface-variant: '#e5e2df'\\n  clay-dark: '#A85E40'\\n  ink-light: '#5A4E48'\\n  sage: '#D6E4D8'\\n  cream-warm: '#F2ECE6'\\n  border-subtle: '#E8DDD6'\\ntypography:\\n  display:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 80px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.1'\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\n  display-mobile:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 44px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n  headline-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 40px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  headline-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 32px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  body-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.8'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.01em\\n  body-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.85'\\n  label-uppercase:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 12px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.15em\\n  caption:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 11px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.4'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.05em\\nrounded:\\n  sm: 0.25rem\\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\\n  md: 0.75rem\\n  lg: 1rem\\n  xl: 1.5rem\\n  full: 9999px\\nspacing:\\n  container-max: 1440px\\n  section-gap-desktop: 80px\\n  section-gap-mobile: 48px\\n  grid-gutter: 24px\\n  element-gap-sm: 8px\\n  element-gap-md: 16px\\n  element-gap-lg: 32px\\n---\\n\\n## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Colors\\n\\nThe palette is inspired by natural, undyed fibers and earthen materials. \\n\\n- **Primary (Clay):** Used for call-to-actions, price accents, and critical indicators. It provides a warm, energetic contrast to the neutral base.\\n- **Secondary (Ink):** The foundation for readability. Used for all primary headings and body text to ensure high legibility against light backgrounds.\\n- **Tertiary (Blush):** A soft accent for secondary surfaces, card backgrounds, and promotional banners.\\n- **Neutral (Cream):** The primary canvas. This off-white base reduces eye strain and feels more premium and \\\"organic\\\" than pure white.\\n- **Named Colors:** **Sage** is reserved for eco-specific callouts or decorative elements to reinforce the sustainability narrative. **Ink-light** is used for secondary navigation and metadata to create visual hierarchy.\\n\\n## Typography\\n\\nThis design system employs a high-contrast pairing to balance heritage and modernity.\\n\\n- **Headlines:** Use **DM Serif Display**. Its graceful curves and high contrast evoke luxury and editorial authority. Use it sparingly for section headers and hero statements.\\n- **Body \\u0026 UI:** Use **DM Sans**. This low-contrast geometric sans-serif ensures maximum legibility across all digital interfaces. \\n- **The \\\"Label-Uppercase\\\" Style:** This is a signature brand element. Use it for navigation, small headings over titles, and button labels. The generous letter-spacing (tracking) is essential to achieving the \\\"premium\\\" feel.\\n- **Line Height:** Maintain a generous line height (1.8 - 1.85) for body text to reinforce the airy, spacious aesthetic.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Shapes\\n\\nThe shape language is \\\"Soft-Modern,\\\" utilizing rounded corners to evoke friendliness and comfort—qualities essential to a wearable fashion brand.\\n\\n- **Small Elements (Buttons, Tags, Pills):** Use `rounded-full` (pill-shaped). This creates a distinct interactive language that feels modern and approachable.\\n- **Medium Elements (Product Images, Floating Cards):** Use `rounded-lg` (1rem / 16px). This softens the grid without making it feel juvenile.\\n- **Large Elements (Banners, Testimonial Containers):** Use `rounded-xl` (1.5rem / 24px) to create \\\"enveloping\\\" containers that feel substantial and high-end.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",6,\"#c97b5a\",\"#2a2420\",\"#f5ede6\",\"#faf7f4\",2,[[\"headline-lg\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"40px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"headline-md\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"32px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"caption\",[\"DM Sans\",\"11px\",\"500\",\"1.4\",\"0.05em\"]],[\"body-lg\",[\"DM Sans\",\"16px\",\"400\",\"1.8\",\"0.01em\"]],[\"body-md\",[\"DM Sans\",\"14px\",\"400\",\"1.85\"]],[\"display\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"80px\",\"400\",\"1.1\",\"-0.02em\"]],[\"display-mobile\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"44px\",\"400\",\"1.2\"]],[\"label-uppercase\",[\"DM Sans\",\"12px\",\"500\",\"1.2\",\"0.15em\"]]],[[\"element-gap-lg\",\"32px\"],[\"grid-gutter\",\"24px\"],[\"section-gap-desktop\",\"80px\"],[\"section-gap-mobile\",\"48px\"],[\"element-gap-sm\",\"8px\"],[\"container-max\",\"1440px\"],[\"element-gap-md\",\"16px\"]],null,\"dmSerifDisplay\",\"Dm Sans\",\"Dm Sans\"]],1]],[[\"projects/18178749605532028059/files/39a11c34db974095a324bd4f42aad867\",null,\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida/AP1WRLuDzUm6HnOrtq-_Y79i_vsNtvsGyIMS8g5BpV56X4MexM0dTmurOSNbZNzZ_5m18T_3rdO2ADC6yjiyTdBlfB7FXtq5LvxawQBTupWiLoeVkOPMd86cIWEVaEphgOLJOEWPbTNFZJcK566vi-mcdjad6Y-UcIUxjjOCscNtT9xqN9_QzZo8QPV2YTQVIbOduueI3QfOMiJmqRSGnBayp_4Aj9KOEO50W9WhBT-3RRFfORWsB1COzhz7G9c\"],[\"projects/18178749605532028059/files/f85d691f8fbb472e87af1847005b6a4a\",null,\"https://contribution.usercontent.google.com/download?c\\u003dCgthaWRhX2NvZGVmeBJ8Eh1hcHBfY29tcGFuaW9uX2dlbmVyYXRlZF9maWxlcxpbCiVodG1sXzdmZTk5MTc1NDA0MTQ1MzZhNjE1NTJkYWIwZmRjNmY4EgsSBxDv9_C4jw8YAZIBJAoKcHJvamVjdF9pZBIWQhQxODE3ODc0OTYwNTUzMjAyODA1OQ\\u0026filename\\u003d\\u0026opi\\u003d89354086\",null,null,\"text/html\"],null,null,\"6d8f3e5228b2439fae4ff85c281541d7\",\"figaro_agent\",\"2560\",\"9436\",\"Stitch — Trang chủ (Redesign V2)\",\"Thiết kế trang chủ (Home Page) cho Stitch — thương hiệu thời trang bền vững tối giản. \\nCấu trúc trang:\\n1. Navbar: Logo Stitch, Menu (Shop All, Women, Men, Accessories, Our Story), Search icon, User icon, Shopping Bag icon.\\n2. Hero Section: Hình ảnh lớn về thời trang tối giản, tiêu đề \\\"Mặc thứ bạn yêu thích\\\", mô tả ngắn về vải organic và quy trình may thủ công, nút CTA \\\"Khám phá ngay\\\".\\n3. Marquee: Dòng chữ chạy ngang thông báo miễn phí vận chuyển, vải organic, 30 ngày đổi trả.\\n4. New Arrivals: Lưới sản phẩm (4 sản phẩm) với hình ảnh sạch sẽ, tên sản phẩm, giá cả và nhãn \\\"Mới\\\".\\n5. Categories (Bento Grid): 3-4 ô danh mục chính như Đồ Nữ, Đồ Nam, Phụ kiện, Eco Line với phong cách tối giản.\\n6. Best Sellers: Section hiển thị 4 sản phẩm bán chạy nhất.\\n7. Flash Sale Section: Khu vực làm nổi bật các sản phẩm đang giảm giá với nhãn % giảm giá.\\n8. Brand Story: Một section kết hợp hình ảnh và văn bản nói về \\\"Mỗi mũi chỉ là một cam kết\\\" bền vững.\\n9. Newsletter: Đăng ký nhận tin với form tinh tế.\\n10. Footer: Thông tin liên hệ, links chính sách, mạng xã hội.\\n\\nNgôn ngữ: Tiếng Việt.\\nPhong cách: Cao cấp, tối giản, nhiều khoảng trắng, sử dụng font Serif cho tiêu đề và Sans-serif cho nội dung. Màu sắc chủ đạo từ Design System {{DATA:DESIGN_SYSTEM:DESIGN_SYSTEM_1}} (#c97b5a clay).\",\"projects/18178749605532028059/screens/6d8f3e5228b2439fae4ff85c281541d7\",[1,null,3,null,\"#c97b5a\",null,null,null,null,null,26,26,[[\"surface_container\",\"#f0edea\"],[\"error\",\"#ba1a1a\"],[\"primary_fixed\",\"#ffdbcd\"],[\"outline_variant\",\"#d9c2b9\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed_variant\",\"#4a4641\"],[\"surface_variant\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"outline\",\"#86736c\"],[\"tertiary_fixed\",\"#e9e1da\"],[\"tertiary_fixed_dim\",\"#ccc5bf\"],[\"on_background\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"secondary_fixed_dim\",\"#cfc4be\"],[\"error_container\",\"#ffdad6\"],[\"secondary_fixed\",\"#ece0da\"],[\"on_secondary_container\",\"#69615c\"],[\"on_error_container\",\"#93000a\"],[\"secondary\",\"#655d58\"],[\"inverse_on_surface\",\"#f3f0ed\"],[\"on_tertiary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"surface_container_highest\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"sage\",\"#D6E4D8\"],[\"on_tertiary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"surface_dim\",\"#dcdad7\"],[\"cream-warm\",\"#F2ECE6\"],[\"on_surface\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"primary_fixed_dim\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"on_error\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"ink-light\",\"#5A4E48\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed\",\"#1e1b17\"],[\"surface\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"surface_tint\",\"#8f4c2f\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed_variant\",\"#4d4541\"],[\"surface_bright\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"primary_container\",\"#aa6243\"],[\"on_primary_fixed\",\"#360f00\"],[\"surface_container_lowest\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_primary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"background\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_primary_fixed_variant\",\"#72351a\"],[\"on_secondary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed\",\"#201a17\"],[\"border-subtle\",\"#E8DDD6\"],[\"tertiary\",\"#605b56\"],[\"on_primary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"primary\",\"#8c4a2d\"],[\"surface_container_low\",\"#f6f3f0\"],[\"tertiary_container\",\"#79746e\"],[\"inverse_primary\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"clay-dark\",\"#A85E40\"],[\"surface_container_high\",\"#eae8e5\"],[\"on_surface_variant\",\"#53433d\"],[\"inverse_surface\",\"#31302f\"],[\"secondary_container\",\"#e9ddd7\"]],\"---\\nname: Stitch Design System\\ncolors:\\n  surface: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-dim: '#dcdad7'\\n  surface-bright: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-container-lowest: '#ffffff'\\n  surface-container-low: '#f6f3f0'\\n  surface-container: '#f0edea'\\n  surface-container-high: '#eae8e5'\\n  surface-container-highest: '#e5e2df'\\n  on-surface: '#1c1c1a'\\n  on-surface-variant: '#53433d'\\n  inverse-surface: '#31302f'\\n  inverse-on-surface: '#f3f0ed'\\n  outline: '#86736c'\\n  outline-variant: '#d9c2b9'\\n  surface-tint: '#8f4c2f'\\n  primary: '#8c4a2d'\\n  on-primary: '#ffffff'\\n  primary-container: '#aa6243'\\n  on-primary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  inverse-primary: '#ffb597'\\n  secondary: '#655d58'\\n  on-secondary: '#ffffff'\\n  secondary-container: '#e9ddd7'\\n  on-secondary-container: '#69615c'\\n  tertiary: '#605b56'\\n  on-tertiary: '#ffffff'\\n  tertiary-container: '#79746e'\\n  on-tertiary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  error: '#ba1a1a'\\n  on-error: '#ffffff'\\n  error-container: '#ffdad6'\\n  on-error-container: '#93000a'\\n  primary-fixed: '#ffdbcd'\\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#ffb597'\\n  on-primary-fixed: '#360f00'\\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#72351a'\\n  secondary-fixed: '#ece0da'\\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#cfc4be'\\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#201a17'\\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#4d4541'\\n  tertiary-fixed: '#e9e1da'\\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#ccc5bf'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#1e1b17'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#4a4641'\\n  background: '#fcf9f6'\\n  on-background: '#1c1c1a'\\n  surface-variant: '#e5e2df'\\n  clay-dark: '#A85E40'\\n  ink-light: '#5A4E48'\\n  sage: '#D6E4D8'\\n  cream-warm: '#F2ECE6'\\n  border-subtle: '#E8DDD6'\\ntypography:\\n  display:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 80px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.1'\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\n  display-mobile:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 44px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n  headline-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 40px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  headline-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 32px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  body-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.8'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.01em\\n  body-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.85'\\n  label-uppercase:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 12px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.15em\\n  caption:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 11px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.4'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.05em\\nrounded:\\n  sm: 0.25rem\\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\\n  md: 0.75rem\\n  lg: 1rem\\n  xl: 1.5rem\\n  full: 9999px\\nspacing:\\n  container-max: 1440px\\n  section-gap-desktop: 80px\\n  section-gap-mobile: 48px\\n  grid-gutter: 24px\\n  element-gap-sm: 8px\\n  element-gap-md: 16px\\n  element-gap-lg: 32px\\n---\\n\\n## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Colors\\n\\nThe palette is inspired by natural, undyed fibers and earthen materials. \\n\\n- **Primary (Clay):** Used for call-to-actions, price accents, and critical indicators. It provides a warm, energetic contrast to the neutral base.\\n- **Secondary (Ink):** The foundation for readability. Used for all primary headings and body text to ensure high legibility against light backgrounds.\\n- **Tertiary (Blush):** A soft accent for secondary surfaces, card backgrounds, and promotional banners.\\n- **Neutral (Cream):** The primary canvas. This off-white base reduces eye strain and feels more premium and \\\"organic\\\" than pure white.\\n- **Named Colors:** **Sage** is reserved for eco-specific callouts or decorative elements to reinforce the sustainability narrative. **Ink-light** is used for secondary navigation and metadata to create visual hierarchy.\\n\\n## Typography\\n\\nThis design system employs a high-contrast pairing to balance heritage and modernity.\\n\\n- **Headlines:** Use **DM Serif Display**. Its graceful curves and high contrast evoke luxury and editorial authority. Use it sparingly for section headers and hero statements.\\n- **Body \\u0026 UI:** Use **DM Sans**. This low-contrast geometric sans-serif ensures maximum legibility across all digital interfaces. \\n- **The \\\"Label-Uppercase\\\" Style:** This is a signature brand element. Use it for navigation, small headings over titles, and button labels. The generous letter-spacing (tracking) is essential to achieving the \\\"premium\\\" feel.\\n- **Line Height:** Maintain a generous line height (1.8 - 1.85) for body text to reinforce the airy, spacious aesthetic.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Shapes\\n\\nThe shape language is \\\"Soft-Modern,\\\" utilizing rounded corners to evoke friendliness and comfort—qualities essential to a wearable fashion brand.\\n\\n- **Small Elements (Buttons, Tags, Pills):** Use `rounded-full` (pill-shaped). This creates a distinct interactive language that feels modern and approachable.\\n- **Medium Elements (Product Images, Floating Cards):** Use `rounded-lg` (1rem / 16px). This softens the grid without making it feel juvenile.\\n- **Large Elements (Banners, Testimonial Containers):** Use `rounded-xl` (1.5rem / 24px) to create \\\"enveloping\\\" containers that feel substantial and high-end.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",6,\"#c97b5a\",\"#2a2420\",\"#f5ede6\",\"#faf7f4\",2,[[\"headline-lg\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"40px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"headline-md\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"32px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"caption\",[\"DM Sans\",\"11px\",\"500\",\"1.4\",\"0.05em\"]],[\"body-lg\",[\"DM Sans\",\"16px\",\"400\",\"1.8\",\"0.01em\"]],[\"body-md\",[\"DM Sans\",\"14px\",\"400\",\"1.85\"]],[\"display\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"80px\",\"400\",\"1.1\",\"-0.02em\"]],[\"display-mobile\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"44px\",\"400\",\"1.2\"]],[\"label-uppercase\",[\"DM Sans\",\"12px\",\"500\",\"1.2\",\"0.15em\"]]],[[\"element-gap-md\",\"16px\"],[\"element-gap-sm\",\"8px\"],[\"section-gap-mobile\",\"48px\"],[\"container-max\",\"1440px\"],[\"grid-gutter\",\"24px\"],[\"section-gap-desktop\",\"80px\"],[\"element-gap-lg\",\"32px\"]],null,\"dmSerifDisplay\",\"Dm Sans\",\"Dm Sans\"],2,1,null,[null,2,null,null,2],null,null,[\"assets/f84726af88af499598b78556bda4af11\",null,[\"Stitch Design System\",null,\"## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",[1,null,3,null,\"#c97b5a\",null,null,null,null,null,26,26,[[\"clay-dark\",\"#A85E40\"],[\"surface_container_high\",\"#eae8e5\"],[\"on_surface_variant\",\"#53433d\"],[\"inverse_surface\",\"#31302f\"],[\"secondary_container\",\"#e9ddd7\"],[\"on_primary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"inverse_primary\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"tertiary_container\",\"#79746e\"],[\"surface_container_low\",\"#f6f3f0\"],[\"primary\",\"#8c4a2d\"],[\"on_primary_fixed\",\"#360f00\"],[\"primary_container\",\"#aa6243\"],[\"surface_bright\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed\",\"#201a17\"],[\"on_secondary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"tertiary\",\"#605b56\"],[\"border-subtle\",\"#E8DDD6\"],[\"on_primary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"surface_container_lowest\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_primary_fixed_variant\",\"#72351a\"],[\"background\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"primary_fixed_dim\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"on_error\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"surface_tint\",\"#8f4c2f\"],[\"surface\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed_variant\",\"#4d4541\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed\",\"#1e1b17\"],[\"ink-light\",\"#5A4E48\"],[\"cream-warm\",\"#F2ECE6\"],[\"surface_dim\",\"#dcdad7\"],[\"on_surface\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"surface_container_highest\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"sage\",\"#D6E4D8\"],[\"inverse_on_surface\",\"#f3f0ed\"],[\"on_tertiary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_tertiary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"secondary_fixed\",\"#ece0da\"],[\"on_secondary_container\",\"#69615c\"],[\"on_error_container\",\"#93000a\"],[\"secondary_fixed_dim\",\"#cfc4be\"],[\"on_background\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"error_container\",\"#ffdad6\"],[\"secondary\",\"#655d58\"],[\"primary_fixed\",\"#ffdbcd\"],[\"error\",\"#ba1a1a\"],[\"outline_variant\",\"#d9c2b9\"],[\"surface_container\",\"#f0edea\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed_variant\",\"#4a4641\"],[\"surface_variant\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"outline\",\"#86736c\"],[\"tertiary_fixed\",\"#e9e1da\"],[\"tertiary_fixed_dim\",\"#ccc5bf\"]],\"---\\nname: Stitch Design System\\ncolors:\\n  surface: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-dim: '#dcdad7'\\n  surface-bright: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-container-lowest: '#ffffff'\\n  surface-container-low: '#f6f3f0'\\n  surface-container: '#f0edea'\\n  surface-container-high: '#eae8e5'\\n  surface-container-highest: '#e5e2df'\\n  on-surface: '#1c1c1a'\\n  on-surface-variant: '#53433d'\\n  inverse-surface: '#31302f'\\n  inverse-on-surface: '#f3f0ed'\\n  outline: '#86736c'\\n  outline-variant: '#d9c2b9'\\n  surface-tint: '#8f4c2f'\\n  primary: '#8c4a2d'\\n  on-primary: '#ffffff'\\n  primary-container: '#aa6243'\\n  on-primary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  inverse-primary: '#ffb597'\\n  secondary: '#655d58'\\n  on-secondary: '#ffffff'\\n  secondary-container: '#e9ddd7'\\n  on-secondary-container: '#69615c'\\n  tertiary: '#605b56'\\n  on-tertiary: '#ffffff'\\n  tertiary-container: '#79746e'\\n  on-tertiary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  error: '#ba1a1a'\\n  on-error: '#ffffff'\\n  error-container: '#ffdad6'\\n  on-error-container: '#93000a'\\n  primary-fixed: '#ffdbcd'\\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#ffb597'\\n  on-primary-fixed: '#360f00'\\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#72351a'\\n  secondary-fixed: '#ece0da'\\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#cfc4be'\\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#201a17'\\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#4d4541'\\n  tertiary-fixed: '#e9e1da'\\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#ccc5bf'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#1e1b17'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#4a4641'\\n  background: '#fcf9f6'\\n  on-background: '#1c1c1a'\\n  surface-variant: '#e5e2df'\\n  clay-dark: '#A85E40'\\n  ink-light: '#5A4E48'\\n  sage: '#D6E4D8'\\n  cream-warm: '#F2ECE6'\\n  border-subtle: '#E8DDD6'\\ntypography:\\n  display:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 80px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.1'\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\n  display-mobile:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 44px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n  headline-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 40px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  headline-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 32px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  body-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.8'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.01em\\n  body-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.85'\\n  label-uppercase:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 12px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.15em\\n  caption:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 11px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.4'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.05em\\nrounded:\\n  sm: 0.25rem\\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\\n  md: 0.75rem\\n  lg: 1rem\\n  xl: 1.5rem\\n  full: 9999px\\nspacing:\\n  container-max: 1440px\\n  section-gap-desktop: 80px\\n  section-gap-mobile: 48px\\n  grid-gutter: 24px\\n  element-gap-sm: 8px\\n  element-gap-md: 16px\\n  element-gap-lg: 32px\\n---\\n\\n## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Colors\\n\\nThe palette is inspired by natural, undyed fibers and earthen materials. \\n\\n- **Primary (Clay):** Used for call-to-actions, price accents, and critical indicators. It provides a warm, energetic contrast to the neutral base.\\n- **Secondary (Ink):** The foundation for readability. Used for all primary headings and body text to ensure high legibility against light backgrounds.\\n- **Tertiary (Blush):** A soft accent for secondary surfaces, card backgrounds, and promotional banners.\\n- **Neutral (Cream):** The primary canvas. This off-white base reduces eye strain and feels more premium and \\\"organic\\\" than pure white.\\n- **Named Colors:** **Sage** is reserved for eco-specific callouts or decorative elements to reinforce the sustainability narrative. **Ink-light** is used for secondary navigation and metadata to create visual hierarchy.\\n\\n## Typography\\n\\nThis design system employs a high-contrast pairing to balance heritage and modernity.\\n\\n- **Headlines:** Use **DM Serif Display**. Its graceful curves and high contrast evoke luxury and editorial authority. Use it sparingly for section headers and hero statements.\\n- **Body \\u0026 UI:** Use **DM Sans**. This low-contrast geometric sans-serif ensures maximum legibility across all digital interfaces. \\n- **The \\\"Label-Uppercase\\\" Style:** This is a signature brand element. Use it for navigation, small headings over titles, and button labels. The generous letter-spacing (tracking) is essential to achieving the \\\"premium\\\" feel.\\n- **Line Height:** Maintain a generous line height (1.8 - 1.85) for body text to reinforce the airy, spacious aesthetic.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Shapes\\n\\nThe shape language is \\\"Soft-Modern,\\\" utilizing rounded corners to evoke friendliness and comfort—qualities essential to a wearable fashion brand.\\n\\n- **Small Elements (Buttons, Tags, Pills):** Use `rounded-full` (pill-shaped). This creates a distinct interactive language that feels modern and approachable.\\n- **Medium Elements (Product Images, Floating Cards):** Use `rounded-lg` (1rem / 16px). This softens the grid without making it feel juvenile.\\n- **Large Elements (Banners, Testimonial Containers):** Use `rounded-xl` (1.5rem / 24px) to create \\\"enveloping\\\" containers that feel substantial and high-end.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",6,\"#c97b5a\",\"#2a2420\",\"#f5ede6\",\"#faf7f4\",2,[[\"caption\",[\"DM Sans\",\"11px\",\"500\",\"1.4\",\"0.05em\"]],[\"headline-lg\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"40px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"headline-md\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"32px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"body-lg\",[\"DM Sans\",\"16px\",\"400\",\"1.8\",\"0.01em\"]],[\"display\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"80px\",\"400\",\"1.1\",\"-0.02em\"]],[\"body-md\",[\"DM Sans\",\"14px\",\"400\",\"1.85\"]],[\"display-mobile\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"44px\",\"400\",\"1.2\"]],[\"label-uppercase\",[\"DM Sans\",\"12px\",\"500\",\"1.2\",\"0.15em\"]]],[[\"element-gap-md\",\"16px\"],[\"container-max\",\"1440px\"],[\"element-gap-sm\",\"8px\"],[\"section-gap-mobile\",\"48px\"],[\"section-gap-desktop\",\"80px\"],[\"grid-gutter\",\"24px\"],[\"element-gap-lg\",\"32px\"]],null,\"dmSerifDisplay\",\"Dm Sans\",\"Dm Sans\"]],1]],[[\"projects/18178749605532028059/files/2d16979a389d45508705a8df18f034c8\",null,\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida/AP1WRLvWqyFMqFkRsLffB60ErS6HMGDe9VtPxRY0QCsHmkvZTXaCB0sYYbD0hr9CrsvkMhHK1NYHtGwwEIlVuZcilKDslg2BAZ0A74S2bSxn8J2ScMxyu3xru31Vu1pP6-oR0FWQswj-T0YijUqSUcYfxmEPnA-mRzTIIDbla-FT-RHmfLBd3BSRIuMjWefqabzawUZEGXf2hPhVYyMn0cQf1lMr72oB7YZ5WV1mWRYpg0dLV85VKhdqRCAMvdY\"],null,null,null,\"388645ffbdd94b14869744a7514afcd2\",\"interactive_ui_controller\",\"896\",\"1200\",\"Minimalist sustainable fashion for girls: an organic cotton floral summer dress in soft terracotta tones, high-quality natural fabric, soft studio lighting, professional fashion catalog style, simple and elegant.\",\"Minimalist sustainable fashion for girls: an organic cotton floral summer dress in soft terracotta tones, high-quality natural fabric, soft studio lighting, professional fashion catalog style, simple and elegant.\",\"projects/18178749605532028059/screens/388645ffbdd94b14869744a7514afcd2\",[],null,2,null,[null,2,null,null,2],null,null,[\"assets/f84726af88af499598b78556bda4af11\",null,[\"Stitch Design System\",null,\"## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",[1,null,3,null,\"#c97b5a\",null,null,null,null,null,26,26,[[\"secondary_container\",\"#e9ddd7\"],[\"surface_container_high\",\"#eae8e5\"],[\"on_surface_variant\",\"#53433d\"],[\"inverse_surface\",\"#31302f\"],[\"clay-dark\",\"#A85E40\"],[\"inverse_primary\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"tertiary_container\",\"#79746e\"],[\"surface_container_low\",\"#f6f3f0\"],[\"primary\",\"#8c4a2d\"],[\"on_primary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"tertiary\",\"#605b56\"],[\"border-subtle\",\"#E8DDD6\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed\",\"#201a17\"],[\"on_secondary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_primary_fixed_variant\",\"#72351a\"],[\"background\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_primary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"surface_container_lowest\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_primary_fixed\",\"#360f00\"],[\"primary_container\",\"#aa6243\"],[\"surface_bright\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed_variant\",\"#4d4541\"],[\"surface_tint\",\"#8f4c2f\"],[\"surface\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed\",\"#1e1b17\"],[\"ink-light\",\"#5A4E48\"],[\"on_error\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"primary_fixed_dim\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"on_surface\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"cream-warm\",\"#F2ECE6\"],[\"surface_dim\",\"#dcdad7\"],[\"on_tertiary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"sage\",\"#D6E4D8\"],[\"surface_container_highest\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"on_tertiary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"inverse_on_surface\",\"#f3f0ed\"],[\"secondary\",\"#655d58\"],[\"on_error_container\",\"#93000a\"],[\"on_secondary_container\",\"#69615c\"],[\"secondary_fixed\",\"#ece0da\"],[\"error_container\",\"#ffdad6\"],[\"secondary_fixed_dim\",\"#cfc4be\"],[\"on_background\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"tertiary_fixed_dim\",\"#ccc5bf\"],[\"tertiary_fixed\",\"#e9e1da\"],[\"outline\",\"#86736c\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed_variant\",\"#4a4641\"],[\"surface_variant\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"outline_variant\",\"#d9c2b9\"],[\"primary_fixed\",\"#ffdbcd\"],[\"error\",\"#ba1a1a\"],[\"surface_container\",\"#f0edea\"]],\"---\\nname: Stitch Design System\\ncolors:\\n  surface: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-dim: '#dcdad7'\\n  surface-bright: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-container-lowest: '#ffffff'\\n  surface-container-low: '#f6f3f0'\\n  surface-container: '#f0edea'\\n  surface-container-high: '#eae8e5'\\n  surface-container-highest: '#e5e2df'\\n  on-surface: '#1c1c1a'\\n  on-surface-variant: '#53433d'\\n  inverse-surface: '#31302f'\\n  inverse-on-surface: '#f3f0ed'\\n  outline: '#86736c'\\n  outline-variant: '#d9c2b9'\\n  surface-tint: '#8f4c2f'\\n  primary: '#8c4a2d'\\n  on-primary: '#ffffff'\\n  primary-container: '#aa6243'\\n  on-primary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  inverse-primary: '#ffb597'\\n  secondary: '#655d58'\\n  on-secondary: '#ffffff'\\n  secondary-container: '#e9ddd7'\\n  on-secondary-container: '#69615c'\\n  tertiary: '#605b56'\\n  on-tertiary: '#ffffff'\\n  tertiary-container: '#79746e'\\n  on-tertiary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  error: '#ba1a1a'\\n  on-error: '#ffffff'\\n  error-container: '#ffdad6'\\n  on-error-container: '#93000a'\\n  primary-fixed: '#ffdbcd'\\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#ffb597'\\n  on-primary-fixed: '#360f00'\\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#72351a'\\n  secondary-fixed: '#ece0da'\\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#cfc4be'\\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#201a17'\\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#4d4541'\\n  tertiary-fixed: '#e9e1da'\\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#ccc5bf'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#1e1b17'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#4a4641'\\n  background: '#fcf9f6'\\n  on-background: '#1c1c1a'\\n  surface-variant: '#e5e2df'\\n  clay-dark: '#A85E40'\\n  ink-light: '#5A4E48'\\n  sage: '#D6E4D8'\\n  cream-warm: '#F2ECE6'\\n  border-subtle: '#E8DDD6'\\ntypography:\\n  display:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 80px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.1'\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\n  display-mobile:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 44px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n  headline-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 40px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  headline-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 32px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  body-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.8'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.01em\\n  body-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.85'\\n  label-uppercase:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 12px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.15em\\n  caption:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 11px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.4'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.05em\\nrounded:\\n  sm: 0.25rem\\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\\n  md: 0.75rem\\n  lg: 1rem\\n  xl: 1.5rem\\n  full: 9999px\\nspacing:\\n  container-max: 1440px\\n  section-gap-desktop: 80px\\n  section-gap-mobile: 48px\\n  grid-gutter: 24px\\n  element-gap-sm: 8px\\n  element-gap-md: 16px\\n  element-gap-lg: 32px\\n---\\n\\n## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Colors\\n\\nThe palette is inspired by natural, undyed fibers and earthen materials. \\n\\n- **Primary (Clay):** Used for call-to-actions, price accents, and critical indicators. It provides a warm, energetic contrast to the neutral base.\\n- **Secondary (Ink):** The foundation for readability. Used for all primary headings and body text to ensure high legibility against light backgrounds.\\n- **Tertiary (Blush):** A soft accent for secondary surfaces, card backgrounds, and promotional banners.\\n- **Neutral (Cream):** The primary canvas. This off-white base reduces eye strain and feels more premium and \\\"organic\\\" than pure white.\\n- **Named Colors:** **Sage** is reserved for eco-specific callouts or decorative elements to reinforce the sustainability narrative. **Ink-light** is used for secondary navigation and metadata to create visual hierarchy.\\n\\n## Typography\\n\\nThis design system employs a high-contrast pairing to balance heritage and modernity.\\n\\n- **Headlines:** Use **DM Serif Display**. Its graceful curves and high contrast evoke luxury and editorial authority. Use it sparingly for section headers and hero statements.\\n- **Body \\u0026 UI:** Use **DM Sans**. This low-contrast geometric sans-serif ensures maximum legibility across all digital interfaces. \\n- **The \\\"Label-Uppercase\\\" Style:** This is a signature brand element. Use it for navigation, small headings over titles, and button labels. The generous letter-spacing (tracking) is essential to achieving the \\\"premium\\\" feel.\\n- **Line Height:** Maintain a generous line height (1.8 - 1.85) for body text to reinforce the airy, spacious aesthetic.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Shapes\\n\\nThe shape language is \\\"Soft-Modern,\\\" utilizing rounded corners to evoke friendliness and comfort—qualities essential to a wearable fashion brand.\\n\\n- **Small Elements (Buttons, Tags, Pills):** Use `rounded-full` (pill-shaped). This creates a distinct interactive language that feels modern and approachable.\\n- **Medium Elements (Product Images, Floating Cards):** Use `rounded-lg` (1rem / 16px). This softens the grid without making it feel juvenile.\\n- **Large Elements (Banners, Testimonial Containers):** Use `rounded-xl` (1.5rem / 24px) to create \\\"enveloping\\\" containers that feel substantial and high-end.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",6,\"#c97b5a\",\"#2a2420\",\"#f5ede6\",\"#faf7f4\",2,[[\"headline-lg\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"40px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"headline-md\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"32px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"caption\",[\"DM Sans\",\"11px\",\"500\",\"1.4\",\"0.05em\"]],[\"display-mobile\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"44px\",\"400\",\"1.2\"]],[\"label-uppercase\",[\"DM Sans\",\"12px\",\"500\",\"1.2\",\"0.15em\"]],[\"body-lg\",[\"DM Sans\",\"16px\",\"400\",\"1.8\",\"0.01em\"]],[\"body-md\",[\"DM Sans\",\"14px\",\"400\",\"1.85\"]],[\"display\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"80px\",\"400\",\"1.1\",\"-0.02em\"]]],[[\"element-gap-lg\",\"32px\"],[\"grid-gutter\",\"24px\"],[\"section-gap-desktop\",\"80px\"],[\"container-max\",\"1440px\"],[\"section-gap-mobile\",\"48px\"],[\"element-gap-sm\",\"8px\"],[\"element-gap-md\",\"16px\"]],null,\"dmSerifDisplay\",\"Dm Sans\",\"Dm Sans\"]],1]],[[\"projects/18178749605532028059/files/94949c19d43041c2937ea5333ed81fe1\",null,\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida/AP1WRLvbzvillnoDNeG5er10msuzbDa0BAHM4WUCLiuMjg-rFapllmIQH5P3FhCZqleZ9Vbak-DmSqjszNS_BM8orTdO49rwBo2Abe0qNh1i7NXEUh2Lgzhk-LK_at6nt76V8fSW8KQDWTwPuuEm7H1PBsI7vhTfw8g0OU9DxDlRZgTdYrZOq7JkprUb7uMtxc_n9B3_JVzcOOoGn3bu5QQQav8TDfcbOfatlH7PzCBxhGz63_WBhCWwHiZpNJ_M\"],[\"projects/18178749605532028059/files/77abacf8497149e58822b13675cd9ba8\",null,\"https://contribution.usercontent.google.com/download?c\\u003dCgthaWRhX2NvZGVmeBJ8Eh1hcHBfY29tcGFuaW9uX2dlbmVyYXRlZF9maWxlcxpbCiVodG1sX2Q1ZTExMjRjZTg4MTQ0MmI4OTJiMDBmNjdjN2FhNDc4EgsSBxDv9_C4jw8YAZIBJAoKcHJvamVjdF9pZBIWQhQxODE3ODc0OTYwNTUzMjAyODA1OQ\\u0026filename\\u003d\\u0026opi\\u003d89354086\",null,null,\"text/html\"],null,null,\"70510204b2984606bea8e8d4d73d088d\",\"HatterAgent\",\"2560\",\"5458\",\"Stitch — Danh mục sản phẩm (Updated Footer)\",\"Replace the existing footer with the standardized footer from the Home page ({{DATA:SCREEN:SCREEN_17}}). The footer should have a background color of #F2ECE6, contain 4 columns (Brand info, Shop, Support, About Us), a newsletter section above it (bg-ink), and a bottom bar with copyright and legal links. Ensure social icons and typography match the brand's elegant, sustainable aesthetic.\",\"projects/18178749605532028059/screens/70510204b2984606bea8e8d4d73d088d\",[1,null,3,null,\"#c97b5a\",null,null,null,null,null,26,26,[[\"primary_fixed_dim\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"on_error\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"surface_tint\",\"#8f4c2f\"],[\"surface\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed_variant\",\"#4d4541\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed\",\"#1e1b17\"],[\"ink-light\",\"#5A4E48\"],[\"on_primary_fixed\",\"#360f00\"],[\"primary_container\",\"#aa6243\"],[\"surface_bright\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed\",\"#201a17\"],[\"on_secondary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"tertiary\",\"#605b56\"],[\"border-subtle\",\"#E8DDD6\"],[\"on_primary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"surface_container_lowest\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_primary_fixed_variant\",\"#72351a\"],[\"background\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_primary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"inverse_primary\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"tertiary_container\",\"#79746e\"],[\"surface_container_low\",\"#f6f3f0\"],[\"primary\",\"#8c4a2d\"],[\"clay-dark\",\"#A85E40\"],[\"surface_container_high\",\"#eae8e5\"],[\"on_surface_variant\",\"#53433d\"],[\"inverse_surface\",\"#31302f\"],[\"secondary_container\",\"#e9ddd7\"],[\"primary_fixed\",\"#ffdbcd\"],[\"error\",\"#ba1a1a\"],[\"outline_variant\",\"#d9c2b9\"],[\"surface_container\",\"#f0edea\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed_variant\",\"#4a4641\"],[\"surface_variant\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"outline\",\"#86736c\"],[\"tertiary_fixed\",\"#e9e1da\"],[\"tertiary_fixed_dim\",\"#ccc5bf\"],[\"secondary_fixed\",\"#ece0da\"],[\"on_secondary_container\",\"#69615c\"],[\"on_error_container\",\"#93000a\"],[\"secondary_fixed_dim\",\"#cfc4be\"],[\"on_background\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"error_container\",\"#ffdad6\"],[\"secondary\",\"#655d58\"],[\"surface_container_highest\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"sage\",\"#D6E4D8\"],[\"inverse_on_surface\",\"#f3f0ed\"],[\"on_tertiary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_tertiary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"cream-warm\",\"#F2ECE6\"],[\"surface_dim\",\"#dcdad7\"],[\"on_surface\",\"#1c1c1a\"]],\"---\\nname: Stitch Design System\\ncolors:\\n  surface: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-dim: '#dcdad7'\\n  surface-bright: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-container-lowest: '#ffffff'\\n  surface-container-low: '#f6f3f0'\\n  surface-container: '#f0edea'\\n  surface-container-high: '#eae8e5'\\n  surface-container-highest: '#e5e2df'\\n  on-surface: '#1c1c1a'\\n  on-surface-variant: '#53433d'\\n  inverse-surface: '#31302f'\\n  inverse-on-surface: '#f3f0ed'\\n  outline: '#86736c'\\n  outline-variant: '#d9c2b9'\\n  surface-tint: '#8f4c2f'\\n  primary: '#8c4a2d'\\n  on-primary: '#ffffff'\\n  primary-container: '#aa6243'\\n  on-primary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  inverse-primary: '#ffb597'\\n  secondary: '#655d58'\\n  on-secondary: '#ffffff'\\n  secondary-container: '#e9ddd7'\\n  on-secondary-container: '#69615c'\\n  tertiary: '#605b56'\\n  on-tertiary: '#ffffff'\\n  tertiary-container: '#79746e'\\n  on-tertiary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  error: '#ba1a1a'\\n  on-error: '#ffffff'\\n  error-container: '#ffdad6'\\n  on-error-container: '#93000a'\\n  primary-fixed: '#ffdbcd'\\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#ffb597'\\n  on-primary-fixed: '#360f00'\\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#72351a'\\n  secondary-fixed: '#ece0da'\\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#cfc4be'\\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#201a17'\\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#4d4541'\\n  tertiary-fixed: '#e9e1da'\\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#ccc5bf'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#1e1b17'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#4a4641'\\n  background: '#fcf9f6'\\n  on-background: '#1c1c1a'\\n  surface-variant: '#e5e2df'\\n  clay-dark: '#A85E40'\\n  ink-light: '#5A4E48'\\n  sage: '#D6E4D8'\\n  cream-warm: '#F2ECE6'\\n  border-subtle: '#E8DDD6'\\ntypography:\\n  display:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 80px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.1'\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\n  display-mobile:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 44px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n  headline-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 40px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  headline-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 32px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  body-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.8'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.01em\\n  body-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.85'\\n  label-uppercase:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 12px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.15em\\n  caption:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 11px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.4'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.05em\\nrounded:\\n  sm: 0.25rem\\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\\n  md: 0.75rem\\n  lg: 1rem\\n  xl: 1.5rem\\n  full: 9999px\\nspacing:\\n  container-max: 1440px\\n  section-gap-desktop: 80px\\n  section-gap-mobile: 48px\\n  grid-gutter: 24px\\n  element-gap-sm: 8px\\n  element-gap-md: 16px\\n  element-gap-lg: 32px\\n---\\n\\n## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Colors\\n\\nThe palette is inspired by natural, undyed fibers and earthen materials. \\n\\n- **Primary (Clay):** Used for call-to-actions, price accents, and critical indicators. It provides a warm, energetic contrast to the neutral base.\\n- **Secondary (Ink):** The foundation for readability. Used for all primary headings and body text to ensure high legibility against light backgrounds.\\n- **Tertiary (Blush):** A soft accent for secondary surfaces, card backgrounds, and promotional banners.\\n- **Neutral (Cream):** The primary canvas. This off-white base reduces eye strain and feels more premium and \\\"organic\\\" than pure white.\\n- **Named Colors:** **Sage** is reserved for eco-specific callouts or decorative elements to reinforce the sustainability narrative. **Ink-light** is used for secondary navigation and metadata to create visual hierarchy.\\n\\n## Typography\\n\\nThis design system employs a high-contrast pairing to balance heritage and modernity.\\n\\n- **Headlines:** Use **DM Serif Display**. Its graceful curves and high contrast evoke luxury and editorial authority. Use it sparingly for section headers and hero statements.\\n- **Body \\u0026 UI:** Use **DM Sans**. This low-contrast geometric sans-serif ensures maximum legibility across all digital interfaces. \\n- **The \\\"Label-Uppercase\\\" Style:** This is a signature brand element. Use it for navigation, small headings over titles, and button labels. The generous letter-spacing (tracking) is essential to achieving the \\\"premium\\\" feel.\\n- **Line Height:** Maintain a generous line height (1.8 - 1.85) for body text to reinforce the airy, spacious aesthetic.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Shapes\\n\\nThe shape language is \\\"Soft-Modern,\\\" utilizing rounded corners to evoke friendliness and comfort—qualities essential to a wearable fashion brand.\\n\\n- **Small Elements (Buttons, Tags, Pills):** Use `rounded-full` (pill-shaped). This creates a distinct interactive language that feels modern and approachable.\\n- **Medium Elements (Product Images, Floating Cards):** Use `rounded-lg` (1rem / 16px). This softens the grid without making it feel juvenile.\\n- **Large Elements (Banners, Testimonial Containers):** Use `rounded-xl` (1.5rem / 24px) to create \\\"enveloping\\\" containers that feel substantial and high-end.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",6,\"#c97b5a\",\"#2a2420\",\"#f5ede6\",\"#faf7f4\",2,[[\"caption\",[\"DM Sans\",\"11px\",\"500\",\"1.4\",\"0.05em\"]],[\"headline-lg\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"40px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"headline-md\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"32px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"body-lg\",[\"DM Sans\",\"16px\",\"400\",\"1.8\",\"0.01em\"]],[\"display\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"80px\",\"400\",\"1.1\",\"-0.02em\"]],[\"body-md\",[\"DM Sans\",\"14px\",\"400\",\"1.85\"]],[\"display-mobile\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"44px\",\"400\",\"1.2\"]],[\"label-uppercase\",[\"DM Sans\",\"12px\",\"500\",\"1.2\",\"0.15em\"]]],[[\"element-gap-md\",\"16px\"],[\"container-max\",\"1440px\"],[\"section-gap-mobile\",\"48px\"],[\"element-gap-sm\",\"8px\"],[\"element-gap-lg\",\"32px\"],[\"grid-gutter\",\"24px\"],[\"section-gap-desktop\",\"80px\"]],null,\"dmSerifDisplay\",\"Dm Sans\",\"Dm Sans\"],2,1,null,[null,2,null,null,2],null,null,[\"assets/f84726af88af499598b78556bda4af11\",null,[\"Stitch Design System\",null,\"## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",[1,null,3,null,\"#c97b5a\",null,null,null,null,null,26,26,[[\"primary_container\",\"#aa6243\"],[\"surface_bright\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_primary_fixed\",\"#360f00\"],[\"on_primary_fixed_variant\",\"#72351a\"],[\"background\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_primary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"surface_container_lowest\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"tertiary\",\"#605b56\"],[\"border-subtle\",\"#E8DDD6\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed\",\"#201a17\"],[\"on_secondary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_error\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"primary_fixed_dim\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed\",\"#1e1b17\"],[\"ink-light\",\"#5A4E48\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed_variant\",\"#4d4541\"],[\"surface_tint\",\"#8f4c2f\"],[\"surface\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"clay-dark\",\"#A85E40\"],[\"secondary_container\",\"#e9ddd7\"],[\"inverse_surface\",\"#31302f\"],[\"on_surface_variant\",\"#53433d\"],[\"surface_container_high\",\"#eae8e5\"],[\"on_primary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"surface_container_low\",\"#f6f3f0\"],[\"primary\",\"#8c4a2d\"],[\"inverse_primary\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"tertiary_container\",\"#79746e\"],[\"error_container\",\"#ffdad6\"],[\"secondary_fixed_dim\",\"#cfc4be\"],[\"on_background\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"on_error_container\",\"#93000a\"],[\"secondary_fixed\",\"#ece0da\"],[\"on_secondary_container\",\"#69615c\"],[\"secondary\",\"#655d58\"],[\"surface_container\",\"#f0edea\"],[\"outline_variant\",\"#d9c2b9\"],[\"primary_fixed\",\"#ffdbcd\"],[\"error\",\"#ba1a1a\"],[\"tertiary_fixed\",\"#e9e1da\"],[\"tertiary_fixed_dim\",\"#ccc5bf\"],[\"outline\",\"#86736c\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed_variant\",\"#4a4641\"],[\"surface_variant\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"surface_dim\",\"#dcdad7\"],[\"cream-warm\",\"#F2ECE6\"],[\"on_surface\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"on_tertiary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"inverse_on_surface\",\"#f3f0ed\"],[\"sage\",\"#D6E4D8\"],[\"surface_container_highest\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"on_tertiary_container\",\"#fffbff\"]],\"---\\nname: Stitch Design System\\ncolors:\\n  surface: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-dim: '#dcdad7'\\n  surface-bright: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-container-lowest: '#ffffff'\\n  surface-container-low: '#f6f3f0'\\n  surface-container: '#f0edea'\\n  surface-container-high: '#eae8e5'\\n  surface-container-highest: '#e5e2df'\\n  on-surface: '#1c1c1a'\\n  on-surface-variant: '#53433d'\\n  inverse-surface: '#31302f'\\n  inverse-on-surface: '#f3f0ed'\\n  outline: '#86736c'\\n  outline-variant: '#d9c2b9'\\n  surface-tint: '#8f4c2f'\\n  primary: '#8c4a2d'\\n  on-primary: '#ffffff'\\n  primary-container: '#aa6243'\\n  on-primary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  inverse-primary: '#ffb597'\\n  secondary: '#655d58'\\n  on-secondary: '#ffffff'\\n  secondary-container: '#e9ddd7'\\n  on-secondary-container: '#69615c'\\n  tertiary: '#605b56'\\n  on-tertiary: '#ffffff'\\n  tertiary-container: '#79746e'\\n  on-tertiary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  error: '#ba1a1a'\\n  on-error: '#ffffff'\\n  error-container: '#ffdad6'\\n  on-error-container: '#93000a'\\n  primary-fixed: '#ffdbcd'\\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#ffb597'\\n  on-primary-fixed: '#360f00'\\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#72351a'\\n  secondary-fixed: '#ece0da'\\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#cfc4be'\\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#201a17'\\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#4d4541'\\n  tertiary-fixed: '#e9e1da'\\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#ccc5bf'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#1e1b17'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#4a4641'\\n  background: '#fcf9f6'\\n  on-background: '#1c1c1a'\\n  surface-variant: '#e5e2df'\\n  clay-dark: '#A85E40'\\n  ink-light: '#5A4E48'\\n  sage: '#D6E4D8'\\n  cream-warm: '#F2ECE6'\\n  border-subtle: '#E8DDD6'\\ntypography:\\n  display:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 80px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.1'\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\n  display-mobile:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 44px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n  headline-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 40px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  headline-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 32px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  body-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.8'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.01em\\n  body-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.85'\\n  label-uppercase:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 12px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.15em\\n  caption:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 11px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.4'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.05em\\nrounded:\\n  sm: 0.25rem\\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\\n  md: 0.75rem\\n  lg: 1rem\\n  xl: 1.5rem\\n  full: 9999px\\nspacing:\\n  container-max: 1440px\\n  section-gap-desktop: 80px\\n  section-gap-mobile: 48px\\n  grid-gutter: 24px\\n  element-gap-sm: 8px\\n  element-gap-md: 16px\\n  element-gap-lg: 32px\\n---\\n\\n## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Colors\\n\\nThe palette is inspired by natural, undyed fibers and earthen materials. \\n\\n- **Primary (Clay):** Used for call-to-actions, price accents, and critical indicators. It provides a warm, energetic contrast to the neutral base.\\n- **Secondary (Ink):** The foundation for readability. Used for all primary headings and body text to ensure high legibility against light backgrounds.\\n- **Tertiary (Blush):** A soft accent for secondary surfaces, card backgrounds, and promotional banners.\\n- **Neutral (Cream):** The primary canvas. This off-white base reduces eye strain and feels more premium and \\\"organic\\\" than pure white.\\n- **Named Colors:** **Sage** is reserved for eco-specific callouts or decorative elements to reinforce the sustainability narrative. **Ink-light** is used for secondary navigation and metadata to create visual hierarchy.\\n\\n## Typography\\n\\nThis design system employs a high-contrast pairing to balance heritage and modernity.\\n\\n- **Headlines:** Use **DM Serif Display**. Its graceful curves and high contrast evoke luxury and editorial authority. Use it sparingly for section headers and hero statements.\\n- **Body \\u0026 UI:** Use **DM Sans**. This low-contrast geometric sans-serif ensures maximum legibility across all digital interfaces. \\n- **The \\\"Label-Uppercase\\\" Style:** This is a signature brand element. Use it for navigation, small headings over titles, and button labels. The generous letter-spacing (tracking) is essential to achieving the \\\"premium\\\" feel.\\n- **Line Height:** Maintain a generous line height (1.8 - 1.85) for body text to reinforce the airy, spacious aesthetic.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Shapes\\n\\nThe shape language is \\\"Soft-Modern,\\\" utilizing rounded corners to evoke friendliness and comfort—qualities essential to a wearable fashion brand.\\n\\n- **Small Elements (Buttons, Tags, Pills):** Use `rounded-full` (pill-shaped). This creates a distinct interactive language that feels modern and approachable.\\n- **Medium Elements (Product Images, Floating Cards):** Use `rounded-lg` (1rem / 16px). This softens the grid without making it feel juvenile.\\n- **Large Elements (Banners, Testimonial Containers):** Use `rounded-xl` (1.5rem / 24px) to create \\\"enveloping\\\" containers that feel substantial and high-end.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",6,\"#c97b5a\",\"#2a2420\",\"#f5ede6\",\"#faf7f4\",2,[[\"headline-lg\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"40px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"headline-md\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"32px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"caption\",[\"DM Sans\",\"11px\",\"500\",\"1.4\",\"0.05em\"]],[\"display-mobile\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"44px\",\"400\",\"1.2\"]],[\"label-uppercase\",[\"DM Sans\",\"12px\",\"500\",\"1.2\",\"0.15em\"]],[\"body-lg\",[\"DM Sans\",\"16px\",\"400\",\"1.8\",\"0.01em\"]],[\"body-md\",[\"DM Sans\",\"14px\",\"400\",\"1.85\"]],[\"display\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"80px\",\"400\",\"1.1\",\"-0.02em\"]]],[[\"element-gap-md\",\"16px\"],[\"element-gap-sm\",\"8px\"],[\"section-gap-mobile\",\"48px\"],[\"container-max\",\"1440px\"],[\"grid-gutter\",\"24px\"],[\"section-gap-desktop\",\"80px\"],[\"element-gap-lg\",\"32px\"]],null,\"dmSerifDisplay\",\"Dm Sans\",\"Dm Sans\"]],1]],[[\"projects/18178749605532028059/files/64a290f72faf482caac9bc0bd9fc1a75\",null,\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida/AP1WRLtvjBXajuaTee4Z0GpIqdV2pSOsJQFK80pNYZO8Q87bdfJxF-Vf2KxbgsX3vDQBv_ECEO6sbLO4I9VpJFZtLGHozVFgjoe3yiwPjlSxKUm9bHdi-rBXJR-4xHN8_2hGNJfhAD1l9zlqKEKOc_7c9KcZS82xwNdwUxo0TuMUsKajofbMkds8LZ2L0cC_mZMDWXoSwzmE9n4VRy37xQi6SqlJMW8NW4yllK1kO_krGyny7ivuUZkXazBxFDiB\"],[\"projects/18178749605532028059/files/ef65df4257c54c9e8561f4beccddc238\",null,\"https://contribution.usercontent.google.com/download?c\\u003dCgthaWRhX2NvZGVmeBJ8Eh1hcHBfY29tcGFuaW9uX2dlbmVyYXRlZF9maWxlcxpbCiVodG1sXzA5YmUyNzk0M2VjYjQzZTM5NWM0NDUyNjU1MDVkZTg2EgsSBxDv9_C4jw8YAZIBJAoKcHJvamVjdF9pZBIWQhQxODE3ODc0OTYwNTUzMjAyODA1OQ\\u0026filename\\u003d\\u0026opi\\u003d89354086\",null,null,\"text/html\"],null,null,\"3174cdbbacbf49dd8f9b4df7f3b2fbd0\",\"HatterAgent\",\"2560\",\"7050\",\"Stitch — Chi tiết sản phẩm (Updated Footer)\",\"Replace the footer with the unified design from the Home Page. Include the newsletter signup block and the detailed 4-column navigation links. Use the established #F2ECE6 background and ensure all brand assets and social links are preserved.\",\"projects/18178749605532028059/screens/3174cdbbacbf49dd8f9b4df7f3b2fbd0\",[1,null,3,null,\"#c97b5a\",null,null,null,null,null,26,26,[[\"surface_container_high\",\"#eae8e5\"],[\"on_surface_variant\",\"#53433d\"],[\"inverse_surface\",\"#31302f\"],[\"secondary_container\",\"#e9ddd7\"],[\"clay-dark\",\"#A85E40\"],[\"tertiary_container\",\"#79746e\"],[\"inverse_primary\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"primary\",\"#8c4a2d\"],[\"surface_container_low\",\"#f6f3f0\"],[\"on_primary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_secondary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed\",\"#201a17\"],[\"border-subtle\",\"#E8DDD6\"],[\"tertiary\",\"#605b56\"],[\"surface_container_lowest\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_primary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"background\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_primary_fixed_variant\",\"#72351a\"],[\"on_primary_fixed\",\"#360f00\"],[\"surface_bright\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"primary_container\",\"#aa6243\"],[\"surface\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"surface_tint\",\"#8f4c2f\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed_variant\",\"#4d4541\"],[\"ink-light\",\"#5A4E48\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed\",\"#1e1b17\"],[\"primary_fixed_dim\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"on_error\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_surface\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"cream-warm\",\"#F2ECE6\"],[\"surface_dim\",\"#dcdad7\"],[\"on_tertiary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"surface_container_highest\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"sage\",\"#D6E4D8\"],[\"inverse_on_surface\",\"#f3f0ed\"],[\"on_tertiary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"secondary\",\"#655d58\"],[\"secondary_fixed\",\"#ece0da\"],[\"on_secondary_container\",\"#69615c\"],[\"on_error_container\",\"#93000a\"],[\"on_background\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"secondary_fixed_dim\",\"#cfc4be\"],[\"error_container\",\"#ffdad6\"],[\"surface_variant\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed_variant\",\"#4a4641\"],[\"tertiary_fixed_dim\",\"#ccc5bf\"],[\"tertiary_fixed\",\"#e9e1da\"],[\"outline\",\"#86736c\"],[\"error\",\"#ba1a1a\"],[\"primary_fixed\",\"#ffdbcd\"],[\"outline_variant\",\"#d9c2b9\"],[\"surface_container\",\"#f0edea\"]],\"---\\nname: Stitch Design System\\ncolors:\\n  surface: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-dim: '#dcdad7'\\n  surface-bright: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-container-lowest: '#ffffff'\\n  surface-container-low: '#f6f3f0'\\n  surface-container: '#f0edea'\\n  surface-container-high: '#eae8e5'\\n  surface-container-highest: '#e5e2df'\\n  on-surface: '#1c1c1a'\\n  on-surface-variant: '#53433d'\\n  inverse-surface: '#31302f'\\n  inverse-on-surface: '#f3f0ed'\\n  outline: '#86736c'\\n  outline-variant: '#d9c2b9'\\n  surface-tint: '#8f4c2f'\\n  primary: '#8c4a2d'\\n  on-primary: '#ffffff'\\n  primary-container: '#aa6243'\\n  on-primary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  inverse-primary: '#ffb597'\\n  secondary: '#655d58'\\n  on-secondary: '#ffffff'\\n  secondary-container: '#e9ddd7'\\n  on-secondary-container: '#69615c'\\n  tertiary: '#605b56'\\n  on-tertiary: '#ffffff'\\n  tertiary-container: '#79746e'\\n  on-tertiary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  error: '#ba1a1a'\\n  on-error: '#ffffff'\\n  error-container: '#ffdad6'\\n  on-error-container: '#93000a'\\n  primary-fixed: '#ffdbcd'\\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#ffb597'\\n  on-primary-fixed: '#360f00'\\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#72351a'\\n  secondary-fixed: '#ece0da'\\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#cfc4be'\\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#201a17'\\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#4d4541'\\n  tertiary-fixed: '#e9e1da'\\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#ccc5bf'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#1e1b17'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#4a4641'\\n  background: '#fcf9f6'\\n  on-background: '#1c1c1a'\\n  surface-variant: '#e5e2df'\\n  clay-dark: '#A85E40'\\n  ink-light: '#5A4E48'\\n  sage: '#D6E4D8'\\n  cream-warm: '#F2ECE6'\\n  border-subtle: '#E8DDD6'\\ntypography:\\n  display:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 80px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.1'\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\n  display-mobile:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 44px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n  headline-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 40px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  headline-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 32px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  body-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.8'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.01em\\n  body-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.85'\\n  label-uppercase:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 12px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.15em\\n  caption:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 11px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.4'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.05em\\nrounded:\\n  sm: 0.25rem\\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\\n  md: 0.75rem\\n  lg: 1rem\\n  xl: 1.5rem\\n  full: 9999px\\nspacing:\\n  container-max: 1440px\\n  section-gap-desktop: 80px\\n  section-gap-mobile: 48px\\n  grid-gutter: 24px\\n  element-gap-sm: 8px\\n  element-gap-md: 16px\\n  element-gap-lg: 32px\\n---\\n\\n## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Colors\\n\\nThe palette is inspired by natural, undyed fibers and earthen materials. \\n\\n- **Primary (Clay):** Used for call-to-actions, price accents, and critical indicators. It provides a warm, energetic contrast to the neutral base.\\n- **Secondary (Ink):** The foundation for readability. Used for all primary headings and body text to ensure high legibility against light backgrounds.\\n- **Tertiary (Blush):** A soft accent for secondary surfaces, card backgrounds, and promotional banners.\\n- **Neutral (Cream):** The primary canvas. This off-white base reduces eye strain and feels more premium and \\\"organic\\\" than pure white.\\n- **Named Colors:** **Sage** is reserved for eco-specific callouts or decorative elements to reinforce the sustainability narrative. **Ink-light** is used for secondary navigation and metadata to create visual hierarchy.\\n\\n## Typography\\n\\nThis design system employs a high-contrast pairing to balance heritage and modernity.\\n\\n- **Headlines:** Use **DM Serif Display**. Its graceful curves and high contrast evoke luxury and editorial authority. Use it sparingly for section headers and hero statements.\\n- **Body \\u0026 UI:** Use **DM Sans**. This low-contrast geometric sans-serif ensures maximum legibility across all digital interfaces. \\n- **The \\\"Label-Uppercase\\\" Style:** This is a signature brand element. Use it for navigation, small headings over titles, and button labels. The generous letter-spacing (tracking) is essential to achieving the \\\"premium\\\" feel.\\n- **Line Height:** Maintain a generous line height (1.8 - 1.85) for body text to reinforce the airy, spacious aesthetic.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Shapes\\n\\nThe shape language is \\\"Soft-Modern,\\\" utilizing rounded corners to evoke friendliness and comfort—qualities essential to a wearable fashion brand.\\n\\n- **Small Elements (Buttons, Tags, Pills):** Use `rounded-full` (pill-shaped). This creates a distinct interactive language that feels modern and approachable.\\n- **Medium Elements (Product Images, Floating Cards):** Use `rounded-lg` (1rem / 16px). This softens the grid without making it feel juvenile.\\n- **Large Elements (Banners, Testimonial Containers):** Use `rounded-xl` (1.5rem / 24px) to create \\\"enveloping\\\" containers that feel substantial and high-end.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",6,\"#c97b5a\",\"#2a2420\",\"#f5ede6\",\"#faf7f4\",2,[[\"headline-lg\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"40px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"headline-md\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"32px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"caption\",[\"DM Sans\",\"11px\",\"500\",\"1.4\",\"0.05em\"]],[\"body-lg\",[\"DM Sans\",\"16px\",\"400\",\"1.8\",\"0.01em\"]],[\"body-md\",[\"DM Sans\",\"14px\",\"400\",\"1.85\"]],[\"display\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"80px\",\"400\",\"1.1\",\"-0.02em\"]],[\"display-mobile\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"44px\",\"400\",\"1.2\"]],[\"label-uppercase\",[\"DM Sans\",\"12px\",\"500\",\"1.2\",\"0.15em\"]]],[[\"element-gap-lg\",\"32px\"],[\"grid-gutter\",\"24px\"],[\"section-gap-desktop\",\"80px\"],[\"element-gap-sm\",\"8px\"],[\"section-gap-mobile\",\"48px\"],[\"container-max\",\"1440px\"],[\"element-gap-md\",\"16px\"]],null,\"dmSerifDisplay\",\"Dm Sans\",\"Dm Sans\"],2,1,null,[null,2,null,null,2],null,null,[\"assets/f84726af88af499598b78556bda4af11\",null,[\"Stitch Design System\",null,\"## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",[1,null,3,null,\"#c97b5a\",null,null,null,null,null,26,26,[[\"on_surface\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"surface_dim\",\"#dcdad7\"],[\"cream-warm\",\"#F2ECE6\"],[\"on_tertiary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"inverse_on_surface\",\"#f3f0ed\"],[\"on_tertiary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"surface_container_highest\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"sage\",\"#D6E4D8\"],[\"secondary\",\"#655d58\"],[\"on_background\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"secondary_fixed_dim\",\"#cfc4be\"],[\"error_container\",\"#ffdad6\"],[\"on_secondary_container\",\"#69615c\"],[\"secondary_fixed\",\"#ece0da\"],[\"on_error_container\",\"#93000a\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed_variant\",\"#4a4641\"],[\"surface_variant\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"outline\",\"#86736c\"],[\"tertiary_fixed\",\"#e9e1da\"],[\"tertiary_fixed_dim\",\"#ccc5bf\"],[\"surface_container\",\"#f0edea\"],[\"error\",\"#ba1a1a\"],[\"primary_fixed\",\"#ffdbcd\"],[\"outline_variant\",\"#d9c2b9\"],[\"surface_container_high\",\"#eae8e5\"],[\"on_surface_variant\",\"#53433d\"],[\"inverse_surface\",\"#31302f\"],[\"secondary_container\",\"#e9ddd7\"],[\"clay-dark\",\"#A85E40\"],[\"primary\",\"#8c4a2d\"],[\"surface_container_low\",\"#f6f3f0\"],[\"tertiary_container\",\"#79746e\"],[\"inverse_primary\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"on_primary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"surface_container_lowest\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_primary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"on_primary_fixed_variant\",\"#72351a\"],[\"background\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_secondary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed\",\"#201a17\"],[\"tertiary\",\"#605b56\"],[\"border-subtle\",\"#E8DDD6\"],[\"surface_bright\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"primary_container\",\"#aa6243\"],[\"on_primary_fixed\",\"#360f00\"],[\"ink-light\",\"#5A4E48\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed\",\"#1e1b17\"],[\"surface\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"surface_tint\",\"#8f4c2f\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed_variant\",\"#4d4541\"],[\"primary_fixed_dim\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"on_error\",\"#ffffff\"]],\"---\\nname: Stitch Design System\\ncolors:\\n  surface: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-dim: '#dcdad7'\\n  surface-bright: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-container-lowest: '#ffffff'\\n  surface-container-low: '#f6f3f0'\\n  surface-container: '#f0edea'\\n  surface-container-high: '#eae8e5'\\n  surface-container-highest: '#e5e2df'\\n  on-surface: '#1c1c1a'\\n  on-surface-variant: '#53433d'\\n  inverse-surface: '#31302f'\\n  inverse-on-surface: '#f3f0ed'\\n  outline: '#86736c'\\n  outline-variant: '#d9c2b9'\\n  surface-tint: '#8f4c2f'\\n  primary: '#8c4a2d'\\n  on-primary: '#ffffff'\\n  primary-container: '#aa6243'\\n  on-primary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  inverse-primary: '#ffb597'\\n  secondary: '#655d58'\\n  on-secondary: '#ffffff'\\n  secondary-container: '#e9ddd7'\\n  on-secondary-container: '#69615c'\\n  tertiary: '#605b56'\\n  on-tertiary: '#ffffff'\\n  tertiary-container: '#79746e'\\n  on-tertiary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  error: '#ba1a1a'\\n  on-error: '#ffffff'\\n  error-container: '#ffdad6'\\n  on-error-container: '#93000a'\\n  primary-fixed: '#ffdbcd'\\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#ffb597'\\n  on-primary-fixed: '#360f00'\\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#72351a'\\n  secondary-fixed: '#ece0da'\\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#cfc4be'\\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#201a17'\\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#4d4541'\\n  tertiary-fixed: '#e9e1da'\\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#ccc5bf'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#1e1b17'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#4a4641'\\n  background: '#fcf9f6'\\n  on-background: '#1c1c1a'\\n  surface-variant: '#e5e2df'\\n  clay-dark: '#A85E40'\\n  ink-light: '#5A4E48'\\n  sage: '#D6E4D8'\\n  cream-warm: '#F2ECE6'\\n  border-subtle: '#E8DDD6'\\ntypography:\\n  display:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 80px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.1'\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\n  display-mobile:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 44px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n  headline-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 40px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  headline-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 32px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  body-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.8'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.01em\\n  body-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.85'\\n  label-uppercase:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 12px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.15em\\n  caption:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 11px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.4'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.05em\\nrounded:\\n  sm: 0.25rem\\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\\n  md: 0.75rem\\n  lg: 1rem\\n  xl: 1.5rem\\n  full: 9999px\\nspacing:\\n  container-max: 1440px\\n  section-gap-desktop: 80px\\n  section-gap-mobile: 48px\\n  grid-gutter: 24px\\n  element-gap-sm: 8px\\n  element-gap-md: 16px\\n  element-gap-lg: 32px\\n---\\n\\n## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Colors\\n\\nThe palette is inspired by natural, undyed fibers and earthen materials. \\n\\n- **Primary (Clay):** Used for call-to-actions, price accents, and critical indicators. It provides a warm, energetic contrast to the neutral base.\\n- **Secondary (Ink):** The foundation for readability. Used for all primary headings and body text to ensure high legibility against light backgrounds.\\n- **Tertiary (Blush):** A soft accent for secondary surfaces, card backgrounds, and promotional banners.\\n- **Neutral (Cream):** The primary canvas. This off-white base reduces eye strain and feels more premium and \\\"organic\\\" than pure white.\\n- **Named Colors:** **Sage** is reserved for eco-specific callouts or decorative elements to reinforce the sustainability narrative. **Ink-light** is used for secondary navigation and metadata to create visual hierarchy.\\n\\n## Typography\\n\\nThis design system employs a high-contrast pairing to balance heritage and modernity.\\n\\n- **Headlines:** Use **DM Serif Display**. Its graceful curves and high contrast evoke luxury and editorial authority. Use it sparingly for section headers and hero statements.\\n- **Body \\u0026 UI:** Use **DM Sans**. This low-contrast geometric sans-serif ensures maximum legibility across all digital interfaces. \\n- **The \\\"Label-Uppercase\\\" Style:** This is a signature brand element. Use it for navigation, small headings over titles, and button labels. The generous letter-spacing (tracking) is essential to achieving the \\\"premium\\\" feel.\\n- **Line Height:** Maintain a generous line height (1.8 - 1.85) for body text to reinforce the airy, spacious aesthetic.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Shapes\\n\\nThe shape language is \\\"Soft-Modern,\\\" utilizing rounded corners to evoke friendliness and comfort—qualities essential to a wearable fashion brand.\\n\\n- **Small Elements (Buttons, Tags, Pills):** Use `rounded-full` (pill-shaped). This creates a distinct interactive language that feels modern and approachable.\\n- **Medium Elements (Product Images, Floating Cards):** Use `rounded-lg` (1rem / 16px). This softens the grid without making it feel juvenile.\\n- **Large Elements (Banners, Testimonial Containers):** Use `rounded-xl` (1.5rem / 24px) to create \\\"enveloping\\\" containers that feel substantial and high-end.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",6,\"#c97b5a\",\"#2a2420\",\"#f5ede6\",\"#faf7f4\",2,[[\"display-mobile\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"44px\",\"400\",\"1.2\"]],[\"label-uppercase\",[\"DM Sans\",\"12px\",\"500\",\"1.2\",\"0.15em\"]],[\"body-lg\",[\"DM Sans\",\"16px\",\"400\",\"1.8\",\"0.01em\"]],[\"display\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"80px\",\"400\",\"1.1\",\"-0.02em\"]],[\"body-md\",[\"DM Sans\",\"14px\",\"400\",\"1.85\"]],[\"caption\",[\"DM Sans\",\"11px\",\"500\",\"1.4\",\"0.05em\"]],[\"headline-lg\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"40px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"headline-md\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"32px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]]],[[\"element-gap-sm\",\"8px\"],[\"section-gap-mobile\",\"48px\"],[\"container-max\",\"1440px\"],[\"section-gap-desktop\",\"80px\"],[\"grid-gutter\",\"24px\"],[\"element-gap-lg\",\"32px\"],[\"element-gap-md\",\"16px\"]],null,\"dmSerifDisplay\",\"Dm Sans\",\"Dm Sans\"]],1]],[[\"projects/18178749605532028059/files/2050897650657422195\",null,\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida/AP1WRLt0oVpfwHkpdjYmWWtezCwCng4H2fGbH8XZWr8zLP9m8fXoRnQ-a5zNuZy8ulYaKO7WgRnwOjYviTslW2rvfEitKap7NzT6XyutDb3Govy_xqCUXRh8EU89UktJ2FLfvl8XlAaDtdNF6AyqyqT5Z5auUB5JJ_sgLtcFvt4JkOJn50KgvTDU9QdNBwQjbOpl3EqYLAUfABi9wh_r5jbeOpfpJTH2SrOX3o7jxaNSlYf-sf3dSSgmYWDkHEjh\"],[\"projects/18178749605532028059/files/11901788469654053515\",null,\"https://contribution.usercontent.google.com/download?c\\u003dCgthaWRhX2NvZGVmeBJ8Eh1hcHBfY29tcGFuaW9uX2dlbmVyYXRlZF9maWxlcxpbCiVodG1sXzAwMDY1NDlkMDIyZWQ5ZTYwMWVlN2RiZDU2MDc0MDk3EgsSBxDv9_C4jw8YAZIBJAoKcHJvamVjdF9pZBIWQhQxODE3ODc0OTYwNTUzMjAyODA1OQ\\u0026filename\\u003d\\u0026opi\\u003d89354086\",null,null,\"text/html\"],null,null,\"f67c7e6487de4985adc7f25f31748396\",\"figaro_agent\",\"2560\",\"2952\",\"Stitch — Danh mục Đồ bé trai\",\"Create a product category page for 'Bộ sưu tập Bé Trai' (Boys Collection). \\nHeader: Use the standard TopNavBar from components. \\nContent: \\n- Title: 'Bộ sưu tập Bé Trai'\\n- Description: 'Khám phá những thiết kế tối giản, bền vững và thoải mái dành riêng cho các bé trai. Mỗi sản phẩm được làm từ chất liệu tự nhiên, an toàn cho làn da nhạy cảm.'\\n- Sidebar filters: Category (Tất cả đồ bé trai, Áo thun \\u0026 Sơ mi, Quần \\u0026 Yếm, Đồ len), Size (S, M, L, XL), Color (Earthy tones), Price range.\\n- Product Grid: 4 items per row.\\n    1. 'Set Áo Thun \\u0026 Quần Linen' - Image: {{DATA:IMAGE:IMAGE_54}} - Price: 950.000đ.\\n    2. 'Áo Hoodie Cotton Organic' - Image: {{DATA:IMAGE:IMAGE_56}} - Price: 1.250.000đ.\\n    3. 'Yếm Denim Recycled' - Image: {{DATA:IMAGE:IMAGE_53}} - Price: 1.150.000đ.\\n    4. 'Sơ Mi Linen Sage Green' - Image: {{DATA:IMAGE:IMAGE_55}} - Price: 850.000đ.\\nFooter: Use the standard Footer from components. \\nApply consistent styling from the design system {{DATA:DESIGN_SYSTEM:DESIGN_SYSTEM_1}} including fonts and earthy colors.\",\"projects/18178749605532028059/screens/f67c7e6487de4985adc7f25f31748396\",[1,null,3,null,\"#c97b5a\",null,null,null,null,null,26,26,[[\"surface_bright\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"primary_container\",\"#aa6243\"],[\"on_primary_fixed\",\"#360f00\"],[\"surface_container_lowest\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_primary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"on_primary_fixed_variant\",\"#72351a\"],[\"background\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_secondary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed\",\"#201a17\"],[\"tertiary\",\"#605b56\"],[\"border-subtle\",\"#E8DDD6\"],[\"primary_fixed_dim\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"on_error\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"ink-light\",\"#5A4E48\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed\",\"#1e1b17\"],[\"surface\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"surface_tint\",\"#8f4c2f\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed_variant\",\"#4d4541\"],[\"clay-dark\",\"#A85E40\"],[\"surface_container_high\",\"#eae8e5\"],[\"on_surface_variant\",\"#53433d\"],[\"inverse_surface\",\"#31302f\"],[\"secondary_container\",\"#e9ddd7\"],[\"on_primary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"surface_container_low\",\"#f6f3f0\"],[\"primary\",\"#8c4a2d\"],[\"tertiary_container\",\"#79746e\"],[\"inverse_primary\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"on_background\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"secondary_fixed_dim\",\"#cfc4be\"],[\"error_container\",\"#ffdad6\"],[\"on_secondary_container\",\"#69615c\"],[\"secondary_fixed\",\"#ece0da\"],[\"on_error_container\",\"#93000a\"],[\"secondary\",\"#655d58\"],[\"surface_container\",\"#f0edea\"],[\"error\",\"#ba1a1a\"],[\"primary_fixed\",\"#ffdbcd\"],[\"outline_variant\",\"#d9c2b9\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed_variant\",\"#4a4641\"],[\"surface_variant\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"tertiary_fixed_dim\",\"#ccc5bf\"],[\"tertiary_fixed\",\"#e9e1da\"],[\"outline\",\"#86736c\"],[\"surface_dim\",\"#dcdad7\"],[\"cream-warm\",\"#F2ECE6\"],[\"on_surface\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"inverse_on_surface\",\"#f3f0ed\"],[\"on_tertiary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"surface_container_highest\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"sage\",\"#D6E4D8\"],[\"on_tertiary_container\",\"#fffbff\"]],\"---\\nname: Stitch Design System\\ncolors:\\n  surface: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-dim: '#dcdad7'\\n  surface-bright: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-container-lowest: '#ffffff'\\n  surface-container-low: '#f6f3f0'\\n  surface-container: '#f0edea'\\n  surface-container-high: '#eae8e5'\\n  surface-container-highest: '#e5e2df'\\n  on-surface: '#1c1c1a'\\n  on-surface-variant: '#53433d'\\n  inverse-surface: '#31302f'\\n  inverse-on-surface: '#f3f0ed'\\n  outline: '#86736c'\\n  outline-variant: '#d9c2b9'\\n  surface-tint: '#8f4c2f'\\n  primary: '#8c4a2d'\\n  on-primary: '#ffffff'\\n  primary-container: '#aa6243'\\n  on-primary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  inverse-primary: '#ffb597'\\n  secondary: '#655d58'\\n  on-secondary: '#ffffff'\\n  secondary-container: '#e9ddd7'\\n  on-secondary-container: '#69615c'\\n  tertiary: '#605b56'\\n  on-tertiary: '#ffffff'\\n  tertiary-container: '#79746e'\\n  on-tertiary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  error: '#ba1a1a'\\n  on-error: '#ffffff'\\n  error-container: '#ffdad6'\\n  on-error-container: '#93000a'\\n  primary-fixed: '#ffdbcd'\\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#ffb597'\\n  on-primary-fixed: '#360f00'\\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#72351a'\\n  secondary-fixed: '#ece0da'\\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#cfc4be'\\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#201a17'\\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#4d4541'\\n  tertiary-fixed: '#e9e1da'\\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#ccc5bf'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#1e1b17'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#4a4641'\\n  background: '#fcf9f6'\\n  on-background: '#1c1c1a'\\n  surface-variant: '#e5e2df'\\n  clay-dark: '#A85E40'\\n  ink-light: '#5A4E48'\\n  sage: '#D6E4D8'\\n  cream-warm: '#F2ECE6'\\n  border-subtle: '#E8DDD6'\\ntypography:\\n  display:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 80px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.1'\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\n  display-mobile:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 44px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n  headline-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 40px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  headline-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 32px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  body-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.8'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.01em\\n  body-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.85'\\n  label-uppercase:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 12px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.15em\\n  caption:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 11px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.4'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.05em\\nrounded:\\n  sm: 0.25rem\\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\\n  md: 0.75rem\\n  lg: 1rem\\n  xl: 1.5rem\\n  full: 9999px\\nspacing:\\n  container-max: 1440px\\n  section-gap-desktop: 80px\\n  section-gap-mobile: 48px\\n  grid-gutter: 24px\\n  element-gap-sm: 8px\\n  element-gap-md: 16px\\n  element-gap-lg: 32px\\n---\\n\\n## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Colors\\n\\nThe palette is inspired by natural, undyed fibers and earthen materials. \\n\\n- **Primary (Clay):** Used for call-to-actions, price accents, and critical indicators. It provides a warm, energetic contrast to the neutral base.\\n- **Secondary (Ink):** The foundation for readability. Used for all primary headings and body text to ensure high legibility against light backgrounds.\\n- **Tertiary (Blush):** A soft accent for secondary surfaces, card backgrounds, and promotional banners.\\n- **Neutral (Cream):** The primary canvas. This off-white base reduces eye strain and feels more premium and \\\"organic\\\" than pure white.\\n- **Named Colors:** **Sage** is reserved for eco-specific callouts or decorative elements to reinforce the sustainability narrative. **Ink-light** is used for secondary navigation and metadata to create visual hierarchy.\\n\\n## Typography\\n\\nThis design system employs a high-contrast pairing to balance heritage and modernity.\\n\\n- **Headlines:** Use **DM Serif Display**. Its graceful curves and high contrast evoke luxury and editorial authority. Use it sparingly for section headers and hero statements.\\n- **Body \\u0026 UI:** Use **DM Sans**. This low-contrast geometric sans-serif ensures maximum legibility across all digital interfaces. \\n- **The \\\"Label-Uppercase\\\" Style:** This is a signature brand element. Use it for navigation, small headings over titles, and button labels. The generous letter-spacing (tracking) is essential to achieving the \\\"premium\\\" feel.\\n- **Line Height:** Maintain a generous line height (1.8 - 1.85) for body text to reinforce the airy, spacious aesthetic.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Shapes\\n\\nThe shape language is \\\"Soft-Modern,\\\" utilizing rounded corners to evoke friendliness and comfort—qualities essential to a wearable fashion brand.\\n\\n- **Small Elements (Buttons, Tags, Pills):** Use `rounded-full` (pill-shaped). This creates a distinct interactive language that feels modern and approachable.\\n- **Medium Elements (Product Images, Floating Cards):** Use `rounded-lg` (1rem / 16px). This softens the grid without making it feel juvenile.\\n- **Large Elements (Banners, Testimonial Containers):** Use `rounded-xl` (1.5rem / 24px) to create \\\"enveloping\\\" containers that feel substantial and high-end.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",6,\"#c97b5a\",\"#2a2420\",\"#f5ede6\",\"#faf7f4\",2,[[\"headline-lg\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"40px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"headline-md\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"32px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"caption\",[\"DM Sans\",\"11px\",\"500\",\"1.4\",\"0.05em\"]],[\"body-lg\",[\"DM Sans\",\"16px\",\"400\",\"1.8\",\"0.01em\"]],[\"body-md\",[\"DM Sans\",\"14px\",\"400\",\"1.85\"]],[\"display\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"80px\",\"400\",\"1.1\",\"-0.02em\"]],[\"display-mobile\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"44px\",\"400\",\"1.2\"]],[\"label-uppercase\",[\"DM Sans\",\"12px\",\"500\",\"1.2\",\"0.15em\"]]],[[\"element-gap-lg\",\"32px\"],[\"grid-gutter\",\"24px\"],[\"section-gap-desktop\",\"80px\"],[\"section-gap-mobile\",\"48px\"],[\"element-gap-sm\",\"8px\"],[\"container-max\",\"1440px\"],[\"element-gap-md\",\"16px\"]],null,\"dmSerifDisplay\",\"Dm Sans\",\"Dm Sans\"],2,1,null,[null,2,null,null,2,2],null,null,[\"assets/f84726af88af499598b78556bda4af11\",null,[\"Stitch Design System\",null,\"## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",[1,null,3,null,\"#c97b5a\",null,null,null,null,null,26,26,[[\"surface_tint\",\"#8f4c2f\"],[\"surface\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed_variant\",\"#4d4541\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed\",\"#1e1b17\"],[\"ink-light\",\"#5A4E48\"],[\"primary_fixed_dim\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"on_error\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed\",\"#201a17\"],[\"on_secondary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"border-subtle\",\"#E8DDD6\"],[\"tertiary\",\"#605b56\"],[\"on_primary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"surface_container_lowest\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_primary_fixed_variant\",\"#72351a\"],[\"background\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_primary_fixed\",\"#360f00\"],[\"primary_container\",\"#aa6243\"],[\"surface_bright\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"inverse_primary\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"tertiary_container\",\"#79746e\"],[\"surface_container_low\",\"#f6f3f0\"],[\"primary\",\"#8c4a2d\"],[\"on_primary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"surface_container_high\",\"#eae8e5\"],[\"on_surface_variant\",\"#53433d\"],[\"inverse_surface\",\"#31302f\"],[\"secondary_container\",\"#e9ddd7\"],[\"clay-dark\",\"#A85E40\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed_variant\",\"#4a4641\"],[\"surface_variant\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"outline\",\"#86736c\"],[\"tertiary_fixed\",\"#e9e1da\"],[\"tertiary_fixed_dim\",\"#ccc5bf\"],[\"primary_fixed\",\"#ffdbcd\"],[\"error\",\"#ba1a1a\"],[\"outline_variant\",\"#d9c2b9\"],[\"surface_container\",\"#f0edea\"],[\"secondary\",\"#655d58\"],[\"on_secondary_container\",\"#69615c\"],[\"secondary_fixed\",\"#ece0da\"],[\"on_error_container\",\"#93000a\"],[\"secondary_fixed_dim\",\"#cfc4be\"],[\"on_background\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"error_container\",\"#ffdad6\"],[\"on_tertiary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"surface_container_highest\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"sage\",\"#D6E4D8\"],[\"inverse_on_surface\",\"#f3f0ed\"],[\"on_tertiary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_surface\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"cream-warm\",\"#F2ECE6\"],[\"surface_dim\",\"#dcdad7\"]],\"---\\nname: Stitch Design System\\ncolors:\\n  surface: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-dim: '#dcdad7'\\n  surface-bright: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-container-lowest: '#ffffff'\\n  surface-container-low: '#f6f3f0'\\n  surface-container: '#f0edea'\\n  surface-container-high: '#eae8e5'\\n  surface-container-highest: '#e5e2df'\\n  on-surface: '#1c1c1a'\\n  on-surface-variant: '#53433d'\\n  inverse-surface: '#31302f'\\n  inverse-on-surface: '#f3f0ed'\\n  outline: '#86736c'\\n  outline-variant: '#d9c2b9'\\n  surface-tint: '#8f4c2f'\\n  primary: '#8c4a2d'\\n  on-primary: '#ffffff'\\n  primary-container: '#aa6243'\\n  on-primary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  inverse-primary: '#ffb597'\\n  secondary: '#655d58'\\n  on-secondary: '#ffffff'\\n  secondary-container: '#e9ddd7'\\n  on-secondary-container: '#69615c'\\n  tertiary: '#605b56'\\n  on-tertiary: '#ffffff'\\n  tertiary-container: '#79746e'\\n  on-tertiary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  error: '#ba1a1a'\\n  on-error: '#ffffff'\\n  error-container: '#ffdad6'\\n  on-error-container: '#93000a'\\n  primary-fixed: '#ffdbcd'\\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#ffb597'\\n  on-primary-fixed: '#360f00'\\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#72351a'\\n  secondary-fixed: '#ece0da'\\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#cfc4be'\\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#201a17'\\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#4d4541'\\n  tertiary-fixed: '#e9e1da'\\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#ccc5bf'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#1e1b17'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#4a4641'\\n  background: '#fcf9f6'\\n  on-background: '#1c1c1a'\\n  surface-variant: '#e5e2df'\\n  clay-dark: '#A85E40'\\n  ink-light: '#5A4E48'\\n  sage: '#D6E4D8'\\n  cream-warm: '#F2ECE6'\\n  border-subtle: '#E8DDD6'\\ntypography:\\n  display:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 80px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.1'\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\n  display-mobile:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 44px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n  headline-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 40px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  headline-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 32px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  body-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.8'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.01em\\n  body-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.85'\\n  label-uppercase:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 12px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.15em\\n  caption:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 11px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.4'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.05em\\nrounded:\\n  sm: 0.25rem\\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\\n  md: 0.75rem\\n  lg: 1rem\\n  xl: 1.5rem\\n  full: 9999px\\nspacing:\\n  container-max: 1440px\\n  section-gap-desktop: 80px\\n  section-gap-mobile: 48px\\n  grid-gutter: 24px\\n  element-gap-sm: 8px\\n  element-gap-md: 16px\\n  element-gap-lg: 32px\\n---\\n\\n## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Colors\\n\\nThe palette is inspired by natural, undyed fibers and earthen materials. \\n\\n- **Primary (Clay):** Used for call-to-actions, price accents, and critical indicators. It provides a warm, energetic contrast to the neutral base.\\n- **Secondary (Ink):** The foundation for readability. Used for all primary headings and body text to ensure high legibility against light backgrounds.\\n- **Tertiary (Blush):** A soft accent for secondary surfaces, card backgrounds, and promotional banners.\\n- **Neutral (Cream):** The primary canvas. This off-white base reduces eye strain and feels more premium and \\\"organic\\\" than pure white.\\n- **Named Colors:** **Sage** is reserved for eco-specific callouts or decorative elements to reinforce the sustainability narrative. **Ink-light** is used for secondary navigation and metadata to create visual hierarchy.\\n\\n## Typography\\n\\nThis design system employs a high-contrast pairing to balance heritage and modernity.\\n\\n- **Headlines:** Use **DM Serif Display**. Its graceful curves and high contrast evoke luxury and editorial authority. Use it sparingly for section headers and hero statements.\\n- **Body \\u0026 UI:** Use **DM Sans**. This low-contrast geometric sans-serif ensures maximum legibility across all digital interfaces. \\n- **The \\\"Label-Uppercase\\\" Style:** This is a signature brand element. Use it for navigation, small headings over titles, and button labels. The generous letter-spacing (tracking) is essential to achieving the \\\"premium\\\" feel.\\n- **Line Height:** Maintain a generous line height (1.8 - 1.85) for body text to reinforce the airy, spacious aesthetic.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Shapes\\n\\nThe shape language is \\\"Soft-Modern,\\\" utilizing rounded corners to evoke friendliness and comfort—qualities essential to a wearable fashion brand.\\n\\n- **Small Elements (Buttons, Tags, Pills):** Use `rounded-full` (pill-shaped). This creates a distinct interactive language that feels modern and approachable.\\n- **Medium Elements (Product Images, Floating Cards):** Use `rounded-lg` (1rem / 16px). This softens the grid without making it feel juvenile.\\n- **Large Elements (Banners, Testimonial Containers):** Use `rounded-xl` (1.5rem / 24px) to create \\\"enveloping\\\" containers that feel substantial and high-end.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",6,\"#c97b5a\",\"#2a2420\",\"#f5ede6\",\"#faf7f4\",2,[[\"caption\",[\"DM Sans\",\"11px\",\"500\",\"1.4\",\"0.05em\"]],[\"headline-lg\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"40px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"headline-md\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"32px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"body-md\",[\"DM Sans\",\"14px\",\"400\",\"1.85\"]],[\"display\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"80px\",\"400\",\"1.1\",\"-0.02em\"]],[\"body-lg\",[\"DM Sans\",\"16px\",\"400\",\"1.8\",\"0.01em\"]],[\"display-mobile\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"44px\",\"400\",\"1.2\"]],[\"label-uppercase\",[\"DM Sans\",\"12px\",\"500\",\"1.2\",\"0.15em\"]]],[[\"element-gap-md\",\"16px\"],[\"element-gap-lg\",\"32px\"],[\"grid-gutter\",\"24px\"],[\"section-gap-desktop\",\"80px\"],[\"container-max\",\"1440px\"],[\"section-gap-mobile\",\"48px\"],[\"element-gap-sm\",\"8px\"]],null,\"dmSerifDisplay\",\"Dm Sans\",\"Dm Sans\"]],1]],[[\"projects/18178749605532028059/files/b11be90a4bcc4457bac19f31ff7791fa\",null,\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida/AP1WRLvk9OXvscyQa6ljIFMqTSe1YrSyRdZ_VcnJL9IL60g09UFpJ13gU_8DqDm2y3SAUotp-kve5DX8TGVqMqnPAbMo_Y5feUWLAya-ffqwdSey0vnHLRPpsZzkxnHd6RRaIT6FJPkw3o1rhEumOwXMNktZl6KXjpVupin4Xd57eQiiCeQAKvPysk0a8UNS8IVsx_5Tppoy1T-xIMf1rWdk_T4wIg2pgEcEx6oWqo-K3ki4QR_K4xkaJanYo7fy\"],[\"projects/18178749605532028059/files/896a5324451445818127aa5e6b8d663b\",null,\"https://contribution.usercontent.google.com/download?c\\u003dCgthaWRhX2NvZGVmeBJ8Eh1hcHBfY29tcGFuaW9uX2dlbmVyYXRlZF9maWxlcxpbCiVodG1sX2ZmNGZiZDFkOTExYTQ1ZmRhMDAwNzcwMjk0ZGRjNmU1EgsSBxDv9_C4jw8YAZIBJAoKcHJvamVjdF9pZBIWQhQxODE3ODc0OTYwNTUzMjAyODA1OQ\\u0026filename\\u003d\\u0026opi\\u003d89354086\",null,null,\"text/html\"],null,null,\"ed54f795a3a64f3cbbb68d4955b10b3e\",\"HatterAgent\",\"2560\",\"5108\",\"Stitch — Đơn hàng của tôi (Updated Footer)\",\"Synchronize the footer to match the updated Kids Fashion theme on the homepage. Ensure it includes the 'Kết nối với STITCH' newsletter section, organized shopping links (Bé trai, Bé gái, Giày dép), and professional contact information as seen on the primary screen.\",\"projects/18178749605532028059/screens/ed54f795a3a64f3cbbb68d4955b10b3e\",[1,null,3,null,\"#c97b5a\",null,null,null,null,null,26,26,[[\"surface_dim\",\"#dcdad7\"],[\"cream-warm\",\"#F2ECE6\"],[\"on_surface\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"inverse_on_surface\",\"#f3f0ed\"],[\"on_tertiary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"surface_container_highest\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"sage\",\"#D6E4D8\"],[\"on_tertiary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"secondary_fixed_dim\",\"#cfc4be\"],[\"on_background\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"error_container\",\"#ffdad6\"],[\"secondary_fixed\",\"#ece0da\"],[\"on_secondary_container\",\"#69615c\"],[\"on_error_container\",\"#93000a\"],[\"secondary\",\"#655d58\"],[\"surface_container\",\"#f0edea\"],[\"primary_fixed\",\"#ffdbcd\"],[\"error\",\"#ba1a1a\"],[\"outline_variant\",\"#d9c2b9\"],[\"surface_variant\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed_variant\",\"#4a4641\"],[\"tertiary_fixed_dim\",\"#ccc5bf\"],[\"tertiary_fixed\",\"#e9e1da\"],[\"outline\",\"#86736c\"],[\"clay-dark\",\"#A85E40\"],[\"surface_container_high\",\"#eae8e5\"],[\"on_surface_variant\",\"#53433d\"],[\"inverse_surface\",\"#31302f\"],[\"secondary_container\",\"#e9ddd7\"],[\"on_primary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"primary\",\"#8c4a2d\"],[\"surface_container_low\",\"#f6f3f0\"],[\"inverse_primary\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"tertiary_container\",\"#79746e\"],[\"primary_container\",\"#aa6243\"],[\"surface_bright\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_primary_fixed\",\"#360f00\"],[\"on_primary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"surface_container_lowest\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_primary_fixed_variant\",\"#72351a\"],[\"background\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed\",\"#201a17\"],[\"on_secondary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"tertiary\",\"#605b56\"],[\"border-subtle\",\"#E8DDD6\"],[\"primary_fixed_dim\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"on_error\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed\",\"#1e1b17\"],[\"ink-light\",\"#5A4E48\"],[\"surface_tint\",\"#8f4c2f\"],[\"surface\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed_variant\",\"#4d4541\"]],\"---\\nname: Stitch Design System\\ncolors:\\n  surface: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-dim: '#dcdad7'\\n  surface-bright: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-container-lowest: '#ffffff'\\n  surface-container-low: '#f6f3f0'\\n  surface-container: '#f0edea'\\n  surface-container-high: '#eae8e5'\\n  surface-container-highest: '#e5e2df'\\n  on-surface: '#1c1c1a'\\n  on-surface-variant: '#53433d'\\n  inverse-surface: '#31302f'\\n  inverse-on-surface: '#f3f0ed'\\n  outline: '#86736c'\\n  outline-variant: '#d9c2b9'\\n  surface-tint: '#8f4c2f'\\n  primary: '#8c4a2d'\\n  on-primary: '#ffffff'\\n  primary-container: '#aa6243'\\n  on-primary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  inverse-primary: '#ffb597'\\n  secondary: '#655d58'\\n  on-secondary: '#ffffff'\\n  secondary-container: '#e9ddd7'\\n  on-secondary-container: '#69615c'\\n  tertiary: '#605b56'\\n  on-tertiary: '#ffffff'\\n  tertiary-container: '#79746e'\\n  on-tertiary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  error: '#ba1a1a'\\n  on-error: '#ffffff'\\n  error-container: '#ffdad6'\\n  on-error-container: '#93000a'\\n  primary-fixed: '#ffdbcd'\\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#ffb597'\\n  on-primary-fixed: '#360f00'\\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#72351a'\\n  secondary-fixed: '#ece0da'\\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#cfc4be'\\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#201a17'\\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#4d4541'\\n  tertiary-fixed: '#e9e1da'\\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#ccc5bf'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#1e1b17'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#4a4641'\\n  background: '#fcf9f6'\\n  on-background: '#1c1c1a'\\n  surface-variant: '#e5e2df'\\n  clay-dark: '#A85E40'\\n  ink-light: '#5A4E48'\\n  sage: '#D6E4D8'\\n  cream-warm: '#F2ECE6'\\n  border-subtle: '#E8DDD6'\\ntypography:\\n  display:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 80px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.1'\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\n  display-mobile:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 44px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n  headline-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 40px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  headline-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 32px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  body-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.8'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.01em\\n  body-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.85'\\n  label-uppercase:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 12px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.15em\\n  caption:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 11px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.4'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.05em\\nrounded:\\n  sm: 0.25rem\\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\\n  md: 0.75rem\\n  lg: 1rem\\n  xl: 1.5rem\\n  full: 9999px\\nspacing:\\n  container-max: 1440px\\n  section-gap-desktop: 80px\\n  section-gap-mobile: 48px\\n  grid-gutter: 24px\\n  element-gap-sm: 8px\\n  element-gap-md: 16px\\n  element-gap-lg: 32px\\n---\\n\\n## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Colors\\n\\nThe palette is inspired by natural, undyed fibers and earthen materials. \\n\\n- **Primary (Clay):** Used for call-to-actions, price accents, and critical indicators. It provides a warm, energetic contrast to the neutral base.\\n- **Secondary (Ink):** The foundation for readability. Used for all primary headings and body text to ensure high legibility against light backgrounds.\\n- **Tertiary (Blush):** A soft accent for secondary surfaces, card backgrounds, and promotional banners.\\n- **Neutral (Cream):** The primary canvas. This off-white base reduces eye strain and feels more premium and \\\"organic\\\" than pure white.\\n- **Named Colors:** **Sage** is reserved for eco-specific callouts or decorative elements to reinforce the sustainability narrative. **Ink-light** is used for secondary navigation and metadata to create visual hierarchy.\\n\\n## Typography\\n\\nThis design system employs a high-contrast pairing to balance heritage and modernity.\\n\\n- **Headlines:** Use **DM Serif Display**. Its graceful curves and high contrast evoke luxury and editorial authority. Use it sparingly for section headers and hero statements.\\n- **Body \\u0026 UI:** Use **DM Sans**. This low-contrast geometric sans-serif ensures maximum legibility across all digital interfaces. \\n- **The \\\"Label-Uppercase\\\" Style:** This is a signature brand element. Use it for navigation, small headings over titles, and button labels. The generous letter-spacing (tracking) is essential to achieving the \\\"premium\\\" feel.\\n- **Line Height:** Maintain a generous line height (1.8 - 1.85) for body text to reinforce the airy, spacious aesthetic.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Shapes\\n\\nThe shape language is \\\"Soft-Modern,\\\" utilizing rounded corners to evoke friendliness and comfort—qualities essential to a wearable fashion brand.\\n\\n- **Small Elements (Buttons, Tags, Pills):** Use `rounded-full` (pill-shaped). This creates a distinct interactive language that feels modern and approachable.\\n- **Medium Elements (Product Images, Floating Cards):** Use `rounded-lg` (1rem / 16px). This softens the grid without making it feel juvenile.\\n- **Large Elements (Banners, Testimonial Containers):** Use `rounded-xl` (1.5rem / 24px) to create \\\"enveloping\\\" containers that feel substantial and high-end.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",6,\"#c97b5a\",\"#2a2420\",\"#f5ede6\",\"#faf7f4\",2,[[\"body-md\",[\"DM Sans\",\"14px\",\"400\",\"1.85\"]],[\"display\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"80px\",\"400\",\"1.1\",\"-0.02em\"]],[\"body-lg\",[\"DM Sans\",\"16px\",\"400\",\"1.8\",\"0.01em\"]],[\"display-mobile\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"44px\",\"400\",\"1.2\"]],[\"label-uppercase\",[\"DM Sans\",\"12px\",\"500\",\"1.2\",\"0.15em\"]],[\"caption\",[\"DM Sans\",\"11px\",\"500\",\"1.4\",\"0.05em\"]],[\"headline-lg\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"40px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"headline-md\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"32px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]]],[[\"element-gap-lg\",\"32px\"],[\"grid-gutter\",\"24px\"],[\"section-gap-desktop\",\"80px\"],[\"container-max\",\"1440px\"],[\"section-gap-mobile\",\"48px\"],[\"element-gap-sm\",\"8px\"],[\"element-gap-md\",\"16px\"]],null,\"dmSerifDisplay\",\"Dm Sans\",\"Dm Sans\"],2,1,null,[null,2,null,null,2],null,null,[\"assets/f84726af88af499598b78556bda4af11\",null,[\"Stitch Design System\",null,\"## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",[1,null,3,null,\"#c97b5a\",null,null,null,null,null,26,26,[[\"on_tertiary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"surface_container_highest\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"sage\",\"#D6E4D8\"],[\"inverse_on_surface\",\"#f3f0ed\"],[\"on_tertiary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_surface\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"cream-warm\",\"#F2ECE6\"],[\"surface_dim\",\"#dcdad7\"],[\"surface_variant\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed_variant\",\"#4a4641\"],[\"tertiary_fixed_dim\",\"#ccc5bf\"],[\"tertiary_fixed\",\"#e9e1da\"],[\"outline\",\"#86736c\"],[\"error\",\"#ba1a1a\"],[\"primary_fixed\",\"#ffdbcd\"],[\"outline_variant\",\"#d9c2b9\"],[\"surface_container\",\"#f0edea\"],[\"secondary\",\"#655d58\"],[\"secondary_fixed\",\"#ece0da\"],[\"on_secondary_container\",\"#69615c\"],[\"on_error_container\",\"#93000a\"],[\"on_background\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"secondary_fixed_dim\",\"#cfc4be\"],[\"error_container\",\"#ffdad6\"],[\"tertiary_container\",\"#79746e\"],[\"inverse_primary\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"primary\",\"#8c4a2d\"],[\"surface_container_low\",\"#f6f3f0\"],[\"on_primary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"surface_container_high\",\"#eae8e5\"],[\"on_surface_variant\",\"#53433d\"],[\"inverse_surface\",\"#31302f\"],[\"secondary_container\",\"#e9ddd7\"],[\"clay-dark\",\"#A85E40\"],[\"surface\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"surface_tint\",\"#8f4c2f\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed_variant\",\"#4d4541\"],[\"ink-light\",\"#5A4E48\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed\",\"#1e1b17\"],[\"primary_fixed_dim\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"on_error\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_secondary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed\",\"#201a17\"],[\"tertiary\",\"#605b56\"],[\"border-subtle\",\"#E8DDD6\"],[\"surface_container_lowest\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_primary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"background\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_primary_fixed_variant\",\"#72351a\"],[\"on_primary_fixed\",\"#360f00\"],[\"surface_bright\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"primary_container\",\"#aa6243\"]],\"---\\nname: Stitch Design System\\ncolors:\\n  surface: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-dim: '#dcdad7'\\n  surface-bright: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-container-lowest: '#ffffff'\\n  surface-container-low: '#f6f3f0'\\n  surface-container: '#f0edea'\\n  surface-container-high: '#eae8e5'\\n  surface-container-highest: '#e5e2df'\\n  on-surface: '#1c1c1a'\\n  on-surface-variant: '#53433d'\\n  inverse-surface: '#31302f'\\n  inverse-on-surface: '#f3f0ed'\\n  outline: '#86736c'\\n  outline-variant: '#d9c2b9'\\n  surface-tint: '#8f4c2f'\\n  primary: '#8c4a2d'\\n  on-primary: '#ffffff'\\n  primary-container: '#aa6243'\\n  on-primary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  inverse-primary: '#ffb597'\\n  secondary: '#655d58'\\n  on-secondary: '#ffffff'\\n  secondary-container: '#e9ddd7'\\n  on-secondary-container: '#69615c'\\n  tertiary: '#605b56'\\n  on-tertiary: '#ffffff'\\n  tertiary-container: '#79746e'\\n  on-tertiary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  error: '#ba1a1a'\\n  on-error: '#ffffff'\\n  error-container: '#ffdad6'\\n  on-error-container: '#93000a'\\n  primary-fixed: '#ffdbcd'\\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#ffb597'\\n  on-primary-fixed: '#360f00'\\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#72351a'\\n  secondary-fixed: '#ece0da'\\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#cfc4be'\\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#201a17'\\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#4d4541'\\n  tertiary-fixed: '#e9e1da'\\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#ccc5bf'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#1e1b17'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#4a4641'\\n  background: '#fcf9f6'\\n  on-background: '#1c1c1a'\\n  surface-variant: '#e5e2df'\\n  clay-dark: '#A85E40'\\n  ink-light: '#5A4E48'\\n  sage: '#D6E4D8'\\n  cream-warm: '#F2ECE6'\\n  border-subtle: '#E8DDD6'\\ntypography:\\n  display:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 80px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.1'\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\n  display-mobile:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 44px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n  headline-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 40px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  headline-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 32px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  body-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.8'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.01em\\n  body-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.85'\\n  label-uppercase:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 12px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.15em\\n  caption:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 11px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.4'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.05em\\nrounded:\\n  sm: 0.25rem\\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\\n  md: 0.75rem\\n  lg: 1rem\\n  xl: 1.5rem\\n  full: 9999px\\nspacing:\\n  container-max: 1440px\\n  section-gap-desktop: 80px\\n  section-gap-mobile: 48px\\n  grid-gutter: 24px\\n  element-gap-sm: 8px\\n  element-gap-md: 16px\\n  element-gap-lg: 32px\\n---\\n\\n## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Colors\\n\\nThe palette is inspired by natural, undyed fibers and earthen materials. \\n\\n- **Primary (Clay):** Used for call-to-actions, price accents, and critical indicators. It provides a warm, energetic contrast to the neutral base.\\n- **Secondary (Ink):** The foundation for readability. Used for all primary headings and body text to ensure high legibility against light backgrounds.\\n- **Tertiary (Blush):** A soft accent for secondary surfaces, card backgrounds, and promotional banners.\\n- **Neutral (Cream):** The primary canvas. This off-white base reduces eye strain and feels more premium and \\\"organic\\\" than pure white.\\n- **Named Colors:** **Sage** is reserved for eco-specific callouts or decorative elements to reinforce the sustainability narrative. **Ink-light** is used for secondary navigation and metadata to create visual hierarchy.\\n\\n## Typography\\n\\nThis design system employs a high-contrast pairing to balance heritage and modernity.\\n\\n- **Headlines:** Use **DM Serif Display**. Its graceful curves and high contrast evoke luxury and editorial authority. Use it sparingly for section headers and hero statements.\\n- **Body \\u0026 UI:** Use **DM Sans**. This low-contrast geometric sans-serif ensures maximum legibility across all digital interfaces. \\n- **The \\\"Label-Uppercase\\\" Style:** This is a signature brand element. Use it for navigation, small headings over titles, and button labels. The generous letter-spacing (tracking) is essential to achieving the \\\"premium\\\" feel.\\n- **Line Height:** Maintain a generous line height (1.8 - 1.85) for body text to reinforce the airy, spacious aesthetic.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Shapes\\n\\nThe shape language is \\\"Soft-Modern,\\\" utilizing rounded corners to evoke friendliness and comfort—qualities essential to a wearable fashion brand.\\n\\n- **Small Elements (Buttons, Tags, Pills):** Use `rounded-full` (pill-shaped). This creates a distinct interactive language that feels modern and approachable.\\n- **Medium Elements (Product Images, Floating Cards):** Use `rounded-lg` (1rem / 16px). This softens the grid without making it feel juvenile.\\n- **Large Elements (Banners, Testimonial Containers):** Use `rounded-xl` (1.5rem / 24px) to create \\\"enveloping\\\" containers that feel substantial and high-end.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",6,\"#c97b5a\",\"#2a2420\",\"#f5ede6\",\"#faf7f4\",2,[[\"caption\",[\"DM Sans\",\"11px\",\"500\",\"1.4\",\"0.05em\"]],[\"headline-lg\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"40px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"headline-md\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"32px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"display-mobile\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"44px\",\"400\",\"1.2\"]],[\"label-uppercase\",[\"DM Sans\",\"12px\",\"500\",\"1.2\",\"0.15em\"]],[\"body-lg\",[\"DM Sans\",\"16px\",\"400\",\"1.8\",\"0.01em\"]],[\"display\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"80px\",\"400\",\"1.1\",\"-0.02em\"]],[\"body-md\",[\"DM Sans\",\"14px\",\"400\",\"1.85\"]]],[[\"element-gap-md\",\"16px\"],[\"element-gap-sm\",\"8px\"],[\"section-gap-mobile\",\"48px\"],[\"container-max\",\"1440px\"],[\"grid-gutter\",\"24px\"],[\"section-gap-desktop\",\"80px\"],[\"element-gap-lg\",\"32px\"]],null,\"dmSerifDisplay\",\"Dm Sans\",\"Dm Sans\"]],1]],[[\"projects/18178749605532028059/files/bfe58fc4d0974c9bb7c6e9a0901a942d\",null,\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida/AP1WRLu36LAymjeVn-5cvIIhvTKDbB9yiT1-Q8iNPUPspiN3xcfiNq9bdhoWIaBNdvAhGxbnSBHvOz4punDqPL4ZGg8oibeWj7ywqqg105w45unlloCvTY2KkaHxJ3KTqWOnFhZavZNjM-FVbri7Y-BClPWiVe74SYXa8Vh_V-UgJBiKoKPSu46OAqCq-Clxz7ejMJOh6Rfm8WCzmwOebymX4xJHZhnT_OSbg-FONgy3mWVA5UCZ26-6q-EbnLKs\"],null,null,null,\"181b45f7de684eaab14b94b41c68f1e4\",\"interactive_ui_controller\",\"896\",\"1200\",\"Minimalist high-quality leather sandals on a stone surface, neutral beige tones, soft natural lighting, professional fashion photography for a sustainable brand like Stitch.\",\"Minimalist high-quality leather sandals on a stone surface, neutral beige tones, soft natural lighting, professional fashion photography for a sustainable brand like Stitch.\",\"projects/18178749605532028059/screens/181b45f7de684eaab14b94b41c68f1e4\",[],null,2,null,[null,2,null,null,2],null,null,[\"assets/f84726af88af499598b78556bda4af11\",null,[\"Stitch Design System\",null,\"## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",[1,null,3,null,\"#c97b5a\",null,null,null,null,null,26,26,[[\"on_primary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"tertiary_container\",\"#79746e\"],[\"inverse_primary\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"surface_container_low\",\"#f6f3f0\"],[\"primary\",\"#8c4a2d\"],[\"clay-dark\",\"#A85E40\"],[\"inverse_surface\",\"#31302f\"],[\"on_surface_variant\",\"#53433d\"],[\"surface_container_high\",\"#eae8e5\"],[\"secondary_container\",\"#e9ddd7\"],[\"primary_fixed_dim\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"on_error\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"surface\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"surface_tint\",\"#8f4c2f\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed_variant\",\"#4d4541\"],[\"ink-light\",\"#5A4E48\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed\",\"#1e1b17\"],[\"on_primary_fixed\",\"#360f00\"],[\"surface_bright\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"primary_container\",\"#aa6243\"],[\"on_secondary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed\",\"#201a17\"],[\"tertiary\",\"#605b56\"],[\"border-subtle\",\"#E8DDD6\"],[\"surface_container_lowest\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_primary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"on_primary_fixed_variant\",\"#72351a\"],[\"background\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"surface_container_highest\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"sage\",\"#D6E4D8\"],[\"inverse_on_surface\",\"#f3f0ed\"],[\"on_tertiary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_tertiary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"cream-warm\",\"#F2ECE6\"],[\"surface_dim\",\"#dcdad7\"],[\"on_surface\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"error\",\"#ba1a1a\"],[\"primary_fixed\",\"#ffdbcd\"],[\"outline_variant\",\"#d9c2b9\"],[\"surface_container\",\"#f0edea\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed_variant\",\"#4a4641\"],[\"surface_variant\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"tertiary_fixed\",\"#e9e1da\"],[\"tertiary_fixed_dim\",\"#ccc5bf\"],[\"outline\",\"#86736c\"],[\"on_secondary_container\",\"#69615c\"],[\"secondary_fixed\",\"#ece0da\"],[\"on_error_container\",\"#93000a\"],[\"on_background\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"secondary_fixed_dim\",\"#cfc4be\"],[\"error_container\",\"#ffdad6\"],[\"secondary\",\"#655d58\"]],\"---\\nname: Stitch Design System\\ncolors:\\n  surface: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-dim: '#dcdad7'\\n  surface-bright: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-container-lowest: '#ffffff'\\n  surface-container-low: '#f6f3f0'\\n  surface-container: '#f0edea'\\n  surface-container-high: '#eae8e5'\\n  surface-container-highest: '#e5e2df'\\n  on-surface: '#1c1c1a'\\n  on-surface-variant: '#53433d'\\n  inverse-surface: '#31302f'\\n  inverse-on-surface: '#f3f0ed'\\n  outline: '#86736c'\\n  outline-variant: '#d9c2b9'\\n  surface-tint: '#8f4c2f'\\n  primary: '#8c4a2d'\\n  on-primary: '#ffffff'\\n  primary-container: '#aa6243'\\n  on-primary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  inverse-primary: '#ffb597'\\n  secondary: '#655d58'\\n  on-secondary: '#ffffff'\\n  secondary-container: '#e9ddd7'\\n  on-secondary-container: '#69615c'\\n  tertiary: '#605b56'\\n  on-tertiary: '#ffffff'\\n  tertiary-container: '#79746e'\\n  on-tertiary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  error: '#ba1a1a'\\n  on-error: '#ffffff'\\n  error-container: '#ffdad6'\\n  on-error-container: '#93000a'\\n  primary-fixed: '#ffdbcd'\\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#ffb597'\\n  on-primary-fixed: '#360f00'\\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#72351a'\\n  secondary-fixed: '#ece0da'\\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#cfc4be'\\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#201a17'\\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#4d4541'\\n  tertiary-fixed: '#e9e1da'\\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#ccc5bf'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#1e1b17'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#4a4641'\\n  background: '#fcf9f6'\\n  on-background: '#1c1c1a'\\n  surface-variant: '#e5e2df'\\n  clay-dark: '#A85E40'\\n  ink-light: '#5A4E48'\\n  sage: '#D6E4D8'\\n  cream-warm: '#F2ECE6'\\n  border-subtle: '#E8DDD6'\\ntypography:\\n  display:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 80px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.1'\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\n  display-mobile:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 44px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n  headline-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 40px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  headline-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 32px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  body-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.8'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.01em\\n  body-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.85'\\n  label-uppercase:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 12px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.15em\\n  caption:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 11px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.4'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.05em\\nrounded:\\n  sm: 0.25rem\\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\\n  md: 0.75rem\\n  lg: 1rem\\n  xl: 1.5rem\\n  full: 9999px\\nspacing:\\n  container-max: 1440px\\n  section-gap-desktop: 80px\\n  section-gap-mobile: 48px\\n  grid-gutter: 24px\\n  element-gap-sm: 8px\\n  element-gap-md: 16px\\n  element-gap-lg: 32px\\n---\\n\\n## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Colors\\n\\nThe palette is inspired by natural, undyed fibers and earthen materials. \\n\\n- **Primary (Clay):** Used for call-to-actions, price accents, and critical indicators. It provides a warm, energetic contrast to the neutral base.\\n- **Secondary (Ink):** The foundation for readability. Used for all primary headings and body text to ensure high legibility against light backgrounds.\\n- **Tertiary (Blush):** A soft accent for secondary surfaces, card backgrounds, and promotional banners.\\n- **Neutral (Cream):** The primary canvas. This off-white base reduces eye strain and feels more premium and \\\"organic\\\" than pure white.\\n- **Named Colors:** **Sage** is reserved for eco-specific callouts or decorative elements to reinforce the sustainability narrative. **Ink-light** is used for secondary navigation and metadata to create visual hierarchy.\\n\\n## Typography\\n\\nThis design system employs a high-contrast pairing to balance heritage and modernity.\\n\\n- **Headlines:** Use **DM Serif Display**. Its graceful curves and high contrast evoke luxury and editorial authority. Use it sparingly for section headers and hero statements.\\n- **Body \\u0026 UI:** Use **DM Sans**. This low-contrast geometric sans-serif ensures maximum legibility across all digital interfaces. \\n- **The \\\"Label-Uppercase\\\" Style:** This is a signature brand element. Use it for navigation, small headings over titles, and button labels. The generous letter-spacing (tracking) is essential to achieving the \\\"premium\\\" feel.\\n- **Line Height:** Maintain a generous line height (1.8 - 1.85) for body text to reinforce the airy, spacious aesthetic.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Shapes\\n\\nThe shape language is \\\"Soft-Modern,\\\" utilizing rounded corners to evoke friendliness and comfort—qualities essential to a wearable fashion brand.\\n\\n- **Small Elements (Buttons, Tags, Pills):** Use `rounded-full` (pill-shaped). This creates a distinct interactive language that feels modern and approachable.\\n- **Medium Elements (Product Images, Floating Cards):** Use `rounded-lg` (1rem / 16px). This softens the grid without making it feel juvenile.\\n- **Large Elements (Banners, Testimonial Containers):** Use `rounded-xl` (1.5rem / 24px) to create \\\"enveloping\\\" containers that feel substantial and high-end.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",6,\"#c97b5a\",\"#2a2420\",\"#f5ede6\",\"#faf7f4\",2,[[\"caption\",[\"DM Sans\",\"11px\",\"500\",\"1.4\",\"0.05em\"]],[\"headline-lg\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"40px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"headline-md\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"32px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"display-mobile\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"44px\",\"400\",\"1.2\"]],[\"label-uppercase\",[\"DM Sans\",\"12px\",\"500\",\"1.2\",\"0.15em\"]],[\"body-md\",[\"DM Sans\",\"14px\",\"400\",\"1.85\"]],[\"display\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"80px\",\"400\",\"1.1\",\"-0.02em\"]],[\"body-lg\",[\"DM Sans\",\"16px\",\"400\",\"1.8\",\"0.01em\"]]],[[\"section-gap-desktop\",\"80px\"],[\"grid-gutter\",\"24px\"],[\"element-gap-lg\",\"32px\"],[\"element-gap-sm\",\"8px\"],[\"section-gap-mobile\",\"48px\"],[\"container-max\",\"1440px\"],[\"element-gap-md\",\"16px\"]],null,\"dmSerifDisplay\",\"Dm Sans\",\"Dm Sans\"]],1]],[[\"projects/18178749605532028059/files/f2676f00b3b140158254748d1df71305\",null,\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida/AP1WRLtXQUzuopxQOOolXS4O8jUcPDDHYxUYBZsWD2QkDyJnMjyu7McQzonPsWfJ0js82ACv_c25bZXS7yuPCHx1Xfhl9J1XKcDlji6lrEkF_8LFy6rwktRlzlrO7z6P4MOrFOSU2QPYMPyXpcRRDQRi_oVNaFjw9Uh9t5NUYZolAso1rFzkHzk-DXZdq_sL7B6Q0wavhYBnuN-Ku5vUDkszzY1q8jqn9VfcBuo4pS3tUovuvbMK8AIS5uRfgqhp\"],[\"projects/18178749605532028059/files/d7bda6fa90564a95a012579a08652eee\",null,\"https://contribution.usercontent.google.com/download?c\\u003dCgthaWRhX2NvZGVmeBJ8Eh1hcHBfY29tcGFuaW9uX2dlbmVyYXRlZF9maWxlcxpbCiVodG1sXzZkOGU2Nzc0MTk0ZTQ2ODM4YjBkZmM1MGI2OTZiMWIwEgsSBxDv9_C4jw8YAZIBJAoKcHJvamVjdF9pZBIWQhQxODE3ODc0OTYwNTUzMjAyODA1OQ\\u0026filename\\u003d\\u0026opi\\u003d89354086\",null,null,\"text/html\"],null,null,\"f25a1316cf5d4960af384aaa9e49fb13\",\"HatterAgent\",\"2560\",\"5026\",\"Stitch — Giỏ hàng (Updated Footer)\",\"Synchronize the footer to match the updated Kids Fashion theme on the homepage. Ensure it includes the 'Kết nối với STITCH' newsletter section, organized shopping links (Bé trai, Bé gái, Giày dép), and professional contact information as seen on the primary screen.\",\"projects/18178749605532028059/screens/f25a1316cf5d4960af384aaa9e49fb13\",[1,null,3,null,\"#c97b5a\",null,null,null,null,null,26,26,[[\"outline\",\"#86736c\"],[\"tertiary_fixed_dim\",\"#ccc5bf\"],[\"tertiary_fixed\",\"#e9e1da\"],[\"surface_variant\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed_variant\",\"#4a4641\"],[\"outline_variant\",\"#d9c2b9\"],[\"primary_fixed\",\"#ffdbcd\"],[\"error\",\"#ba1a1a\"],[\"surface_container\",\"#f0edea\"],[\"secondary\",\"#655d58\"],[\"on_error_container\",\"#93000a\"],[\"on_secondary_container\",\"#69615c\"],[\"secondary_fixed\",\"#ece0da\"],[\"error_container\",\"#ffdad6\"],[\"secondary_fixed_dim\",\"#cfc4be\"],[\"on_background\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"on_tertiary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"sage\",\"#D6E4D8\"],[\"surface_container_highest\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"on_tertiary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"inverse_on_surface\",\"#f3f0ed\"],[\"on_surface\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"cream-warm\",\"#F2ECE6\"],[\"surface_dim\",\"#dcdad7\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed_variant\",\"#4d4541\"],[\"surface_tint\",\"#8f4c2f\"],[\"surface\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed\",\"#1e1b17\"],[\"ink-light\",\"#5A4E48\"],[\"on_error\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"primary_fixed_dim\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"tertiary\",\"#605b56\"],[\"border-subtle\",\"#E8DDD6\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed\",\"#201a17\"],[\"on_secondary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"background\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_primary_fixed_variant\",\"#72351a\"],[\"on_primary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"surface_container_lowest\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_primary_fixed\",\"#360f00\"],[\"primary_container\",\"#aa6243\"],[\"surface_bright\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"inverse_primary\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"tertiary_container\",\"#79746e\"],[\"surface_container_low\",\"#f6f3f0\"],[\"primary\",\"#8c4a2d\"],[\"on_primary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"secondary_container\",\"#e9ddd7\"],[\"surface_container_high\",\"#eae8e5\"],[\"on_surface_variant\",\"#53433d\"],[\"inverse_surface\",\"#31302f\"],[\"clay-dark\",\"#A85E40\"]],\"---\\nname: Stitch Design System\\ncolors:\\n  surface: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-dim: '#dcdad7'\\n  surface-bright: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-container-lowest: '#ffffff'\\n  surface-container-low: '#f6f3f0'\\n  surface-container: '#f0edea'\\n  surface-container-high: '#eae8e5'\\n  surface-container-highest: '#e5e2df'\\n  on-surface: '#1c1c1a'\\n  on-surface-variant: '#53433d'\\n  inverse-surface: '#31302f'\\n  inverse-on-surface: '#f3f0ed'\\n  outline: '#86736c'\\n  outline-variant: '#d9c2b9'\\n  surface-tint: '#8f4c2f'\\n  primary: '#8c4a2d'\\n  on-primary: '#ffffff'\\n  primary-container: '#aa6243'\\n  on-primary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  inverse-primary: '#ffb597'\\n  secondary: '#655d58'\\n  on-secondary: '#ffffff'\\n  secondary-container: '#e9ddd7'\\n  on-secondary-container: '#69615c'\\n  tertiary: '#605b56'\\n  on-tertiary: '#ffffff'\\n  tertiary-container: '#79746e'\\n  on-tertiary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  error: '#ba1a1a'\\n  on-error: '#ffffff'\\n  error-container: '#ffdad6'\\n  on-error-container: '#93000a'\\n  primary-fixed: '#ffdbcd'\\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#ffb597'\\n  on-primary-fixed: '#360f00'\\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#72351a'\\n  secondary-fixed: '#ece0da'\\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#cfc4be'\\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#201a17'\\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#4d4541'\\n  tertiary-fixed: '#e9e1da'\\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#ccc5bf'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#1e1b17'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#4a4641'\\n  background: '#fcf9f6'\\n  on-background: '#1c1c1a'\\n  surface-variant: '#e5e2df'\\n  clay-dark: '#A85E40'\\n  ink-light: '#5A4E48'\\n  sage: '#D6E4D8'\\n  cream-warm: '#F2ECE6'\\n  border-subtle: '#E8DDD6'\\ntypography:\\n  display:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 80px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.1'\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\n  display-mobile:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 44px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n  headline-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 40px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  headline-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 32px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  body-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.8'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.01em\\n  body-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.85'\\n  label-uppercase:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 12px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.15em\\n  caption:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 11px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.4'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.05em\\nrounded:\\n  sm: 0.25rem\\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\\n  md: 0.75rem\\n  lg: 1rem\\n  xl: 1.5rem\\n  full: 9999px\\nspacing:\\n  container-max: 1440px\\n  section-gap-desktop: 80px\\n  section-gap-mobile: 48px\\n  grid-gutter: 24px\\n  element-gap-sm: 8px\\n  element-gap-md: 16px\\n  element-gap-lg: 32px\\n---\\n\\n## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Colors\\n\\nThe palette is inspired by natural, undyed fibers and earthen materials. \\n\\n- **Primary (Clay):** Used for call-to-actions, price accents, and critical indicators. It provides a warm, energetic contrast to the neutral base.\\n- **Secondary (Ink):** The foundation for readability. Used for all primary headings and body text to ensure high legibility against light backgrounds.\\n- **Tertiary (Blush):** A soft accent for secondary surfaces, card backgrounds, and promotional banners.\\n- **Neutral (Cream):** The primary canvas. This off-white base reduces eye strain and feels more premium and \\\"organic\\\" than pure white.\\n- **Named Colors:** **Sage** is reserved for eco-specific callouts or decorative elements to reinforce the sustainability narrative. **Ink-light** is used for secondary navigation and metadata to create visual hierarchy.\\n\\n## Typography\\n\\nThis design system employs a high-contrast pairing to balance heritage and modernity.\\n\\n- **Headlines:** Use **DM Serif Display**. Its graceful curves and high contrast evoke luxury and editorial authority. Use it sparingly for section headers and hero statements.\\n- **Body \\u0026 UI:** Use **DM Sans**. This low-contrast geometric sans-serif ensures maximum legibility across all digital interfaces. \\n- **The \\\"Label-Uppercase\\\" Style:** This is a signature brand element. Use it for navigation, small headings over titles, and button labels. The generous letter-spacing (tracking) is essential to achieving the \\\"premium\\\" feel.\\n- **Line Height:** Maintain a generous line height (1.8 - 1.85) for body text to reinforce the airy, spacious aesthetic.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Shapes\\n\\nThe shape language is \\\"Soft-Modern,\\\" utilizing rounded corners to evoke friendliness and comfort—qualities essential to a wearable fashion brand.\\n\\n- **Small Elements (Buttons, Tags, Pills):** Use `rounded-full` (pill-shaped). This creates a distinct interactive language that feels modern and approachable.\\n- **Medium Elements (Product Images, Floating Cards):** Use `rounded-lg` (1rem / 16px). This softens the grid without making it feel juvenile.\\n- **Large Elements (Banners, Testimonial Containers):** Use `rounded-xl` (1.5rem / 24px) to create \\\"enveloping\\\" containers that feel substantial and high-end.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",6,\"#c97b5a\",\"#2a2420\",\"#f5ede6\",\"#faf7f4\",2,[[\"caption\",[\"DM Sans\",\"11px\",\"500\",\"1.4\",\"0.05em\"]],[\"headline-lg\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"40px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"headline-md\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"32px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"display-mobile\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"44px\",\"400\",\"1.2\"]],[\"label-uppercase\",[\"DM Sans\",\"12px\",\"500\",\"1.2\",\"0.15em\"]],[\"body-md\",[\"DM Sans\",\"14px\",\"400\",\"1.85\"]],[\"display\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"80px\",\"400\",\"1.1\",\"-0.02em\"]],[\"body-lg\",[\"DM Sans\",\"16px\",\"400\",\"1.8\",\"0.01em\"]]],[[\"element-gap-md\",\"16px\"],[\"section-gap-desktop\",\"80px\"],[\"grid-gutter\",\"24px\"],[\"element-gap-lg\",\"32px\"],[\"container-max\",\"1440px\"],[\"element-gap-sm\",\"8px\"],[\"section-gap-mobile\",\"48px\"]],null,\"dmSerifDisplay\",\"Dm Sans\",\"Dm Sans\"],2,1,null,[null,2,null,null,2],null,null,[\"assets/f84726af88af499598b78556bda4af11\",null,[\"Stitch Design System\",null,\"## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",[1,null,3,null,\"#c97b5a\",null,null,null,null,null,26,26,[[\"on_error\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"primary_fixed_dim\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed\",\"#1e1b17\"],[\"ink-light\",\"#5A4E48\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed_variant\",\"#4d4541\"],[\"surface_tint\",\"#8f4c2f\"],[\"surface\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"primary_container\",\"#aa6243\"],[\"surface_bright\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_primary_fixed\",\"#360f00\"],[\"background\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_primary_fixed_variant\",\"#72351a\"],[\"on_primary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"surface_container_lowest\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"tertiary\",\"#605b56\"],[\"border-subtle\",\"#E8DDD6\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed\",\"#201a17\"],[\"on_secondary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_primary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"surface_container_low\",\"#f6f3f0\"],[\"primary\",\"#8c4a2d\"],[\"inverse_primary\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"tertiary_container\",\"#79746e\"],[\"clay-dark\",\"#A85E40\"],[\"secondary_container\",\"#e9ddd7\"],[\"surface_container_high\",\"#eae8e5\"],[\"on_surface_variant\",\"#53433d\"],[\"inverse_surface\",\"#31302f\"],[\"surface_container\",\"#f0edea\"],[\"outline_variant\",\"#d9c2b9\"],[\"primary_fixed\",\"#ffdbcd\"],[\"error\",\"#ba1a1a\"],[\"tertiary_fixed_dim\",\"#ccc5bf\"],[\"tertiary_fixed\",\"#e9e1da\"],[\"outline\",\"#86736c\"],[\"surface_variant\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed_variant\",\"#4a4641\"],[\"error_container\",\"#ffdad6\"],[\"secondary_fixed_dim\",\"#cfc4be\"],[\"on_background\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"on_error_container\",\"#93000a\"],[\"on_secondary_container\",\"#69615c\"],[\"secondary_fixed\",\"#ece0da\"],[\"secondary\",\"#655d58\"],[\"on_tertiary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"inverse_on_surface\",\"#f3f0ed\"],[\"sage\",\"#D6E4D8\"],[\"surface_container_highest\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"on_tertiary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"surface_dim\",\"#dcdad7\"],[\"cream-warm\",\"#F2ECE6\"],[\"on_surface\",\"#1c1c1a\"]],\"---\\nname: Stitch Design System\\ncolors:\\n  surface: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-dim: '#dcdad7'\\n  surface-bright: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-container-lowest: '#ffffff'\\n  surface-container-low: '#f6f3f0'\\n  surface-container: '#f0edea'\\n  surface-container-high: '#eae8e5'\\n  surface-container-highest: '#e5e2df'\\n  on-surface: '#1c1c1a'\\n  on-surface-variant: '#53433d'\\n  inverse-surface: '#31302f'\\n  inverse-on-surface: '#f3f0ed'\\n  outline: '#86736c'\\n  outline-variant: '#d9c2b9'\\n  surface-tint: '#8f4c2f'\\n  primary: '#8c4a2d'\\n  on-primary: '#ffffff'\\n  primary-container: '#aa6243'\\n  on-primary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  inverse-primary: '#ffb597'\\n  secondary: '#655d58'\\n  on-secondary: '#ffffff'\\n  secondary-container: '#e9ddd7'\\n  on-secondary-container: '#69615c'\\n  tertiary: '#605b56'\\n  on-tertiary: '#ffffff'\\n  tertiary-container: '#79746e'\\n  on-tertiary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  error: '#ba1a1a'\\n  on-error: '#ffffff'\\n  error-container: '#ffdad6'\\n  on-error-container: '#93000a'\\n  primary-fixed: '#ffdbcd'\\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#ffb597'\\n  on-primary-fixed: '#360f00'\\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#72351a'\\n  secondary-fixed: '#ece0da'\\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#cfc4be'\\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#201a17'\\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#4d4541'\\n  tertiary-fixed: '#e9e1da'\\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#ccc5bf'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#1e1b17'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#4a4641'\\n  background: '#fcf9f6'\\n  on-background: '#1c1c1a'\\n  surface-variant: '#e5e2df'\\n  clay-dark: '#A85E40'\\n  ink-light: '#5A4E48'\\n  sage: '#D6E4D8'\\n  cream-warm: '#F2ECE6'\\n  border-subtle: '#E8DDD6'\\ntypography:\\n  display:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 80px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.1'\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\n  display-mobile:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 44px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n  headline-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 40px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  headline-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 32px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  body-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.8'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.01em\\n  body-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.85'\\n  label-uppercase:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 12px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.15em\\n  caption:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 11px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.4'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.05em\\nrounded:\\n  sm: 0.25rem\\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\\n  md: 0.75rem\\n  lg: 1rem\\n  xl: 1.5rem\\n  full: 9999px\\nspacing:\\n  container-max: 1440px\\n  section-gap-desktop: 80px\\n  section-gap-mobile: 48px\\n  grid-gutter: 24px\\n  element-gap-sm: 8px\\n  element-gap-md: 16px\\n  element-gap-lg: 32px\\n---\\n\\n## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Colors\\n\\nThe palette is inspired by natural, undyed fibers and earthen materials. \\n\\n- **Primary (Clay):** Used for call-to-actions, price accents, and critical indicators. It provides a warm, energetic contrast to the neutral base.\\n- **Secondary (Ink):** The foundation for readability. Used for all primary headings and body text to ensure high legibility against light backgrounds.\\n- **Tertiary (Blush):** A soft accent for secondary surfaces, card backgrounds, and promotional banners.\\n- **Neutral (Cream):** The primary canvas. This off-white base reduces eye strain and feels more premium and \\\"organic\\\" than pure white.\\n- **Named Colors:** **Sage** is reserved for eco-specific callouts or decorative elements to reinforce the sustainability narrative. **Ink-light** is used for secondary navigation and metadata to create visual hierarchy.\\n\\n## Typography\\n\\nThis design system employs a high-contrast pairing to balance heritage and modernity.\\n\\n- **Headlines:** Use **DM Serif Display**. Its graceful curves and high contrast evoke luxury and editorial authority. Use it sparingly for section headers and hero statements.\\n- **Body \\u0026 UI:** Use **DM Sans**. This low-contrast geometric sans-serif ensures maximum legibility across all digital interfaces. \\n- **The \\\"Label-Uppercase\\\" Style:** This is a signature brand element. Use it for navigation, small headings over titles, and button labels. The generous letter-spacing (tracking) is essential to achieving the \\\"premium\\\" feel.\\n- **Line Height:** Maintain a generous line height (1.8 - 1.85) for body text to reinforce the airy, spacious aesthetic.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Shapes\\n\\nThe shape language is \\\"Soft-Modern,\\\" utilizing rounded corners to evoke friendliness and comfort—qualities essential to a wearable fashion brand.\\n\\n- **Small Elements (Buttons, Tags, Pills):** Use `rounded-full` (pill-shaped). This creates a distinct interactive language that feels modern and approachable.\\n- **Medium Elements (Product Images, Floating Cards):** Use `rounded-lg` (1rem / 16px). This softens the grid without making it feel juvenile.\\n- **Large Elements (Banners, Testimonial Containers):** Use `rounded-xl` (1.5rem / 24px) to create \\\"enveloping\\\" containers that feel substantial and high-end.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",6,\"#c97b5a\",\"#2a2420\",\"#f5ede6\",\"#faf7f4\",2,[[\"display-mobile\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"44px\",\"400\",\"1.2\"]],[\"label-uppercase\",[\"DM Sans\",\"12px\",\"500\",\"1.2\",\"0.15em\"]],[\"body-lg\",[\"DM Sans\",\"16px\",\"400\",\"1.8\",\"0.01em\"]],[\"display\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"80px\",\"400\",\"1.1\",\"-0.02em\"]],[\"body-md\",[\"DM Sans\",\"14px\",\"400\",\"1.85\"]],[\"caption\",[\"DM Sans\",\"11px\",\"500\",\"1.4\",\"0.05em\"]],[\"headline-lg\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"40px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"headline-md\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"32px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]]],[[\"element-gap-md\",\"16px\"],[\"element-gap-lg\",\"32px\"],[\"grid-gutter\",\"24px\"],[\"section-gap-desktop\",\"80px\"],[\"section-gap-mobile\",\"48px\"],[\"element-gap-sm\",\"8px\"],[\"container-max\",\"1440px\"]],null,\"dmSerifDisplay\",\"Dm Sans\",\"Dm Sans\"]],1]],[[\"projects/18178749605532028059/files/5a9ac45e15f5484a9c9e3c5d3f3af472\",null,\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida/AP1WRLsmm1vAQefgmd9sQEwfa2bhPW8faOs602zqgIAGuaGEMQvLdBKiKzNgfMq6Wq2lg46-OSoaVuc55GufVXOuY39oFVvknrGFvHphQ7dFVaQRSVSqv6_BM-xco5v75rSreL-RGtX0I_R6LMDHmotNIHEJCNY-M7yDK8M3uR1_EEZ-5raK0h1KiO4X1Ris8WKPZAyC0HV4ll4Qvg00Qm59KrHYNwo22-H89eX9s9MhhfIWaJjLmfRQcGfB_SUk\"],[\"projects/18178749605532028059/files/3c3c2f1e600948d0a4bcb6d08392c9da\",null,\"https://contribution.usercontent.google.com/download?c\\u003dCgthaWRhX2NvZGVmeBJ8Eh1hcHBfY29tcGFuaW9uX2dlbmVyYXRlZF9maWxlcxpbCiVodG1sXzFmN2FlOTUwMGQ1ODQyZWVhZmEwZmZjM2QyOGY2NzMwEgsSBxDv9_C4jw8YAZIBJAoKcHJvamVjdF9pZBIWQhQxODE3ODc0OTYwNTUzMjAyODA1OQ\\u0026filename\\u003d\\u0026opi\\u003d89354086\",null,null,\"text/html\"],null,null,\"0fa9b5fe18ca494f987ccd3596b7d757\",\"figaro_agent\",\"2560\",\"9108\",\"Stitch — Trang chủ (Redesign)\",\"Thiết kế lại toàn bộ trang chủ dựa trên {{DATA:DOCUMENT:DOCUMENT_1}}. Cấu trúc trang: \\n1. Header: Logo Stitch tinh tế, menu điều hướng Hàng mới, Nữ, Nam, Bộ sưu tập, Sale. \\n2. Hero Section: Hình ảnh lớn (hero image) minh họa áo khoác wool, tiêu đề \\\"Mặc thứ bạn yêu thích\\\", mô tả về thời trang tối giản và vải organic, CTA \\\"Khám phá ngay\\\". \\n3. Marquee: Chạy chữ thông tin vận chuyển và cam kết vải organic. \\n4. New Arrivals: Lưới 4 sản phẩm với thẻ sản phẩm (product cards) hiện đại, có hiệu ứng hover, nút \\\"Thêm vào giỏ\\\" nhanh. \\n5. Categories: Layout bento box cho các danh mục Nữ, Nam, Phụ kiện, Sale, Eco Line. \\n6. Feature Strip: 3 cột thông tin về Giao hàng, Đổi trả, Bền vững. \\n7. Brand Story: Section chia 2 cột, một bên là hình ảnh minh họa chất liệu, một bên là câu chuyện \\\"Mỗi mũi chỉ là một cam kết\\\". \\n8. Testimonials: 3 thẻ nhận xét khách hàng với đánh giá 5 sao. \\n9. Newsletter: Section tối màu sang trọng để đăng ký nhận tin. \\n10. Footer: Thông tin liên hệ, liên kết mua sắm và hỗ trợ. \\nNgôn ngữ sử dụng: Tiếng Việt. Phong cách: Hiện đại, cao cấp, tối giản.\",\"projects/18178749605532028059/screens/0fa9b5fe18ca494f987ccd3596b7d757\",[1,null,3,null,\"#c97b5a\",null,null,null,null,null,26,26,[[\"on_primary_fixed\",\"#360f00\"],[\"primary_container\",\"#aa6243\"],[\"surface_bright\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"tertiary\",\"#605b56\"],[\"border-subtle\",\"#E8DDD6\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed\",\"#201a17\"],[\"on_secondary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"background\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_primary_fixed_variant\",\"#72351a\"],[\"on_primary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"surface_container_lowest\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_error\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"primary_fixed_dim\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed_variant\",\"#4d4541\"],[\"surface_tint\",\"#8f4c2f\"],[\"surface\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed\",\"#1e1b17\"],[\"ink-light\",\"#5A4E48\"],[\"clay-dark\",\"#A85E40\"],[\"secondary_container\",\"#e9ddd7\"],[\"on_surface_variant\",\"#53433d\"],[\"surface_container_high\",\"#eae8e5\"],[\"inverse_surface\",\"#31302f\"],[\"on_primary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"inverse_primary\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"tertiary_container\",\"#79746e\"],[\"surface_container_low\",\"#f6f3f0\"],[\"primary\",\"#8c4a2d\"],[\"on_error_container\",\"#93000a\"],[\"on_secondary_container\",\"#69615c\"],[\"secondary_fixed\",\"#ece0da\"],[\"error_container\",\"#ffdad6\"],[\"secondary_fixed_dim\",\"#cfc4be\"],[\"on_background\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"secondary\",\"#655d58\"],[\"outline_variant\",\"#d9c2b9\"],[\"primary_fixed\",\"#ffdbcd\"],[\"error\",\"#ba1a1a\"],[\"surface_container\",\"#f0edea\"],[\"tertiary_fixed_dim\",\"#ccc5bf\"],[\"tertiary_fixed\",\"#e9e1da\"],[\"outline\",\"#86736c\"],[\"surface_variant\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed_variant\",\"#4a4641\"],[\"cream-warm\",\"#F2ECE6\"],[\"surface_dim\",\"#dcdad7\"],[\"on_surface\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"sage\",\"#D6E4D8\"],[\"surface_container_highest\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"on_tertiary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"inverse_on_surface\",\"#f3f0ed\"],[\"on_tertiary_container\",\"#fffbff\"]],\"---\\nname: Stitch Design System\\ncolors:\\n  surface: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-dim: '#dcdad7'\\n  surface-bright: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-container-lowest: '#ffffff'\\n  surface-container-low: '#f6f3f0'\\n  surface-container: '#f0edea'\\n  surface-container-high: '#eae8e5'\\n  surface-container-highest: '#e5e2df'\\n  on-surface: '#1c1c1a'\\n  on-surface-variant: '#53433d'\\n  inverse-surface: '#31302f'\\n  inverse-on-surface: '#f3f0ed'\\n  outline: '#86736c'\\n  outline-variant: '#d9c2b9'\\n  surface-tint: '#8f4c2f'\\n  primary: '#8c4a2d'\\n  on-primary: '#ffffff'\\n  primary-container: '#aa6243'\\n  on-primary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  inverse-primary: '#ffb597'\\n  secondary: '#655d58'\\n  on-secondary: '#ffffff'\\n  secondary-container: '#e9ddd7'\\n  on-secondary-container: '#69615c'\\n  tertiary: '#605b56'\\n  on-tertiary: '#ffffff'\\n  tertiary-container: '#79746e'\\n  on-tertiary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  error: '#ba1a1a'\\n  on-error: '#ffffff'\\n  error-container: '#ffdad6'\\n  on-error-container: '#93000a'\\n  primary-fixed: '#ffdbcd'\\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#ffb597'\\n  on-primary-fixed: '#360f00'\\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#72351a'\\n  secondary-fixed: '#ece0da'\\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#cfc4be'\\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#201a17'\\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#4d4541'\\n  tertiary-fixed: '#e9e1da'\\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#ccc5bf'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#1e1b17'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#4a4641'\\n  background: '#fcf9f6'\\n  on-background: '#1c1c1a'\\n  surface-variant: '#e5e2df'\\n  clay-dark: '#A85E40'\\n  ink-light: '#5A4E48'\\n  sage: '#D6E4D8'\\n  cream-warm: '#F2ECE6'\\n  border-subtle: '#E8DDD6'\\ntypography:\\n  display:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 80px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.1'\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\n  display-mobile:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 44px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n  headline-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 40px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  headline-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 32px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  body-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.8'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.01em\\n  body-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.85'\\n  label-uppercase:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 12px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.15em\\n  caption:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 11px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.4'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.05em\\nrounded:\\n  sm: 0.25rem\\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\\n  md: 0.75rem\\n  lg: 1rem\\n  xl: 1.5rem\\n  full: 9999px\\nspacing:\\n  container-max: 1440px\\n  section-gap-desktop: 80px\\n  section-gap-mobile: 48px\\n  grid-gutter: 24px\\n  element-gap-sm: 8px\\n  element-gap-md: 16px\\n  element-gap-lg: 32px\\n---\\n\\n## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Colors\\n\\nThe palette is inspired by natural, undyed fibers and earthen materials. \\n\\n- **Primary (Clay):** Used for call-to-actions, price accents, and critical indicators. It provides a warm, energetic contrast to the neutral base.\\n- **Secondary (Ink):** The foundation for readability. Used for all primary headings and body text to ensure high legibility against light backgrounds.\\n- **Tertiary (Blush):** A soft accent for secondary surfaces, card backgrounds, and promotional banners.\\n- **Neutral (Cream):** The primary canvas. This off-white base reduces eye strain and feels more premium and \\\"organic\\\" than pure white.\\n- **Named Colors:** **Sage** is reserved for eco-specific callouts or decorative elements to reinforce the sustainability narrative. **Ink-light** is used for secondary navigation and metadata to create visual hierarchy.\\n\\n## Typography\\n\\nThis design system employs a high-contrast pairing to balance heritage and modernity.\\n\\n- **Headlines:** Use **DM Serif Display**. Its graceful curves and high contrast evoke luxury and editorial authority. Use it sparingly for section headers and hero statements.\\n- **Body \\u0026 UI:** Use **DM Sans**. This low-contrast geometric sans-serif ensures maximum legibility across all digital interfaces. \\n- **The \\\"Label-Uppercase\\\" Style:** This is a signature brand element. Use it for navigation, small headings over titles, and button labels. The generous letter-spacing (tracking) is essential to achieving the \\\"premium\\\" feel.\\n- **Line Height:** Maintain a generous line height (1.8 - 1.85) for body text to reinforce the airy, spacious aesthetic.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Shapes\\n\\nThe shape language is \\\"Soft-Modern,\\\" utilizing rounded corners to evoke friendliness and comfort—qualities essential to a wearable fashion brand.\\n\\n- **Small Elements (Buttons, Tags, Pills):** Use `rounded-full` (pill-shaped). This creates a distinct interactive language that feels modern and approachable.\\n- **Medium Elements (Product Images, Floating Cards):** Use `rounded-lg` (1rem / 16px). This softens the grid without making it feel juvenile.\\n- **Large Elements (Banners, Testimonial Containers):** Use `rounded-xl` (1.5rem / 24px) to create \\\"enveloping\\\" containers that feel substantial and high-end.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",6,\"#c97b5a\",\"#2a2420\",\"#f5ede6\",\"#faf7f4\",2,[[\"headline-lg\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"40px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"headline-md\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"32px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"caption\",[\"DM Sans\",\"11px\",\"500\",\"1.4\",\"0.05em\"]],[\"body-lg\",[\"DM Sans\",\"16px\",\"400\",\"1.8\",\"0.01em\"]],[\"body-md\",[\"DM Sans\",\"14px\",\"400\",\"1.85\"]],[\"display\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"80px\",\"400\",\"1.1\",\"-0.02em\"]],[\"display-mobile\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"44px\",\"400\",\"1.2\"]],[\"label-uppercase\",[\"DM Sans\",\"12px\",\"500\",\"1.2\",\"0.15em\"]]],[[\"element-gap-md\",\"16px\"],[\"element-gap-lg\",\"32px\"],[\"grid-gutter\",\"24px\"],[\"section-gap-desktop\",\"80px\"],[\"container-max\",\"1440px\"],[\"section-gap-mobile\",\"48px\"],[\"element-gap-sm\",\"8px\"]],null,\"dmSerifDisplay\",\"Dm Sans\",\"Dm Sans\"],2,1,null,[null,2,null,null,2],null,null,[\"assets/f84726af88af499598b78556bda4af11\",null,[\"Stitch Design System\",null,\"## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",[1,null,3,null,\"#c97b5a\",null,null,null,null,null,26,26,[[\"primary_container\",\"#aa6243\"],[\"surface_bright\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_primary_fixed\",\"#360f00\"],[\"on_primary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"surface_container_lowest\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"background\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_primary_fixed_variant\",\"#72351a\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed\",\"#201a17\"],[\"on_secondary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"border-subtle\",\"#E8DDD6\"],[\"tertiary\",\"#605b56\"],[\"primary_fixed_dim\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"on_error\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed\",\"#1e1b17\"],[\"ink-light\",\"#5A4E48\"],[\"surface_tint\",\"#8f4c2f\"],[\"surface\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed_variant\",\"#4d4541\"],[\"clay-dark\",\"#A85E40\"],[\"inverse_surface\",\"#31302f\"],[\"on_surface_variant\",\"#53433d\"],[\"surface_container_high\",\"#eae8e5\"],[\"secondary_container\",\"#e9ddd7\"],[\"on_primary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"surface_container_low\",\"#f6f3f0\"],[\"primary\",\"#8c4a2d\"],[\"inverse_primary\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"tertiary_container\",\"#79746e\"],[\"secondary_fixed_dim\",\"#cfc4be\"],[\"on_background\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"error_container\",\"#ffdad6\"],[\"secondary_fixed\",\"#ece0da\"],[\"on_secondary_container\",\"#69615c\"],[\"on_error_container\",\"#93000a\"],[\"secondary\",\"#655d58\"],[\"surface_container\",\"#f0edea\"],[\"primary_fixed\",\"#ffdbcd\"],[\"error\",\"#ba1a1a\"],[\"outline_variant\",\"#d9c2b9\"],[\"surface_variant\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed_variant\",\"#4a4641\"],[\"tertiary_fixed_dim\",\"#ccc5bf\"],[\"tertiary_fixed\",\"#e9e1da\"],[\"outline\",\"#86736c\"],[\"surface_dim\",\"#dcdad7\"],[\"cream-warm\",\"#F2ECE6\"],[\"on_surface\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"inverse_on_surface\",\"#f3f0ed\"],[\"on_tertiary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"surface_container_highest\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"sage\",\"#D6E4D8\"],[\"on_tertiary_container\",\"#fffbff\"]],\"---\\nname: Stitch Design System\\ncolors:\\n  surface: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-dim: '#dcdad7'\\n  surface-bright: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-container-lowest: '#ffffff'\\n  surface-container-low: '#f6f3f0'\\n  surface-container: '#f0edea'\\n  surface-container-high: '#eae8e5'\\n  surface-container-highest: '#e5e2df'\\n  on-surface: '#1c1c1a'\\n  on-surface-variant: '#53433d'\\n  inverse-surface: '#31302f'\\n  inverse-on-surface: '#f3f0ed'\\n  outline: '#86736c'\\n  outline-variant: '#d9c2b9'\\n  surface-tint: '#8f4c2f'\\n  primary: '#8c4a2d'\\n  on-primary: '#ffffff'\\n  primary-container: '#aa6243'\\n  on-primary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  inverse-primary: '#ffb597'\\n  secondary: '#655d58'\\n  on-secondary: '#ffffff'\\n  secondary-container: '#e9ddd7'\\n  on-secondary-container: '#69615c'\\n  tertiary: '#605b56'\\n  on-tertiary: '#ffffff'\\n  tertiary-container: '#79746e'\\n  on-tertiary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  error: '#ba1a1a'\\n  on-error: '#ffffff'\\n  error-container: '#ffdad6'\\n  on-error-container: '#93000a'\\n  primary-fixed: '#ffdbcd'\\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#ffb597'\\n  on-primary-fixed: '#360f00'\\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#72351a'\\n  secondary-fixed: '#ece0da'\\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#cfc4be'\\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#201a17'\\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#4d4541'\\n  tertiary-fixed: '#e9e1da'\\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#ccc5bf'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#1e1b17'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#4a4641'\\n  background: '#fcf9f6'\\n  on-background: '#1c1c1a'\\n  surface-variant: '#e5e2df'\\n  clay-dark: '#A85E40'\\n  ink-light: '#5A4E48'\\n  sage: '#D6E4D8'\\n  cream-warm: '#F2ECE6'\\n  border-subtle: '#E8DDD6'\\ntypography:\\n  display:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 80px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.1'\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\n  display-mobile:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 44px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n  headline-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 40px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  headline-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 32px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  body-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.8'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.01em\\n  body-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.85'\\n  label-uppercase:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 12px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.15em\\n  caption:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 11px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.4'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.05em\\nrounded:\\n  sm: 0.25rem\\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\\n  md: 0.75rem\\n  lg: 1rem\\n  xl: 1.5rem\\n  full: 9999px\\nspacing:\\n  container-max: 1440px\\n  section-gap-desktop: 80px\\n  section-gap-mobile: 48px\\n  grid-gutter: 24px\\n  element-gap-sm: 8px\\n  element-gap-md: 16px\\n  element-gap-lg: 32px\\n---\\n\\n## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Colors\\n\\nThe palette is inspired by natural, undyed fibers and earthen materials. \\n\\n- **Primary (Clay):** Used for call-to-actions, price accents, and critical indicators. It provides a warm, energetic contrast to the neutral base.\\n- **Secondary (Ink):** The foundation for readability. Used for all primary headings and body text to ensure high legibility against light backgrounds.\\n- **Tertiary (Blush):** A soft accent for secondary surfaces, card backgrounds, and promotional banners.\\n- **Neutral (Cream):** The primary canvas. This off-white base reduces eye strain and feels more premium and \\\"organic\\\" than pure white.\\n- **Named Colors:** **Sage** is reserved for eco-specific callouts or decorative elements to reinforce the sustainability narrative. **Ink-light** is used for secondary navigation and metadata to create visual hierarchy.\\n\\n## Typography\\n\\nThis design system employs a high-contrast pairing to balance heritage and modernity.\\n\\n- **Headlines:** Use **DM Serif Display**. Its graceful curves and high contrast evoke luxury and editorial authority. Use it sparingly for section headers and hero statements.\\n- **Body \\u0026 UI:** Use **DM Sans**. This low-contrast geometric sans-serif ensures maximum legibility across all digital interfaces. \\n- **The \\\"Label-Uppercase\\\" Style:** This is a signature brand element. Use it for navigation, small headings over titles, and button labels. The generous letter-spacing (tracking) is essential to achieving the \\\"premium\\\" feel.\\n- **Line Height:** Maintain a generous line height (1.8 - 1.85) for body text to reinforce the airy, spacious aesthetic.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Shapes\\n\\nThe shape language is \\\"Soft-Modern,\\\" utilizing rounded corners to evoke friendliness and comfort—qualities essential to a wearable fashion brand.\\n\\n- **Small Elements (Buttons, Tags, Pills):** Use `rounded-full` (pill-shaped). This creates a distinct interactive language that feels modern and approachable.\\n- **Medium Elements (Product Images, Floating Cards):** Use `rounded-lg` (1rem / 16px). This softens the grid without making it feel juvenile.\\n- **Large Elements (Banners, Testimonial Containers):** Use `rounded-xl` (1.5rem / 24px) to create \\\"enveloping\\\" containers that feel substantial and high-end.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",6,\"#c97b5a\",\"#2a2420\",\"#f5ede6\",\"#faf7f4\",2,[[\"body-lg\",[\"DM Sans\",\"16px\",\"400\",\"1.8\",\"0.01em\"]],[\"body-md\",[\"DM Sans\",\"14px\",\"400\",\"1.85\"]],[\"display\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"80px\",\"400\",\"1.1\",\"-0.02em\"]],[\"display-mobile\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"44px\",\"400\",\"1.2\"]],[\"label-uppercase\",[\"DM Sans\",\"12px\",\"500\",\"1.2\",\"0.15em\"]],[\"headline-lg\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"40px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"headline-md\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"32px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"caption\",[\"DM Sans\",\"11px\",\"500\",\"1.4\",\"0.05em\"]]],[[\"container-max\",\"1440px\"],[\"element-gap-sm\",\"8px\"],[\"section-gap-mobile\",\"48px\"],[\"grid-gutter\",\"24px\"],[\"section-gap-desktop\",\"80px\"],[\"element-gap-lg\",\"32px\"],[\"element-gap-md\",\"16px\"]],null,\"dmSerifDisplay\",\"Dm Sans\",\"Dm Sans\"]],1]],[[\"projects/18178749605532028059/files/6773971968181820280\",null,\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida/AP1WRLtuhEuvpCHTCqvfwaiHprf_Z4DoxBUzVU9UGgDjG8VaSiEWeE4oIBAfDTeTd_aQ_4nZDuB3iKtQJ8lIOTUq_uTHGI5MfPDHwzf9AcpVKE28nq-C-CEaV0ZVcWXBWaOKFxmjvAsutXl1uWLeLS2yFuTH7e6u3TmLzwLj75frznt3oggQXnQRuJVkkheH-jAuWJgiVxqCP2u7cKScEKp2htQlcrflmNu-5n4gdsGhSqZ4VpyFAJPLzAolhkhx\"],[\"projects/18178749605532028059/files/1340684978942504931\",null,\"https://contribution.usercontent.google.com/download?c\\u003dCgthaWRhX2NvZGVmeBJ8Eh1hcHBfY29tcGFuaW9uX2dlbmVyYXRlZF9maWxlcxpbCiVodG1sXzAwMDY1M2UxNzhmOGMyYzIwMzgzOWM2ZGZmMzFkMWY0EgsSBxDv9_C4jw8YAZIBJAoKcHJvamVjdF9pZBIWQhQxODE3ODc0OTYwNTUzMjAyODA1OQ\\u0026filename\\u003d\\u0026opi\\u003d89354086\",null,null,\"text/html\"],null,null,\"41f8a3fd15434462ae04c90afe352fd1\",\"figaro_agent\",\"2560\",\"3820\",\"Stitch — Danh mục sản phẩm\",\"Thiết kế trang danh mục sản phẩm (Product Listing Page) cho Stitch. \\nBao gồm:\\n1. Header với Breadcrumb và Tiêu đề danh mục lớn (vd: \\\"Bộ sưu tập Nữ\\\").\\n2. Thanh bộ lọc bên trái (Sidebar Filter) với các tùy chọn: Phân loại (Áo, Quần, Đầm), Kích cỡ (S, M, L, XL), Màu sắc (Neutral, Clay, Sage, Ink), Khoảng giá.\\n3. Thanh công cụ phía trên lưới sản phẩm: Tổng số sản phẩm và nút Sắp xếp (Mới nhất, Giá thấp đến cao, v.v.).\\n4. Lưới sản phẩm (Product Grid): 3 hoặc 4 cột. Mỗi thẻ sản phẩm bao gồm ảnh sản phẩm, nhãn (Mới/Eco/Sale), tên sản phẩm, giá, lựa chọn màu sắc (color swatches) và nút thêm nhanh vào giỏ hàng khi di chuột.\\n5. Pagination (Phân trang) ở cuối lưới.\\n6. Đồng nhất phong cách thiết kế hiện đại, tối giản, sử dụng các biến màu từ design system {{DATA:DESIGN_SYSTEM:DESIGN_SYSTEM_1}}.\\n7. Ngôn ngữ: Tiếng Việt.\",\"projects/18178749605532028059/screens/41f8a3fd15434462ae04c90afe352fd1\",[1,null,3,null,\"#c97b5a\",null,null,null,null,null,26,26,[[\"on_surface\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"surface_dim\",\"#dcdad7\"],[\"cream-warm\",\"#F2ECE6\"],[\"on_tertiary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"inverse_on_surface\",\"#f3f0ed\"],[\"on_tertiary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"surface_container_highest\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"sage\",\"#D6E4D8\"],[\"secondary\",\"#655d58\"],[\"secondary_fixed_dim\",\"#cfc4be\"],[\"on_background\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"error_container\",\"#ffdad6\"],[\"secondary_fixed\",\"#ece0da\"],[\"on_secondary_container\",\"#69615c\"],[\"on_error_container\",\"#93000a\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed_variant\",\"#4a4641\"],[\"surface_variant\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"outline\",\"#86736c\"],[\"tertiary_fixed\",\"#e9e1da\"],[\"tertiary_fixed_dim\",\"#ccc5bf\"],[\"surface_container\",\"#f0edea\"],[\"primary_fixed\",\"#ffdbcd\"],[\"error\",\"#ba1a1a\"],[\"outline_variant\",\"#d9c2b9\"],[\"surface_container_high\",\"#eae8e5\"],[\"on_surface_variant\",\"#53433d\"],[\"inverse_surface\",\"#31302f\"],[\"secondary_container\",\"#e9ddd7\"],[\"clay-dark\",\"#A85E40\"],[\"surface_container_low\",\"#f6f3f0\"],[\"primary\",\"#8c4a2d\"],[\"inverse_primary\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"tertiary_container\",\"#79746e\"],[\"on_primary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_primary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"surface_container_lowest\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_primary_fixed_variant\",\"#72351a\"],[\"background\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed\",\"#201a17\"],[\"on_secondary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"tertiary\",\"#605b56\"],[\"border-subtle\",\"#E8DDD6\"],[\"primary_container\",\"#aa6243\"],[\"surface_bright\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_primary_fixed\",\"#360f00\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed\",\"#1e1b17\"],[\"ink-light\",\"#5A4E48\"],[\"surface_tint\",\"#8f4c2f\"],[\"surface\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed_variant\",\"#4d4541\"],[\"primary_fixed_dim\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"on_error\",\"#ffffff\"]],\"---\\nname: Stitch Design System\\ncolors:\\n  surface: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-dim: '#dcdad7'\\n  surface-bright: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-container-lowest: '#ffffff'\\n  surface-container-low: '#f6f3f0'\\n  surface-container: '#f0edea'\\n  surface-container-high: '#eae8e5'\\n  surface-container-highest: '#e5e2df'\\n  on-surface: '#1c1c1a'\\n  on-surface-variant: '#53433d'\\n  inverse-surface: '#31302f'\\n  inverse-on-surface: '#f3f0ed'\\n  outline: '#86736c'\\n  outline-variant: '#d9c2b9'\\n  surface-tint: '#8f4c2f'\\n  primary: '#8c4a2d'\\n  on-primary: '#ffffff'\\n  primary-container: '#aa6243'\\n  on-primary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  inverse-primary: '#ffb597'\\n  secondary: '#655d58'\\n  on-secondary: '#ffffff'\\n  secondary-container: '#e9ddd7'\\n  on-secondary-container: '#69615c'\\n  tertiary: '#605b56'\\n  on-tertiary: '#ffffff'\\n  tertiary-container: '#79746e'\\n  on-tertiary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  error: '#ba1a1a'\\n  on-error: '#ffffff'\\n  error-container: '#ffdad6'\\n  on-error-container: '#93000a'\\n  primary-fixed: '#ffdbcd'\\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#ffb597'\\n  on-primary-fixed: '#360f00'\\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#72351a'\\n  secondary-fixed: '#ece0da'\\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#cfc4be'\\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#201a17'\\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#4d4541'\\n  tertiary-fixed: '#e9e1da'\\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#ccc5bf'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#1e1b17'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#4a4641'\\n  background: '#fcf9f6'\\n  on-background: '#1c1c1a'\\n  surface-variant: '#e5e2df'\\n  clay-dark: '#A85E40'\\n  ink-light: '#5A4E48'\\n  sage: '#D6E4D8'\\n  cream-warm: '#F2ECE6'\\n  border-subtle: '#E8DDD6'\\ntypography:\\n  display:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 80px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.1'\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\n  display-mobile:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 44px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n  headline-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 40px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  headline-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 32px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  body-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.8'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.01em\\n  body-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.85'\\n  label-uppercase:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 12px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.15em\\n  caption:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 11px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.4'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.05em\\nrounded:\\n  sm: 0.25rem\\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\\n  md: 0.75rem\\n  lg: 1rem\\n  xl: 1.5rem\\n  full: 9999px\\nspacing:\\n  container-max: 1440px\\n  section-gap-desktop: 80px\\n  section-gap-mobile: 48px\\n  grid-gutter: 24px\\n  element-gap-sm: 8px\\n  element-gap-md: 16px\\n  element-gap-lg: 32px\\n---\\n\\n## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Colors\\n\\nThe palette is inspired by natural, undyed fibers and earthen materials. \\n\\n- **Primary (Clay):** Used for call-to-actions, price accents, and critical indicators. It provides a warm, energetic contrast to the neutral base.\\n- **Secondary (Ink):** The foundation for readability. Used for all primary headings and body text to ensure high legibility against light backgrounds.\\n- **Tertiary (Blush):** A soft accent for secondary surfaces, card backgrounds, and promotional banners.\\n- **Neutral (Cream):** The primary canvas. This off-white base reduces eye strain and feels more premium and \\\"organic\\\" than pure white.\\n- **Named Colors:** **Sage** is reserved for eco-specific callouts or decorative elements to reinforce the sustainability narrative. **Ink-light** is used for secondary navigation and metadata to create visual hierarchy.\\n\\n## Typography\\n\\nThis design system employs a high-contrast pairing to balance heritage and modernity.\\n\\n- **Headlines:** Use **DM Serif Display**. Its graceful curves and high contrast evoke luxury and editorial authority. Use it sparingly for section headers and hero statements.\\n- **Body \\u0026 UI:** Use **DM Sans**. This low-contrast geometric sans-serif ensures maximum legibility across all digital interfaces. \\n- **The \\\"Label-Uppercase\\\" Style:** This is a signature brand element. Use it for navigation, small headings over titles, and button labels. The generous letter-spacing (tracking) is essential to achieving the \\\"premium\\\" feel.\\n- **Line Height:** Maintain a generous line height (1.8 - 1.85) for body text to reinforce the airy, spacious aesthetic.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Shapes\\n\\nThe shape language is \\\"Soft-Modern,\\\" utilizing rounded corners to evoke friendliness and comfort—qualities essential to a wearable fashion brand.\\n\\n- **Small Elements (Buttons, Tags, Pills):** Use `rounded-full` (pill-shaped). This creates a distinct interactive language that feels modern and approachable.\\n- **Medium Elements (Product Images, Floating Cards):** Use `rounded-lg` (1rem / 16px). This softens the grid without making it feel juvenile.\\n- **Large Elements (Banners, Testimonial Containers):** Use `rounded-xl` (1.5rem / 24px) to create \\\"enveloping\\\" containers that feel substantial and high-end.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",6,\"#c97b5a\",\"#2a2420\",\"#f5ede6\",\"#faf7f4\",2,[[\"display-mobile\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"44px\",\"400\",\"1.2\"]],[\"label-uppercase\",[\"DM Sans\",\"12px\",\"500\",\"1.2\",\"0.15em\"]],[\"body-lg\",[\"DM Sans\",\"16px\",\"400\",\"1.8\",\"0.01em\"]],[\"display\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"80px\",\"400\",\"1.1\",\"-0.02em\"]],[\"body-md\",[\"DM Sans\",\"14px\",\"400\",\"1.85\"]],[\"caption\",[\"DM Sans\",\"11px\",\"500\",\"1.4\",\"0.05em\"]],[\"headline-lg\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"40px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"headline-md\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"32px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]]],[[\"element-gap-md\",\"16px\"],[\"container-max\",\"1440px\"],[\"element-gap-sm\",\"8px\"],[\"section-gap-mobile\",\"48px\"],[\"section-gap-desktop\",\"80px\"],[\"grid-gutter\",\"24px\"],[\"element-gap-lg\",\"32px\"]],null,\"dmSerifDisplay\",\"Dm Sans\",\"Dm Sans\"],2,1,null,[null,2,null,null,2,2],null,null,[\"assets/f84726af88af499598b78556bda4af11\",null,[\"Stitch Design System\",null,\"## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",[1,null,3,null,\"#c97b5a\",null,null,null,null,null,26,26,[[\"error_container\",\"#ffdad6\"],[\"secondary_fixed_dim\",\"#cfc4be\"],[\"on_background\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"on_error_container\",\"#93000a\"],[\"on_secondary_container\",\"#69615c\"],[\"secondary_fixed\",\"#ece0da\"],[\"secondary\",\"#655d58\"],[\"surface_container\",\"#f0edea\"],[\"outline_variant\",\"#d9c2b9\"],[\"primary_fixed\",\"#ffdbcd\"],[\"error\",\"#ba1a1a\"],[\"tertiary_fixed_dim\",\"#ccc5bf\"],[\"tertiary_fixed\",\"#e9e1da\"],[\"outline\",\"#86736c\"],[\"surface_variant\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed_variant\",\"#4a4641\"],[\"surface_dim\",\"#dcdad7\"],[\"cream-warm\",\"#F2ECE6\"],[\"on_surface\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"on_tertiary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"inverse_on_surface\",\"#f3f0ed\"],[\"sage\",\"#D6E4D8\"],[\"surface_container_highest\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"on_tertiary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"primary_container\",\"#aa6243\"],[\"surface_bright\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_primary_fixed\",\"#360f00\"],[\"background\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_primary_fixed_variant\",\"#72351a\"],[\"on_primary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"surface_container_lowest\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"tertiary\",\"#605b56\"],[\"border-subtle\",\"#E8DDD6\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed\",\"#201a17\"],[\"on_secondary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_error\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"primary_fixed_dim\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed\",\"#1e1b17\"],[\"ink-light\",\"#5A4E48\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed_variant\",\"#4d4541\"],[\"surface_tint\",\"#8f4c2f\"],[\"surface\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"clay-dark\",\"#A85E40\"],[\"secondary_container\",\"#e9ddd7\"],[\"inverse_surface\",\"#31302f\"],[\"on_surface_variant\",\"#53433d\"],[\"surface_container_high\",\"#eae8e5\"],[\"on_primary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"primary\",\"#8c4a2d\"],[\"surface_container_low\",\"#f6f3f0\"],[\"inverse_primary\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"tertiary_container\",\"#79746e\"]],\"---\\nname: Stitch Design System\\ncolors:\\n  surface: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-dim: '#dcdad7'\\n  surface-bright: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-container-lowest: '#ffffff'\\n  surface-container-low: '#f6f3f0'\\n  surface-container: '#f0edea'\\n  surface-container-high: '#eae8e5'\\n  surface-container-highest: '#e5e2df'\\n  on-surface: '#1c1c1a'\\n  on-surface-variant: '#53433d'\\n  inverse-surface: '#31302f'\\n  inverse-on-surface: '#f3f0ed'\\n  outline: '#86736c'\\n  outline-variant: '#d9c2b9'\\n  surface-tint: '#8f4c2f'\\n  primary: '#8c4a2d'\\n  on-primary: '#ffffff'\\n  primary-container: '#aa6243'\\n  on-primary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  inverse-primary: '#ffb597'\\n  secondary: '#655d58'\\n  on-secondary: '#ffffff'\\n  secondary-container: '#e9ddd7'\\n  on-secondary-container: '#69615c'\\n  tertiary: '#605b56'\\n  on-tertiary: '#ffffff'\\n  tertiary-container: '#79746e'\\n  on-tertiary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  error: '#ba1a1a'\\n  on-error: '#ffffff'\\n  error-container: '#ffdad6'\\n  on-error-container: '#93000a'\\n  primary-fixed: '#ffdbcd'\\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#ffb597'\\n  on-primary-fixed: '#360f00'\\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#72351a'\\n  secondary-fixed: '#ece0da'\\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#cfc4be'\\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#201a17'\\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#4d4541'\\n  tertiary-fixed: '#e9e1da'\\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#ccc5bf'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#1e1b17'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#4a4641'\\n  background: '#fcf9f6'\\n  on-background: '#1c1c1a'\\n  surface-variant: '#e5e2df'\\n  clay-dark: '#A85E40'\\n  ink-light: '#5A4E48'\\n  sage: '#D6E4D8'\\n  cream-warm: '#F2ECE6'\\n  border-subtle: '#E8DDD6'\\ntypography:\\n  display:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 80px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.1'\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\n  display-mobile:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 44px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n  headline-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 40px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  headline-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 32px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  body-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.8'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.01em\\n  body-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.85'\\n  label-uppercase:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 12px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.15em\\n  caption:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 11px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.4'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.05em\\nrounded:\\n  sm: 0.25rem\\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\\n  md: 0.75rem\\n  lg: 1rem\\n  xl: 1.5rem\\n  full: 9999px\\nspacing:\\n  container-max: 1440px\\n  section-gap-desktop: 80px\\n  section-gap-mobile: 48px\\n  grid-gutter: 24px\\n  element-gap-sm: 8px\\n  element-gap-md: 16px\\n  element-gap-lg: 32px\\n---\\n\\n## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Colors\\n\\nThe palette is inspired by natural, undyed fibers and earthen materials. \\n\\n- **Primary (Clay):** Used for call-to-actions, price accents, and critical indicators. It provides a warm, energetic contrast to the neutral base.\\n- **Secondary (Ink):** The foundation for readability. Used for all primary headings and body text to ensure high legibility against light backgrounds.\\n- **Tertiary (Blush):** A soft accent for secondary surfaces, card backgrounds, and promotional banners.\\n- **Neutral (Cream):** The primary canvas. This off-white base reduces eye strain and feels more premium and \\\"organic\\\" than pure white.\\n- **Named Colors:** **Sage** is reserved for eco-specific callouts or decorative elements to reinforce the sustainability narrative. **Ink-light** is used for secondary navigation and metadata to create visual hierarchy.\\n\\n## Typography\\n\\nThis design system employs a high-contrast pairing to balance heritage and modernity.\\n\\n- **Headlines:** Use **DM Serif Display**. Its graceful curves and high contrast evoke luxury and editorial authority. Use it sparingly for section headers and hero statements.\\n- **Body \\u0026 UI:** Use **DM Sans**. This low-contrast geometric sans-serif ensures maximum legibility across all digital interfaces. \\n- **The \\\"Label-Uppercase\\\" Style:** This is a signature brand element. Use it for navigation, small headings over titles, and button labels. The generous letter-spacing (tracking) is essential to achieving the \\\"premium\\\" feel.\\n- **Line Height:** Maintain a generous line height (1.8 - 1.85) for body text to reinforce the airy, spacious aesthetic.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Shapes\\n\\nThe shape language is \\\"Soft-Modern,\\\" utilizing rounded corners to evoke friendliness and comfort—qualities essential to a wearable fashion brand.\\n\\n- **Small Elements (Buttons, Tags, Pills):** Use `rounded-full` (pill-shaped). This creates a distinct interactive language that feels modern and approachable.\\n- **Medium Elements (Product Images, Floating Cards):** Use `rounded-lg` (1rem / 16px). This softens the grid without making it feel juvenile.\\n- **Large Elements (Banners, Testimonial Containers):** Use `rounded-xl` (1.5rem / 24px) to create \\\"enveloping\\\" containers that feel substantial and high-end.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",6,\"#c97b5a\",\"#2a2420\",\"#f5ede6\",\"#faf7f4\",2,[[\"display-mobile\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"44px\",\"400\",\"1.2\"]],[\"label-uppercase\",[\"DM Sans\",\"12px\",\"500\",\"1.2\",\"0.15em\"]],[\"body-lg\",[\"DM Sans\",\"16px\",\"400\",\"1.8\",\"0.01em\"]],[\"body-md\",[\"DM Sans\",\"14px\",\"400\",\"1.85\"]],[\"display\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"80px\",\"400\",\"1.1\",\"-0.02em\"]],[\"headline-lg\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"40px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"headline-md\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"32px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"caption\",[\"DM Sans\",\"11px\",\"500\",\"1.4\",\"0.05em\"]]],[[\"container-max\",\"1440px\"],[\"element-gap-sm\",\"8px\"],[\"section-gap-mobile\",\"48px\"],[\"element-gap-lg\",\"32px\"],[\"grid-gutter\",\"24px\"],[\"section-gap-desktop\",\"80px\"],[\"element-gap-md\",\"16px\"]],null,\"dmSerifDisplay\",\"Dm Sans\",\"Dm Sans\"]],1]],[[\"projects/18178749605532028059/files/12849683628858570999\",null,\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida/AP1WRLseRN2pBgza_4aeezf7Tgg6NXSP5zy_MEBcZgNwbEfYEvqKPxv0yXa-iLRqYJmNhyJfp9eo4XtOhMVep8m0DNHc6dalI3tsO4GcoDEAleD8nfWuuG-0xkQlQNq3M7l8e7o1Auz4wke1HUVBBNFmPmX8gf3wLng6Ya277Kb2e7fntX6uVZo0X4iwDzfYPSJu6FVfzgbS5WTSg-ZVxpifXERLKmH4mtNaPPRTLLq7hweN33ObfL93Sg6axIHF\"],[\"projects/18178749605532028059/files/9440141955663708272\",null,\"https://contribution.usercontent.google.com/download?c\\u003dCgthaWRhX2NvZGVmeBJ8Eh1hcHBfY29tcGFuaW9uX2dlbmVyYXRlZF9maWxlcxpbCiVodG1sXzAwMDY1M2UxMDJhNTc3N2IwMWVlNGU2YTU0Mzg3MjNhEgsSBxDv9_C4jw8YAZIBJAoKcHJvamVjdF9pZBIWQhQxODE3ODc0OTYwNTUzMjAyODA1OQ\\u0026filename\\u003d\\u0026opi\\u003d89354086\",null,null,\"text/html\"],null,null,\"a98fa8e25f0248d2a53e9a15ee498c64\",\"HatterAgent\",\"2560\",\"12798\",\"Stitch — Trang chủ (Updated with Search, Best Sellers \\u0026 Sale)\",\"Update the screen to include:\\n1. Search and Quick Filters: Add a refined search bar in the header or just below the hero. Add a horizontal list of quick filter tags (e.g., 'Tất cả', 'Áo khoác', 'Váy', 'Nam', 'Sale').\\n2. Best Sellers Section: Add a new section titled 'Sản phẩm bán chạy' with a product grid (3-4 items) featuring high-quality product images, names, and prices.\\n3. Sale/Promotions Section: Add a 'Sản phẩm khuyến mãi' section with prominent sale badges (e.g., -20%, -40%) on product cards, highlighting the original and discounted prices.\\n4. Maintain visual consistency with the existing Clay (#c97b5a) accent color, Serif typography for headings, and the established spacing system.\\n5. Ensure the design remains clean and high-end.\",\"projects/18178749605532028059/screens/a98fa8e25f0248d2a53e9a15ee498c64\",[1,null,3,null,\"#c97b5a\",null,null,null,null,null,26,26,[[\"surface_container_highest\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"sage\",\"#D6E4D8\"],[\"inverse_on_surface\",\"#f3f0ed\"],[\"on_tertiary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_tertiary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"cream-warm\",\"#F2ECE6\"],[\"surface_dim\",\"#dcdad7\"],[\"on_surface\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"error\",\"#ba1a1a\"],[\"primary_fixed\",\"#ffdbcd\"],[\"outline_variant\",\"#d9c2b9\"],[\"surface_container\",\"#f0edea\"],[\"surface_variant\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed_variant\",\"#4a4641\"],[\"tertiary_fixed_dim\",\"#ccc5bf\"],[\"tertiary_fixed\",\"#e9e1da\"],[\"outline\",\"#86736c\"],[\"on_secondary_container\",\"#69615c\"],[\"secondary_fixed\",\"#ece0da\"],[\"on_error_container\",\"#93000a\"],[\"on_background\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"secondary_fixed_dim\",\"#cfc4be\"],[\"error_container\",\"#ffdad6\"],[\"secondary\",\"#655d58\"],[\"on_primary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"tertiary_container\",\"#79746e\"],[\"inverse_primary\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"primary\",\"#8c4a2d\"],[\"surface_container_low\",\"#f6f3f0\"],[\"clay-dark\",\"#A85E40\"],[\"surface_container_high\",\"#eae8e5\"],[\"on_surface_variant\",\"#53433d\"],[\"inverse_surface\",\"#31302f\"],[\"secondary_container\",\"#e9ddd7\"],[\"primary_fixed_dim\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"on_error\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"surface\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"surface_tint\",\"#8f4c2f\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed_variant\",\"#4d4541\"],[\"ink-light\",\"#5A4E48\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed\",\"#1e1b17\"],[\"on_primary_fixed\",\"#360f00\"],[\"surface_bright\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"primary_container\",\"#aa6243\"],[\"on_secondary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed\",\"#201a17\"],[\"tertiary\",\"#605b56\"],[\"border-subtle\",\"#E8DDD6\"],[\"surface_container_lowest\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_primary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"on_primary_fixed_variant\",\"#72351a\"],[\"background\",\"#fcf9f6\"]],\"---\\nname: Stitch Design System\\ncolors:\\n  surface: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-dim: '#dcdad7'\\n  surface-bright: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-container-lowest: '#ffffff'\\n  surface-container-low: '#f6f3f0'\\n  surface-container: '#f0edea'\\n  surface-container-high: '#eae8e5'\\n  surface-container-highest: '#e5e2df'\\n  on-surface: '#1c1c1a'\\n  on-surface-variant: '#53433d'\\n  inverse-surface: '#31302f'\\n  inverse-on-surface: '#f3f0ed'\\n  outline: '#86736c'\\n  outline-variant: '#d9c2b9'\\n  surface-tint: '#8f4c2f'\\n  primary: '#8c4a2d'\\n  on-primary: '#ffffff'\\n  primary-container: '#aa6243'\\n  on-primary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  inverse-primary: '#ffb597'\\n  secondary: '#655d58'\\n  on-secondary: '#ffffff'\\n  secondary-container: '#e9ddd7'\\n  on-secondary-container: '#69615c'\\n  tertiary: '#605b56'\\n  on-tertiary: '#ffffff'\\n  tertiary-container: '#79746e'\\n  on-tertiary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  error: '#ba1a1a'\\n  on-error: '#ffffff'\\n  error-container: '#ffdad6'\\n  on-error-container: '#93000a'\\n  primary-fixed: '#ffdbcd'\\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#ffb597'\\n  on-primary-fixed: '#360f00'\\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#72351a'\\n  secondary-fixed: '#ece0da'\\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#cfc4be'\\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#201a17'\\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#4d4541'\\n  tertiary-fixed: '#e9e1da'\\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#ccc5bf'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#1e1b17'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#4a4641'\\n  background: '#fcf9f6'\\n  on-background: '#1c1c1a'\\n  surface-variant: '#e5e2df'\\n  clay-dark: '#A85E40'\\n  ink-light: '#5A4E48'\\n  sage: '#D6E4D8'\\n  cream-warm: '#F2ECE6'\\n  border-subtle: '#E8DDD6'\\ntypography:\\n  display:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 80px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.1'\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\n  display-mobile:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 44px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n  headline-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 40px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  headline-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 32px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  body-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.8'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.01em\\n  body-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.85'\\n  label-uppercase:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 12px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.15em\\n  caption:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 11px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.4'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.05em\\nrounded:\\n  sm: 0.25rem\\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\\n  md: 0.75rem\\n  lg: 1rem\\n  xl: 1.5rem\\n  full: 9999px\\nspacing:\\n  container-max: 1440px\\n  section-gap-desktop: 80px\\n  section-gap-mobile: 48px\\n  grid-gutter: 24px\\n  element-gap-sm: 8px\\n  element-gap-md: 16px\\n  element-gap-lg: 32px\\n---\\n\\n## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Colors\\n\\nThe palette is inspired by natural, undyed fibers and earthen materials. \\n\\n- **Primary (Clay):** Used for call-to-actions, price accents, and critical indicators. It provides a warm, energetic contrast to the neutral base.\\n- **Secondary (Ink):** The foundation for readability. Used for all primary headings and body text to ensure high legibility against light backgrounds.\\n- **Tertiary (Blush):** A soft accent for secondary surfaces, card backgrounds, and promotional banners.\\n- **Neutral (Cream):** The primary canvas. This off-white base reduces eye strain and feels more premium and \\\"organic\\\" than pure white.\\n- **Named Colors:** **Sage** is reserved for eco-specific callouts or decorative elements to reinforce the sustainability narrative. **Ink-light** is used for secondary navigation and metadata to create visual hierarchy.\\n\\n## Typography\\n\\nThis design system employs a high-contrast pairing to balance heritage and modernity.\\n\\n- **Headlines:** Use **DM Serif Display**. Its graceful curves and high contrast evoke luxury and editorial authority. Use it sparingly for section headers and hero statements.\\n- **Body \\u0026 UI:** Use **DM Sans**. This low-contrast geometric sans-serif ensures maximum legibility across all digital interfaces. \\n- **The \\\"Label-Uppercase\\\" Style:** This is a signature brand element. Use it for navigation, small headings over titles, and button labels. The generous letter-spacing (tracking) is essential to achieving the \\\"premium\\\" feel.\\n- **Line Height:** Maintain a generous line height (1.8 - 1.85) for body text to reinforce the airy, spacious aesthetic.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Shapes\\n\\nThe shape language is \\\"Soft-Modern,\\\" utilizing rounded corners to evoke friendliness and comfort—qualities essential to a wearable fashion brand.\\n\\n- **Small Elements (Buttons, Tags, Pills):** Use `rounded-full` (pill-shaped). This creates a distinct interactive language that feels modern and approachable.\\n- **Medium Elements (Product Images, Floating Cards):** Use `rounded-lg` (1rem / 16px). This softens the grid without making it feel juvenile.\\n- **Large Elements (Banners, Testimonial Containers):** Use `rounded-xl` (1.5rem / 24px) to create \\\"enveloping\\\" containers that feel substantial and high-end.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",6,\"#c97b5a\",\"#2a2420\",\"#f5ede6\",\"#faf7f4\",2,[[\"headline-lg\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"40px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"headline-md\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"32px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"caption\",[\"DM Sans\",\"11px\",\"500\",\"1.4\",\"0.05em\"]],[\"body-lg\",[\"DM Sans\",\"16px\",\"400\",\"1.8\",\"0.01em\"]],[\"body-md\",[\"DM Sans\",\"14px\",\"400\",\"1.85\"]],[\"display\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"80px\",\"400\",\"1.1\",\"-0.02em\"]],[\"display-mobile\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"44px\",\"400\",\"1.2\"]],[\"label-uppercase\",[\"DM Sans\",\"12px\",\"500\",\"1.2\",\"0.15em\"]]],[[\"grid-gutter\",\"24px\"],[\"section-gap-desktop\",\"80px\"],[\"element-gap-lg\",\"32px\"],[\"element-gap-sm\",\"8px\"],[\"section-gap-mobile\",\"48px\"],[\"container-max\",\"1440px\"],[\"element-gap-md\",\"16px\"]],null,\"dmSerifDisplay\",\"Dm Sans\",\"Dm Sans\"],2,1,null,[null,2,null,null,2,2],null,null,[\"assets/f84726af88af499598b78556bda4af11\",null,[\"Stitch Design System\",null,\"## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",[1,null,3,null,\"#c97b5a\",null,null,null,null,null,26,26,[[\"clay-dark\",\"#A85E40\"],[\"secondary_container\",\"#e9ddd7\"],[\"inverse_surface\",\"#31302f\"],[\"on_surface_variant\",\"#53433d\"],[\"surface_container_high\",\"#eae8e5\"],[\"on_primary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"tertiary_container\",\"#79746e\"],[\"inverse_primary\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"surface_container_low\",\"#f6f3f0\"],[\"primary\",\"#8c4a2d\"],[\"on_primary_fixed\",\"#360f00\"],[\"surface_bright\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"primary_container\",\"#aa6243\"],[\"border-subtle\",\"#E8DDD6\"],[\"tertiary\",\"#605b56\"],[\"on_secondary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed\",\"#201a17\"],[\"on_primary_fixed_variant\",\"#72351a\"],[\"background\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"surface_container_lowest\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_primary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"on_error\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"primary_fixed_dim\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed_variant\",\"#4d4541\"],[\"surface\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"surface_tint\",\"#8f4c2f\"],[\"ink-light\",\"#5A4E48\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed\",\"#1e1b17\"],[\"cream-warm\",\"#F2ECE6\"],[\"surface_dim\",\"#dcdad7\"],[\"on_surface\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"sage\",\"#D6E4D8\"],[\"surface_container_highest\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"on_tertiary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"inverse_on_surface\",\"#f3f0ed\"],[\"on_tertiary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"on_error_container\",\"#93000a\"],[\"secondary_fixed\",\"#ece0da\"],[\"on_secondary_container\",\"#69615c\"],[\"error_container\",\"#ffdad6\"],[\"on_background\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"secondary_fixed_dim\",\"#cfc4be\"],[\"secondary\",\"#655d58\"],[\"outline_variant\",\"#d9c2b9\"],[\"error\",\"#ba1a1a\"],[\"primary_fixed\",\"#ffdbcd\"],[\"surface_container\",\"#f0edea\"],[\"tertiary_fixed_dim\",\"#ccc5bf\"],[\"tertiary_fixed\",\"#e9e1da\"],[\"outline\",\"#86736c\"],[\"surface_variant\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed_variant\",\"#4a4641\"]],\"---\\nname: Stitch Design System\\ncolors:\\n  surface: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-dim: '#dcdad7'\\n  surface-bright: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-container-lowest: '#ffffff'\\n  surface-container-low: '#f6f3f0'\\n  surface-container: '#f0edea'\\n  surface-container-high: '#eae8e5'\\n  surface-container-highest: '#e5e2df'\\n  on-surface: '#1c1c1a'\\n  on-surface-variant: '#53433d'\\n  inverse-surface: '#31302f'\\n  inverse-on-surface: '#f3f0ed'\\n  outline: '#86736c'\\n  outline-variant: '#d9c2b9'\\n  surface-tint: '#8f4c2f'\\n  primary: '#8c4a2d'\\n  on-primary: '#ffffff'\\n  primary-container: '#aa6243'\\n  on-primary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  inverse-primary: '#ffb597'\\n  secondary: '#655d58'\\n  on-secondary: '#ffffff'\\n  secondary-container: '#e9ddd7'\\n  on-secondary-container: '#69615c'\\n  tertiary: '#605b56'\\n  on-tertiary: '#ffffff'\\n  tertiary-container: '#79746e'\\n  on-tertiary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  error: '#ba1a1a'\\n  on-error: '#ffffff'\\n  error-container: '#ffdad6'\\n  on-error-container: '#93000a'\\n  primary-fixed: '#ffdbcd'\\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#ffb597'\\n  on-primary-fixed: '#360f00'\\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#72351a'\\n  secondary-fixed: '#ece0da'\\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#cfc4be'\\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#201a17'\\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#4d4541'\\n  tertiary-fixed: '#e9e1da'\\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#ccc5bf'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#1e1b17'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#4a4641'\\n  background: '#fcf9f6'\\n  on-background: '#1c1c1a'\\n  surface-variant: '#e5e2df'\\n  clay-dark: '#A85E40'\\n  ink-light: '#5A4E48'\\n  sage: '#D6E4D8'\\n  cream-warm: '#F2ECE6'\\n  border-subtle: '#E8DDD6'\\ntypography:\\n  display:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 80px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.1'\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\n  display-mobile:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 44px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n  headline-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 40px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  headline-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 32px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  body-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.8'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.01em\\n  body-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.85'\\n  label-uppercase:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 12px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.15em\\n  caption:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 11px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.4'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.05em\\nrounded:\\n  sm: 0.25rem\\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\\n  md: 0.75rem\\n  lg: 1rem\\n  xl: 1.5rem\\n  full: 9999px\\nspacing:\\n  container-max: 1440px\\n  section-gap-desktop: 80px\\n  section-gap-mobile: 48px\\n  grid-gutter: 24px\\n  element-gap-sm: 8px\\n  element-gap-md: 16px\\n  element-gap-lg: 32px\\n---\\n\\n## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Colors\\n\\nThe palette is inspired by natural, undyed fibers and earthen materials. \\n\\n- **Primary (Clay):** Used for call-to-actions, price accents, and critical indicators. It provides a warm, energetic contrast to the neutral base.\\n- **Secondary (Ink):** The foundation for readability. Used for all primary headings and body text to ensure high legibility against light backgrounds.\\n- **Tertiary (Blush):** A soft accent for secondary surfaces, card backgrounds, and promotional banners.\\n- **Neutral (Cream):** The primary canvas. This off-white base reduces eye strain and feels more premium and \\\"organic\\\" than pure white.\\n- **Named Colors:** **Sage** is reserved for eco-specific callouts or decorative elements to reinforce the sustainability narrative. **Ink-light** is used for secondary navigation and metadata to create visual hierarchy.\\n\\n## Typography\\n\\nThis design system employs a high-contrast pairing to balance heritage and modernity.\\n\\n- **Headlines:** Use **DM Serif Display**. Its graceful curves and high contrast evoke luxury and editorial authority. Use it sparingly for section headers and hero statements.\\n- **Body \\u0026 UI:** Use **DM Sans**. This low-contrast geometric sans-serif ensures maximum legibility across all digital interfaces. \\n- **The \\\"Label-Uppercase\\\" Style:** This is a signature brand element. Use it for navigation, small headings over titles, and button labels. The generous letter-spacing (tracking) is essential to achieving the \\\"premium\\\" feel.\\n- **Line Height:** Maintain a generous line height (1.8 - 1.85) for body text to reinforce the airy, spacious aesthetic.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Shapes\\n\\nThe shape language is \\\"Soft-Modern,\\\" utilizing rounded corners to evoke friendliness and comfort—qualities essential to a wearable fashion brand.\\n\\n- **Small Elements (Buttons, Tags, Pills):** Use `rounded-full` (pill-shaped). This creates a distinct interactive language that feels modern and approachable.\\n- **Medium Elements (Product Images, Floating Cards):** Use `rounded-lg` (1rem / 16px). This softens the grid without making it feel juvenile.\\n- **Large Elements (Banners, Testimonial Containers):** Use `rounded-xl` (1.5rem / 24px) to create \\\"enveloping\\\" containers that feel substantial and high-end.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",6,\"#c97b5a\",\"#2a2420\",\"#f5ede6\",\"#faf7f4\",2,[[\"caption\",[\"DM Sans\",\"11px\",\"500\",\"1.4\",\"0.05em\"]],[\"headline-lg\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"40px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"headline-md\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"32px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"display-mobile\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"44px\",\"400\",\"1.2\"]],[\"label-uppercase\",[\"DM Sans\",\"12px\",\"500\",\"1.2\",\"0.15em\"]],[\"body-lg\",[\"DM Sans\",\"16px\",\"400\",\"1.8\",\"0.01em\"]],[\"display\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"80px\",\"400\",\"1.1\",\"-0.02em\"]],[\"body-md\",[\"DM Sans\",\"14px\",\"400\",\"1.85\"]]],[[\"element-gap-md\",\"16px\"],[\"section-gap-desktop\",\"80px\"],[\"grid-gutter\",\"24px\"],[\"element-gap-lg\",\"32px\"],[\"element-gap-sm\",\"8px\"],[\"section-gap-mobile\",\"48px\"],[\"container-max\",\"1440px\"]],null,\"dmSerifDisplay\",\"Dm Sans\",\"Dm Sans\"]],1]],[[\"projects/18178749605532028059/files/2289786989715847437\",null,\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida/AP1WRLvtPRZfYWeIo7w-LygONxe4cmCitCs4ZG1MXHFUUAx01w-9_HBVZnzqQog08eAJT62PDmwheiF-d8yDdY4ojHbcSsi1KY8bz-2vcFi7He94uD9UiWVU--LiZ3PHbsPjuDKnbeyUi7R0R1hEF8UhhnmNAa7ROiM0HBvANGQ9GquhvwOQkDO9pby5ygdgmtIWYnMcGimecGgyKDyuIahPciZXnK6AK3FjxF3XYnw_5-c1niTL7-5fhGWk4BAMmXZtCydPXHeGA-4_D4M\"],null,null,null,\"2289786989715845784\",null,\"682\",\"460\",\"image.png\",null,\"projects/18178749605532028059/screens/2289786989715845784\",[],null,2,true,[null,null,null,null,2]],[[\"projects/18178749605532028059/files/2993056202808824607\",null,\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida/AP1WRLuMPjgPdbNvkBEZannbUTk0Wy4f88VZfoUW6LEiqNNnjcw2mvPk8eEdKFU5y6BW2tLlbUCfNN0mwjiY1GAzg4M2hwS3zf3vjFROcnl04t0LIJo0JhJdM9rucW5gF1Ttw6mQMkfZGrjd7tu8Jazo3dkLIeDVVxYrYzzxyaooIWu-pJTkhrtHiFLdLg047Qr8-Uik61eSVh6qbwZLeLgE_W64lJddQ5i8Nntacd-c2B-86f1uoFYgoeRJo0i3\"],[\"projects/18178749605532028059/files/2239886910435087277\",null,\"https://contribution.usercontent.google.com/download?c\\u003dCgthaWRhX2NvZGVmeBJ8Eh1hcHBfY29tcGFuaW9uX2dlbmVyYXRlZF9maWxlcxpbCiVodG1sXzAwMDY1NDlkMGRmYzQ1OTcwNGVhYTZmOWYyMTljMzkwEgsSBxDv9_C4jw8YAZIBJAoKcHJvamVjdF9pZBIWQhQxODE3ODc0OTYwNTUzMjAyODA1OQ\\u0026filename\\u003d\\u0026opi\\u003d89354086\",null,null,\"text/html\"],null,null,\"090999fa4288499ba4839cd68cad331e\",\"figaro_agent\",\"2560\",\"6100\",\"Stitch — Chi tiết sản phẩm Bé Gái\",\"Create a high-fidelity product detail page for a girl's dress from the Stitch Kids collection. \\nMain product: \\\"Váy Hoa Nhí Organic\\\" (Organic Floral Summer Dress) using {{DATA:IMAGE:IMAGE_15}}.\\nLayout:\\n- Left: Large primary image {{DATA:IMAGE:IMAGE_15}} with smaller thumbnail gallery.\\n- Right: Product info section including:\\n  - Product title: Váy Hoa Nhí Organic\\n  - Price: 1.250.000₫\\n  - Material labels: \\\"100% Organic Cotton\\\", \\\"Thủ công\\\", \\\"Bền vững\\\".\\n  - Size selector (S, M, L, XL).\\n  - Color selector (Terracotta, Sage, Cream).\\n  - \\\"Thêm vào giỏ hàng\\\" and \\\"Mua ngay\\\" buttons.\\n  - Expandable accordion for \\\"Chất liệu \\u0026 Bảo quản\\\", \\\"Hướng dẫn size\\\", and \\\"Giao hàng \\u0026 Đổi trả\\\".\\n- Below: \\\"Câu chuyện sản phẩm\\\" section highlighting natural fabrics and ethical production.\\n- Section: \\\"Có thể bé sẽ thích\\\" featuring other girls' items:\\n  - \\\"Yếm Linen Sage\\\" using {{DATA:IMAGE:IMAGE_51}}\\n  - \\\"Set Chân Váy Dusty Rose\\\" using {{DATA:IMAGE:IMAGE_49}}\\n  - \\\"Áo Len Merino\\\" using {{DATA:IMAGE:IMAGE_13}}\\nStyle: Minimalist, sophisticated, earthy tones, generous whitespace, serif headlines for elegance and sans-serif for readability. Use the navigation and footer from the predicted components.\",\"projects/18178749605532028059/screens/090999fa4288499ba4839cd68cad331e\",[1,null,3,null,\"#c97b5a\",null,null,null,null,null,26,26,[[\"clay-dark\",\"#A85E40\"],[\"surface_container_high\",\"#eae8e5\"],[\"on_surface_variant\",\"#53433d\"],[\"inverse_surface\",\"#31302f\"],[\"secondary_container\",\"#e9ddd7\"],[\"on_primary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"primary\",\"#8c4a2d\"],[\"surface_container_low\",\"#f6f3f0\"],[\"inverse_primary\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"tertiary_container\",\"#79746e\"],[\"primary_container\",\"#aa6243\"],[\"surface_bright\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_primary_fixed\",\"#360f00\"],[\"on_primary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"surface_container_lowest\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_primary_fixed_variant\",\"#72351a\"],[\"background\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed\",\"#201a17\"],[\"on_secondary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"border-subtle\",\"#E8DDD6\"],[\"tertiary\",\"#605b56\"],[\"primary_fixed_dim\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"on_error\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed\",\"#1e1b17\"],[\"ink-light\",\"#5A4E48\"],[\"surface_tint\",\"#8f4c2f\"],[\"surface\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed_variant\",\"#4d4541\"],[\"surface_dim\",\"#dcdad7\"],[\"cream-warm\",\"#F2ECE6\"],[\"on_surface\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"inverse_on_surface\",\"#f3f0ed\"],[\"on_tertiary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"surface_container_highest\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"sage\",\"#D6E4D8\"],[\"on_tertiary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"secondary_fixed_dim\",\"#cfc4be\"],[\"on_background\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"error_container\",\"#ffdad6\"],[\"secondary_fixed\",\"#ece0da\"],[\"on_secondary_container\",\"#69615c\"],[\"on_error_container\",\"#93000a\"],[\"secondary\",\"#655d58\"],[\"surface_container\",\"#f0edea\"],[\"primary_fixed\",\"#ffdbcd\"],[\"error\",\"#ba1a1a\"],[\"outline_variant\",\"#d9c2b9\"],[\"surface_variant\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed_variant\",\"#4a4641\"],[\"tertiary_fixed_dim\",\"#ccc5bf\"],[\"tertiary_fixed\",\"#e9e1da\"],[\"outline\",\"#86736c\"]],\"---\\nname: Stitch Design System\\ncolors:\\n  surface: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-dim: '#dcdad7'\\n  surface-bright: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-container-lowest: '#ffffff'\\n  surface-container-low: '#f6f3f0'\\n  surface-container: '#f0edea'\\n  surface-container-high: '#eae8e5'\\n  surface-container-highest: '#e5e2df'\\n  on-surface: '#1c1c1a'\\n  on-surface-variant: '#53433d'\\n  inverse-surface: '#31302f'\\n  inverse-on-surface: '#f3f0ed'\\n  outline: '#86736c'\\n  outline-variant: '#d9c2b9'\\n  surface-tint: '#8f4c2f'\\n  primary: '#8c4a2d'\\n  on-primary: '#ffffff'\\n  primary-container: '#aa6243'\\n  on-primary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  inverse-primary: '#ffb597'\\n  secondary: '#655d58'\\n  on-secondary: '#ffffff'\\n  secondary-container: '#e9ddd7'\\n  on-secondary-container: '#69615c'\\n  tertiary: '#605b56'\\n  on-tertiary: '#ffffff'\\n  tertiary-container: '#79746e'\\n  on-tertiary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  error: '#ba1a1a'\\n  on-error: '#ffffff'\\n  error-container: '#ffdad6'\\n  on-error-container: '#93000a'\\n  primary-fixed: '#ffdbcd'\\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#ffb597'\\n  on-primary-fixed: '#360f00'\\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#72351a'\\n  secondary-fixed: '#ece0da'\\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#cfc4be'\\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#201a17'\\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#4d4541'\\n  tertiary-fixed: '#e9e1da'\\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#ccc5bf'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#1e1b17'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#4a4641'\\n  background: '#fcf9f6'\\n  on-background: '#1c1c1a'\\n  surface-variant: '#e5e2df'\\n  clay-dark: '#A85E40'\\n  ink-light: '#5A4E48'\\n  sage: '#D6E4D8'\\n  cream-warm: '#F2ECE6'\\n  border-subtle: '#E8DDD6'\\ntypography:\\n  display:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 80px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.1'\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\n  display-mobile:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 44px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n  headline-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 40px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  headline-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 32px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  body-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.8'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.01em\\n  body-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.85'\\n  label-uppercase:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 12px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.15em\\n  caption:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 11px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.4'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.05em\\nrounded:\\n  sm: 0.25rem\\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\\n  md: 0.75rem\\n  lg: 1rem\\n  xl: 1.5rem\\n  full: 9999px\\nspacing:\\n  container-max: 1440px\\n  section-gap-desktop: 80px\\n  section-gap-mobile: 48px\\n  grid-gutter: 24px\\n  element-gap-sm: 8px\\n  element-gap-md: 16px\\n  element-gap-lg: 32px\\n---\\n\\n## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Colors\\n\\nThe palette is inspired by natural, undyed fibers and earthen materials. \\n\\n- **Primary (Clay):** Used for call-to-actions, price accents, and critical indicators. It provides a warm, energetic contrast to the neutral base.\\n- **Secondary (Ink):** The foundation for readability. Used for all primary headings and body text to ensure high legibility against light backgrounds.\\n- **Tertiary (Blush):** A soft accent for secondary surfaces, card backgrounds, and promotional banners.\\n- **Neutral (Cream):** The primary canvas. This off-white base reduces eye strain and feels more premium and \\\"organic\\\" than pure white.\\n- **Named Colors:** **Sage** is reserved for eco-specific callouts or decorative elements to reinforce the sustainability narrative. **Ink-light** is used for secondary navigation and metadata to create visual hierarchy.\\n\\n## Typography\\n\\nThis design system employs a high-contrast pairing to balance heritage and modernity.\\n\\n- **Headlines:** Use **DM Serif Display**. Its graceful curves and high contrast evoke luxury and editorial authority. Use it sparingly for section headers and hero statements.\\n- **Body \\u0026 UI:** Use **DM Sans**. This low-contrast geometric sans-serif ensures maximum legibility across all digital interfaces. \\n- **The \\\"Label-Uppercase\\\" Style:** This is a signature brand element. Use it for navigation, small headings over titles, and button labels. The generous letter-spacing (tracking) is essential to achieving the \\\"premium\\\" feel.\\n- **Line Height:** Maintain a generous line height (1.8 - 1.85) for body text to reinforce the airy, spacious aesthetic.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Shapes\\n\\nThe shape language is \\\"Soft-Modern,\\\" utilizing rounded corners to evoke friendliness and comfort—qualities essential to a wearable fashion brand.\\n\\n- **Small Elements (Buttons, Tags, Pills):** Use `rounded-full` (pill-shaped). This creates a distinct interactive language that feels modern and approachable.\\n- **Medium Elements (Product Images, Floating Cards):** Use `rounded-lg` (1rem / 16px). This softens the grid without making it feel juvenile.\\n- **Large Elements (Banners, Testimonial Containers):** Use `rounded-xl` (1.5rem / 24px) to create \\\"enveloping\\\" containers that feel substantial and high-end.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",6,\"#c97b5a\",\"#2a2420\",\"#f5ede6\",\"#faf7f4\",2,[[\"display-mobile\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"44px\",\"400\",\"1.2\"]],[\"label-uppercase\",[\"DM Sans\",\"12px\",\"500\",\"1.2\",\"0.15em\"]],[\"body-lg\",[\"DM Sans\",\"16px\",\"400\",\"1.8\",\"0.01em\"]],[\"display\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"80px\",\"400\",\"1.1\",\"-0.02em\"]],[\"body-md\",[\"DM Sans\",\"14px\",\"400\",\"1.85\"]],[\"caption\",[\"DM Sans\",\"11px\",\"500\",\"1.4\",\"0.05em\"]],[\"headline-lg\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"40px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"headline-md\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"32px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]]],[[\"element-gap-md\",\"16px\"],[\"element-gap-lg\",\"32px\"],[\"grid-gutter\",\"24px\"],[\"section-gap-desktop\",\"80px\"],[\"element-gap-sm\",\"8px\"],[\"section-gap-mobile\",\"48px\"],[\"container-max\",\"1440px\"]],null,\"dmSerifDisplay\",\"Dm Sans\",\"Dm Sans\"],2,1,null,[null,2,null,null,2,2],null,null,[\"assets/f84726af88af499598b78556bda4af11\",null,[\"Stitch Design System\",null,\"## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",[1,null,3,null,\"#c97b5a\",null,null,null,null,null,26,26,[[\"on_tertiary_fixed\",\"#1e1b17\"],[\"ink-light\",\"#5A4E48\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed_variant\",\"#4d4541\"],[\"surface_tint\",\"#8f4c2f\"],[\"surface\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_error\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"primary_fixed_dim\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"background\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_primary_fixed_variant\",\"#72351a\"],[\"on_primary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"surface_container_lowest\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"border-subtle\",\"#E8DDD6\"],[\"tertiary\",\"#605b56\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed\",\"#201a17\"],[\"on_secondary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"primary_container\",\"#aa6243\"],[\"surface_bright\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_primary_fixed\",\"#360f00\"],[\"surface_container_low\",\"#f6f3f0\"],[\"primary\",\"#8c4a2d\"],[\"inverse_primary\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"tertiary_container\",\"#79746e\"],[\"on_primary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"secondary_container\",\"#e9ddd7\"],[\"on_surface_variant\",\"#53433d\"],[\"surface_container_high\",\"#eae8e5\"],[\"inverse_surface\",\"#31302f\"],[\"clay-dark\",\"#A85E40\"],[\"tertiary_fixed_dim\",\"#ccc5bf\"],[\"tertiary_fixed\",\"#e9e1da\"],[\"outline\",\"#86736c\"],[\"surface_variant\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed_variant\",\"#4a4641\"],[\"surface_container\",\"#f0edea\"],[\"outline_variant\",\"#d9c2b9\"],[\"primary_fixed\",\"#ffdbcd\"],[\"error\",\"#ba1a1a\"],[\"secondary\",\"#655d58\"],[\"error_container\",\"#ffdad6\"],[\"secondary_fixed_dim\",\"#cfc4be\"],[\"on_background\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"on_error_container\",\"#93000a\"],[\"secondary_fixed\",\"#ece0da\"],[\"on_secondary_container\",\"#69615c\"],[\"on_tertiary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"on_tertiary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"inverse_on_surface\",\"#f3f0ed\"],[\"sage\",\"#D6E4D8\"],[\"surface_container_highest\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"on_surface\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"surface_dim\",\"#dcdad7\"],[\"cream-warm\",\"#F2ECE6\"]],\"---\\nname: Stitch Design System\\ncolors:\\n  surface: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-dim: '#dcdad7'\\n  surface-bright: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-container-lowest: '#ffffff'\\n  surface-container-low: '#f6f3f0'\\n  surface-container: '#f0edea'\\n  surface-container-high: '#eae8e5'\\n  surface-container-highest: '#e5e2df'\\n  on-surface: '#1c1c1a'\\n  on-surface-variant: '#53433d'\\n  inverse-surface: '#31302f'\\n  inverse-on-surface: '#f3f0ed'\\n  outline: '#86736c'\\n  outline-variant: '#d9c2b9'\\n  surface-tint: '#8f4c2f'\\n  primary: '#8c4a2d'\\n  on-primary: '#ffffff'\\n  primary-container: '#aa6243'\\n  on-primary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  inverse-primary: '#ffb597'\\n  secondary: '#655d58'\\n  on-secondary: '#ffffff'\\n  secondary-container: '#e9ddd7'\\n  on-secondary-container: '#69615c'\\n  tertiary: '#605b56'\\n  on-tertiary: '#ffffff'\\n  tertiary-container: '#79746e'\\n  on-tertiary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  error: '#ba1a1a'\\n  on-error: '#ffffff'\\n  error-container: '#ffdad6'\\n  on-error-container: '#93000a'\\n  primary-fixed: '#ffdbcd'\\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#ffb597'\\n  on-primary-fixed: '#360f00'\\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#72351a'\\n  secondary-fixed: '#ece0da'\\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#cfc4be'\\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#201a17'\\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#4d4541'\\n  tertiary-fixed: '#e9e1da'\\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#ccc5bf'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#1e1b17'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#4a4641'\\n  background: '#fcf9f6'\\n  on-background: '#1c1c1a'\\n  surface-variant: '#e5e2df'\\n  clay-dark: '#A85E40'\\n  ink-light: '#5A4E48'\\n  sage: '#D6E4D8'\\n  cream-warm: '#F2ECE6'\\n  border-subtle: '#E8DDD6'\\ntypography:\\n  display:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 80px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.1'\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\n  display-mobile:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 44px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n  headline-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 40px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  headline-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 32px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  body-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.8'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.01em\\n  body-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.85'\\n  label-uppercase:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 12px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.15em\\n  caption:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 11px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.4'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.05em\\nrounded:\\n  sm: 0.25rem\\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\\n  md: 0.75rem\\n  lg: 1rem\\n  xl: 1.5rem\\n  full: 9999px\\nspacing:\\n  container-max: 1440px\\n  section-gap-desktop: 80px\\n  section-gap-mobile: 48px\\n  grid-gutter: 24px\\n  element-gap-sm: 8px\\n  element-gap-md: 16px\\n  element-gap-lg: 32px\\n---\\n\\n## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Colors\\n\\nThe palette is inspired by natural, undyed fibers and earthen materials. \\n\\n- **Primary (Clay):** Used for call-to-actions, price accents, and critical indicators. It provides a warm, energetic contrast to the neutral base.\\n- **Secondary (Ink):** The foundation for readability. Used for all primary headings and body text to ensure high legibility against light backgrounds.\\n- **Tertiary (Blush):** A soft accent for secondary surfaces, card backgrounds, and promotional banners.\\n- **Neutral (Cream):** The primary canvas. This off-white base reduces eye strain and feels more premium and \\\"organic\\\" than pure white.\\n- **Named Colors:** **Sage** is reserved for eco-specific callouts or decorative elements to reinforce the sustainability narrative. **Ink-light** is used for secondary navigation and metadata to create visual hierarchy.\\n\\n## Typography\\n\\nThis design system employs a high-contrast pairing to balance heritage and modernity.\\n\\n- **Headlines:** Use **DM Serif Display**. Its graceful curves and high contrast evoke luxury and editorial authority. Use it sparingly for section headers and hero statements.\\n- **Body \\u0026 UI:** Use **DM Sans**. This low-contrast geometric sans-serif ensures maximum legibility across all digital interfaces. \\n- **The \\\"Label-Uppercase\\\" Style:** This is a signature brand element. Use it for navigation, small headings over titles, and button labels. The generous letter-spacing (tracking) is essential to achieving the \\\"premium\\\" feel.\\n- **Line Height:** Maintain a generous line height (1.8 - 1.85) for body text to reinforce the airy, spacious aesthetic.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Shapes\\n\\nThe shape language is \\\"Soft-Modern,\\\" utilizing rounded corners to evoke friendliness and comfort—qualities essential to a wearable fashion brand.\\n\\n- **Small Elements (Buttons, Tags, Pills):** Use `rounded-full` (pill-shaped). This creates a distinct interactive language that feels modern and approachable.\\n- **Medium Elements (Product Images, Floating Cards):** Use `rounded-lg` (1rem / 16px). This softens the grid without making it feel juvenile.\\n- **Large Elements (Banners, Testimonial Containers):** Use `rounded-xl` (1.5rem / 24px) to create \\\"enveloping\\\" containers that feel substantial and high-end.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",6,\"#c97b5a\",\"#2a2420\",\"#f5ede6\",\"#faf7f4\",2,[[\"caption\",[\"DM Sans\",\"11px\",\"500\",\"1.4\",\"0.05em\"]],[\"headline-lg\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"40px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"headline-md\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"32px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"body-lg\",[\"DM Sans\",\"16px\",\"400\",\"1.8\",\"0.01em\"]],[\"display\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"80px\",\"400\",\"1.1\",\"-0.02em\"]],[\"body-md\",[\"DM Sans\",\"14px\",\"400\",\"1.85\"]],[\"display-mobile\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"44px\",\"400\",\"1.2\"]],[\"label-uppercase\",[\"DM Sans\",\"12px\",\"500\",\"1.2\",\"0.15em\"]]],[[\"element-gap-md\",\"16px\"],[\"section-gap-desktop\",\"80px\"],[\"grid-gutter\",\"24px\"],[\"element-gap-lg\",\"32px\"],[\"container-max\",\"1440px\"],[\"element-gap-sm\",\"8px\"],[\"section-gap-mobile\",\"48px\"]],null,\"dmSerifDisplay\",\"Dm Sans\",\"Dm Sans\"]],1]],[[\"projects/18178749605532028059/files/11614410876429492697\",null,\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida/AP1WRLvguZsAqWqlr9HJj4LhMcriVZYOG1Y5MMmpbcFFTp3933nL5-bU8E3lNV_TP-J6HmfRKgnNp7uheeBCNkFMP433RlFCm8mHP3yY6qMbbLfeF6eXxbjmQXv7Pl4kQXNlkFx3U-3Jq4fL_ov73id8NrWsRPqSBc5rgsVDBkj1OKw2T2xznrlT29Y-FFijP4IDM-nywe3T_lhWZBlXowxS1vAY-mWoUnyDfV8PfEq_Oz5y3Z6NIJozZcc4kdoo\"],[\"projects/18178749605532028059/files/12575407052323654084\",null,\"https://contribution.usercontent.google.com/download?c\\u003dCgthaWRhX2NvZGVmeBJ8Eh1hcHBfY29tcGFuaW9uX2dlbmVyYXRlZF9maWxlcxpbCiVodG1sXzAwMDY1M2UxMWVlZmIwMTIwODE2ZmVkMDkwMjcxNjUzEgsSBxDv9_C4jw8YAZIBJAoKcHJvamVjdF9pZBIWQhQxODE3ODc0OTYwNTUzMjAyODA1OQ\\u0026filename\\u003d\\u0026opi\\u003d89354086\",null,null,\"text/html\"],null,null,\"86dc3ebfb1a8498dac96f198a1640c62\",\"HatterAgent\",\"2560\",\"13738\",\"Stitch — Trang chủ (Added Testimonials)\",\"Add a \\\"Khách hàng nói gì về Stitch\\\" (What customers say about Stitch) section before the newsletter/footer area. \\n- Use a clean 3-column layout for testimonials.\\n- Each testimonial card should include a star rating (5 stars), a short text review in Vietnamese about product quality/sustainability, and the customer's name/location.\\n- Maintain the neutral color palette (#FAF7F4 background, #2A2420 text) and Serif typography for headings to match the existing design.\\n- Examples of reviews: \\n  1. \\\"Chất vải linen rất thoáng mát, đường may tỉ mỉ. Tôi rất hài lòng với cam kết bền vững của Stitch.\\\" - Minh Anh, Hà Nội.\\n  2. \\\"Túi tote da thực vật đẹp hơn tôi tưởng. Giao hàng nhanh và đóng gói rất thân thiện với môi trường.\\\" - Linh Chi, TP.HCM.\\n  3. \\\"Sản phẩm thiết kế tối giản nhưng rất sang trọng. Sẽ còn ủng hộ Stitch dài dài.\\\" - Hoàng Nam, Đà Nẵng.\",\"projects/18178749605532028059/screens/86dc3ebfb1a8498dac96f198a1640c62\",[1,null,3,null,\"#c97b5a\",null,null,null,null,null,26,26,[[\"secondary_fixed\",\"#ece0da\"],[\"on_secondary_container\",\"#69615c\"],[\"on_error_container\",\"#93000a\"],[\"on_background\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"secondary_fixed_dim\",\"#cfc4be\"],[\"error_container\",\"#ffdad6\"],[\"secondary\",\"#655d58\"],[\"error\",\"#ba1a1a\"],[\"primary_fixed\",\"#ffdbcd\"],[\"outline_variant\",\"#d9c2b9\"],[\"surface_container\",\"#f0edea\"],[\"surface_variant\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed_variant\",\"#4a4641\"],[\"tertiary_fixed_dim\",\"#ccc5bf\"],[\"tertiary_fixed\",\"#e9e1da\"],[\"outline\",\"#86736c\"],[\"cream-warm\",\"#F2ECE6\"],[\"surface_dim\",\"#dcdad7\"],[\"on_surface\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"surface_container_highest\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"sage\",\"#D6E4D8\"],[\"inverse_on_surface\",\"#f3f0ed\"],[\"on_tertiary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_tertiary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"on_primary_fixed\",\"#360f00\"],[\"surface_bright\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"primary_container\",\"#aa6243\"],[\"on_secondary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed\",\"#201a17\"],[\"tertiary\",\"#605b56\"],[\"border-subtle\",\"#E8DDD6\"],[\"surface_container_lowest\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_primary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"on_primary_fixed_variant\",\"#72351a\"],[\"background\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"primary_fixed_dim\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"on_error\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"surface\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"surface_tint\",\"#8f4c2f\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed_variant\",\"#4d4541\"],[\"ink-light\",\"#5A4E48\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed\",\"#1e1b17\"],[\"clay-dark\",\"#A85E40\"],[\"surface_container_high\",\"#eae8e5\"],[\"on_surface_variant\",\"#53433d\"],[\"inverse_surface\",\"#31302f\"],[\"secondary_container\",\"#e9ddd7\"],[\"on_primary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"tertiary_container\",\"#79746e\"],[\"inverse_primary\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"primary\",\"#8c4a2d\"],[\"surface_container_low\",\"#f6f3f0\"]],\"---\\nname: Stitch Design System\\ncolors:\\n  surface: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-dim: '#dcdad7'\\n  surface-bright: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-container-lowest: '#ffffff'\\n  surface-container-low: '#f6f3f0'\\n  surface-container: '#f0edea'\\n  surface-container-high: '#eae8e5'\\n  surface-container-highest: '#e5e2df'\\n  on-surface: '#1c1c1a'\\n  on-surface-variant: '#53433d'\\n  inverse-surface: '#31302f'\\n  inverse-on-surface: '#f3f0ed'\\n  outline: '#86736c'\\n  outline-variant: '#d9c2b9'\\n  surface-tint: '#8f4c2f'\\n  primary: '#8c4a2d'\\n  on-primary: '#ffffff'\\n  primary-container: '#aa6243'\\n  on-primary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  inverse-primary: '#ffb597'\\n  secondary: '#655d58'\\n  on-secondary: '#ffffff'\\n  secondary-container: '#e9ddd7'\\n  on-secondary-container: '#69615c'\\n  tertiary: '#605b56'\\n  on-tertiary: '#ffffff'\\n  tertiary-container: '#79746e'\\n  on-tertiary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  error: '#ba1a1a'\\n  on-error: '#ffffff'\\n  error-container: '#ffdad6'\\n  on-error-container: '#93000a'\\n  primary-fixed: '#ffdbcd'\\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#ffb597'\\n  on-primary-fixed: '#360f00'\\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#72351a'\\n  secondary-fixed: '#ece0da'\\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#cfc4be'\\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#201a17'\\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#4d4541'\\n  tertiary-fixed: '#e9e1da'\\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#ccc5bf'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#1e1b17'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#4a4641'\\n  background: '#fcf9f6'\\n  on-background: '#1c1c1a'\\n  surface-variant: '#e5e2df'\\n  clay-dark: '#A85E40'\\n  ink-light: '#5A4E48'\\n  sage: '#D6E4D8'\\n  cream-warm: '#F2ECE6'\\n  border-subtle: '#E8DDD6'\\ntypography:\\n  display:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 80px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.1'\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\n  display-mobile:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 44px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n  headline-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 40px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  headline-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 32px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  body-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.8'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.01em\\n  body-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.85'\\n  label-uppercase:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 12px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.15em\\n  caption:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 11px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.4'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.05em\\nrounded:\\n  sm: 0.25rem\\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\\n  md: 0.75rem\\n  lg: 1rem\\n  xl: 1.5rem\\n  full: 9999px\\nspacing:\\n  container-max: 1440px\\n  section-gap-desktop: 80px\\n  section-gap-mobile: 48px\\n  grid-gutter: 24px\\n  element-gap-sm: 8px\\n  element-gap-md: 16px\\n  element-gap-lg: 32px\\n---\\n\\n## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Colors\\n\\nThe palette is inspired by natural, undyed fibers and earthen materials. \\n\\n- **Primary (Clay):** Used for call-to-actions, price accents, and critical indicators. It provides a warm, energetic contrast to the neutral base.\\n- **Secondary (Ink):** The foundation for readability. Used for all primary headings and body text to ensure high legibility against light backgrounds.\\n- **Tertiary (Blush):** A soft accent for secondary surfaces, card backgrounds, and promotional banners.\\n- **Neutral (Cream):** The primary canvas. This off-white base reduces eye strain and feels more premium and \\\"organic\\\" than pure white.\\n- **Named Colors:** **Sage** is reserved for eco-specific callouts or decorative elements to reinforce the sustainability narrative. **Ink-light** is used for secondary navigation and metadata to create visual hierarchy.\\n\\n## Typography\\n\\nThis design system employs a high-contrast pairing to balance heritage and modernity.\\n\\n- **Headlines:** Use **DM Serif Display**. Its graceful curves and high contrast evoke luxury and editorial authority. Use it sparingly for section headers and hero statements.\\n- **Body \\u0026 UI:** Use **DM Sans**. This low-contrast geometric sans-serif ensures maximum legibility across all digital interfaces. \\n- **The \\\"Label-Uppercase\\\" Style:** This is a signature brand element. Use it for navigation, small headings over titles, and button labels. The generous letter-spacing (tracking) is essential to achieving the \\\"premium\\\" feel.\\n- **Line Height:** Maintain a generous line height (1.8 - 1.85) for body text to reinforce the airy, spacious aesthetic.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Shapes\\n\\nThe shape language is \\\"Soft-Modern,\\\" utilizing rounded corners to evoke friendliness and comfort—qualities essential to a wearable fashion brand.\\n\\n- **Small Elements (Buttons, Tags, Pills):** Use `rounded-full` (pill-shaped). This creates a distinct interactive language that feels modern and approachable.\\n- **Medium Elements (Product Images, Floating Cards):** Use `rounded-lg` (1rem / 16px). This softens the grid without making it feel juvenile.\\n- **Large Elements (Banners, Testimonial Containers):** Use `rounded-xl` (1.5rem / 24px) to create \\\"enveloping\\\" containers that feel substantial and high-end.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",6,\"#c97b5a\",\"#2a2420\",\"#f5ede6\",\"#faf7f4\",2,[[\"body-lg\",[\"DM Sans\",\"16px\",\"400\",\"1.8\",\"0.01em\"]],[\"display\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"80px\",\"400\",\"1.1\",\"-0.02em\"]],[\"body-md\",[\"DM Sans\",\"14px\",\"400\",\"1.85\"]],[\"display-mobile\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"44px\",\"400\",\"1.2\"]],[\"label-uppercase\",[\"DM Sans\",\"12px\",\"500\",\"1.2\",\"0.15em\"]],[\"caption\",[\"DM Sans\",\"11px\",\"500\",\"1.4\",\"0.05em\"]],[\"headline-lg\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"40px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"headline-md\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"32px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]]],[[\"element-gap-lg\",\"32px\"],[\"grid-gutter\",\"24px\"],[\"section-gap-desktop\",\"80px\"],[\"element-gap-sm\",\"8px\"],[\"section-gap-mobile\",\"48px\"],[\"container-max\",\"1440px\"],[\"element-gap-md\",\"16px\"]],null,\"dmSerifDisplay\",\"Dm Sans\",\"Dm Sans\"],2,1,null,[null,2,null,null,2,2],null,null,[\"assets/f84726af88af499598b78556bda4af11\",null,[\"Stitch Design System\",null,\"## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",[1,null,3,null,\"#c97b5a\",null,null,null,null,null,26,26,[[\"clay-dark\",\"#A85E40\"],[\"secondary_container\",\"#e9ddd7\"],[\"surface_container_high\",\"#eae8e5\"],[\"on_surface_variant\",\"#53433d\"],[\"inverse_surface\",\"#31302f\"],[\"on_primary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"surface_container_low\",\"#f6f3f0\"],[\"primary\",\"#8c4a2d\"],[\"tertiary_container\",\"#79746e\"],[\"inverse_primary\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"surface_bright\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"primary_container\",\"#aa6243\"],[\"on_primary_fixed\",\"#360f00\"],[\"on_primary_fixed_variant\",\"#72351a\"],[\"background\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"surface_container_lowest\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_primary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"tertiary\",\"#605b56\"],[\"border-subtle\",\"#E8DDD6\"],[\"on_secondary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed\",\"#201a17\"],[\"on_error\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"primary_fixed_dim\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"ink-light\",\"#5A4E48\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed\",\"#1e1b17\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed_variant\",\"#4d4541\"],[\"surface\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"surface_tint\",\"#8f4c2f\"],[\"surface_dim\",\"#dcdad7\"],[\"cream-warm\",\"#F2ECE6\"],[\"on_surface\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"on_tertiary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"inverse_on_surface\",\"#f3f0ed\"],[\"sage\",\"#D6E4D8\"],[\"surface_container_highest\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"on_tertiary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"error_container\",\"#ffdad6\"],[\"on_background\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"secondary_fixed_dim\",\"#cfc4be\"],[\"on_error_container\",\"#93000a\"],[\"secondary_fixed\",\"#ece0da\"],[\"on_secondary_container\",\"#69615c\"],[\"secondary\",\"#655d58\"],[\"surface_container\",\"#f0edea\"],[\"outline_variant\",\"#d9c2b9\"],[\"error\",\"#ba1a1a\"],[\"primary_fixed\",\"#ffdbcd\"],[\"outline\",\"#86736c\"],[\"tertiary_fixed\",\"#e9e1da\"],[\"tertiary_fixed_dim\",\"#ccc5bf\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed_variant\",\"#4a4641\"],[\"surface_variant\",\"#e5e2df\"]],\"---\\nname: Stitch Design System\\ncolors:\\n  surface: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-dim: '#dcdad7'\\n  surface-bright: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-container-lowest: '#ffffff'\\n  surface-container-low: '#f6f3f0'\\n  surface-container: '#f0edea'\\n  surface-container-high: '#eae8e5'\\n  surface-container-highest: '#e5e2df'\\n  on-surface: '#1c1c1a'\\n  on-surface-variant: '#53433d'\\n  inverse-surface: '#31302f'\\n  inverse-on-surface: '#f3f0ed'\\n  outline: '#86736c'\\n  outline-variant: '#d9c2b9'\\n  surface-tint: '#8f4c2f'\\n  primary: '#8c4a2d'\\n  on-primary: '#ffffff'\\n  primary-container: '#aa6243'\\n  on-primary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  inverse-primary: '#ffb597'\\n  secondary: '#655d58'\\n  on-secondary: '#ffffff'\\n  secondary-container: '#e9ddd7'\\n  on-secondary-container: '#69615c'\\n  tertiary: '#605b56'\\n  on-tertiary: '#ffffff'\\n  tertiary-container: '#79746e'\\n  on-tertiary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  error: '#ba1a1a'\\n  on-error: '#ffffff'\\n  error-container: '#ffdad6'\\n  on-error-container: '#93000a'\\n  primary-fixed: '#ffdbcd'\\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#ffb597'\\n  on-primary-fixed: '#360f00'\\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#72351a'\\n  secondary-fixed: '#ece0da'\\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#cfc4be'\\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#201a17'\\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#4d4541'\\n  tertiary-fixed: '#e9e1da'\\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#ccc5bf'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#1e1b17'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#4a4641'\\n  background: '#fcf9f6'\\n  on-background: '#1c1c1a'\\n  surface-variant: '#e5e2df'\\n  clay-dark: '#A85E40'\\n  ink-light: '#5A4E48'\\n  sage: '#D6E4D8'\\n  cream-warm: '#F2ECE6'\\n  border-subtle: '#E8DDD6'\\ntypography:\\n  display:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 80px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.1'\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\n  display-mobile:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 44px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n  headline-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 40px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  headline-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 32px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  body-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.8'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.01em\\n  body-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.85'\\n  label-uppercase:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 12px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.15em\\n  caption:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 11px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.4'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.05em\\nrounded:\\n  sm: 0.25rem\\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\\n  md: 0.75rem\\n  lg: 1rem\\n  xl: 1.5rem\\n  full: 9999px\\nspacing:\\n  container-max: 1440px\\n  section-gap-desktop: 80px\\n  section-gap-mobile: 48px\\n  grid-gutter: 24px\\n  element-gap-sm: 8px\\n  element-gap-md: 16px\\n  element-gap-lg: 32px\\n---\\n\\n## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Colors\\n\\nThe palette is inspired by natural, undyed fibers and earthen materials. \\n\\n- **Primary (Clay):** Used for call-to-actions, price accents, and critical indicators. It provides a warm, energetic contrast to the neutral base.\\n- **Secondary (Ink):** The foundation for readability. Used for all primary headings and body text to ensure high legibility against light backgrounds.\\n- **Tertiary (Blush):** A soft accent for secondary surfaces, card backgrounds, and promotional banners.\\n- **Neutral (Cream):** The primary canvas. This off-white base reduces eye strain and feels more premium and \\\"organic\\\" than pure white.\\n- **Named Colors:** **Sage** is reserved for eco-specific callouts or decorative elements to reinforce the sustainability narrative. **Ink-light** is used for secondary navigation and metadata to create visual hierarchy.\\n\\n## Typography\\n\\nThis design system employs a high-contrast pairing to balance heritage and modernity.\\n\\n- **Headlines:** Use **DM Serif Display**. Its graceful curves and high contrast evoke luxury and editorial authority. Use it sparingly for section headers and hero statements.\\n- **Body \\u0026 UI:** Use **DM Sans**. This low-contrast geometric sans-serif ensures maximum legibility across all digital interfaces. \\n- **The \\\"Label-Uppercase\\\" Style:** This is a signature brand element. Use it for navigation, small headings over titles, and button labels. The generous letter-spacing (tracking) is essential to achieving the \\\"premium\\\" feel.\\n- **Line Height:** Maintain a generous line height (1.8 - 1.85) for body text to reinforce the airy, spacious aesthetic.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Shapes\\n\\nThe shape language is \\\"Soft-Modern,\\\" utilizing rounded corners to evoke friendliness and comfort—qualities essential to a wearable fashion brand.\\n\\n- **Small Elements (Buttons, Tags, Pills):** Use `rounded-full` (pill-shaped). This creates a distinct interactive language that feels modern and approachable.\\n- **Medium Elements (Product Images, Floating Cards):** Use `rounded-lg` (1rem / 16px). This softens the grid without making it feel juvenile.\\n- **Large Elements (Banners, Testimonial Containers):** Use `rounded-xl` (1.5rem / 24px) to create \\\"enveloping\\\" containers that feel substantial and high-end.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",6,\"#c97b5a\",\"#2a2420\",\"#f5ede6\",\"#faf7f4\",2,[[\"caption\",[\"DM Sans\",\"11px\",\"500\",\"1.4\",\"0.05em\"]],[\"headline-lg\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"40px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"headline-md\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"32px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"body-lg\",[\"DM Sans\",\"16px\",\"400\",\"1.8\",\"0.01em\"]],[\"display\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"80px\",\"400\",\"1.1\",\"-0.02em\"]],[\"body-md\",[\"DM Sans\",\"14px\",\"400\",\"1.85\"]],[\"display-mobile\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"44px\",\"400\",\"1.2\"]],[\"label-uppercase\",[\"DM Sans\",\"12px\",\"500\",\"1.2\",\"0.15em\"]]],[[\"grid-gutter\",\"24px\"],[\"section-gap-desktop\",\"80px\"],[\"element-gap-lg\",\"32px\"],[\"element-gap-sm\",\"8px\"],[\"section-gap-mobile\",\"48px\"],[\"container-max\",\"1440px\"],[\"element-gap-md\",\"16px\"]],null,\"dmSerifDisplay\",\"Dm Sans\",\"Dm Sans\"]],1]],[[\"projects/18178749605532028059/files/3c7607f5259e4539837ba2772ac242a4\",null,\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida/AP1WRLsvrqsDfs2lHyRnwTln96BoHZl3Hx1x_ZxoWglLTX5pPsdIPB0iHB52nRbSETLexrFmDvHx6nTAzpE1wQ35sRTo3QPHjxJqoQd2SBFVUjCAWGwW6YkXWrvSgPYGAx3gbrHg--WWCfAemsHdTGo4JDz5p2l5uqfsvKMfTflWnkEnqKys_O5hgqIbVGi6aH33UINg6IWOqxRRsy2i8mzOV4ae4S5qadBisOWr0UBYeNEtj9INfzdsHdihFsrx\"],[\"projects/18178749605532028059/files/e95dcf2d400f4e0199e6cfe1ff6a491e\",null,\"https://contribution.usercontent.google.com/download?c\\u003dCgthaWRhX2NvZGVmeBJ8Eh1hcHBfY29tcGFuaW9uX2dlbmVyYXRlZF9maWxlcxpbCiVodG1sX2U0MGNkZjA4M2MxMjQzOWRhZDMxYzMwNTVkYWNkMDNhEgsSBxDv9_C4jw8YAZIBJAoKcHJvamVjdF9pZBIWQhQxODE3ODc0OTYwNTUzMjAyODA1OQ\\u0026filename\\u003d\\u0026opi\\u003d89354086\",null,null,\"text/html\"],null,null,\"e2d5893384b54f42b8f7cd35486d4e4c\",\"HatterAgent\",\"2560\",\"9108\",\"Stitch — Trang chủ (Redesign) with Scroll Motion\",\"Add scroll-triggered fade-up animations to all major sections (Hero, New Arrivals, Categories, Brand Story, Testimonials). Use IntersectionObserver in a \\u003cscript\\u003e tag to toggle a 'visible' class that triggers CSS transitions. Ensure smooth, elegant entrance effects as the user scrolls down the page. Preserve all existing styles and content.\",\"projects/18178749605532028059/screens/e2d5893384b54f42b8f7cd35486d4e4c\",[1,null,3,null,\"#c97b5a\",null,null,null,null,null,26,26,[[\"on_primary_fixed\",\"#360f00\"],[\"primary_container\",\"#aa6243\"],[\"surface_bright\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed\",\"#201a17\"],[\"on_secondary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"border-subtle\",\"#E8DDD6\"],[\"tertiary\",\"#605b56\"],[\"on_primary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"surface_container_lowest\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_primary_fixed_variant\",\"#72351a\"],[\"background\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"primary_fixed_dim\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"on_error\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"surface_tint\",\"#8f4c2f\"],[\"surface\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed_variant\",\"#4d4541\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed\",\"#1e1b17\"],[\"ink-light\",\"#5A4E48\"],[\"clay-dark\",\"#A85E40\"],[\"surface_container_high\",\"#eae8e5\"],[\"on_surface_variant\",\"#53433d\"],[\"inverse_surface\",\"#31302f\"],[\"secondary_container\",\"#e9ddd7\"],[\"on_primary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"inverse_primary\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"tertiary_container\",\"#79746e\"],[\"primary\",\"#8c4a2d\"],[\"surface_container_low\",\"#f6f3f0\"],[\"secondary_fixed\",\"#ece0da\"],[\"on_secondary_container\",\"#69615c\"],[\"on_error_container\",\"#93000a\"],[\"secondary_fixed_dim\",\"#cfc4be\"],[\"on_background\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"error_container\",\"#ffdad6\"],[\"secondary\",\"#655d58\"],[\"primary_fixed\",\"#ffdbcd\"],[\"error\",\"#ba1a1a\"],[\"outline_variant\",\"#d9c2b9\"],[\"surface_container\",\"#f0edea\"],[\"surface_variant\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed_variant\",\"#4a4641\"],[\"tertiary_fixed_dim\",\"#ccc5bf\"],[\"tertiary_fixed\",\"#e9e1da\"],[\"outline\",\"#86736c\"],[\"cream-warm\",\"#F2ECE6\"],[\"surface_dim\",\"#dcdad7\"],[\"on_surface\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"surface_container_highest\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"sage\",\"#D6E4D8\"],[\"inverse_on_surface\",\"#f3f0ed\"],[\"on_tertiary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_tertiary_container\",\"#fffbff\"]],\"---\\nname: Stitch Design System\\ncolors:\\n  surface: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-dim: '#dcdad7'\\n  surface-bright: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-container-lowest: '#ffffff'\\n  surface-container-low: '#f6f3f0'\\n  surface-container: '#f0edea'\\n  surface-container-high: '#eae8e5'\\n  surface-container-highest: '#e5e2df'\\n  on-surface: '#1c1c1a'\\n  on-surface-variant: '#53433d'\\n  inverse-surface: '#31302f'\\n  inverse-on-surface: '#f3f0ed'\\n  outline: '#86736c'\\n  outline-variant: '#d9c2b9'\\n  surface-tint: '#8f4c2f'\\n  primary: '#8c4a2d'\\n  on-primary: '#ffffff'\\n  primary-container: '#aa6243'\\n  on-primary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  inverse-primary: '#ffb597'\\n  secondary: '#655d58'\\n  on-secondary: '#ffffff'\\n  secondary-container: '#e9ddd7'\\n  on-secondary-container: '#69615c'\\n  tertiary: '#605b56'\\n  on-tertiary: '#ffffff'\\n  tertiary-container: '#79746e'\\n  on-tertiary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  error: '#ba1a1a'\\n  on-error: '#ffffff'\\n  error-container: '#ffdad6'\\n  on-error-container: '#93000a'\\n  primary-fixed: '#ffdbcd'\\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#ffb597'\\n  on-primary-fixed: '#360f00'\\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#72351a'\\n  secondary-fixed: '#ece0da'\\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#cfc4be'\\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#201a17'\\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#4d4541'\\n  tertiary-fixed: '#e9e1da'\\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#ccc5bf'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#1e1b17'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#4a4641'\\n  background: '#fcf9f6'\\n  on-background: '#1c1c1a'\\n  surface-variant: '#e5e2df'\\n  clay-dark: '#A85E40'\\n  ink-light: '#5A4E48'\\n  sage: '#D6E4D8'\\n  cream-warm: '#F2ECE6'\\n  border-subtle: '#E8DDD6'\\ntypography:\\n  display:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 80px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.1'\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\n  display-mobile:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 44px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n  headline-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 40px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  headline-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 32px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  body-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.8'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.01em\\n  body-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.85'\\n  label-uppercase:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 12px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.15em\\n  caption:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 11px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.4'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.05em\\nrounded:\\n  sm: 0.25rem\\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\\n  md: 0.75rem\\n  lg: 1rem\\n  xl: 1.5rem\\n  full: 9999px\\nspacing:\\n  container-max: 1440px\\n  section-gap-desktop: 80px\\n  section-gap-mobile: 48px\\n  grid-gutter: 24px\\n  element-gap-sm: 8px\\n  element-gap-md: 16px\\n  element-gap-lg: 32px\\n---\\n\\n## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Colors\\n\\nThe palette is inspired by natural, undyed fibers and earthen materials. \\n\\n- **Primary (Clay):** Used for call-to-actions, price accents, and critical indicators. It provides a warm, energetic contrast to the neutral base.\\n- **Secondary (Ink):** The foundation for readability. Used for all primary headings and body text to ensure high legibility against light backgrounds.\\n- **Tertiary (Blush):** A soft accent for secondary surfaces, card backgrounds, and promotional banners.\\n- **Neutral (Cream):** The primary canvas. This off-white base reduces eye strain and feels more premium and \\\"organic\\\" than pure white.\\n- **Named Colors:** **Sage** is reserved for eco-specific callouts or decorative elements to reinforce the sustainability narrative. **Ink-light** is used for secondary navigation and metadata to create visual hierarchy.\\n\\n## Typography\\n\\nThis design system employs a high-contrast pairing to balance heritage and modernity.\\n\\n- **Headlines:** Use **DM Serif Display**. Its graceful curves and high contrast evoke luxury and editorial authority. Use it sparingly for section headers and hero statements.\\n- **Body \\u0026 UI:** Use **DM Sans**. This low-contrast geometric sans-serif ensures maximum legibility across all digital interfaces. \\n- **The \\\"Label-Uppercase\\\" Style:** This is a signature brand element. Use it for navigation, small headings over titles, and button labels. The generous letter-spacing (tracking) is essential to achieving the \\\"premium\\\" feel.\\n- **Line Height:** Maintain a generous line height (1.8 - 1.85) for body text to reinforce the airy, spacious aesthetic.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Shapes\\n\\nThe shape language is \\\"Soft-Modern,\\\" utilizing rounded corners to evoke friendliness and comfort—qualities essential to a wearable fashion brand.\\n\\n- **Small Elements (Buttons, Tags, Pills):** Use `rounded-full` (pill-shaped). This creates a distinct interactive language that feels modern and approachable.\\n- **Medium Elements (Product Images, Floating Cards):** Use `rounded-lg` (1rem / 16px). This softens the grid without making it feel juvenile.\\n- **Large Elements (Banners, Testimonial Containers):** Use `rounded-xl` (1.5rem / 24px) to create \\\"enveloping\\\" containers that feel substantial and high-end.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",6,\"#c97b5a\",\"#2a2420\",\"#f5ede6\",\"#faf7f4\",2,[[\"headline-lg\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"40px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"headline-md\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"32px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"caption\",[\"DM Sans\",\"11px\",\"500\",\"1.4\",\"0.05em\"]],[\"body-lg\",[\"DM Sans\",\"16px\",\"400\",\"1.8\",\"0.01em\"]],[\"body-md\",[\"DM Sans\",\"14px\",\"400\",\"1.85\"]],[\"display\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"80px\",\"400\",\"1.1\",\"-0.02em\"]],[\"display-mobile\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"44px\",\"400\",\"1.2\"]],[\"label-uppercase\",[\"DM Sans\",\"12px\",\"500\",\"1.2\",\"0.15em\"]]],[[\"element-gap-md\",\"16px\"],[\"element-gap-lg\",\"32px\"],[\"grid-gutter\",\"24px\"],[\"section-gap-desktop\",\"80px\"],[\"container-max\",\"1440px\"],[\"section-gap-mobile\",\"48px\"],[\"element-gap-sm\",\"8px\"]],null,\"dmSerifDisplay\",\"Dm Sans\",\"Dm Sans\"],2,1,null,[null,2,null,null,2],null,null,[\"assets/f84726af88af499598b78556bda4af11\",null,[\"Stitch Design System\",null,\"## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",[1,null,3,null,\"#c97b5a\",null,null,null,null,null,26,26,[[\"secondary\",\"#655d58\"],[\"on_error_container\",\"#93000a\"],[\"secondary_fixed\",\"#ece0da\"],[\"on_secondary_container\",\"#69615c\"],[\"error_container\",\"#ffdad6\"],[\"on_background\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"secondary_fixed_dim\",\"#cfc4be\"],[\"tertiary_fixed_dim\",\"#ccc5bf\"],[\"tertiary_fixed\",\"#e9e1da\"],[\"outline\",\"#86736c\"],[\"surface_variant\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed_variant\",\"#4a4641\"],[\"outline_variant\",\"#d9c2b9\"],[\"error\",\"#ba1a1a\"],[\"primary_fixed\",\"#ffdbcd\"],[\"surface_container\",\"#f0edea\"],[\"on_surface\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"cream-warm\",\"#F2ECE6\"],[\"surface_dim\",\"#dcdad7\"],[\"on_tertiary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"sage\",\"#D6E4D8\"],[\"surface_container_highest\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"on_tertiary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"inverse_on_surface\",\"#f3f0ed\"],[\"border-subtle\",\"#E8DDD6\"],[\"tertiary\",\"#605b56\"],[\"on_secondary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed\",\"#201a17\"],[\"on_primary_fixed_variant\",\"#72351a\"],[\"background\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"surface_container_lowest\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_primary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"on_primary_fixed\",\"#360f00\"],[\"surface_bright\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"primary_container\",\"#aa6243\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed_variant\",\"#4d4541\"],[\"surface\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"surface_tint\",\"#8f4c2f\"],[\"ink-light\",\"#5A4E48\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed\",\"#1e1b17\"],[\"on_error\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"primary_fixed_dim\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"secondary_container\",\"#e9ddd7\"],[\"surface_container_high\",\"#eae8e5\"],[\"on_surface_variant\",\"#53433d\"],[\"inverse_surface\",\"#31302f\"],[\"clay-dark\",\"#A85E40\"],[\"tertiary_container\",\"#79746e\"],[\"inverse_primary\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"primary\",\"#8c4a2d\"],[\"surface_container_low\",\"#f6f3f0\"],[\"on_primary\",\"#ffffff\"]],\"---\\nname: Stitch Design System\\ncolors:\\n  surface: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-dim: '#dcdad7'\\n  surface-bright: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-container-lowest: '#ffffff'\\n  surface-container-low: '#f6f3f0'\\n  surface-container: '#f0edea'\\n  surface-container-high: '#eae8e5'\\n  surface-container-highest: '#e5e2df'\\n  on-surface: '#1c1c1a'\\n  on-surface-variant: '#53433d'\\n  inverse-surface: '#31302f'\\n  inverse-on-surface: '#f3f0ed'\\n  outline: '#86736c'\\n  outline-variant: '#d9c2b9'\\n  surface-tint: '#8f4c2f'\\n  primary: '#8c4a2d'\\n  on-primary: '#ffffff'\\n  primary-container: '#aa6243'\\n  on-primary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  inverse-primary: '#ffb597'\\n  secondary: '#655d58'\\n  on-secondary: '#ffffff'\\n  secondary-container: '#e9ddd7'\\n  on-secondary-container: '#69615c'\\n  tertiary: '#605b56'\\n  on-tertiary: '#ffffff'\\n  tertiary-container: '#79746e'\\n  on-tertiary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  error: '#ba1a1a'\\n  on-error: '#ffffff'\\n  error-container: '#ffdad6'\\n  on-error-container: '#93000a'\\n  primary-fixed: '#ffdbcd'\\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#ffb597'\\n  on-primary-fixed: '#360f00'\\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#72351a'\\n  secondary-fixed: '#ece0da'\\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#cfc4be'\\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#201a17'\\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#4d4541'\\n  tertiary-fixed: '#e9e1da'\\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#ccc5bf'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#1e1b17'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#4a4641'\\n  background: '#fcf9f6'\\n  on-background: '#1c1c1a'\\n  surface-variant: '#e5e2df'\\n  clay-dark: '#A85E40'\\n  ink-light: '#5A4E48'\\n  sage: '#D6E4D8'\\n  cream-warm: '#F2ECE6'\\n  border-subtle: '#E8DDD6'\\ntypography:\\n  display:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 80px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.1'\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\n  display-mobile:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 44px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n  headline-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 40px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  headline-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 32px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  body-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.8'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.01em\\n  body-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.85'\\n  label-uppercase:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 12px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.15em\\n  caption:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 11px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.4'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.05em\\nrounded:\\n  sm: 0.25rem\\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\\n  md: 0.75rem\\n  lg: 1rem\\n  xl: 1.5rem\\n  full: 9999px\\nspacing:\\n  container-max: 1440px\\n  section-gap-desktop: 80px\\n  section-gap-mobile: 48px\\n  grid-gutter: 24px\\n  element-gap-sm: 8px\\n  element-gap-md: 16px\\n  element-gap-lg: 32px\\n---\\n\\n## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Colors\\n\\nThe palette is inspired by natural, undyed fibers and earthen materials. \\n\\n- **Primary (Clay):** Used for call-to-actions, price accents, and critical indicators. It provides a warm, energetic contrast to the neutral base.\\n- **Secondary (Ink):** The foundation for readability. Used for all primary headings and body text to ensure high legibility against light backgrounds.\\n- **Tertiary (Blush):** A soft accent for secondary surfaces, card backgrounds, and promotional banners.\\n- **Neutral (Cream):** The primary canvas. This off-white base reduces eye strain and feels more premium and \\\"organic\\\" than pure white.\\n- **Named Colors:** **Sage** is reserved for eco-specific callouts or decorative elements to reinforce the sustainability narrative. **Ink-light** is used for secondary navigation and metadata to create visual hierarchy.\\n\\n## Typography\\n\\nThis design system employs a high-contrast pairing to balance heritage and modernity.\\n\\n- **Headlines:** Use **DM Serif Display**. Its graceful curves and high contrast evoke luxury and editorial authority. Use it sparingly for section headers and hero statements.\\n- **Body \\u0026 UI:** Use **DM Sans**. This low-contrast geometric sans-serif ensures maximum legibility across all digital interfaces. \\n- **The \\\"Label-Uppercase\\\" Style:** This is a signature brand element. Use it for navigation, small headings over titles, and button labels. The generous letter-spacing (tracking) is essential to achieving the \\\"premium\\\" feel.\\n- **Line Height:** Maintain a generous line height (1.8 - 1.85) for body text to reinforce the airy, spacious aesthetic.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Shapes\\n\\nThe shape language is \\\"Soft-Modern,\\\" utilizing rounded corners to evoke friendliness and comfort—qualities essential to a wearable fashion brand.\\n\\n- **Small Elements (Buttons, Tags, Pills):** Use `rounded-full` (pill-shaped). This creates a distinct interactive language that feels modern and approachable.\\n- **Medium Elements (Product Images, Floating Cards):** Use `rounded-lg` (1rem / 16px). This softens the grid without making it feel juvenile.\\n- **Large Elements (Banners, Testimonial Containers):** Use `rounded-xl` (1.5rem / 24px) to create \\\"enveloping\\\" containers that feel substantial and high-end.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",6,\"#c97b5a\",\"#2a2420\",\"#f5ede6\",\"#faf7f4\",2,[[\"display-mobile\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"44px\",\"400\",\"1.2\"]],[\"label-uppercase\",[\"DM Sans\",\"12px\",\"500\",\"1.2\",\"0.15em\"]],[\"body-lg\",[\"DM Sans\",\"16px\",\"400\",\"1.8\",\"0.01em\"]],[\"body-md\",[\"DM Sans\",\"14px\",\"400\",\"1.85\"]],[\"display\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"80px\",\"400\",\"1.1\",\"-0.02em\"]],[\"headline-lg\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"40px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"headline-md\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"32px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"caption\",[\"DM Sans\",\"11px\",\"500\",\"1.4\",\"0.05em\"]]],[[\"element-gap-sm\",\"8px\"],[\"section-gap-mobile\",\"48px\"],[\"container-max\",\"1440px\"],[\"section-gap-desktop\",\"80px\"],[\"grid-gutter\",\"24px\"],[\"element-gap-lg\",\"32px\"],[\"element-gap-md\",\"16px\"]],null,\"dmSerifDisplay\",\"Dm Sans\",\"Dm Sans\"]],1]],[[\"projects/18178749605532028059/files/9322127402826010330\",null,\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida/AP1WRLucQjp8tTEF9RmQ3RbFl5mghU2cYttViWofF7Fr69Ed79-zIm7g64LXNcRBnyR884h6GPsnYNb2WhUSJSNU5SqeMFIrngMbs4zLRwWEbw9zKS9ealcfdPcdmdDMGWrLsxA3p2HMyuzQ4QI_uENhYK0-gXUcxDJ0myelRoRxUSK0TOQVgqWMvGMCXum-9RorgwF-Vj3n5zDvh5gV7t3qHdfeZlhoTXmFaPIl2Thf4Rd6KNlWq3Ek6qfW9CA\"],[\"projects/18178749605532028059/files/7836642086432560469\",null,\"https://contribution.usercontent.google.com/download?c\\u003dCgthaWRhX2NvZGVmeBJ8Eh1hcHBfY29tcGFuaW9uX2dlbmVyYXRlZF9maWxlcxpbCiVodG1sXzAwMDY1NDlkMDFlNzA4ZjYwMWE2MmVhYzhiMzkyZWRiEgsSBxDv9_C4jw8YAZIBJAoKcHJvamVjdF9pZBIWQhQxODE3ODc0OTYwNTUzMjAyODA1OQ\\u0026filename\\u003d\\u0026opi\\u003d89354086\",null,null,\"text/html\"],null,null,\"37939af16106449b8e68a35301563931\",\"figaro_agent\",\"2560\",\"7390\",\"Stitch — Chi tiết sản phẩm Bé Trai\",\"Create a high-fidelity product detail page for a boys' clothing item: 'Set Áo Thun \\u0026 Quần Linen'. \\n\\nThe page should feature:\\n1. **Hero Section**: Large, professional studio photography of the boy wearing the sage green t-shirt and linen shorts ({{DATA:IMAGE:IMAGE_10}}).\\n2. **Product Info**: \\n   - Title: Set Áo Thun \\u0026 Quần Linen\\n   - Price: 950.000₫\\n   - Description: A comfortable and sustainable outfit for boys. The t-shirt is made from 100% organic cotton, paired with breathable linen shorts. Earthy tones and soft natural fabrics ensure comfort for sensitive skin.\\n   - Size Selector: S, M, L, XL.\\n   - Color Selection: Earthy tones (Sage Green, Sand).\\n   - 'Thêm vào giỏ hàng' and 'Mua ngay' buttons.\\n3. **Product Details Tabs/Accordions**: Craftsmanship, Material (Organic Cotton \\u0026 Linen), Shipping \\u0026 Returns.\\n4. **Lifestyle/Detail Gallery**: Grid showing close-up shots of the fabric texture and wooden buttons (using references {{DATA:IMAGE:IMAGE_22}} for the shirt detail).\\n5. **Related Products**: 'Có thể bạn sẽ thích' section featuring the Organic Cotton Hoodie ({{DATA:IMAGE:IMAGE_25}}) and Recycled Denim Overalls ({{DATA:IMAGE:IMAGE_37}}).\\n6. **Styling**: Maintain the Stitch aesthetic — minimalist, plenty of whitespace, serif typography for headings (font-serif), and earthy colors (bg-cream, text-clay-dark). Use the predicted TopNavBar and Footer.\",\"projects/18178749605532028059/screens/37939af16106449b8e68a35301563931\",[1,null,3,null,\"#c97b5a\",null,null,null,null,null,26,26,[[\"inverse_primary\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"tertiary_container\",\"#79746e\"],[\"primary\",\"#8c4a2d\"],[\"surface_container_low\",\"#f6f3f0\"],[\"on_primary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"secondary_container\",\"#e9ddd7\"],[\"surface_container_high\",\"#eae8e5\"],[\"on_surface_variant\",\"#53433d\"],[\"inverse_surface\",\"#31302f\"],[\"clay-dark\",\"#A85E40\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed_variant\",\"#4d4541\"],[\"surface_tint\",\"#8f4c2f\"],[\"surface\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed\",\"#1e1b17\"],[\"ink-light\",\"#5A4E48\"],[\"on_error\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"primary_fixed_dim\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"tertiary\",\"#605b56\"],[\"border-subtle\",\"#E8DDD6\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed\",\"#201a17\"],[\"on_secondary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"background\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_primary_fixed_variant\",\"#72351a\"],[\"on_primary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"surface_container_lowest\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_primary_fixed\",\"#360f00\"],[\"primary_container\",\"#aa6243\"],[\"surface_bright\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_tertiary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"sage\",\"#D6E4D8\"],[\"surface_container_highest\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"on_tertiary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"inverse_on_surface\",\"#f3f0ed\"],[\"on_surface\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"cream-warm\",\"#F2ECE6\"],[\"surface_dim\",\"#dcdad7\"],[\"tertiary_fixed_dim\",\"#ccc5bf\"],[\"tertiary_fixed\",\"#e9e1da\"],[\"outline\",\"#86736c\"],[\"surface_variant\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed_variant\",\"#4a4641\"],[\"outline_variant\",\"#d9c2b9\"],[\"primary_fixed\",\"#ffdbcd\"],[\"error\",\"#ba1a1a\"],[\"surface_container\",\"#f0edea\"],[\"secondary\",\"#655d58\"],[\"on_error_container\",\"#93000a\"],[\"secondary_fixed\",\"#ece0da\"],[\"on_secondary_container\",\"#69615c\"],[\"error_container\",\"#ffdad6\"],[\"secondary_fixed_dim\",\"#cfc4be\"],[\"on_background\",\"#1c1c1a\"]],\"---\\nname: Stitch Design System\\ncolors:\\n  surface: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-dim: '#dcdad7'\\n  surface-bright: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-container-lowest: '#ffffff'\\n  surface-container-low: '#f6f3f0'\\n  surface-container: '#f0edea'\\n  surface-container-high: '#eae8e5'\\n  surface-container-highest: '#e5e2df'\\n  on-surface: '#1c1c1a'\\n  on-surface-variant: '#53433d'\\n  inverse-surface: '#31302f'\\n  inverse-on-surface: '#f3f0ed'\\n  outline: '#86736c'\\n  outline-variant: '#d9c2b9'\\n  surface-tint: '#8f4c2f'\\n  primary: '#8c4a2d'\\n  on-primary: '#ffffff'\\n  primary-container: '#aa6243'\\n  on-primary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  inverse-primary: '#ffb597'\\n  secondary: '#655d58'\\n  on-secondary: '#ffffff'\\n  secondary-container: '#e9ddd7'\\n  on-secondary-container: '#69615c'\\n  tertiary: '#605b56'\\n  on-tertiary: '#ffffff'\\n  tertiary-container: '#79746e'\\n  on-tertiary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  error: '#ba1a1a'\\n  on-error: '#ffffff'\\n  error-container: '#ffdad6'\\n  on-error-container: '#93000a'\\n  primary-fixed: '#ffdbcd'\\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#ffb597'\\n  on-primary-fixed: '#360f00'\\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#72351a'\\n  secondary-fixed: '#ece0da'\\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#cfc4be'\\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#201a17'\\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#4d4541'\\n  tertiary-fixed: '#e9e1da'\\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#ccc5bf'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#1e1b17'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#4a4641'\\n  background: '#fcf9f6'\\n  on-background: '#1c1c1a'\\n  surface-variant: '#e5e2df'\\n  clay-dark: '#A85E40'\\n  ink-light: '#5A4E48'\\n  sage: '#D6E4D8'\\n  cream-warm: '#F2ECE6'\\n  border-subtle: '#E8DDD6'\\ntypography:\\n  display:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 80px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.1'\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\n  display-mobile:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 44px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n  headline-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 40px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  headline-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 32px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  body-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.8'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.01em\\n  body-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.85'\\n  label-uppercase:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 12px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.15em\\n  caption:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 11px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.4'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.05em\\nrounded:\\n  sm: 0.25rem\\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\\n  md: 0.75rem\\n  lg: 1rem\\n  xl: 1.5rem\\n  full: 9999px\\nspacing:\\n  container-max: 1440px\\n  section-gap-desktop: 80px\\n  section-gap-mobile: 48px\\n  grid-gutter: 24px\\n  element-gap-sm: 8px\\n  element-gap-md: 16px\\n  element-gap-lg: 32px\\n---\\n\\n## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Colors\\n\\nThe palette is inspired by natural, undyed fibers and earthen materials. \\n\\n- **Primary (Clay):** Used for call-to-actions, price accents, and critical indicators. It provides a warm, energetic contrast to the neutral base.\\n- **Secondary (Ink):** The foundation for readability. Used for all primary headings and body text to ensure high legibility against light backgrounds.\\n- **Tertiary (Blush):** A soft accent for secondary surfaces, card backgrounds, and promotional banners.\\n- **Neutral (Cream):** The primary canvas. This off-white base reduces eye strain and feels more premium and \\\"organic\\\" than pure white.\\n- **Named Colors:** **Sage** is reserved for eco-specific callouts or decorative elements to reinforce the sustainability narrative. **Ink-light** is used for secondary navigation and metadata to create visual hierarchy.\\n\\n## Typography\\n\\nThis design system employs a high-contrast pairing to balance heritage and modernity.\\n\\n- **Headlines:** Use **DM Serif Display**. Its graceful curves and high contrast evoke luxury and editorial authority. Use it sparingly for section headers and hero statements.\\n- **Body \\u0026 UI:** Use **DM Sans**. This low-contrast geometric sans-serif ensures maximum legibility across all digital interfaces. \\n- **The \\\"Label-Uppercase\\\" Style:** This is a signature brand element. Use it for navigation, small headings over titles, and button labels. The generous letter-spacing (tracking) is essential to achieving the \\\"premium\\\" feel.\\n- **Line Height:** Maintain a generous line height (1.8 - 1.85) for body text to reinforce the airy, spacious aesthetic.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Shapes\\n\\nThe shape language is \\\"Soft-Modern,\\\" utilizing rounded corners to evoke friendliness and comfort—qualities essential to a wearable fashion brand.\\n\\n- **Small Elements (Buttons, Tags, Pills):** Use `rounded-full` (pill-shaped). This creates a distinct interactive language that feels modern and approachable.\\n- **Medium Elements (Product Images, Floating Cards):** Use `rounded-lg` (1rem / 16px). This softens the grid without making it feel juvenile.\\n- **Large Elements (Banners, Testimonial Containers):** Use `rounded-xl` (1.5rem / 24px) to create \\\"enveloping\\\" containers that feel substantial and high-end.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",6,\"#c97b5a\",\"#2a2420\",\"#f5ede6\",\"#faf7f4\",2,[[\"caption\",[\"DM Sans\",\"11px\",\"500\",\"1.4\",\"0.05em\"]],[\"headline-lg\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"40px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"headline-md\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"32px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"body-lg\",[\"DM Sans\",\"16px\",\"400\",\"1.8\",\"0.01em\"]],[\"display\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"80px\",\"400\",\"1.1\",\"-0.02em\"]],[\"body-md\",[\"DM Sans\",\"14px\",\"400\",\"1.85\"]],[\"display-mobile\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"44px\",\"400\",\"1.2\"]],[\"label-uppercase\",[\"DM Sans\",\"12px\",\"500\",\"1.2\",\"0.15em\"]]],[[\"element-gap-md\",\"16px\"],[\"section-gap-desktop\",\"80px\"],[\"grid-gutter\",\"24px\"],[\"element-gap-lg\",\"32px\"],[\"container-max\",\"1440px\"],[\"element-gap-sm\",\"8px\"],[\"section-gap-mobile\",\"48px\"]],null,\"dmSerifDisplay\",\"Dm Sans\",\"Dm Sans\"],2,1,null,[null,2,null,null,2,2],null,null,[\"assets/f84726af88af499598b78556bda4af11\",null,[\"Stitch Design System\",null,\"## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",[1,null,3,null,\"#c97b5a\",null,null,null,null,null,26,26,[[\"primary_container\",\"#aa6243\"],[\"surface_bright\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_primary_fixed\",\"#360f00\"],[\"background\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_primary_fixed_variant\",\"#72351a\"],[\"on_primary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"surface_container_lowest\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"tertiary\",\"#605b56\"],[\"border-subtle\",\"#E8DDD6\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed\",\"#201a17\"],[\"on_secondary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_error\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"primary_fixed_dim\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed\",\"#1e1b17\"],[\"ink-light\",\"#5A4E48\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed_variant\",\"#4d4541\"],[\"surface_tint\",\"#8f4c2f\"],[\"surface\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"clay-dark\",\"#A85E40\"],[\"secondary_container\",\"#e9ddd7\"],[\"surface_container_high\",\"#eae8e5\"],[\"on_surface_variant\",\"#53433d\"],[\"inverse_surface\",\"#31302f\"],[\"on_primary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"surface_container_low\",\"#f6f3f0\"],[\"primary\",\"#8c4a2d\"],[\"inverse_primary\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"tertiary_container\",\"#79746e\"],[\"error_container\",\"#ffdad6\"],[\"secondary_fixed_dim\",\"#cfc4be\"],[\"on_background\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"on_error_container\",\"#93000a\"],[\"secondary_fixed\",\"#ece0da\"],[\"on_secondary_container\",\"#69615c\"],[\"secondary\",\"#655d58\"],[\"surface_container\",\"#f0edea\"],[\"outline_variant\",\"#d9c2b9\"],[\"primary_fixed\",\"#ffdbcd\"],[\"error\",\"#ba1a1a\"],[\"tertiary_fixed_dim\",\"#ccc5bf\"],[\"tertiary_fixed\",\"#e9e1da\"],[\"outline\",\"#86736c\"],[\"surface_variant\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed_variant\",\"#4a4641\"],[\"surface_dim\",\"#dcdad7\"],[\"cream-warm\",\"#F2ECE6\"],[\"on_surface\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"on_tertiary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"inverse_on_surface\",\"#f3f0ed\"],[\"sage\",\"#D6E4D8\"],[\"surface_container_highest\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"on_tertiary_container\",\"#fffbff\"]],\"---\\nname: Stitch Design System\\ncolors:\\n  surface: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-dim: '#dcdad7'\\n  surface-bright: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-container-lowest: '#ffffff'\\n  surface-container-low: '#f6f3f0'\\n  surface-container: '#f0edea'\\n  surface-container-high: '#eae8e5'\\n  surface-container-highest: '#e5e2df'\\n  on-surface: '#1c1c1a'\\n  on-surface-variant: '#53433d'\\n  inverse-surface: '#31302f'\\n  inverse-on-surface: '#f3f0ed'\\n  outline: '#86736c'\\n  outline-variant: '#d9c2b9'\\n  surface-tint: '#8f4c2f'\\n  primary: '#8c4a2d'\\n  on-primary: '#ffffff'\\n  primary-container: '#aa6243'\\n  on-primary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  inverse-primary: '#ffb597'\\n  secondary: '#655d58'\\n  on-secondary: '#ffffff'\\n  secondary-container: '#e9ddd7'\\n  on-secondary-container: '#69615c'\\n  tertiary: '#605b56'\\n  on-tertiary: '#ffffff'\\n  tertiary-container: '#79746e'\\n  on-tertiary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  error: '#ba1a1a'\\n  on-error: '#ffffff'\\n  error-container: '#ffdad6'\\n  on-error-container: '#93000a'\\n  primary-fixed: '#ffdbcd'\\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#ffb597'\\n  on-primary-fixed: '#360f00'\\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#72351a'\\n  secondary-fixed: '#ece0da'\\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#cfc4be'\\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#201a17'\\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#4d4541'\\n  tertiary-fixed: '#e9e1da'\\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#ccc5bf'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#1e1b17'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#4a4641'\\n  background: '#fcf9f6'\\n  on-background: '#1c1c1a'\\n  surface-variant: '#e5e2df'\\n  clay-dark: '#A85E40'\\n  ink-light: '#5A4E48'\\n  sage: '#D6E4D8'\\n  cream-warm: '#F2ECE6'\\n  border-subtle: '#E8DDD6'\\ntypography:\\n  display:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 80px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.1'\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\n  display-mobile:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 44px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n  headline-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 40px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  headline-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 32px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  body-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.8'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.01em\\n  body-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.85'\\n  label-uppercase:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 12px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.15em\\n  caption:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 11px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.4'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.05em\\nrounded:\\n  sm: 0.25rem\\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\\n  md: 0.75rem\\n  lg: 1rem\\n  xl: 1.5rem\\n  full: 9999px\\nspacing:\\n  container-max: 1440px\\n  section-gap-desktop: 80px\\n  section-gap-mobile: 48px\\n  grid-gutter: 24px\\n  element-gap-sm: 8px\\n  element-gap-md: 16px\\n  element-gap-lg: 32px\\n---\\n\\n## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Colors\\n\\nThe palette is inspired by natural, undyed fibers and earthen materials. \\n\\n- **Primary (Clay):** Used for call-to-actions, price accents, and critical indicators. It provides a warm, energetic contrast to the neutral base.\\n- **Secondary (Ink):** The foundation for readability. Used for all primary headings and body text to ensure high legibility against light backgrounds.\\n- **Tertiary (Blush):** A soft accent for secondary surfaces, card backgrounds, and promotional banners.\\n- **Neutral (Cream):** The primary canvas. This off-white base reduces eye strain and feels more premium and \\\"organic\\\" than pure white.\\n- **Named Colors:** **Sage** is reserved for eco-specific callouts or decorative elements to reinforce the sustainability narrative. **Ink-light** is used for secondary navigation and metadata to create visual hierarchy.\\n\\n## Typography\\n\\nThis design system employs a high-contrast pairing to balance heritage and modernity.\\n\\n- **Headlines:** Use **DM Serif Display**. Its graceful curves and high contrast evoke luxury and editorial authority. Use it sparingly for section headers and hero statements.\\n- **Body \\u0026 UI:** Use **DM Sans**. This low-contrast geometric sans-serif ensures maximum legibility across all digital interfaces. \\n- **The \\\"Label-Uppercase\\\" Style:** This is a signature brand element. Use it for navigation, small headings over titles, and button labels. The generous letter-spacing (tracking) is essential to achieving the \\\"premium\\\" feel.\\n- **Line Height:** Maintain a generous line height (1.8 - 1.85) for body text to reinforce the airy, spacious aesthetic.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Shapes\\n\\nThe shape language is \\\"Soft-Modern,\\\" utilizing rounded corners to evoke friendliness and comfort—qualities essential to a wearable fashion brand.\\n\\n- **Small Elements (Buttons, Tags, Pills):** Use `rounded-full` (pill-shaped). This creates a distinct interactive language that feels modern and approachable.\\n- **Medium Elements (Product Images, Floating Cards):** Use `rounded-lg` (1rem / 16px). This softens the grid without making it feel juvenile.\\n- **Large Elements (Banners, Testimonial Containers):** Use `rounded-xl` (1.5rem / 24px) to create \\\"enveloping\\\" containers that feel substantial and high-end.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",6,\"#c97b5a\",\"#2a2420\",\"#f5ede6\",\"#faf7f4\",2,[[\"body-lg\",[\"DM Sans\",\"16px\",\"400\",\"1.8\",\"0.01em\"]],[\"body-md\",[\"DM Sans\",\"14px\",\"400\",\"1.85\"]],[\"display\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"80px\",\"400\",\"1.1\",\"-0.02em\"]],[\"display-mobile\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"44px\",\"400\",\"1.2\"]],[\"label-uppercase\",[\"DM Sans\",\"12px\",\"500\",\"1.2\",\"0.15em\"]],[\"headline-lg\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"40px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"headline-md\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"32px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"caption\",[\"DM Sans\",\"11px\",\"500\",\"1.4\",\"0.05em\"]]],[[\"element-gap-md\",\"16px\"],[\"element-gap-lg\",\"32px\"],[\"grid-gutter\",\"24px\"],[\"section-gap-desktop\",\"80px\"],[\"container-max\",\"1440px\"],[\"section-gap-mobile\",\"48px\"],[\"element-gap-sm\",\"8px\"]],null,\"dmSerifDisplay\",\"Dm Sans\",\"Dm Sans\"]],1]],[[\"projects/18178749605532028059/files/12442280056080737227\",null,\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida/AP1WRLsHN9Tfyh12f4P7O0Vs123Gmw-3IuAUoDCq9Q-b4YUv85u0XmCvKDceu1v_I2MWpSHBnC7FfVTKHWY76xQmupzr3j3Mr1VkieTOScpSW2wDAVP2e_JVpV24IHGN70KmHcAKp6xqqHQuPCjcLGYS4eLxOLcqw1vyzAroAg_2_n14fe0GeAee4SX36GLff3HosEfFv62nDYwRSmA4XSh9CtFi0VyQToL8-1lhYmVRgYVwRQw_Hu1FQNahCJ1C\"],[\"projects/18178749605532028059/files/8538123406195920953\",null,\"https://contribution.usercontent.google.com/download?c\\u003dCgthaWRhX2NvZGVmeBJ8Eh1hcHBfY29tcGFuaW9uX2dlbmVyYXRlZF9maWxlcxpbCiVodG1sXzAwMDY1NDljZTY4MDk2N2EwMzgzOTJiN2M1MGQ2MjVmEgsSBxDv9_C4jw8YAZIBJAoKcHJvamVjdF9pZBIWQhQxODE3ODc0OTYwNTUzMjAyODA1OQ\\u0026filename\\u003d\\u0026opi\\u003d89354086\",null,null,\"text/html\"],null,null,\"265483c68abe4654802eca1db6aa0167\",\"HatterAgent\",\"2560\",\"13238\",\"Stitch — Trang chủ (Kids Fashion Theme)\",\"Update the Home Page ({{DATA:DOCUMENT:DOCUMENT_47}}) images to focus on kids' fashion (boys and girls). Replace the adult-focused hero and product images with the following assets:\\n- Hero: Use a high-quality image of kids' fashion.\\n- Sale Section: Use kids' clothing images like {{DATA:IMAGE:IMAGE_15}} (sweater), {{DATA:IMAGE:IMAGE_19}} (dress), {{DATA:IMAGE:IMAGE_41}} (overalls), {{DATA:IMAGE:IMAGE_29}} (hoodie).\\n- Best Sellers: Use {{DATA:IMAGE:IMAGE_12}} (boy outfit), {{DATA:IMAGE:IMAGE_54}} (girl outfit), {{DATA:IMAGE:IMAGE_26}} (linen shirt), {{DATA:IMAGE:IMAGE_56}} (linen overalls).\\n- Newest: Use {{DATA:IMAGE:IMAGE_58}} (sneakers) and other kids' apparel.\\nEnsure all text and labels match the \\\"Sustainable Kids Fashion\\\" brand (Stitch Kids). Keep the centered titles, search, and sale/best seller sections as they are, just swapping the content and images to be kid-centric.\",\"projects/18178749605532028059/screens/265483c68abe4654802eca1db6aa0167\",[1,null,3,null,\"#c97b5a\",null,null,null,null,null,26,26,[[\"primary_container\",\"#aa6243\"],[\"surface_bright\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_primary_fixed\",\"#360f00\"],[\"on_primary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"surface_container_lowest\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_primary_fixed_variant\",\"#72351a\"],[\"background\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed\",\"#201a17\"],[\"on_secondary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"border-subtle\",\"#E8DDD6\"],[\"tertiary\",\"#605b56\"],[\"primary_fixed_dim\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"on_error\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed\",\"#1e1b17\"],[\"ink-light\",\"#5A4E48\"],[\"surface_tint\",\"#8f4c2f\"],[\"surface\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed_variant\",\"#4d4541\"],[\"clay-dark\",\"#A85E40\"],[\"inverse_surface\",\"#31302f\"],[\"on_surface_variant\",\"#53433d\"],[\"surface_container_high\",\"#eae8e5\"],[\"secondary_container\",\"#e9ddd7\"],[\"on_primary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"surface_container_low\",\"#f6f3f0\"],[\"primary\",\"#8c4a2d\"],[\"inverse_primary\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"tertiary_container\",\"#79746e\"],[\"secondary_fixed_dim\",\"#cfc4be\"],[\"on_background\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"error_container\",\"#ffdad6\"],[\"secondary_fixed\",\"#ece0da\"],[\"on_secondary_container\",\"#69615c\"],[\"on_error_container\",\"#93000a\"],[\"secondary\",\"#655d58\"],[\"surface_container\",\"#f0edea\"],[\"primary_fixed\",\"#ffdbcd\"],[\"error\",\"#ba1a1a\"],[\"outline_variant\",\"#d9c2b9\"],[\"surface_variant\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed_variant\",\"#4a4641\"],[\"tertiary_fixed_dim\",\"#ccc5bf\"],[\"tertiary_fixed\",\"#e9e1da\"],[\"outline\",\"#86736c\"],[\"surface_dim\",\"#dcdad7\"],[\"cream-warm\",\"#F2ECE6\"],[\"on_surface\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"inverse_on_surface\",\"#f3f0ed\"],[\"on_tertiary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"surface_container_highest\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"sage\",\"#D6E4D8\"],[\"on_tertiary_container\",\"#fffbff\"]],\"---\\nname: Stitch Design System\\ncolors:\\n  surface: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-dim: '#dcdad7'\\n  surface-bright: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-container-lowest: '#ffffff'\\n  surface-container-low: '#f6f3f0'\\n  surface-container: '#f0edea'\\n  surface-container-high: '#eae8e5'\\n  surface-container-highest: '#e5e2df'\\n  on-surface: '#1c1c1a'\\n  on-surface-variant: '#53433d'\\n  inverse-surface: '#31302f'\\n  inverse-on-surface: '#f3f0ed'\\n  outline: '#86736c'\\n  outline-variant: '#d9c2b9'\\n  surface-tint: '#8f4c2f'\\n  primary: '#8c4a2d'\\n  on-primary: '#ffffff'\\n  primary-container: '#aa6243'\\n  on-primary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  inverse-primary: '#ffb597'\\n  secondary: '#655d58'\\n  on-secondary: '#ffffff'\\n  secondary-container: '#e9ddd7'\\n  on-secondary-container: '#69615c'\\n  tertiary: '#605b56'\\n  on-tertiary: '#ffffff'\\n  tertiary-container: '#79746e'\\n  on-tertiary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  error: '#ba1a1a'\\n  on-error: '#ffffff'\\n  error-container: '#ffdad6'\\n  on-error-container: '#93000a'\\n  primary-fixed: '#ffdbcd'\\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#ffb597'\\n  on-primary-fixed: '#360f00'\\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#72351a'\\n  secondary-fixed: '#ece0da'\\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#cfc4be'\\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#201a17'\\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#4d4541'\\n  tertiary-fixed: '#e9e1da'\\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#ccc5bf'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#1e1b17'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#4a4641'\\n  background: '#fcf9f6'\\n  on-background: '#1c1c1a'\\n  surface-variant: '#e5e2df'\\n  clay-dark: '#A85E40'\\n  ink-light: '#5A4E48'\\n  sage: '#D6E4D8'\\n  cream-warm: '#F2ECE6'\\n  border-subtle: '#E8DDD6'\\ntypography:\\n  display:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 80px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.1'\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\n  display-mobile:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 44px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n  headline-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 40px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  headline-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 32px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  body-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.8'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.01em\\n  body-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.85'\\n  label-uppercase:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 12px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.15em\\n  caption:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 11px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.4'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.05em\\nrounded:\\n  sm: 0.25rem\\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\\n  md: 0.75rem\\n  lg: 1rem\\n  xl: 1.5rem\\n  full: 9999px\\nspacing:\\n  container-max: 1440px\\n  section-gap-desktop: 80px\\n  section-gap-mobile: 48px\\n  grid-gutter: 24px\\n  element-gap-sm: 8px\\n  element-gap-md: 16px\\n  element-gap-lg: 32px\\n---\\n\\n## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Colors\\n\\nThe palette is inspired by natural, undyed fibers and earthen materials. \\n\\n- **Primary (Clay):** Used for call-to-actions, price accents, and critical indicators. It provides a warm, energetic contrast to the neutral base.\\n- **Secondary (Ink):** The foundation for readability. Used for all primary headings and body text to ensure high legibility against light backgrounds.\\n- **Tertiary (Blush):** A soft accent for secondary surfaces, card backgrounds, and promotional banners.\\n- **Neutral (Cream):** The primary canvas. This off-white base reduces eye strain and feels more premium and \\\"organic\\\" than pure white.\\n- **Named Colors:** **Sage** is reserved for eco-specific callouts or decorative elements to reinforce the sustainability narrative. **Ink-light** is used for secondary navigation and metadata to create visual hierarchy.\\n\\n## Typography\\n\\nThis design system employs a high-contrast pairing to balance heritage and modernity.\\n\\n- **Headlines:** Use **DM Serif Display**. Its graceful curves and high contrast evoke luxury and editorial authority. Use it sparingly for section headers and hero statements.\\n- **Body \\u0026 UI:** Use **DM Sans**. This low-contrast geometric sans-serif ensures maximum legibility across all digital interfaces. \\n- **The \\\"Label-Uppercase\\\" Style:** This is a signature brand element. Use it for navigation, small headings over titles, and button labels. The generous letter-spacing (tracking) is essential to achieving the \\\"premium\\\" feel.\\n- **Line Height:** Maintain a generous line height (1.8 - 1.85) for body text to reinforce the airy, spacious aesthetic.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Shapes\\n\\nThe shape language is \\\"Soft-Modern,\\\" utilizing rounded corners to evoke friendliness and comfort—qualities essential to a wearable fashion brand.\\n\\n- **Small Elements (Buttons, Tags, Pills):** Use `rounded-full` (pill-shaped). This creates a distinct interactive language that feels modern and approachable.\\n- **Medium Elements (Product Images, Floating Cards):** Use `rounded-lg` (1rem / 16px). This softens the grid without making it feel juvenile.\\n- **Large Elements (Banners, Testimonial Containers):** Use `rounded-xl` (1.5rem / 24px) to create \\\"enveloping\\\" containers that feel substantial and high-end.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",6,\"#c97b5a\",\"#2a2420\",\"#f5ede6\",\"#faf7f4\",2,[[\"caption\",[\"DM Sans\",\"11px\",\"500\",\"1.4\",\"0.05em\"]],[\"headline-lg\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"40px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"headline-md\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"32px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"display-mobile\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"44px\",\"400\",\"1.2\"]],[\"label-uppercase\",[\"DM Sans\",\"12px\",\"500\",\"1.2\",\"0.15em\"]],[\"body-md\",[\"DM Sans\",\"14px\",\"400\",\"1.85\"]],[\"display\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"80px\",\"400\",\"1.1\",\"-0.02em\"]],[\"body-lg\",[\"DM Sans\",\"16px\",\"400\",\"1.8\",\"0.01em\"]]],[[\"element-gap-md\",\"16px\"],[\"element-gap-lg\",\"32px\"],[\"grid-gutter\",\"24px\"],[\"section-gap-desktop\",\"80px\"],[\"container-max\",\"1440px\"],[\"section-gap-mobile\",\"48px\"],[\"element-gap-sm\",\"8px\"]],null,\"dmSerifDisplay\",\"Dm Sans\",\"Dm Sans\"],2,1,null,[null,2,null,null,2,2],null,null,[\"assets/f84726af88af499598b78556bda4af11\",null,[\"Stitch Design System\",null,\"## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",[1,null,3,null,\"#c97b5a\",null,null,null,null,null,26,26,[[\"clay-dark\",\"#A85E40\"],[\"secondary_container\",\"#e9ddd7\"],[\"inverse_surface\",\"#31302f\"],[\"on_surface_variant\",\"#53433d\"],[\"surface_container_high\",\"#eae8e5\"],[\"on_primary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"surface_container_low\",\"#f6f3f0\"],[\"primary\",\"#8c4a2d\"],[\"inverse_primary\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"tertiary_container\",\"#79746e\"],[\"primary_container\",\"#aa6243\"],[\"surface_bright\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_primary_fixed\",\"#360f00\"],[\"on_primary_fixed_variant\",\"#72351a\"],[\"background\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_primary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"surface_container_lowest\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"tertiary\",\"#605b56\"],[\"border-subtle\",\"#E8DDD6\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed\",\"#201a17\"],[\"on_secondary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_error\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"primary_fixed_dim\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed\",\"#1e1b17\"],[\"ink-light\",\"#5A4E48\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed_variant\",\"#4d4541\"],[\"surface_tint\",\"#8f4c2f\"],[\"surface\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"surface_dim\",\"#dcdad7\"],[\"cream-warm\",\"#F2ECE6\"],[\"on_surface\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"on_tertiary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"inverse_on_surface\",\"#f3f0ed\"],[\"sage\",\"#D6E4D8\"],[\"surface_container_highest\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"on_tertiary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"error_container\",\"#ffdad6\"],[\"secondary_fixed_dim\",\"#cfc4be\"],[\"on_background\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"on_error_container\",\"#93000a\"],[\"on_secondary_container\",\"#69615c\"],[\"secondary_fixed\",\"#ece0da\"],[\"secondary\",\"#655d58\"],[\"surface_container\",\"#f0edea\"],[\"outline_variant\",\"#d9c2b9\"],[\"primary_fixed\",\"#ffdbcd\"],[\"error\",\"#ba1a1a\"],[\"tertiary_fixed\",\"#e9e1da\"],[\"tertiary_fixed_dim\",\"#ccc5bf\"],[\"outline\",\"#86736c\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed_variant\",\"#4a4641\"],[\"surface_variant\",\"#e5e2df\"]],\"---\\nname: Stitch Design System\\ncolors:\\n  surface: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-dim: '#dcdad7'\\n  surface-bright: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-container-lowest: '#ffffff'\\n  surface-container-low: '#f6f3f0'\\n  surface-container: '#f0edea'\\n  surface-container-high: '#eae8e5'\\n  surface-container-highest: '#e5e2df'\\n  on-surface: '#1c1c1a'\\n  on-surface-variant: '#53433d'\\n  inverse-surface: '#31302f'\\n  inverse-on-surface: '#f3f0ed'\\n  outline: '#86736c'\\n  outline-variant: '#d9c2b9'\\n  surface-tint: '#8f4c2f'\\n  primary: '#8c4a2d'\\n  on-primary: '#ffffff'\\n  primary-container: '#aa6243'\\n  on-primary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  inverse-primary: '#ffb597'\\n  secondary: '#655d58'\\n  on-secondary: '#ffffff'\\n  secondary-container: '#e9ddd7'\\n  on-secondary-container: '#69615c'\\n  tertiary: '#605b56'\\n  on-tertiary: '#ffffff'\\n  tertiary-container: '#79746e'\\n  on-tertiary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  error: '#ba1a1a'\\n  on-error: '#ffffff'\\n  error-container: '#ffdad6'\\n  on-error-container: '#93000a'\\n  primary-fixed: '#ffdbcd'\\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#ffb597'\\n  on-primary-fixed: '#360f00'\\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#72351a'\\n  secondary-fixed: '#ece0da'\\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#cfc4be'\\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#201a17'\\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#4d4541'\\n  tertiary-fixed: '#e9e1da'\\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#ccc5bf'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#1e1b17'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#4a4641'\\n  background: '#fcf9f6'\\n  on-background: '#1c1c1a'\\n  surface-variant: '#e5e2df'\\n  clay-dark: '#A85E40'\\n  ink-light: '#5A4E48'\\n  sage: '#D6E4D8'\\n  cream-warm: '#F2ECE6'\\n  border-subtle: '#E8DDD6'\\ntypography:\\n  display:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 80px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.1'\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\n  display-mobile:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 44px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n  headline-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 40px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  headline-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 32px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  body-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.8'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.01em\\n  body-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.85'\\n  label-uppercase:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 12px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.15em\\n  caption:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 11px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.4'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.05em\\nrounded:\\n  sm: 0.25rem\\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\\n  md: 0.75rem\\n  lg: 1rem\\n  xl: 1.5rem\\n  full: 9999px\\nspacing:\\n  container-max: 1440px\\n  section-gap-desktop: 80px\\n  section-gap-mobile: 48px\\n  grid-gutter: 24px\\n  element-gap-sm: 8px\\n  element-gap-md: 16px\\n  element-gap-lg: 32px\\n---\\n\\n## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Colors\\n\\nThe palette is inspired by natural, undyed fibers and earthen materials. \\n\\n- **Primary (Clay):** Used for call-to-actions, price accents, and critical indicators. It provides a warm, energetic contrast to the neutral base.\\n- **Secondary (Ink):** The foundation for readability. Used for all primary headings and body text to ensure high legibility against light backgrounds.\\n- **Tertiary (Blush):** A soft accent for secondary surfaces, card backgrounds, and promotional banners.\\n- **Neutral (Cream):** The primary canvas. This off-white base reduces eye strain and feels more premium and \\\"organic\\\" than pure white.\\n- **Named Colors:** **Sage** is reserved for eco-specific callouts or decorative elements to reinforce the sustainability narrative. **Ink-light** is used for secondary navigation and metadata to create visual hierarchy.\\n\\n## Typography\\n\\nThis design system employs a high-contrast pairing to balance heritage and modernity.\\n\\n- **Headlines:** Use **DM Serif Display**. Its graceful curves and high contrast evoke luxury and editorial authority. Use it sparingly for section headers and hero statements.\\n- **Body \\u0026 UI:** Use **DM Sans**. This low-contrast geometric sans-serif ensures maximum legibility across all digital interfaces. \\n- **The \\\"Label-Uppercase\\\" Style:** This is a signature brand element. Use it for navigation, small headings over titles, and button labels. The generous letter-spacing (tracking) is essential to achieving the \\\"premium\\\" feel.\\n- **Line Height:** Maintain a generous line height (1.8 - 1.85) for body text to reinforce the airy, spacious aesthetic.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Shapes\\n\\nThe shape language is \\\"Soft-Modern,\\\" utilizing rounded corners to evoke friendliness and comfort—qualities essential to a wearable fashion brand.\\n\\n- **Small Elements (Buttons, Tags, Pills):** Use `rounded-full` (pill-shaped). This creates a distinct interactive language that feels modern and approachable.\\n- **Medium Elements (Product Images, Floating Cards):** Use `rounded-lg` (1rem / 16px). This softens the grid without making it feel juvenile.\\n- **Large Elements (Banners, Testimonial Containers):** Use `rounded-xl` (1.5rem / 24px) to create \\\"enveloping\\\" containers that feel substantial and high-end.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",6,\"#c97b5a\",\"#2a2420\",\"#f5ede6\",\"#faf7f4\",2,[[\"body-lg\",[\"DM Sans\",\"16px\",\"400\",\"1.8\",\"0.01em\"]],[\"body-md\",[\"DM Sans\",\"14px\",\"400\",\"1.85\"]],[\"display\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"80px\",\"400\",\"1.1\",\"-0.02em\"]],[\"display-mobile\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"44px\",\"400\",\"1.2\"]],[\"label-uppercase\",[\"DM Sans\",\"12px\",\"500\",\"1.2\",\"0.15em\"]],[\"headline-lg\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"40px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"headline-md\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"32px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"caption\",[\"DM Sans\",\"11px\",\"500\",\"1.4\",\"0.05em\"]]],[[\"element-gap-lg\",\"32px\"],[\"grid-gutter\",\"24px\"],[\"section-gap-desktop\",\"80px\"],[\"container-max\",\"1440px\"],[\"section-gap-mobile\",\"48px\"],[\"element-gap-sm\",\"8px\"],[\"element-gap-md\",\"16px\"]],null,\"dmSerifDisplay\",\"Dm Sans\",\"Dm Sans\"]],1]],[[\"projects/18178749605532028059/files/ccd62887bb794c0f9b715eb6532776f5\",null,\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida/AP1WRLvAqTI6a95EAQkJuiRHWlgbBcIdyqQJ-nlQ0XRNejW8erLfXuGL8zFqnShP-wsa7LGwTzE9UTcQOi53WQCQ00Dzysj44rxfvrfJU1Cnw16ALlmdPW4Ccscty_gpOUjm1oJ2TxkeROJXz9k-EA_HwGT-MPKfKZT48qku1YFeK0YprHAnkgzoSKlIda-MB9upQB7OC0rGSe4GyaAxnu4LBK3JkNpwX0nMlk_dm-XuYJ1gH_Bi58rO21-Bapkx\"],[\"projects/18178749605532028059/files/8082f46e79e34b5bb945a954a1b0dd8e\",null,\"https://contribution.usercontent.google.com/download?c\\u003dCgthaWRhX2NvZGVmeBJ8Eh1hcHBfY29tcGFuaW9uX2dlbmVyYXRlZF9maWxlcxpbCiVodG1sX2UyMTYzYmNlMDg5YTRjYzliNWYyMjFjN2MwY2Y4MWQ0EgsSBxDv9_C4jw8YAZIBJAoKcHJvamVjdF9pZBIWQhQxODE3ODc0OTYwNTUzMjAyODA1OQ\\u0026filename\\u003d\\u0026opi\\u003d89354086\",null,null,\"text/html\"],null,null,\"7c7687b7a58b42b1b5e71c6b90cef078\",\"HatterAgent\",\"2560\",\"4948\",\"Stitch — Đơn hàng của tôi (Updated Footer V2)\",\"Cập nhật chân trang (footer) giống hệt như yêu cầu cho trang chủ dựa trên {{DATA:IMAGE:IMAGE_6}}. Áp dụng cho trang Đơn hàng {{DATA:SCREEN:SCREEN_17}}.\",\"projects/18178749605532028059/screens/7c7687b7a58b42b1b5e71c6b90cef078\",[1,null,3,null,\"#c97b5a\",null,null,null,null,null,26,26,[[\"surface_dim\",\"#dcdad7\"],[\"cream-warm\",\"#F2ECE6\"],[\"on_surface\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"on_tertiary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"inverse_on_surface\",\"#f3f0ed\"],[\"sage\",\"#D6E4D8\"],[\"surface_container_highest\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"on_tertiary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"error_container\",\"#ffdad6\"],[\"secondary_fixed_dim\",\"#cfc4be\"],[\"on_background\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"on_error_container\",\"#93000a\"],[\"secondary_fixed\",\"#ece0da\"],[\"on_secondary_container\",\"#69615c\"],[\"secondary\",\"#655d58\"],[\"surface_container\",\"#f0edea\"],[\"outline_variant\",\"#d9c2b9\"],[\"primary_fixed\",\"#ffdbcd\"],[\"error\",\"#ba1a1a\"],[\"tertiary_fixed_dim\",\"#ccc5bf\"],[\"tertiary_fixed\",\"#e9e1da\"],[\"outline\",\"#86736c\"],[\"surface_variant\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed_variant\",\"#4a4641\"],[\"clay-dark\",\"#A85E40\"],[\"secondary_container\",\"#e9ddd7\"],[\"surface_container_high\",\"#eae8e5\"],[\"on_surface_variant\",\"#53433d\"],[\"inverse_surface\",\"#31302f\"],[\"on_primary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"primary\",\"#8c4a2d\"],[\"surface_container_low\",\"#f6f3f0\"],[\"inverse_primary\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"tertiary_container\",\"#79746e\"],[\"primary_container\",\"#aa6243\"],[\"surface_bright\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_primary_fixed\",\"#360f00\"],[\"on_primary_fixed_variant\",\"#72351a\"],[\"background\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_primary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"surface_container_lowest\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"tertiary\",\"#605b56\"],[\"border-subtle\",\"#E8DDD6\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed\",\"#201a17\"],[\"on_secondary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_error\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"primary_fixed_dim\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed\",\"#1e1b17\"],[\"ink-light\",\"#5A4E48\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed_variant\",\"#4d4541\"],[\"surface_tint\",\"#8f4c2f\"],[\"surface\",\"#fcf9f6\"]],\"---\\nname: Stitch Design System\\ncolors:\\n  surface: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-dim: '#dcdad7'\\n  surface-bright: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-container-lowest: '#ffffff'\\n  surface-container-low: '#f6f3f0'\\n  surface-container: '#f0edea'\\n  surface-container-high: '#eae8e5'\\n  surface-container-highest: '#e5e2df'\\n  on-surface: '#1c1c1a'\\n  on-surface-variant: '#53433d'\\n  inverse-surface: '#31302f'\\n  inverse-on-surface: '#f3f0ed'\\n  outline: '#86736c'\\n  outline-variant: '#d9c2b9'\\n  surface-tint: '#8f4c2f'\\n  primary: '#8c4a2d'\\n  on-primary: '#ffffff'\\n  primary-container: '#aa6243'\\n  on-primary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  inverse-primary: '#ffb597'\\n  secondary: '#655d58'\\n  on-secondary: '#ffffff'\\n  secondary-container: '#e9ddd7'\\n  on-secondary-container: '#69615c'\\n  tertiary: '#605b56'\\n  on-tertiary: '#ffffff'\\n  tertiary-container: '#79746e'\\n  on-tertiary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  error: '#ba1a1a'\\n  on-error: '#ffffff'\\n  error-container: '#ffdad6'\\n  on-error-container: '#93000a'\\n  primary-fixed: '#ffdbcd'\\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#ffb597'\\n  on-primary-fixed: '#360f00'\\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#72351a'\\n  secondary-fixed: '#ece0da'\\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#cfc4be'\\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#201a17'\\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#4d4541'\\n  tertiary-fixed: '#e9e1da'\\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#ccc5bf'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#1e1b17'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#4a4641'\\n  background: '#fcf9f6'\\n  on-background: '#1c1c1a'\\n  surface-variant: '#e5e2df'\\n  clay-dark: '#A85E40'\\n  ink-light: '#5A4E48'\\n  sage: '#D6E4D8'\\n  cream-warm: '#F2ECE6'\\n  border-subtle: '#E8DDD6'\\ntypography:\\n  display:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 80px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.1'\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\n  display-mobile:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 44px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n  headline-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 40px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  headline-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 32px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  body-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.8'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.01em\\n  body-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.85'\\n  label-uppercase:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 12px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.15em\\n  caption:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 11px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.4'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.05em\\nrounded:\\n  sm: 0.25rem\\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\\n  md: 0.75rem\\n  lg: 1rem\\n  xl: 1.5rem\\n  full: 9999px\\nspacing:\\n  container-max: 1440px\\n  section-gap-desktop: 80px\\n  section-gap-mobile: 48px\\n  grid-gutter: 24px\\n  element-gap-sm: 8px\\n  element-gap-md: 16px\\n  element-gap-lg: 32px\\n---\\n\\n## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Colors\\n\\nThe palette is inspired by natural, undyed fibers and earthen materials. \\n\\n- **Primary (Clay):** Used for call-to-actions, price accents, and critical indicators. It provides a warm, energetic contrast to the neutral base.\\n- **Secondary (Ink):** The foundation for readability. Used for all primary headings and body text to ensure high legibility against light backgrounds.\\n- **Tertiary (Blush):** A soft accent for secondary surfaces, card backgrounds, and promotional banners.\\n- **Neutral (Cream):** The primary canvas. This off-white base reduces eye strain and feels more premium and \\\"organic\\\" than pure white.\\n- **Named Colors:** **Sage** is reserved for eco-specific callouts or decorative elements to reinforce the sustainability narrative. **Ink-light** is used for secondary navigation and metadata to create visual hierarchy.\\n\\n## Typography\\n\\nThis design system employs a high-contrast pairing to balance heritage and modernity.\\n\\n- **Headlines:** Use **DM Serif Display**. Its graceful curves and high contrast evoke luxury and editorial authority. Use it sparingly for section headers and hero statements.\\n- **Body \\u0026 UI:** Use **DM Sans**. This low-contrast geometric sans-serif ensures maximum legibility across all digital interfaces. \\n- **The \\\"Label-Uppercase\\\" Style:** This is a signature brand element. Use it for navigation, small headings over titles, and button labels. The generous letter-spacing (tracking) is essential to achieving the \\\"premium\\\" feel.\\n- **Line Height:** Maintain a generous line height (1.8 - 1.85) for body text to reinforce the airy, spacious aesthetic.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Shapes\\n\\nThe shape language is \\\"Soft-Modern,\\\" utilizing rounded corners to evoke friendliness and comfort—qualities essential to a wearable fashion brand.\\n\\n- **Small Elements (Buttons, Tags, Pills):** Use `rounded-full` (pill-shaped). This creates a distinct interactive language that feels modern and approachable.\\n- **Medium Elements (Product Images, Floating Cards):** Use `rounded-lg` (1rem / 16px). This softens the grid without making it feel juvenile.\\n- **Large Elements (Banners, Testimonial Containers):** Use `rounded-xl` (1.5rem / 24px) to create \\\"enveloping\\\" containers that feel substantial and high-end.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",6,\"#c97b5a\",\"#2a2420\",\"#f5ede6\",\"#faf7f4\",2,[[\"headline-lg\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"40px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"headline-md\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"32px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"caption\",[\"DM Sans\",\"11px\",\"500\",\"1.4\",\"0.05em\"]],[\"display-mobile\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"44px\",\"400\",\"1.2\"]],[\"label-uppercase\",[\"DM Sans\",\"12px\",\"500\",\"1.2\",\"0.15em\"]],[\"body-lg\",[\"DM Sans\",\"16px\",\"400\",\"1.8\",\"0.01em\"]],[\"body-md\",[\"DM Sans\",\"14px\",\"400\",\"1.85\"]],[\"display\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"80px\",\"400\",\"1.1\",\"-0.02em\"]]],[[\"element-gap-lg\",\"32px\"],[\"grid-gutter\",\"24px\"],[\"section-gap-desktop\",\"80px\"],[\"container-max\",\"1440px\"],[\"element-gap-sm\",\"8px\"],[\"section-gap-mobile\",\"48px\"],[\"element-gap-md\",\"16px\"]],null,\"dmSerifDisplay\",\"Dm Sans\",\"Dm Sans\"],2,1,null,[null,2,null,null,2],null,null,[\"assets/f84726af88af499598b78556bda4af11\",null,[\"Stitch Design System\",null,\"## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",[1,null,3,null,\"#c97b5a\",null,null,null,null,null,26,26,[[\"on_error\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"primary_fixed_dim\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed_variant\",\"#4d4541\"],[\"surface_tint\",\"#8f4c2f\"],[\"surface\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed\",\"#1e1b17\"],[\"ink-light\",\"#5A4E48\"],[\"on_primary_fixed\",\"#360f00\"],[\"primary_container\",\"#aa6243\"],[\"surface_bright\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"tertiary\",\"#605b56\"],[\"border-subtle\",\"#E8DDD6\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed\",\"#201a17\"],[\"on_secondary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_primary_fixed_variant\",\"#72351a\"],[\"background\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_primary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"surface_container_lowest\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_primary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"inverse_primary\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"tertiary_container\",\"#79746e\"],[\"primary\",\"#8c4a2d\"],[\"surface_container_low\",\"#f6f3f0\"],[\"clay-dark\",\"#A85E40\"],[\"secondary_container\",\"#e9ddd7\"],[\"surface_container_high\",\"#eae8e5\"],[\"on_surface_variant\",\"#53433d\"],[\"inverse_surface\",\"#31302f\"],[\"outline_variant\",\"#d9c2b9\"],[\"primary_fixed\",\"#ffdbcd\"],[\"error\",\"#ba1a1a\"],[\"surface_container\",\"#f0edea\"],[\"outline\",\"#86736c\"],[\"tertiary_fixed\",\"#e9e1da\"],[\"tertiary_fixed_dim\",\"#ccc5bf\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed_variant\",\"#4a4641\"],[\"surface_variant\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"on_error_container\",\"#93000a\"],[\"on_secondary_container\",\"#69615c\"],[\"secondary_fixed\",\"#ece0da\"],[\"error_container\",\"#ffdad6\"],[\"secondary_fixed_dim\",\"#cfc4be\"],[\"on_background\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"secondary\",\"#655d58\"],[\"sage\",\"#D6E4D8\"],[\"surface_container_highest\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"on_tertiary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"inverse_on_surface\",\"#f3f0ed\"],[\"on_tertiary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"cream-warm\",\"#F2ECE6\"],[\"surface_dim\",\"#dcdad7\"],[\"on_surface\",\"#1c1c1a\"]],\"---\\nname: Stitch Design System\\ncolors:\\n  surface: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-dim: '#dcdad7'\\n  surface-bright: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-container-lowest: '#ffffff'\\n  surface-container-low: '#f6f3f0'\\n  surface-container: '#f0edea'\\n  surface-container-high: '#eae8e5'\\n  surface-container-highest: '#e5e2df'\\n  on-surface: '#1c1c1a'\\n  on-surface-variant: '#53433d'\\n  inverse-surface: '#31302f'\\n  inverse-on-surface: '#f3f0ed'\\n  outline: '#86736c'\\n  outline-variant: '#d9c2b9'\\n  surface-tint: '#8f4c2f'\\n  primary: '#8c4a2d'\\n  on-primary: '#ffffff'\\n  primary-container: '#aa6243'\\n  on-primary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  inverse-primary: '#ffb597'\\n  secondary: '#655d58'\\n  on-secondary: '#ffffff'\\n  secondary-container: '#e9ddd7'\\n  on-secondary-container: '#69615c'\\n  tertiary: '#605b56'\\n  on-tertiary: '#ffffff'\\n  tertiary-container: '#79746e'\\n  on-tertiary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  error: '#ba1a1a'\\n  on-error: '#ffffff'\\n  error-container: '#ffdad6'\\n  on-error-container: '#93000a'\\n  primary-fixed: '#ffdbcd'\\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#ffb597'\\n  on-primary-fixed: '#360f00'\\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#72351a'\\n  secondary-fixed: '#ece0da'\\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#cfc4be'\\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#201a17'\\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#4d4541'\\n  tertiary-fixed: '#e9e1da'\\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#ccc5bf'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#1e1b17'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#4a4641'\\n  background: '#fcf9f6'\\n  on-background: '#1c1c1a'\\n  surface-variant: '#e5e2df'\\n  clay-dark: '#A85E40'\\n  ink-light: '#5A4E48'\\n  sage: '#D6E4D8'\\n  cream-warm: '#F2ECE6'\\n  border-subtle: '#E8DDD6'\\ntypography:\\n  display:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 80px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.1'\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\n  display-mobile:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 44px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n  headline-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 40px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  headline-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 32px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  body-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.8'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.01em\\n  body-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.85'\\n  label-uppercase:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 12px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.15em\\n  caption:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 11px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.4'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.05em\\nrounded:\\n  sm: 0.25rem\\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\\n  md: 0.75rem\\n  lg: 1rem\\n  xl: 1.5rem\\n  full: 9999px\\nspacing:\\n  container-max: 1440px\\n  section-gap-desktop: 80px\\n  section-gap-mobile: 48px\\n  grid-gutter: 24px\\n  element-gap-sm: 8px\\n  element-gap-md: 16px\\n  element-gap-lg: 32px\\n---\\n\\n## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Colors\\n\\nThe palette is inspired by natural, undyed fibers and earthen materials. \\n\\n- **Primary (Clay):** Used for call-to-actions, price accents, and critical indicators. It provides a warm, energetic contrast to the neutral base.\\n- **Secondary (Ink):** The foundation for readability. Used for all primary headings and body text to ensure high legibility against light backgrounds.\\n- **Tertiary (Blush):** A soft accent for secondary surfaces, card backgrounds, and promotional banners.\\n- **Neutral (Cream):** The primary canvas. This off-white base reduces eye strain and feels more premium and \\\"organic\\\" than pure white.\\n- **Named Colors:** **Sage** is reserved for eco-specific callouts or decorative elements to reinforce the sustainability narrative. **Ink-light** is used for secondary navigation and metadata to create visual hierarchy.\\n\\n## Typography\\n\\nThis design system employs a high-contrast pairing to balance heritage and modernity.\\n\\n- **Headlines:** Use **DM Serif Display**. Its graceful curves and high contrast evoke luxury and editorial authority. Use it sparingly for section headers and hero statements.\\n- **Body \\u0026 UI:** Use **DM Sans**. This low-contrast geometric sans-serif ensures maximum legibility across all digital interfaces. \\n- **The \\\"Label-Uppercase\\\" Style:** This is a signature brand element. Use it for navigation, small headings over titles, and button labels. The generous letter-spacing (tracking) is essential to achieving the \\\"premium\\\" feel.\\n- **Line Height:** Maintain a generous line height (1.8 - 1.85) for body text to reinforce the airy, spacious aesthetic.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Shapes\\n\\nThe shape language is \\\"Soft-Modern,\\\" utilizing rounded corners to evoke friendliness and comfort—qualities essential to a wearable fashion brand.\\n\\n- **Small Elements (Buttons, Tags, Pills):** Use `rounded-full` (pill-shaped). This creates a distinct interactive language that feels modern and approachable.\\n- **Medium Elements (Product Images, Floating Cards):** Use `rounded-lg` (1rem / 16px). This softens the grid without making it feel juvenile.\\n- **Large Elements (Banners, Testimonial Containers):** Use `rounded-xl` (1.5rem / 24px) to create \\\"enveloping\\\" containers that feel substantial and high-end.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",6,\"#c97b5a\",\"#2a2420\",\"#f5ede6\",\"#faf7f4\",2,[[\"body-lg\",[\"DM Sans\",\"16px\",\"400\",\"1.8\",\"0.01em\"]],[\"body-md\",[\"DM Sans\",\"14px\",\"400\",\"1.85\"]],[\"display\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"80px\",\"400\",\"1.1\",\"-0.02em\"]],[\"display-mobile\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"44px\",\"400\",\"1.2\"]],[\"label-uppercase\",[\"DM Sans\",\"12px\",\"500\",\"1.2\",\"0.15em\"]],[\"headline-lg\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"40px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"headline-md\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"32px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"caption\",[\"DM Sans\",\"11px\",\"500\",\"1.4\",\"0.05em\"]]],[[\"grid-gutter\",\"24px\"],[\"section-gap-desktop\",\"80px\"],[\"element-gap-lg\",\"32px\"],[\"container-max\",\"1440px\"],[\"element-gap-sm\",\"8px\"],[\"section-gap-mobile\",\"48px\"],[\"element-gap-md\",\"16px\"]],null,\"dmSerifDisplay\",\"Dm Sans\",\"Dm Sans\"]],1]],[[\"projects/18178749605532028059/files/da6e1e399eb447c488eb080eb5142353\",null,\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida/AP1WRLtniSAOAvdHkRGzenrIyy2B_riDzE1_GCxkKmD1q2qNv85DHdvPkuhmHVV54q7I1_faGJbB7dUK9EDlogJXBS4bjch0QsWOfeGvXcLI6iDlAeZG0_x01AuPWgeEGKD7129-FZXvHO3KY9clllikM2KjEqGrO75CyMpReS16Ks6zg9q0ahe6P0ddxRPv3s9iJxwGHh5S2ycdTzA490UosGOYtrJ1-vxRYDV9qMSxgjAAO3eQyigJwKhjdOaY\"],[\"projects/18178749605532028059/files/128e43e924d34277ad63a907dc5eebde\",null,\"https://contribution.usercontent.google.com/download?c\\u003dCgthaWRhX2NvZGVmeBJ8Eh1hcHBfY29tcGFuaW9uX2dlbmVyYXRlZF9maWxlcxpbCiVodG1sX2I0N2FhMzY4YTE4MjRiODM4NWNlYTU4M2JkYWZlMWIxEgsSBxDv9_C4jw8YAZIBJAoKcHJvamVjdF9pZBIWQhQxODE3ODc0OTYwNTUzMjAyODA1OQ\\u0026filename\\u003d\\u0026opi\\u003d89354086\",null,null,\"text/html\"],null,null,\"b2f900fbd9b543d6a8baf949db5e6fd6\",\"HatterAgent\",\"2560\",\"5448\",\"Stitch — Trang chủ (Updated Footer)\",\"Cập nhật phần chân trang (footer) của toàn bộ website dựa trên hình ảnh {{DATA:IMAGE:IMAGE_6}}. \\n\\nCác thay đổi cụ thể:\\n1. Phần Newsletter: Tiêu đề \\\"Kết nối với STITCH\\\", đoạn mô tả ngắn về ưu đãi 10%, ô nhập email bo tròn có nút \\\"Đăng ký\\\" màu nâu đất (#8D4F31) bên trong.\\n2. Bố cục Footer chính:\\n   - Cột 1 (Logo \\u0026 Intro): Logo \\\"STITCH\\\" font serif lớn, đoạn giới thiệu ngắn về sự tinh tế của nghề may thủ công, và các icon mạng xã hội (Instagram, Facebook, Share).\\n   - Cột 2 (Mua sắm): Các link \\\"Tất cả sản phẩm\\\", \\\"BST Mới\\\", \\\"Nam giới\\\", \\\"Nữ giới\\\".\\n   - Cột 3 (Hỗ trợ): Các link \\\"Chính sách vận chuyển\\\", \\\"Đổi trả \\u0026 Hoàn tiền\\\", \\\"Hướng dẫn chọn size\\\", \\\"Chính sách bảo mật\\\".\\n   - Cột 4 (Liên hệ): Thông tin địa chỉ (28 Thảo Điền, Quận 2, TP. Hồ Chí Minh), email (hello@stitchatclicr.vn), và hotline (+84 (0) 901 234 567) kèm theo các icon tương ứng (location, email, phone).\\n3. Thanh bản quyền: \\\"© 2024 STITCH SUSTAINABLE ATELIER. ALL RIGHTS RESERVED.\\\" bên trái và các link \\\"Sustainability Report\\\", \\\"Care Guide\\\" bên phải.\\n4. Màu sắc \\u0026 Typography: Sử dụng font serif cho tiêu đề, font sans cho nội dung. Màu nền chân trang là kem nhạt, các tiêu đề cột màu nâu đậm.\\n\\nÁp dụng thay đổi này cho trang chủ {{DATA:SCREEN:SCREEN_21}}.\",\"projects/18178749605532028059/screens/b2f900fbd9b543d6a8baf949db5e6fd6\",[1,null,3,null,\"#c97b5a\",null,null,null,null,null,26,26,[[\"surface_dim\",\"#dcdad7\"],[\"cream-warm\",\"#F2ECE6\"],[\"on_surface\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"inverse_on_surface\",\"#f3f0ed\"],[\"on_tertiary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"surface_container_highest\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"sage\",\"#D6E4D8\"],[\"on_tertiary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"secondary_fixed_dim\",\"#cfc4be\"],[\"on_background\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"error_container\",\"#ffdad6\"],[\"on_secondary_container\",\"#69615c\"],[\"secondary_fixed\",\"#ece0da\"],[\"on_error_container\",\"#93000a\"],[\"secondary\",\"#655d58\"],[\"surface_container\",\"#f0edea\"],[\"primary_fixed\",\"#ffdbcd\"],[\"error\",\"#ba1a1a\"],[\"outline_variant\",\"#d9c2b9\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed_variant\",\"#4a4641\"],[\"surface_variant\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"outline\",\"#86736c\"],[\"tertiary_fixed\",\"#e9e1da\"],[\"tertiary_fixed_dim\",\"#ccc5bf\"],[\"clay-dark\",\"#A85E40\"],[\"surface_container_high\",\"#eae8e5\"],[\"on_surface_variant\",\"#53433d\"],[\"inverse_surface\",\"#31302f\"],[\"secondary_container\",\"#e9ddd7\"],[\"on_primary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"primary\",\"#8c4a2d\"],[\"surface_container_low\",\"#f6f3f0\"],[\"inverse_primary\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"tertiary_container\",\"#79746e\"],[\"primary_container\",\"#aa6243\"],[\"surface_bright\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_primary_fixed\",\"#360f00\"],[\"on_primary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"surface_container_lowest\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_primary_fixed_variant\",\"#72351a\"],[\"background\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed\",\"#201a17\"],[\"on_secondary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"tertiary\",\"#605b56\"],[\"border-subtle\",\"#E8DDD6\"],[\"primary_fixed_dim\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"on_error\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed\",\"#1e1b17\"],[\"ink-light\",\"#5A4E48\"],[\"surface_tint\",\"#8f4c2f\"],[\"surface\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed_variant\",\"#4d4541\"]],\"---\\nname: Stitch Design System\\ncolors:\\n  surface: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-dim: '#dcdad7'\\n  surface-bright: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-container-lowest: '#ffffff'\\n  surface-container-low: '#f6f3f0'\\n  surface-container: '#f0edea'\\n  surface-container-high: '#eae8e5'\\n  surface-container-highest: '#e5e2df'\\n  on-surface: '#1c1c1a'\\n  on-surface-variant: '#53433d'\\n  inverse-surface: '#31302f'\\n  inverse-on-surface: '#f3f0ed'\\n  outline: '#86736c'\\n  outline-variant: '#d9c2b9'\\n  surface-tint: '#8f4c2f'\\n  primary: '#8c4a2d'\\n  on-primary: '#ffffff'\\n  primary-container: '#aa6243'\\n  on-primary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  inverse-primary: '#ffb597'\\n  secondary: '#655d58'\\n  on-secondary: '#ffffff'\\n  secondary-container: '#e9ddd7'\\n  on-secondary-container: '#69615c'\\n  tertiary: '#605b56'\\n  on-tertiary: '#ffffff'\\n  tertiary-container: '#79746e'\\n  on-tertiary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  error: '#ba1a1a'\\n  on-error: '#ffffff'\\n  error-container: '#ffdad6'\\n  on-error-container: '#93000a'\\n  primary-fixed: '#ffdbcd'\\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#ffb597'\\n  on-primary-fixed: '#360f00'\\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#72351a'\\n  secondary-fixed: '#ece0da'\\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#cfc4be'\\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#201a17'\\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#4d4541'\\n  tertiary-fixed: '#e9e1da'\\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#ccc5bf'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#1e1b17'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#4a4641'\\n  background: '#fcf9f6'\\n  on-background: '#1c1c1a'\\n  surface-variant: '#e5e2df'\\n  clay-dark: '#A85E40'\\n  ink-light: '#5A4E48'\\n  sage: '#D6E4D8'\\n  cream-warm: '#F2ECE6'\\n  border-subtle: '#E8DDD6'\\ntypography:\\n  display:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 80px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.1'\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\n  display-mobile:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 44px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n  headline-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 40px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  headline-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 32px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  body-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.8'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.01em\\n  body-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.85'\\n  label-uppercase:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 12px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.15em\\n  caption:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 11px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.4'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.05em\\nrounded:\\n  sm: 0.25rem\\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\\n  md: 0.75rem\\n  lg: 1rem\\n  xl: 1.5rem\\n  full: 9999px\\nspacing:\\n  container-max: 1440px\\n  section-gap-desktop: 80px\\n  section-gap-mobile: 48px\\n  grid-gutter: 24px\\n  element-gap-sm: 8px\\n  element-gap-md: 16px\\n  element-gap-lg: 32px\\n---\\n\\n## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Colors\\n\\nThe palette is inspired by natural, undyed fibers and earthen materials. \\n\\n- **Primary (Clay):** Used for call-to-actions, price accents, and critical indicators. It provides a warm, energetic contrast to the neutral base.\\n- **Secondary (Ink):** The foundation for readability. Used for all primary headings and body text to ensure high legibility against light backgrounds.\\n- **Tertiary (Blush):** A soft accent for secondary surfaces, card backgrounds, and promotional banners.\\n- **Neutral (Cream):** The primary canvas. This off-white base reduces eye strain and feels more premium and \\\"organic\\\" than pure white.\\n- **Named Colors:** **Sage** is reserved for eco-specific callouts or decorative elements to reinforce the sustainability narrative. **Ink-light** is used for secondary navigation and metadata to create visual hierarchy.\\n\\n## Typography\\n\\nThis design system employs a high-contrast pairing to balance heritage and modernity.\\n\\n- **Headlines:** Use **DM Serif Display**. Its graceful curves and high contrast evoke luxury and editorial authority. Use it sparingly for section headers and hero statements.\\n- **Body \\u0026 UI:** Use **DM Sans**. This low-contrast geometric sans-serif ensures maximum legibility across all digital interfaces. \\n- **The \\\"Label-Uppercase\\\" Style:** This is a signature brand element. Use it for navigation, small headings over titles, and button labels. The generous letter-spacing (tracking) is essential to achieving the \\\"premium\\\" feel.\\n- **Line Height:** Maintain a generous line height (1.8 - 1.85) for body text to reinforce the airy, spacious aesthetic.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Shapes\\n\\nThe shape language is \\\"Soft-Modern,\\\" utilizing rounded corners to evoke friendliness and comfort—qualities essential to a wearable fashion brand.\\n\\n- **Small Elements (Buttons, Tags, Pills):** Use `rounded-full` (pill-shaped). This creates a distinct interactive language that feels modern and approachable.\\n- **Medium Elements (Product Images, Floating Cards):** Use `rounded-lg` (1rem / 16px). This softens the grid without making it feel juvenile.\\n- **Large Elements (Banners, Testimonial Containers):** Use `rounded-xl` (1.5rem / 24px) to create \\\"enveloping\\\" containers that feel substantial and high-end.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",6,\"#c97b5a\",\"#2a2420\",\"#f5ede6\",\"#faf7f4\",2,[[\"headline-lg\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"40px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"headline-md\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"32px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"caption\",[\"DM Sans\",\"11px\",\"500\",\"1.4\",\"0.05em\"]],[\"body-lg\",[\"DM Sans\",\"16px\",\"400\",\"1.8\",\"0.01em\"]],[\"body-md\",[\"DM Sans\",\"14px\",\"400\",\"1.85\"]],[\"display\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"80px\",\"400\",\"1.1\",\"-0.02em\"]],[\"display-mobile\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"44px\",\"400\",\"1.2\"]],[\"label-uppercase\",[\"DM Sans\",\"12px\",\"500\",\"1.2\",\"0.15em\"]]],[[\"container-max\",\"1440px\"],[\"section-gap-mobile\",\"48px\"],[\"element-gap-sm\",\"8px\"],[\"element-gap-lg\",\"32px\"],[\"grid-gutter\",\"24px\"],[\"section-gap-desktop\",\"80px\"],[\"element-gap-md\",\"16px\"]],null,\"dmSerifDisplay\",\"Dm Sans\",\"Dm Sans\"],2,1,null,[null,2,null,null,2],null,null,[\"assets/f84726af88af499598b78556bda4af11\",null,[\"Stitch Design System\",null,\"## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",[1,null,3,null,\"#c97b5a\",null,null,null,null,null,26,26,[[\"on_tertiary_fixed_variant\",\"#4a4641\"],[\"surface_variant\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"outline\",\"#86736c\"],[\"tertiary_fixed\",\"#e9e1da\"],[\"tertiary_fixed_dim\",\"#ccc5bf\"],[\"surface_container\",\"#f0edea\"],[\"error\",\"#ba1a1a\"],[\"primary_fixed\",\"#ffdbcd\"],[\"outline_variant\",\"#d9c2b9\"],[\"secondary\",\"#655d58\"],[\"on_background\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"secondary_fixed_dim\",\"#cfc4be\"],[\"error_container\",\"#ffdad6\"],[\"on_secondary_container\",\"#69615c\"],[\"secondary_fixed\",\"#ece0da\"],[\"on_error_container\",\"#93000a\"],[\"on_tertiary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"inverse_on_surface\",\"#f3f0ed\"],[\"on_tertiary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"surface_container_highest\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"sage\",\"#D6E4D8\"],[\"on_surface\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"surface_dim\",\"#dcdad7\"],[\"cream-warm\",\"#F2ECE6\"],[\"ink-light\",\"#5A4E48\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed\",\"#1e1b17\"],[\"surface\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"surface_tint\",\"#8f4c2f\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed_variant\",\"#4d4541\"],[\"primary_fixed_dim\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"on_error\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"surface_container_lowest\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_primary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"on_primary_fixed_variant\",\"#72351a\"],[\"background\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"on_secondary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed\",\"#201a17\"],[\"tertiary\",\"#605b56\"],[\"border-subtle\",\"#E8DDD6\"],[\"surface_bright\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"primary_container\",\"#aa6243\"],[\"on_primary_fixed\",\"#360f00\"],[\"primary\",\"#8c4a2d\"],[\"surface_container_low\",\"#f6f3f0\"],[\"tertiary_container\",\"#79746e\"],[\"inverse_primary\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"on_primary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"surface_container_high\",\"#eae8e5\"],[\"on_surface_variant\",\"#53433d\"],[\"inverse_surface\",\"#31302f\"],[\"secondary_container\",\"#e9ddd7\"],[\"clay-dark\",\"#A85E40\"]],\"---\\nname: Stitch Design System\\ncolors:\\n  surface: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-dim: '#dcdad7'\\n  surface-bright: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-container-lowest: '#ffffff'\\n  surface-container-low: '#f6f3f0'\\n  surface-container: '#f0edea'\\n  surface-container-high: '#eae8e5'\\n  surface-container-highest: '#e5e2df'\\n  on-surface: '#1c1c1a'\\n  on-surface-variant: '#53433d'\\n  inverse-surface: '#31302f'\\n  inverse-on-surface: '#f3f0ed'\\n  outline: '#86736c'\\n  outline-variant: '#d9c2b9'\\n  surface-tint: '#8f4c2f'\\n  primary: '#8c4a2d'\\n  on-primary: '#ffffff'\\n  primary-container: '#aa6243'\\n  on-primary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  inverse-primary: '#ffb597'\\n  secondary: '#655d58'\\n  on-secondary: '#ffffff'\\n  secondary-container: '#e9ddd7'\\n  on-secondary-container: '#69615c'\\n  tertiary: '#605b56'\\n  on-tertiary: '#ffffff'\\n  tertiary-container: '#79746e'\\n  on-tertiary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  error: '#ba1a1a'\\n  on-error: '#ffffff'\\n  error-container: '#ffdad6'\\n  on-error-container: '#93000a'\\n  primary-fixed: '#ffdbcd'\\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#ffb597'\\n  on-primary-fixed: '#360f00'\\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#72351a'\\n  secondary-fixed: '#ece0da'\\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#cfc4be'\\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#201a17'\\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#4d4541'\\n  tertiary-fixed: '#e9e1da'\\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#ccc5bf'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#1e1b17'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#4a4641'\\n  background: '#fcf9f6'\\n  on-background: '#1c1c1a'\\n  surface-variant: '#e5e2df'\\n  clay-dark: '#A85E40'\\n  ink-light: '#5A4E48'\\n  sage: '#D6E4D8'\\n  cream-warm: '#F2ECE6'\\n  border-subtle: '#E8DDD6'\\ntypography:\\n  display:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 80px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.1'\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\n  display-mobile:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 44px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n  headline-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 40px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  headline-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Serif Display\\n    fontSize: 32px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.3'\\n  body-lg:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.8'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.01em\\n  body-md:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: '1.85'\\n  label-uppercase:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 12px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.2'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.15em\\n  caption:\\n    fontFamily: DM Sans\\n    fontSize: 11px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: '1.4'\\n    letterSpacing: 0.05em\\nrounded:\\n  sm: 0.25rem\\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\\n  md: 0.75rem\\n  lg: 1rem\\n  xl: 1.5rem\\n  full: 9999px\\nspacing:\\n  container-max: 1440px\\n  section-gap-desktop: 80px\\n  section-gap-mobile: 48px\\n  grid-gutter: 24px\\n  element-gap-sm: 8px\\n  element-gap-md: 16px\\n  element-gap-lg: 32px\\n---\\n\\n## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Colors\\n\\nThe palette is inspired by natural, undyed fibers and earthen materials. \\n\\n- **Primary (Clay):** Used for call-to-actions, price accents, and critical indicators. It provides a warm, energetic contrast to the neutral base.\\n- **Secondary (Ink):** The foundation for readability. Used for all primary headings and body text to ensure high legibility against light backgrounds.\\n- **Tertiary (Blush):** A soft accent for secondary surfaces, card backgrounds, and promotional banners.\\n- **Neutral (Cream):** The primary canvas. This off-white base reduces eye strain and feels more premium and \\\"organic\\\" than pure white.\\n- **Named Colors:** **Sage** is reserved for eco-specific callouts or decorative elements to reinforce the sustainability narrative. **Ink-light** is used for secondary navigation and metadata to create visual hierarchy.\\n\\n## Typography\\n\\nThis design system employs a high-contrast pairing to balance heritage and modernity.\\n\\n- **Headlines:** Use **DM Serif Display**. Its graceful curves and high contrast evoke luxury and editorial authority. Use it sparingly for section headers and hero statements.\\n- **Body \\u0026 UI:** Use **DM Sans**. This low-contrast geometric sans-serif ensures maximum legibility across all digital interfaces. \\n- **The \\\"Label-Uppercase\\\" Style:** This is a signature brand element. Use it for navigation, small headings over titles, and button labels. The generous letter-spacing (tracking) is essential to achieving the \\\"premium\\\" feel.\\n- **Line Height:** Maintain a generous line height (1.8 - 1.85) for body text to reinforce the airy, spacious aesthetic.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Shapes\\n\\nThe shape language is \\\"Soft-Modern,\\\" utilizing rounded corners to evoke friendliness and comfort—qualities essential to a wearable fashion brand.\\n\\n- **Small Elements (Buttons, Tags, Pills):** Use `rounded-full` (pill-shaped). This creates a distinct interactive language that feels modern and approachable.\\n- **Medium Elements (Product Images, Floating Cards):** Use `rounded-lg` (1rem / 16px). This softens the grid without making it feel juvenile.\\n- **Large Elements (Banners, Testimonial Containers):** Use `rounded-xl` (1.5rem / 24px) to create \\\"enveloping\\\" containers that feel substantial and high-end.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",6,\"#c97b5a\",\"#2a2420\",\"#f5ede6\",\"#faf7f4\",2,[[\"headline-lg\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"40px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"headline-md\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"32px\",\"400\",\"1.3\"]],[\"caption\",[\"DM Sans\",\"11px\",\"500\",\"1.4\",\"0.05em\"]],[\"display-mobile\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"44px\",\"400\",\"1.2\"]],[\"label-uppercase\",[\"DM Sans\",\"12px\",\"500\",\"1.2\",\"0.15em\"]],[\"body-lg\",[\"DM Sans\",\"16px\",\"400\",\"1.8\",\"0.01em\"]],[\"body-md\",[\"DM Sans\",\"14px\",\"400\",\"1.85\"]],[\"display\",[\"DM Serif Display\",\"80px\",\"400\",\"1.1\",\"-0.02em\"]]],[[\"element-gap-md\",\"16px\"],[\"grid-gutter\",\"24px\"],[\"section-gap-desktop\",\"80px\"],[\"element-gap-lg\",\"32px\"],[\"container-max\",\"1440px\"],[\"element-gap-sm\",\"8px\"],[\"section-gap-mobile\",\"48px\"]],null,\"dmSerifDisplay\",\"Dm Sans\",\"Dm Sans\"]],1]],[[\"projects/18178749605532028059/files/8728fada18e54c5fac32e37378914b5c\",null,\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida/AP1WRLsAnzGEcQ3ZFXy1duQLsIt8iqtri0mhjm6bPYEQJhSs3Oco-4BXfsJTr_prc7u9tWDDwCYSxbU1dVazORAjYXewTaOIAwOd-v9RmDcr4KI5wHQ4fEk2kxQTO_9NqIs5BWpOSaDk4VsE6obFP7zg7FqKJaaoiciVixc9g5TalvXjI_jMohJXdo00Tp3CxnmCmXvN9SAw0sxvZnauuXMeG3cMQG1hU9SPJQ32Wwofnpe_MKywdD20cx8RfgoS\"],null,null,null,\"382108cab7074a68b7afa755275de605\",\"interactive_ui_controller\",\"1184\",\"864\",\"Professional fashion catalog photography for a sustainable kids' brand: A stylish young boy wearing a minimalist organic cotton outfit in earthy tones, soft natural studio lighting, clean background, premium aesthetic.\",\"Professional fashion catalog photography for a sustainable kids' brand: A stylish young boy wearing a minimalist organic cotton outfit in earthy tones, soft natural studio lighting, clean background, premium aesthetic.\",\"projects/18178749605532028059/screens/382108cab7074a68b7afa755275de605\",[],null,2,null,[null,2,null,null,2],null,null,[\"assets/f84726af88af499598b78556bda4af11\",null,[\"Stitch Design System\",null,\"## Brand \\u0026 Style\\n\\nThe brand identity centers on **Ethical Luxury**—a harmony between artisanal craftsmanship and sustainable consciousness. It targets a discerning audience that values \\\"Quiet Luxury,\\\" where quality is felt through texture and space rather than loud logos.\\n\\nThe design style is **Refined Minimalism**. It leverages heavy whitespace to create \\\"breathing room,\\\" allowing high-quality imagery and sophisticated typography to take center stage. The aesthetic is warm and organic, moving away from cold, clinical minimalism toward a more tactile, human-centric experience. Visual interest is generated through:\\n- **Sophisticated Layering:** Using background color shifts and subtle blurs rather than heavy shadows.\\n- **Organic Geometry:** A mix of large-radius containers and pill-shaped interactive elements.\\n- **Editorial Polish:** High-contrast typography that mirrors premium print magazines.\\n\\n## Layout \\u0026 Spacing\\n\\nThe layout philosophy follows a **Fluid Grid** model with extreme emphasis on vertical breathing room.\\n\\n- **Grid:** Use a 12-column grid for desktop and a 2-column grid for mobile. \\n- **Margins:** Desktop margins should be at least 64px to create a \\\"framed\\\" editorial look. Mobile margins should be 20px.\\n- **Vertical Spacing:** Use `section-gap-desktop` (80px) between major content blocks. This intentional \\\"over-spacing\\\" is what differentiates the design from standard e-commerce layouts.\\n- **Alignment:** Center-align hero content and primary section titles to maintain a formal, balanced feel. Use left-alignment for product grids and content-heavy blocks.\\n\\n## Elevation \\u0026 Depth\\n\\nThis design system avoids heavy drop shadows in favor of **Tonal Layering** and **Atmospheric Depth**.\\n\\n- **Surface Tiers:** Depth is indicated by shifting background colors (e.g., a `Blush` card on a `Cream` background).\\n- **Glassmorphism:** Use `backdrop-blur` (8px to 12px) for sticky headers and floating badges. This creates a sense of lightness and transparency.\\n- **Subtle Elevation:** For interactive states (like hover on product cards), use a very soft, low-opacity shadow: `0 10px 30px rgba(42, 36, 32, 0.05)`. The shadow should feel like a soft ambient light rather than a hard edge.\\n- **Transitions:** All elevation changes should be paired with a subtle vertical translation (e.g., `translateY(-4px)`) to provide tactile feedback.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Pill-shaped, `Clay` background, white text, `label-uppercase` typography. \\n- **Secondary:** Pill-shaped, `Ink` border (1px), `Ink` text. Hover state fills the background with `Ink` and changes text to `Cream`.\\n- **Ghost:** No border, `label-uppercase` text with a subtle underline that expands on hover.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- **Style:** Underlined or very soft borders (`border-subtle`). \\n- **Focus State:** Border color shifts to `Clay`.\\n- **Typography:** Placeholder text in `Ink-light` using `body-md`.\\n\\n### Cards\\n- **Product Cards:** No visible borders. Imagery uses `rounded-lg`. Product name and price are stacked below with `element-gap-sm`. On hover, the image should subtly scale or lift.\\n- **Testimonial/Category Cards:** Use `Blush` or `Sage` backgrounds with `rounded-xl`. \\n\\n### Chips \\u0026 Filters\\n- **Style:** Always pill-shaped (`rounded-full`). \\n- **Active State:** `Clay` background with white text.\\n- **Inactive State:** `Cream-warm` background or 1px `border-subtle`.\\n\\n### Navigation\\n- **Header:** Sticky with `backdrop-blur` and a `Cream` background at 90% opacity. \\n- **Links:** Use `label-uppercase` with 24px horizontal spacing. An active state is indicated by a thin 1px underline.\",[1,null,3,null,\"#c97b5a\",null,null,null,null,null,26,26,[[\"on_secondary_container\",\"#69615c\"],[\"secondary_fixed\",\"#ece0da\"],[\"on_error_container\",\"#93000a\"],[\"on_background\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"secondary_fixed_dim\",\"#cfc4be\"],[\"error_container\",\"#ffdad6\"],[\"secondary\",\"#655d58\"],[\"error\",\"#ba1a1a\"],[\"primary_fixed\",\"#ffdbcd\"],[\"outline_variant\",\"#d9c2b9\"],[\"surface_container\",\"#f0edea\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed_variant\",\"#4a4641\"],[\"surface_variant\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"outline\",\"#86736c\"],[\"tertiary_fixed\",\"#e9e1da\"],[\"tertiary_fixed_dim\",\"#ccc5bf\"],[\"cream-warm\",\"#F2ECE6\"],[\"surface_dim\",\"#dcdad7\"],[\"on_surface\",\"#1c1c1a\"],[\"surface_container_highest\",\"#e5e2df\"],[\"sage\",\"#D6E4D8\"],[\"inverse_on_surface\",\"#f3f0ed\"],[\"on_tertiary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_tertiary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"on_primary_fixed\",\"#360f00\"],[\"surface_bright\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"primary_container\",\"#aa6243\"],[\"on_secondary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed\",\"#201a17\"],[\"tertiary\",\"#605b56\"],[\"border-subtle\",\"#E8DDD6\"],[\"surface_container_lowest\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"on_primary_container\",\"#fffbff\"],[\"on_primary_fixed_variant\",\"#72351a\"],[\"background\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"primary_fixed_dim\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"on_error\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"surface\",\"#fcf9f6\"],[\"surface_tint\",\"#8f4c2f\"],[\"on_secondary_fixed_variant\",\"#4d4541\"],[\"ink-light\",\"#5A4E48\"],[\"on_tertiary_fixed\",\"#1e1b17\"],[\"clay-dark\",\"#A85E40\"],[\"surface_container_high\",\"#eae8e5\"],[\"on_surface_variant\",\"#53433d\"],[\"inverse_surface\",\"#31302f\"],[\"secondary_container\",\"#e9ddd7\"],[\"on_primary\",\"#ffffff\"],[\"tertiary_container\",\"#79746e\"],[\"inverse_primary\",\"#ffb597\"],[\"primary\",\"#8c4a2d\"],[\"surface_container_low\",\"#f6f3f0\"]],\"---\\nname: Stitch Design System\\ncolors:\\n  surface: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-dim: '#dcdad7'\\n  surface-bright: '#fcf9f6'\\n  surface-container-lowest: '#ffffff'\\n  surface-container-low: '#f6f3f0'\\n  surface-container: '#f0edea'\\n  surface-container-high: '#eae8e5'\\n  surface-container-highest: '#e5e2df'\\n  on-surface: '#1c1c1a'\\n  on-surface-variant: '#53433d'\\n  inverse-surface: '#31302f'\\n  inverse-on-surface: '#f3f0ed'\\n  outline: '#86736c'\\n  outline-variant: '#d9c2b9'\\n  surface-tint: '#8f4c2f'\\n  primary: '#8c4a2d'\\n  on-primary: '#ffffff'\\n  primary-container: '#aa6243'\\n  on-primary-container: '#fffbff'\\n  inverse-pri